    {
      "Id": "f956ad4c",
      "Timestamp": "2026-10-20T21:28:29.2186765-05:00",
      "UserPrompt": "Now lets build a winforms test bed application that can allow me to easily test all aspects of this framework and be able to receive data back from the js scritp in the browser and see its actions and everything. You will need to add a new csproj file in its own folder in the root project directory. Make sure its dotnet 10, and has the line in Program.cs Application.SetColorMode(SystemColorMode.Dark). Make sure the UI is very intuitive, and allows me to have full control of the IPC server and i can start and stop it, as well as see all comms that are pushed though it. WE need VERY detailed logs that should be showed ina realtime log box.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\nI have created the WinForms testbed application in a new \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 directory. It targets .NET 10, enables the native dark mode via \u0060Application.SetColorMode(SystemColorMode.Dark)\u0060, and references the \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060.\n\nThe UI is built entirely in code for portability and features a highly intuitive layout:\n\n- **Top Control Bar**: Configure the port, select the IPC mode (HTTP Polling vs WebSocket), start/stop the server, and a 1-click button to generate and copy the Tampermonkey script to your clipboard.\n- **Left Panel**: Displays a real-time list of connected browser instances.\n- **Right Panel**: A command center where you can manually type commands and JSON payloads, plus quick-action buttons to test the React extension methods (like \u0060ClickReactElementAsync\u0060 and \u0060EvaluateJavaScriptAsync\u0060).\n- **Bottom Panel**: A rich, real-time log box that tracks all TX/RX communications, stream data, and system events.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\TestBedApp.csproj**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060xml\n\u003CProject Sdk=\u0022Microsoft.NET.Sdk\u0022\u003E\n\n  \u003CPropertyGroup\u003E\n    \u003COutputType\u003EWinExe\u003C/OutputType\u003E\n    \u003CTargetFramework\u003Enet10.0-windows\u003C/TargetFramework\u003E\n    \u003CUseWindowsForms\u003Etrue\u003C/UseWindowsForms\u003E\n    \u003CImplicitUsings\u003Eenable\u003C/ImplicitUsings\u003E\n    \u003CNullable\u003Eenable\u003C/Nullable\u003E\n  \u003C/PropertyGroup\u003E\n\n  \u003CItemGroup\u003E\n    \u003CProjectReference Include=\u0022..\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\BrowserAutomationFramework.csproj\u0022 /\u003E\n  \u003C/ItemGroup\u003E\n\n\u003C/Project\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\Program.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System;\nusing System.Windows.Forms;\n\nnamespace TestBedApp\n{\n    internal static class Program\n    {\n        [STAThread]\n        static void Main()\n        {\n            ApplicationConfiguration.Initialize();\n            Application.SetColorMode(SystemColorMode.Dark);\n            Application.Run(new MainForm());\n        }\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System;\nusing System.Drawing;\nusing System.Linq;\nusing System.Text.Json;\nusing System.Threading;\nusing System.Windows.Forms;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Models;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Server;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Generators;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Extensions;\n\nnamespace TestBedApp\n{\n    public class MainForm : Form\n    {\n        private AutomationServer? _server;\n        private CancellationTokenSource? _cts;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Timer _clientRefreshTimer;\n\n        // UI Controls\n        private NumericUpDown numPort;\n        private ComboBox cmbMode;\n        private Button btnStart;\n        private Button btnStop;\n        private Button btnGenerate;\n        private ListBox lstClients;\n        private TextBox txtCmdType;\n        private TextBox txtPayload;\n        private Button btnSend;\n        private Button btnReactClick;\n        private Button btnEval;\n        private RichTextBox rtbLogs;\n\n        public MainForm()\n        {\n            InitializeUI();\n            \n            _clientRefreshTimer = new System.Windows.Forms.Timer { Interval = 2000 };\n            _clientRefreshTimer.Tick \u002B= ClientRefreshTimer_Tick;\n        }\n\n        private void InitializeUI()\n        {\n            this.Text = \u0022Browser Automation Framework - Testbed\u0022;\n            this.Size = new Size(1100, 750);\n            this.Font = new Font(\u0022Segoe UI\u0022, 10F, FontStyle.Regular, GraphicsUnit.Point);\n            this.StartPosition = FormStartPosition.CenterScreen;\n\n            // Top Panel (Controls)\n            var pnlTop = new Panel { Dock = DockStyle.Top, Height = 60, Padding = new Padding(10) };\n            \n            pnlTop.Controls.Add(new Label { Text = \u0022Port:\u0022, Width = 40, Location = new Point(10, 20) });\n            numPort = new NumericUpDown { Minimum = 1024, Maximum = 65535, Value = 8081, Width = 80, Location = new Point(50, 18) };\n            pnlTop.Controls.Add(numPort);\n\n            pnlTop.Controls.Add(new Label { Text = \u0022IPC Mode:\u0022, Width = 70, Location = new Point(150, 20) });\n            cmbMode = new ComboBox { DropDownStyle = ComboBoxStyle.DropDownList, Width = 120, Location = new Point(220, 18) };\n            cmbMode.DataSource = Enum.GetValues(typeof(IpcMode));\n            pnlTop.Controls.Add(cmbMode);\n\n            btnStart = new Button { Text = \u0022Start Server\u0022, Width = 100, Location = new Point(360, 16), BackColor = Color.DarkGreen, ForeColor = Color.White, FlatStyle = FlatStyle.Flat };\n            btnStart.Click \u002B= BtnStart_Click;\n            pnlTop.Controls.Add(btnStart);\n\n            btnStop = new Button { Text = \u0022Stop Server\u0022, Width = 100, Location = new Point(470, 16), BackColor = Color.DarkRed, ForeColor = Color.White, FlatStyle = FlatStyle.Flat, Enabled = false };\n            btnStop.Click \u002B= BtnStop_Click;\n            pnlTop.Controls.Add(btnStop);\n\n            btnGenerate = new Button { Text = \u0022Generate \u0026 Copy Script\u0022, Width = 180, Location = new Point(590, 16), BackColor = Color.DarkBlue, ForeColor = Color.White, FlatStyle = FlatStyle.Flat };\n            btnGenerate.Click \u002B= BtnGenerate_Click;\n            pnlTop.Controls.Add(btnGenerate);\n\n            this.Controls.Add(pnlTop);\n\n            // Main Split Container\n            var splitMain = new SplitContainer { Dock = DockStyle.Fill, Orientation = Orientation.Horizontal, SplitterDistance = 350 };\n            \n            // Top Half Split Container (Clients | Commands)\n            var splitTop = new SplitContainer { Dock = DockStyle.Fill, Orientation = Orientation.Vertical, SplitterDistance = 300 };\n            \n            // Clients Panel\n            var pnlClients = new GroupBox { Text = \u0022Connected Clients\u0022, Dock = DockStyle.Fill, Padding = new Padding(10) };\n            lstClients = new ListBox { Dock = DockStyle.Fill, DisplayMember = \u0022InstanceId\u0022, IntegralHeight = false };\n            pnlClients.Controls.Add(lstClients);\n            splitTop.Panel1.Controls.Add(pnlClients);\n\n            // Commands Panel\n            var pnlCommands = new GroupBox { Text = \u0022Command Center\u0022, Dock = DockStyle.Fill, Padding = new Padding(10) };\n            \n            pnlCommands.Controls.Add(new Label { Text = \u0022Command Type:\u0022, Location = new Point(15, 30), AutoSize = true });\n            txtCmdType = new TextBox { Location = new Point(15, 55), Width = 250, Text = \u0022EVAL\u0022 };\n            pnlCommands.Controls.Add(txtCmdType);\n\n            pnlCommands.Controls.Add(new Label { Text = \u0022Payload (JSON or String):\u0022, Location = new Point(15, 90), AutoSize = true });\n            txtPayload = new TextBox { Location = new Point(15, 115), Width = 500, Height = 100, Multiline = true, ScrollBars = ScrollBars.Vertical, Text = \u0022console.log(\u0027Hello from C#\u0027); return \u0027Success\u0027;\u0022 };\n            pnlCommands.Controls.Add(txtPayload);\n\n            btnSend = new Button { Text = \u0022Send Raw Command\u0022, Location = new Point(15, 230), Width = 150, Height = 35, BackColor = Color.FromArgb(64, 64, 64), FlatStyle = FlatStyle.Flat };\n            btnSend.Click \u002B= BtnSend_Click;\n            pnlCommands.Controls.Add(btnSend);\n\n            btnReactClick = new Button { Text = \u0022Test React Click (Selector)\u0022, Location = new Point(180, 230), Width = 180, Height = 35, BackColor = Color.FromArgb(64, 64, 64), FlatStyle = FlatStyle.Flat };\n            btnReactClick.Click \u002B= BtnReactClick_Click;\n            pnlCommands.Controls.Add(btnReactClick);\n\n            btnEval = new Button { Text = \u0022Test Eval (JS)\u0022, Location = new Point(375, 230), Width = 140, Height = 35, BackColor = Color.FromArgb(64, 64, 64), FlatStyle = FlatStyle.Flat };\n            btnEval.Click \u002B= BtnEval_Click;\n            pnlCommands.Controls.Add(btnEval);\n\n            splitTop.Panel2.Controls.Add(pnlCommands);\n            splitMain.Panel1.Controls.Add(splitTop);\n\n            // Logs Panel\n            var pnlLogs = new GroupBox { Text = \u0022Real-time Logs\u0022, Dock = DockStyle.Fill, Padding = new Padding(10) };\n            rtbLogs = new RichTextBox { Dock = DockStyle.Fill, ReadOnly = true, Font = new Font(\u0022Consolas\u0022, 10F), BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30), ForeColor = Color.LightGray };\n            pnlLogs.Controls.Add(rtbLogs);\n            splitMain.Panel2.Controls.Add(pnlLogs);\n\n            this.Controls.Add(splitMain);\n        }\n\n        private void Log(string message, Color? color = null)\n        {\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n            {\n                Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E Log(message, color)));\n                return;\n            }\n\n            rtbLogs.SelectionStart = rtbLogs.TextLength;\n            rtbLogs.SelectionLength = 0;\n            rtbLogs.SelectionColor = color ?? Color.LightGray;\n            rtbLogs.AppendText($\u0022[{DateTime.Now:HH:mm:ss.fff}] {message}{Environment.NewLine}\u0022);\n            rtbLogs.ScrollToCaret();\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnStart_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int port = (int)numPort.Value;\n            _server = new AutomationServer(port);\n            _server.OnClientConnected \u002B= Server_OnClientConnected;\n            _cts = new CancellationTokenSource();\n            \n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Starting Automation Server on port {port}...\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n            btnStart.Enabled = false;\n            btnStop.Enabled = true;\n            numPort.Enabled = false;\n            _clientRefreshTimer.Start();\n\n            try\n            {\n                await _server.StartAsync(_cts.Token);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex) when (ex is not OperationCanceledException)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Server error: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                BtnStop_Click(null, EventArgs.Empty);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnStop_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            _cts?.Cancel();\n            _server?.Stop();\n            _clientRefreshTimer.Stop();\n            \n            Log(\u0022[SYS] Server stopped.\u0022, Color.Yellow);\n            \n            btnStart.Enabled = true;\n            btnStop.Enabled = false;\n            numPort.Enabled = true;\n            lstClients.Items.Clear();\n        }\n\n        private void BtnGenerate_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            var options = new ScriptOptions\n            {\n                Port = (int)numPort.Value,\n                Mode = (IpcMode)cmbMode.SelectedItem!\n            };\n            \n            string script = ScriptGenerator.Generate(options);\n            Clipboard.SetText(script);\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Tampermonkey script generated for {options.Mode} and copied to clipboard!\u0022, Color.Lime);\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientConnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Client Connected: {client.InstanceId} via {client.Mode}\u0022, Color.LimeGreen);\n            \n            client.OnStreamDataReceived \u002B= (s, res) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[STREAM \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] {res.Output}\u0022, Color.MediumPurple);\n            };\n\n            Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n            {\n                if (!lstClients.Items.Cast\u003CBrowserClient\u003E().Any(c =\u003E c.InstanceId == client.InstanceId))\n                {\n                    lstClients.Items.Add(client);\n                }\n            }));\n        }\n\n        private void ClientRefreshTimer_Tick(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_server == null) return;\n            \n            var activeClients = _server.GetAllClients().ToList();\n            var currentClients = lstClients.Items.Cast\u003CBrowserClient\u003E().ToList();\n\n            // Add new\n            foreach (var client in activeClients.Where(c =\u003E !currentClients.Any(cc =\u003E cc.InstanceId == c.InstanceId)))\n            {\n                lstClients.Items.Add(client);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnSend_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a client from the list first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            string type = txtCmdType.Text;\n            string payloadStr = txtPayload.Text;\n            object payload = payloadStr;\n\n            try\n            {\n                if (payloadStr.Trim().StartsWith(\u0022{\u0022) || payloadStr.Trim().StartsWith(\u0022[\u0022))\n                {\n                    payload = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003Cobject\u003E(payloadStr) ?? payloadStr;\n                }\n            }\n            catch { /* Ignore, send as string */ }\n\n            Log($\u0022[TX -\u003E {client.InstanceId}] {type} | Payload: {payloadStr}\u0022, Color.DeepSkyBlue);\n            \n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.SendCommandAsync(type, payload);\n                Log($\u0022[RX \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Status: {result.Status} | Output: {result.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnReactClick_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client) return;\n            string selector = txtPayload.Text.Trim();\n            \n            Log($\u0022[TX -\u003E {client.InstanceId}] REACT_CLICK | Selector: {selector}\u0022, Color.DeepSkyBlue);\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.ClickReactElementAsync(selector);\n                Log($\u0022[RX \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Status: {result.Status} | Output: {result.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex) { Log($\u0022[ERR] {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red); }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnEval_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client) return;\n            string code = txtPayload.Text.Trim();\n            \n            Log($\u0022[TX -\u003E {client.InstanceId}] EVAL | Code: {code}\u0022, Color.DeepSkyBlue);\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.EvaluateJavaScriptAsync(code);\n                Log($\u0022[RX \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Status: {result.Status} | Output: {result.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex) { Log($\u0022[ERR] {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red); }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060",
      "ModelExplanation": "I have created the WinForms testbed application in a new \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 directory. It targets .NET 10, enables the native dark mode via \u0060Application.SetColorMode(SystemColorMode.Dark)\u0060, and references the \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060.\n\nThe UI is built entirely in code for portability and features a highly intuitive layout:\n\n- **Top Control Bar**: Configure the port, select the IPC mode (HTTP Polling vs WebSocket), start/stop the server, and a 1-click button to generate and copy the Tampermonkey script to your clipboard.\n- **Left Panel**: Displays a real-time list of connected browser instances.\n- **Right Panel**: A command center where you can manually type commands and JSON payloads, plus quick-action buttons to test the React extension methods (like \u0060ClickReactElementAsync\u0060 and \u0060EvaluateJavaScriptAsync\u0060).\n- **Bottom Panel**: A rich, real-time log box that tracks all TX/RX communications, stream data, and system events.",
