      "UserPrompt": "[Attached Image]\n\n[Attached Image]\n\nThe root directory for this project is: C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\nThe following directories are currently tracked/active for this project (place new files in these directories unless otherwise specified):\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\n\nNow one last thing, we need to fix the UI for the DOM Explorer and the Automation Editor tabs. As you can see in the screenshot, when we resize the window (this example is full screened), it does not auto size the contents of the tabs. They remain the same and we see a lot of white background. Please fix this so that they will auto size to fill the space of the tab box they are in.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\nI have fixed the layout issue by adding the missing \u0060ResumeLayout()\u0060 calls at the end of \u0060InitializeComponent()\u0060. Without these calls, the layout engine remained suspended for the tabs and their child controls, preventing them from resizing to fill the available space. I also updated the \u0060BackColor\u0060, \u0060ForeColor\u0060, and \u0060UseVisualStyleBackColor\u0060 properties for the tab pages and various input controls to ensure they properly match the dark theme and eliminate the white backgrounds.\n\nTo test these changes:\n\n- Run the \u0060TestBedApp\u0060.\n- Maximize or resize the window.\n- Switch to the \u0022DOM Explorer\u0022 and \u0022Automation Editor\u0022 tabs.\n- Verify that the split containers and their contents now automatically resize to fill the entire tab area, and that the backgrounds are correctly themed dark.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.Designer.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // numPort\n            // \n            numPort.Location = new Point(71, 14);\n            numPort.Margin = new Padding(3, 4, 15, 3);\n            numPort.Maximum = new decimal(new int[] { 65535, 0, 0, 0 });\n            numPort.Minimum = new decimal(new int[] { 1024, 0, 0, 0 });\n            numPort.Name = \u0022numPort\u0022;\n            numPort.Size = new Size(80, 34);\n            numPort.TabIndex = 1;\n            numPort.Value = new decimal(new int[] { 8081, 0, 0, 0 });\n            // \n            // lblMode\n            // \n            lblMode.AutoSize = true;\n            lblMode.Location = new Point(169, 16);\n            lblMode.Margin = new Padding(3, 6, 3, 3);\n            lblMode.Name = \u0022lblMode\u0022;\n            lblMode.Size = new Size(101, 28);\n            lblMode.TabIndex = 2;\n            lblMode.Text = \u0022IPC Mode:\u0022;\n            // \n            // cmbMode\n   