      "Timestamp": "2026-10-24T18:23:25.621523-05:00",
      "UserPrompt": "The root directory for this project is: C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\nThe following directories are currently tracked/active for this project (place new files in these directories unless otherwise specified):\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\n\nI want to add auto dom load and auto refresh whenever the dom changes, and once this is done, remove the manual refresh button. \nI also want it setup so that whenever you\u0027re selected on something in the dom viewer, it remembers its position, and if after the reload that same position exists, it resets your currently selected dom element to the previously selected one.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\nI have implemented the requested features by introducing an event system to the IPC bridge. A \u0060MutationObserver\u0060 is now injected into the generated Tampermonkey script to detect DOM changes, debounce them, and send a \u0060DOM_CHANGED\u0060 event back to the server. The server routes these events to the \u0060BrowserClient\u0060, which the \u0060MainForm\u0060 listens to in order to trigger an automatic DOM refresh. The manual refresh button has been removed from the UI, and the DOM tree now remembers and restores the previously selected element\u0027s path across reloads.\n\nTo test these changes:\n1. Run the \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 and start the server.\n2. Generate and install the Tampermonkey script in your browser.\n3. Navigate to any page; the client will connect and the DOM will automatically load in the \u0022DOM Explorer\u0022 tab.\n4. Select an element in the DOM tree.\n5. Cause a DOM change on the page (e.g., click a button that modifies the page, or edit the DOM via DevTools).\n6. Verify that the DOM tree automatically refreshes and your previously selected element remains selected (if it still exists).\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\EventMessage.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System.Text.Json.Serialization;\n\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\n{\n    public class EventMessage\n    {\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022event\u0022)]\n        public string Event { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022payload\u0022)]\n        public object? Payload { get; set; }\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Server\\BrowserClient.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Triggered when the browser script streams partial data back for a long-running task.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CCommandResult\u003E? OnStreamDataReceived;\n\n        public BrowserClient(string instanceId, IpcMode mode, WebSocket? webSocket = null)\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Triggered when the browser script streams partial data back for a long-running task.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CCommandResult\u003E? OnStreamDataReceived;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Triggered when the browser script sends an event.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CEventMessage\u003E? OnEventReceived;\n\n        public BrowserClient(string instanceId, IpcMode mode, WebSocket? webSocket = null)\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        internal void HandleResult(CommandResult result)\n        {\n            if (result.Status == \u0022streaming\u0022)\n==== REPLACE\n        internal void HandleEvent(EventMessage evt)\n        {\n            OnEventReceived?.Invoke(this, evt);\n        }\n\n        internal void HandleResult(CommandResult result)\n        {\n            if (result.Status == \u0022streaming\u0022)\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Server\\AutomationServer.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                else if (path.StartsWith(\u0022/api/result/\u0022))\n                {\n                    string instanceId = path.Substring(\u0022/api/result/\u0022.Length);\n                    var client = GetOrAddClient(instanceId, IpcMode.HttpPolling);\n                    client.LastSeen = DateTime.UtcNow;\n\n                    using var reader = new StreamReader(request.InputStream);\n                    string body = await reader.ReadToEndAsync(cancellationToken);\n                    var result = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CCommandResult\u003E(body);\n\n                    if (result != null)\n                    {\n                        client.HandleResult(result);\n                    }\n\n                    await SendJsonAsync(response, new { status = \u0022acknowledged\u0022 });\n                }\n                else\n                {\n==== REPLACE\n                else if (path.StartsWith(\u0022/api/result/\u0022))\n                {\n                    string instanceId = path.Substring(\u0022/api/result/\u0022.Length);\n                    var client = GetOrAddClient(instanceId, IpcMode.HttpPolling);\n                    client.LastSeen = DateTime.UtcNow;\n\n                    using var reader = new StreamReader(request.InputStream);\n                    string body = await reader.ReadToEndAsync(cancellationToken);\n                    var result = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CCommandResult\u003E(body);\n\n                    if (result != null)\n                    {\n                        client.HandleResult(result);\n                    }\n\n                    await SendJsonAsync(response, new { status = \u0022acknowledged\u0022 });\n                }\n                else if (path.StartsWith(\u0022/api/event/\u0022))\n                {\n                    string instanceId = path.Substring(\u0022/api/event/\u0022.Length);\n                    var client = GetOrAddClient(instanceId, IpcMode.HttpPolling);\n                    client.LastSeen = DateTime.UtcNow;\n\n                    using var reader = new StreamReader(request.InputStream);\n                    string body = await reader.ReadToEndAsync(cancellationToken);\n                    var evt = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CEventMessage\u003E(body);\n\n                    if (evt != null)\n                    {\n                        client.HandleEvent(evt);\n                    }\n\n                    await SendJsonAsync(response, new { status = \u0022acknowledged\u0022 });\n                }\n                else\n                {\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                    string message = Encoding.UTF8.GetString(ms.ToArray());\n                    var cmdResult = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CCommandResult\u003E(message);\n                    if (cmdResult != null)\n                    {\n                        client.HandleResult(cmdResult);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n==== REPLACE\n                    string message = Encoding.UTF8.GetString(ms.ToArray());\n                    if (message.Contains(\u0022\\\u0022event\\\u0022\u0022))\n                    {\n                        var evt = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CEventMessage\u003E(message);\n                        if (evt != null)\n                        {\n                            client.HandleEvent(evt);\n                        }\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        var cmdResult = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CCommandResult\u003E(message);\n                        if (cmdResult != null)\n                        {\n                            client.HandleResult(cmdResult);\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Generators\\ScriptGenerator.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n    // --- Command Registry ---\n    const actionHandlers = Object.create(null);\n==== REPLACE\n    // --- DOM Observer ---\n    let domTimeout;\n    const observer = new MutationObserver(() =\u003E {\n        clearTimeout(domTimeout);\n        domTimeout = setTimeout(() =\u003E {\n            if (typeof sendEvent === \u0027function\u0027) {\n                sendEvent(\u0027DOM_CHANGED\u0027, null);\n            }\n        }, 500);\n    });\n    observer.observe(document.documentElement, { childList: true, subtree: true, attributes: true, characterData: true });\n\n    // --- Command Registry ---\n    const actionHandlers = Object.create(null);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n    async function sendResult(taskId, status, output) {\n        const outStr = typeof output === \u0027object\u0027 ? JSON.stringify(output) : String(output);\n        await tmFetch(\u0060${API_BASE}/result/${INSTANCE_ID}\u0060, {\n            method: \u0027POST\u0027,\n            body: JSON.stringify({ task_id: taskId, status: status, output: outStr })\n        });\n    }\n\n    // Expose streaming capability to handlers\n==== REPLACE\n    async function sendResult(taskId, status, output) {\n        const outStr = typeof output === \u0027object\u0027 ? JSON.stringify(output) : String(output);\n        await tmFetch(\u0060${API_BASE}/result/${INSTANCE_ID}\u0060, {\n            method: \u0027POST\u0027,\n            body: JSON.stringify({ task_id: taskId, status: status, output: outStr })\n        });\n    }\n\n    async function sendEvent(eventName, payload) {\n        await tmFetch(\u0060${API_BASE}/event/${INSTANCE_ID}\u0060, {\n            method: \u0027POST\u0027,\n            body: JSON.stringify({ event: eventName, payload: payload })\n        });\n    }\n\n    // Expose streaming capability to handlers\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n    function sendResult(taskId, status, output) {\n        if (ws \u0026\u0026 ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN) {\n            const outStr = typeof output === \u0027object\u0027 ? JSON.stringify(output) : String(output);\n            ws.send(JSON.stringify({ task_id: taskId, status: status, output: outStr }));\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Expose streaming capability to handlers\n==== REPLACE\n    function sendResult(taskId, status, output) {\n        if (ws \u0026\u0026 ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN) {\n            const outStr = typeof output === \u0027object\u0027 ? JSON.stringify(output) : String(output);\n            ws.send(JSON.stringify({ task_id: taskId, status: status, output: outStr }));\n        }\n    }\n\n    function sendEvent(eventName, payload) {\n        if (ws \u0026\u0026 ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN) {\n            ws.send(JSON.stringify({ event: eventName, payload: payload }));\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Expose streaming capability to handlers\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void Server_OnClientConnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Client Connected: {client.InstanceId} via {client.Mode}\u0022, Color.LimeGreen);\n            \n            client.OnStreamDataReceived \u002B= (s, res) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[STREAM \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] {res.Output}\u0022, Color.MediumPurple);\n            };\n\n            Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n            {\n                if (!lstClients.Items.Cast\u003CBrowserClient\u003E().Any(c =\u003E c.InstanceId == client.InstanceId))\n                {\n                    lstClients.Items.Add(client);\n                }\n            }));\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void Server_OnClientConnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Client Connected: {client.InstanceId} via {client.Mode}\u0022, Color.LimeGreen);\n            \n            client.OnStreamDataReceived \u002B= (s, res) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[STREAM \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] {res.Output}\u0022, Color.MediumPurple);\n            };\n\n            client.OnEventReceived \u002B= (s, evt) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (evt.Event == \u0022DOM_CHANGED\u0022)\n                {\n                    Invoke(new Action(async () =\u003E\n                    {\n                        if (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient selectedClient \u0026\u0026 selectedClient.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                        {\n                            await RefreshDomAsync(client);\n                        }\n                    }));\n                }\n            };\n\n            Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n            {\n                if (!lstClients.Items.Cast\u003CBrowserClient\u003E().Any(c =\u003E c.InstanceId == client.InstanceId))\n                {\n                    lstClients.Items.Add(client);\n                    if (lstClients.Items.Count == 1)\n                    {\n                        lstClients.SelectedIndex = 0;\n                    }\n                }\n            }));\n        }\n\n        private async void LstClients_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                await RefreshDomAsync(client);\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private async void BtnRefreshDom_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a client first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Fetching DOM from {client.InstanceId}...\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.GetDomAsync();\n                if (result.Status == \u0022completed\u0022 \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(result.Output))\n                {\n                    var rootNode = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CDomNode\u003E(result.Output);\n                    if (rootNode != null)\n                    {\n                        tvDom.Nodes.Clear();\n                        var treeNode = BuildTreeNode(rootNode);\n                        tvDom.Nodes.Add(treeNode);\n                        treeNode.Expand();\n                        Log(\u0022[SYS] DOM loaded successfully.\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to fetch DOM: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private async Task RefreshDomAsync(BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.GetDomAsync();\n                if (result.Status == \u0022completed\u0022 \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(result.Output))\n                {\n                    var rootNode = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CDomNode\u003E(result.Output);\n                    if (rootNode != null)\n                    {\n                        string? selectedPath = (tvDom.SelectedNode?.Tag as DomNode)?.Path;\n\n                        tvDom.BeginUpdate();\n                        tvDom.Nodes.Clear();\n                        var treeNode = BuildTreeNode(rootNode);\n                        tvDom.Nodes.Add(treeNode);\n                        treeNode.Expand();\n\n                        if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(selectedPath))\n                        {\n                            var nodeToSelect = FindNodeByPath(treeNode, selectedPath);\n                            if (nodeToSelect != null)\n                            {\n                                tvDom.SelectedNode = nodeToSelect;\n                                nodeToSelect.EnsureVisible();\n                            }\n                        }\n                        tvDom.EndUpdate();\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to fetch DOM: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private TreeNode? FindNodeByPath(TreeNode root, string path)\n        {\n            if (root.Tag is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 domNode.Path == path)\n                return root;\n\n            foreach (TreeNode child in root.Nodes)\n            {\n                var found = FindNodeByPath(child, path);\n                if (found != null) return found;\n            }\n\n            return null;\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.Designer.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            tvDom = new TestBedApp.Controls.DomTreeView();\n            txtElementDetails = new TextBox();\n            pnlDomTop = new Panel();\n            btnRefreshDom = new Button();\n            tabEditor = new TabPage();\n==== REPLACE\n            tvDom = new TestBedApp.Controls.DomTreeView();\n            txtElementDetails = new TextBox();\n            tabEditor = new TabPage();\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            splitDom.Panel1.SuspendLayout();\n            splitDom.Panel2.SuspendLayout();\n            splitDom.SuspendLayout();\n            pnlDomTop.SuspendLayout();\n            tabEditor.SuspendLayout();\n==== REPLACE\n            splitDom.Panel1.SuspendLayout();\n            splitDom.Panel2.SuspendLayout();\n            splitDom.SuspendLayout();\n            tabEditor.SuspendLayout();\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // lstClients\n            // \n            lstClients.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            lstClients.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            lstClients.DisplayMember = \u0022InstanceId\u0022;\n            lstClients.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n            lstClients.ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n            lstClients.IntegralHeight = false;\n            lstClients.Location = new Point(10, 37);\n            lstClients.Name = \u0022lstClients\u0022;\n            lstClients.Size = new Size(281, 477);\n            lstClients.TabIndex = 0;\n==== REPLACE\n            // lstClients\n            // \n            lstClients.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            lstClients.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            lstClients.DisplayMember = \u0022InstanceId\u0022;\n            lstClients.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n            lstClients.ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n            lstClients.IntegralHeight = false;\n            lstClients.Location = new Point(10, 37);\n            lstClients.Name = \u0022lstClients\u0022;\n            lstClients.Size = new Size(281, 477);\n            lstClients.TabIndex = 0;\n            lstClients.SelectedIndexChanged \u002B= LstClients_SelectedIndexChanged;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            tabDom.Controls.Add(splitDom);\n            tabDom.Controls.Add(pnlDomTop);\n            tabDom.Location = new Point(4, 34);\n==== REPLACE\n            tabDom.Controls.Add(splitDom);\n            tabDom.Location = new Point(4, 34);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // splitDom\n            // \n            splitDom.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n            splitDom.Location = new Point(3, 53);\n            splitDom.Name = \u0022splitDom\u0022;\n==== REPLACE\n            // splitDom\n            // \n            splitDom.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n            splitDom.Location = new Point(3, 3);\n            splitDom.Name = \u0022splitDom\u0022;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // pnlDomTop\n            // \n            pnlDomTop.Controls.Add(btnRefreshDom);\n            pnlDomTop.Dock = DockStyle.Top;\n            pnlDomTop.Location = new Point(3, 3);\n            pnlDomTop.Name = \u0022pnlDomTop\u0022;\n            pnlDomTop.Padding = new Padding(5);\n            pnlDomTop.Size = new Size(912, 50);\n            pnlDomTop.TabIndex = 0;\n            // \n            // btnRefreshDom\n            // \n            btnRefreshDom.Dock = DockStyle.Left;\n            btnRefreshDom.Location = new Point(5, 5);\n            btnRefreshDom.Name = \u0022btnRefreshDom\u0022;\n            btnRefreshDom.Size = new Size(150, 40);\n            btnRefreshDom.TabIndex = 0;\n            btnRefreshDom.Text = \u0022Refresh DOM\u0022;\n            btnRefreshDom.UseVisualStyleBackColor = true;\n            btnRefreshDom.Click \u002B= BtnRefreshDom_Click;\n            // \n            // tabEditor\n==== REPLACE\n            // tabEditor\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            splitDom.Panel1.ResumeLayout(false);\n            splitDom.Panel2.ResumeLayout(false);\n            splitDom.Panel2.PerformLayout();\n            ((System.ComponentModel.ISupportInitialize)splitDom).EndInit();\n            splitDom.ResumeLayout(false);\n            pnlDomTop.ResumeLayout(false);\n            tabEditor.ResumeLayout(false);\n==== REPLACE\n            splitDom.Panel1.ResumeLayout(false);\n            splitDom.Panel2.ResumeLayout(false);\n            splitDom.Panel2.PerformLayout();\n            ((System.ComponentModel.ISupportInitialize)splitDom).EndInit();\n            splitDom.ResumeLayout(false);\n            tabEditor.ResumeLayout(false);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private System.Windows.Forms.TabPage tabEditor;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Panel pnlDomTop;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Button btnRefreshDom;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.SplitContainer splitDom;\n==== REPLACE\n        private System.Windows.Forms.TabPage tabEditor;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.SplitContainer splitDom;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060",
      "ModelExplanation": "I have implemented the requested features by introducing an event system to the IPC bridge. A \u0060MutationObserver\u0060 is now injected into the generated Tampermonkey script to detect DOM changes, debounce them, and send a \u0060DOM_CHANGED\u0060 event back to the server. The server routes these events to the \u0060BrowserClient\u0060, which the \u0060MainForm\u0060 listens to in order to trigger an automatic DOM refresh. The manual refresh button has been removed from the UI, and the DOM tree now remembers and restores the previously selected element\u0027s path across reloads.\n\nTo test these changes:\n1. Run the \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 and start the server.\n2. Generate and install the Tampermonkey script in your browser.\n3. Navigate to any page; the client will connect and the DOM will automatically load in the \u0022DOM Explorer\u0022 tab.\n4. Select an element in the DOM tree.\n5. Cause a DOM change on the page (e.g., click a button that modifies the page, or edit the DOM via DevTools).\n6. Verify that the DOM tree automatically refreshes and your previously selected element remains selected (if it still exists).",
