    {
      "Id": "1b402dae",
      "Timestamp": "2026-10-24T19:52:29.6582353-05:00",
      "UserPrompt": "All of this new functionality works. Now we need to add a critical feature. We need the ability to create multiple automation lists. We need the ability to right click on an element in the dom viewer, and it have a menu item that opens to see all automation lists, and we should be able to add the atuomation for the selected element in any automation list. \nWE should have a spot in the UI that allows for selecting any of the automation lists, and check or uncheck them to be included in the run automation lists feature. This feature will run each automation list in order that its in the master list. Any automation lists that are not designated to run will be skipped/ignored. We also need buttons to move automation lists up and down in the main automations list that has the indivatual automations. We also need to ensure that all this new infomration is saved in the project save file and can be loaded from the project save file.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\nI have implemented the multiple automation lists feature.\n\n- Created a new \u0060AutomationSequence\u0060 model to hold a list of steps.\n- Updated the UI in the \u0022Automation Editor\u0022 tab to include a \u0060CheckedListBox\u0060 for managing multiple automation lists.\n- Added buttons to Add, Remove, Rename, and Move lists up/down.\n- Updated the DOM viewer\u0027s right-click context menu to dynamically populate submenus with your available automation lists, allowing you to add steps directly to any specific list.\n- Updated the \u0022Run Automation\u0022 logic to iterate through all checked automation lists in the order they appear, executing their steps sequentially.\n- Updated the Save/Load functionality to serialize and deserialize the entire collection of automation lists and their checked states.\n\nTo test:\n\n- Open the application and go to the \u0022Automation Editor\u0022 tab.\n- Click \u0022Add List\u0022 to create a few automation lists (e.g., \u0022Login\u0022, \u0022Navigate\u0022, \u0022Scrape\u0022).\n- Go to the \u0022DOM Explorer\u0022 tab, right-click an element, and hover over \u0022Add Click Step To...\u0022 or \u0022Add Set Value Step To...\u0022. You will see your lists as submenus. Click one to add the step to that specific list.\n- Back in the \u0022Automation Editor\u0022, select different lists to see their individual steps. Use the checkboxes to enable/disable lists for the run.\n- Use the \u0022Move Up\u0022 and \u0022Move Down\u0022 buttons above the lists to reorder them.\n- Click \u0022Run Automation\u0022 and verify it only runs the checked lists in the order they appear.\n- Save the project and open it again to verify the lists, steps, and checked states are preserved.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\Models\\AutomationSequence.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Text.Json.Serialization;\n\nnamespace TestBedApp.Models\n{\n    public class AutomationSequence\n    {\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022id\u0022)]\n        public string Id { get; set; } = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022name\u0022)]\n        public string Name { get; set; } = \u0022New Sequence\u0022;\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022isActive\u0022)]\n        public bool IsActive { get; set; } = true;\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022steps\u0022)]\n        public List\u003CAutomationStep\u003E Steps { get; set; } = new();\n\n        public override string ToString() =\u003E Name;\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.Designer.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private System.Windows.Forms.ToolStripMenuItem mnuAddClickStep;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.ToolStripMenuItem mnuAddSetValueStep;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.MenuStrip menuStripMain;\n==== REPLACE\n        private System.Windows.Forms.ToolStripMenuItem mnuAddClickTo;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.ToolStripMenuItem mnuAddSetValueTo;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.SplitContainer splitSequences;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.CheckedListBox chkLstSequences;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Panel pnlSequencesTop;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Button btnAddSequence;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Button btnRemoveSequence;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Button btnMoveSeqUp;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Button btnMoveSeqDown;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Button btnRenameSeq;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.MenuStrip menuStripMain;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            mnuAddClickStep = new ToolStripMenuItem();\n            mnuAddSetValueStep = new ToolStripMenuItem();\n            menuStripMain = new MenuStrip();\n==== REPLACE\n            mnuAddClickTo = new ToolStripMenuItem();\n            mnuAddSetValueTo = new ToolStripMenuItem();\n            splitSequences = new SplitContainer();\n            chkLstSequences = new CheckedListBox();\n            pnlSequencesTop = new Panel();\n            btnAddSequence = new Button();\n            btnRemoveSequence = new Button();\n            btnMoveSeqUp = new Button();\n            btnMoveSeqDown = new Button();\n            btnRenameSeq = new Button();\n            menuStripMain = new MenuStrip();\n            ((System.ComponentModel.ISupportInitialize)splitSequences).BeginInit();\n            splitSequences.Panel1.SuspendLayout();\n            splitSequences.Panel2.SuspendLayout();\n            splitSequences.SuspendLayout();\n            pnlSequencesTop.SuspendLayout();\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // tabEditor\n            // \n            tabEditor.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            tabEditor.Controls.Add(splitEditor);\n            tabEditor.Controls.Add(pnlEditorTop);\n            tabEditor.Location = new Point(4, 24);\n            tabEditor.Name = \u0022tabEditor\u0022;\n            tabEditor.Padding = new Padding(3);\n            tabEditor.Size = new Size(923, 460);\n            tabEditor.TabIndex = 2;\n            tabEditor.Text = \u0022Automation Editor\u0022;\n            // \n            // splitEditor\n            // \n            splitEditor.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n            splitEditor.Location = new Point(3, 53);\n            splitEditor.Name = \u0022splitEditor\u0022;\n==== REPLACE\n            // tabEditor\n            // \n            tabEditor.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            tabEditor.Controls.Add(splitSequences);\n            tabEditor.Location = new Point(4, 24);\n            tabEditor.Name = \u0022tabEditor\u0022;\n            tabEditor.Padding = new Padding(3);\n            tabEditor.Size = new Size(923, 460);\n            tabEditor.TabIndex = 2;\n            tabEditor.Text = \u0022Automation Editor\u0022;\n            // \n            // splitSequences\n            // \n            splitSequences.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n            splitSequences.Location = new Point(3, 3);\n            splitSequences.Name = \u0022splitSequences\u0022;\n            // \n            // splitSequences.Panel1\n            // \n            splitSequences.Panel1.Controls.Add(chkLstSequences);\n            splitSequences.Panel1.Controls.Add(pnlSequencesTop);\n            // \n            // splitSequences.Panel2\n            // \n            splitSequences.Panel2.Controls.Add(splitEditor);\n            splitSequences.Panel2.Controls.Add(pnlEditorTop);\n            splitSequences.Size = new Size(917, 454);\n            splitSequences.SplitterDistance = 250;\n            splitSequences.TabIndex = 3;\n            // \n            // chkLstSequences\n            // \n            chkLstSequences.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            chkLstSequences.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n            chkLstSequences.ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n            chkLstSequences.FormattingEnabled = true;\n            chkLstSequences.Location = new Point(0, 80);\n            chkLstSequences.Name = \u0022chkLstSequences\u0022;\n            chkLstSequences.Size = new Size(250, 374);\n            chkLstSequences.TabIndex = 1;\n            chkLstSequences.ItemCheck \u002B= ChkLstSequences_ItemCheck;\n            chkLstSequences.SelectedIndexChanged \u002B= ChkLstSequences_SelectedIndexChanged;\n            // \n            // pnlSequencesTop\n            // \n            pnlSequencesTop.Controls.Add(btnRenameSeq);\n            pnlSequencesTop.Controls.Add(btnMoveSeqDown);\n            pnlSequencesTop.Controls.Add(btnMoveSeqUp);\n            pnlSequencesTop.Controls.Add(btnRemoveSequence);\n            pnlSequencesTop.Controls.Add(btnAddSequence);\n            pnlSequencesTop.Dock = DockStyle.Top;\n            pnlSequencesTop.Location = new Point(0, 0);\n            pnlSequencesTop.Name = \u0022pnlSequencesTop\u0022;\n            pnlSequencesTop.Padding = new Padding(5);\n            pnlSequencesTop.Size = new Size(250, 80);\n            pnlSequencesTop.TabIndex = 0;\n            // \n            // btnAddSequence\n            // \n            btnAddSequence.Location = new Point(5, 5);\n            btnAddSequence.Name = \u0022btnAddSequence\u0022;\n            btnAddSequence.Size = new Size(115, 30);\n            btnAddSequence.TabIndex = 0;\n            btnAddSequence.Text = \u0022Add List\u0022;\n            btnAddSequence.UseVisualStyleBackColor = true;\n            btnAddSequence.Click \u002B= BtnAddSequence_Click;\n            // \n            // btnRemoveSequence\n            // \n            btnRemoveSequence.Location = new Point(125, 5);\n            btnRemoveSequence.Name = \u0022btnRemoveSequence\u0022;\n            btnRemoveSequence.Size = new Size(115, 30);\n            btnRemoveSequence.TabIndex = 1;\n            btnRemoveSequence.Text = \u0022Remove List\u0022;\n            btnRemoveSequence.UseVisualStyleBackColor = true;\n            btnRemoveSequence.Click \u002B= BtnRemoveSequence_Click;\n            // \n            // btnMoveSeqUp\n            // \n            btnMoveSeqUp.Location = new Point(5, 40);\n            btnMoveSeqUp.Name = \u0022btnMoveSeqUp\u0022;\n            btnMoveSeqUp.Size = new Size(75, 30);\n            btnMoveSeqUp.TabIndex = 2;\n            btnMoveSeqUp.Text = \u0022Move Up\u0022;\n            btnMoveSeqUp.UseVisualStyleBackColor = true;\n            btnMoveSeqUp.Click \u002B= BtnMoveSeqUp_Click;\n            // \n            // btnMoveSeqDown\n            // \n            btnMoveSeqDown.Location = new Point(85, 40);\n            btnMoveSeqDown.Name = \u0022btnMoveSeqDown\u0022;\n            btnMoveSeqDown.Size = new Size(75, 30);\n            btnMoveSeqDown.TabIndex = 3;\n            btnMoveSeqDown.Text = \u0022Move Down\u0022;\n            btnMoveSeqDown.UseVisualStyleBackColor = true;\n            btnMoveSeqDown.Click \u002B= BtnMoveSeqDown_Click;\n            // \n            // btnRenameSeq\n            // \n            btnRenameSeq.Location = new Point(165, 40);\n            btnRenameSeq.Name = \u0022btnRenameSeq\u0022;\n            btnRenameSeq.Size = new Size(75, 30);\n            btnRenameSeq.TabIndex = 4;\n            btnRenameSeq.Text = \u0022Rename\u0022;\n            btnRenameSeq.UseVisualStyleBackColor = true;\n            btnRenameSeq.Click \u002B= BtnRenameSeq_Click;\n            // \n            // splitEditor\n            // \n            splitEditor.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n            splitEditor.Location = new Point(0, 50);\n            splitEditor.Name = \u0022splitEditor\u0022;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // ctxDomNode\n            // \n            ctxDomNode.ImageScalingSize = new Size(24, 24);\n            ctxDomNode.Items.AddRange(new ToolStripItem[] { mnuClickElement, mnuSetValue, mnuAddClickStep, mnuAddSetValueStep });\n            ctxDomNode.Name = \u0022ctxDomNode\u0022;\n            ctxDomNode.Size = new Size(236, 92);\n            // \n            // mnuClickElement\n            // \n            mnuClickElement.Name = \u0022mnuClickElement\u0022;\n            mnuClickElement.Size = new Size(235, 22);\n            mnuClickElement.Text = \u0022Test Click Element\u0022;\n            mnuClickElement.Click \u002B= MnuClickElement_Click;\n            // \n            // mnuSetValue\n            // \n            mnuSetValue.Name = \u0022mnuSetValue\u0022;\n            mnuSetValue.Size = new Size(235, 22);\n            mnuSetValue.Text = \u0022Test Set Value\u0022;\n            mnuSetValue.Click \u002B= MnuSetValue_Click;\n            // \n            // mnuAddClickStep\n            // \n            mnuAddClickStep.Name = \u0022mnuAddClickStep\u0022;\n            mnuAddClickStep.Size = new Size(235, 22);\n            mnuAddClickStep.Text = \u0022Add to Automation (Click)\u0022;\n            mnuAddClickStep.Click \u002B= MnuAddClickStep_Click;\n            // \n            // mnuAddSetValueStep\n            // \n            mnuAddSetValueStep.Name = \u0022mnuAddSetValueStep\u0022;\n            mnuAddSetValueStep.Size = new Size(235, 22);\n            mnuAddSetValueStep.Text = \u0022Add to Automation (Set Value)\u0022;\n            mnuAddSetValueStep.Click \u002B= MnuAddSetValueStep_Click;\n==== REPLACE\n            // ctxDomNode\n            // \n            ctxDomNode.ImageScalingSize = new Size(24, 24);\n            ctxDomNode.Items.AddRange(new ToolStripItem[] { mnuClickElement, mnuSetValue, mnuAddClickTo, mnuAddSetValueTo });\n            ctxDomNode.Name = \u0022ctxDomNode\u0022;\n            ctxDomNode.Size = new Size(236, 92);\n            ctxDomNode.Opening \u002B= CtxDomNode_Opening;\n            // \n            // mnuClickElement\n            // \n            mnuClickElement.Name = \u0022mnuClickElement\u0022;\n            mnuClickElement.Size = new Size(235, 22);\n            mnuClickElement.Text = \u0022Test Click Element\u0022;\n            mnuClickElement.Click \u002B= MnuClickElement_Click;\n            // \n            // mnuSetValue\n            // \n            mnuSetValue.Name = \u0022mnuSetValue\u0022;\n            mnuSetValue.Size = new Size(235, 22);\n            mnuSetValue.Text = \u0022Test Set Value\u0022;\n            mnuSetValue.Click \u002B= MnuSetValue_Click;\n            // \n            // mnuAddClickTo\n            // \n            mnuAddClickTo.Name = \u0022mnuAddClickTo\u0022;\n            mnuAddClickTo.Size = new Size(235, 22);\n            mnuAddClickTo.Text = \u0022Add Click Step To...\u0022;\n            // \n            // mnuAddSetValueTo\n            // \n            mnuAddSetValueTo.Name = \u0022mnuAddSetValueTo\u0022;\n            mnuAddSetValueTo.Size = new Size(235, 22);\n            mnuAddSetValueTo.Text = \u0022Add Set Value Step To...\u0022;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            ((System.ComponentModel.ISupportInitialize)splitEditor).EndInit();\n            splitEditor.ResumeLayout(false);\n            pnlEditorTop.ResumeLayout(false);\n            pnlLogs.ResumeLayout(false);\n            ctxDomNode.ResumeLayout(false);\n            menuStripMain.ResumeLayout(false);\n            menuStripMain.PerformLayout();\n            ResumeLayout(false);\n            PerformLayout();\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n            ((System.ComponentModel.ISupportInitialize)splitEditor).EndInit();\n            splitEditor.ResumeLayout(false);\n            pnlEditorTop.ResumeLayout(false);\n            pnlLogs.ResumeLayout(false);\n            ctxDomNode.ResumeLayout(false);\n            menuStripMain.ResumeLayout(false);\n            menuStripMain.PerformLayout();\n            splitSequences.Panel1.ResumeLayout(false);\n            splitSequences.Panel2.ResumeLayout(false);\n            ((System.ComponentModel.ISupportInitialize)splitSequences).EndInit();\n            splitSequences.ResumeLayout(false);\n            pnlSequencesTop.ResumeLayout(false);\n            ResumeLayout(false);\n            PerformLayout();\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void MnuFileNew_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            lstSteps.Items.Clear();\n            Log(\u0022[SYS] Started new automation project.\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileOpen_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var ofd = new OpenFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Open Automation Project\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (ofd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    string json = File.ReadAllText(ofd.FileName);\n                    var steps = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CList\u003CAutomationStep\u003E\u003E(json);\n                    if (steps != null)\n                    {\n                        lstSteps.Items.Clear();\n                        foreach (var step in steps)\n                        {\n                            lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                        }\n                        Log($\u0022[SYS] Loaded project from {ofd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                    }\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to load project: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileSave_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Save Automation Project\u0022,\n                DefaultExt = \u0022json\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    var steps = lstSteps.Items.Cast\u003CAutomationStep\u003E().ToList();\n                    string json = JsonSerializer.Serialize(steps, new JsonSerializerOptions { WriteIndented = true });\n                    File.WriteAllText(sfd.FileName, json);\n                    Log($\u0022[SYS] Saved project to {sfd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to save project: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void MnuFileNew_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            chkLstSequences.Items.Clear();\n            lstSteps.Items.Clear();\n            Log(\u0022[SYS] Started new automation project.\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileOpen_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var ofd = new OpenFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Open Automation Project\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (ofd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    string json = File.ReadAllText(ofd.FileName);\n                    var sequences = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CList\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E\u003E(json);\n                    if (sequences != null)\n                    {\n                        chkLstSequences.Items.Clear();\n                        lstSteps.Items.Clear();\n                        foreach (var seq in sequences)\n                        {\n                            chkLstSequences.Items.Add(seq, seq.IsActive);\n                        }\n                        if (chkLstSequences.Items.Count \u003E 0) chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = 0;\n                        Log($\u0022[SYS] Loaded project from {ofd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                    }\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to load project: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileSave_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Save Automation Project\u0022,\n                DefaultExt = \u0022json\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    var sequences = chkLstSequences.Items.Cast\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E().ToList();\n                    string json = JsonSerializer.Serialize(sequences, new JsonSerializerOptions { WriteIndented = true });\n                    File.WriteAllText(sfd.FileName, json);\n                    Log($\u0022[SYS] Saved project to {sfd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to save project: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void MnuAddClickStep_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedNode?.Tag is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n            {\n                var step = new AutomationStep\n                {\n                    Name = $\u0022Click \u003C{domNode.TagName}\u003E\u0022,\n                    ActionType = AutomationActionType.Click,\n                    Selector = domNode.Path\n                };\n                lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                tabMain.SelectedTab = tabEditor;\n                lstSteps.SelectedItem = step;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void MnuAddSetValueStep_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedNode?.Tag is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n            {\n                var step = new AutomationStep\n                {\n                    Name = $\u0022Set Value \u003C{domNode.TagName}\u003E\u0022,\n                    ActionType = AutomationActionType.SetValue,\n                    Selector = domNode.Path\n                };\n                lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                tabMain.SelectedTab = tabEditor;\n                lstSteps.SelectedItem = step;\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void CtxDomNode_Opening(object? sender, System.ComponentModel.CancelEventArgs e)\n        {\n            mnuAddClickTo.DropDownItems.Clear();\n            mnuAddSetValueTo.DropDownItems.Clear();\n\n            if (chkLstSequences.Items.Count == 0)\n            {\n                mnuAddClickTo.DropDownItems.Add(new ToolStripMenuItem(\u0022(No lists available)\u0022) { Enabled = false });\n                mnuAddSetValueTo.DropDownItems.Add(new ToolStripMenuItem(\u0022(No lists available)\u0022) { Enabled = false });\n                return;\n            }\n\n            foreach (AutomationSequence seq in chkLstSequences.Items)\n            {\n                var clickItem = new ToolStripMenuItem(seq.Name);\n                clickItem.Click \u002B= (s, args) =\u003E AddStepToSequence(seq, AutomationActionType.Click);\n                mnuAddClickTo.DropDownItems.Add(clickItem);\n\n                var setValItem = new ToolStripMenuItem(seq.Name);\n                setValItem.Click \u002B= (s, args) =\u003E AddStepToSequence(seq, AutomationActionType.SetValue);\n                mnuAddSetValueTo.DropDownItems.Add(setValItem);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void AddStepToSequence(AutomationSequence seq, AutomationActionType actionType)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedNode?.Tag is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n            {\n                var step = new AutomationStep\n                {\n                    Name = $\u0022{(actionType == AutomationActionType.Click ? \u0022Click\u0022 : \u0022Set Value\u0022)} \u003C{domNode.TagName}\u003E\u0022,\n                    ActionType = actionType,\n                    Selector = domNode.Path\n                };\n                seq.Steps.Add(step);\n                \n                if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem == seq)\n                {\n                    lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                    lstSteps.SelectedItem = step;\n                }\n                \n                tabMain.SelectedTab = tabEditor;\n                Log($\u0022[SYS] Added step to list \u0027{seq.Name}\u0027\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void BtnAddStep_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            var step = new AutomationStep();\n            lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n            lstSteps.SelectedItem = step;\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRemoveStep_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstSteps.SelectedItem != null)\n            {\n                lstSteps.Items.Remove(lstSteps.SelectedItem);\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void BtnAddStep_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq)\n            {\n                var step = new AutomationStep();\n                seq.Steps.Add(step);\n                lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                lstSteps.SelectedItem = step;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select an automation list first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRemoveStep_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedItem is AutomationStep step)\n            {\n                seq.Steps.Remove(step);\n                lstSteps.Items.Remove(step);\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void BtnMoveUp_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstSteps.SelectedItem == null || lstSteps.SelectedIndex == 0) return;\n            \n            int idx = lstSteps.SelectedIndex;\n            var item = lstSteps.SelectedItem;\n            \n            lstSteps.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n            lstSteps.Items.Insert(idx - 1, item);\n            lstSteps.SelectedIndex = idx - 1;\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveDown_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstSteps.SelectedItem == null || lstSteps.SelectedIndex == lstSteps.Items.Count - 1) return;\n            \n            int idx = lstSteps.SelectedIndex;\n            var item = lstSteps.SelectedItem;\n            \n            lstSteps.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n            lstSteps.Items.Insert(idx \u002B 1, item);\n            lstSteps.SelectedIndex = idx \u002B 1;\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnRunAutomation_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a client first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (lstSteps.Items.Count == 0) return;\n\n            Log(\u0022[SYS] Starting Automation Run...\u0022, Color.Magenta);\n            btnRunAutomation.Enabled = false;\n\n            try\n            {\n                foreach (AutomationStep step in lstSteps.Items)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[AUTO] Executing: {step.Name}\u0022, Color.Plum);\n                    CommandResult res = null;\n                    \n                    if (step.ActionType == AutomationActionType.Click)\n                    {\n                        res = await client.ClickReactElementAsync(step.Selector);\n                    }\n                    else if (step.ActionType == AutomationActionType.SetValue)\n                    {\n                        res = await client.SetReactInputValueAsync(step.Selector, step.Value, step.Overwrite);\n                    }\n                    else if (step.ActionType == AutomationActionType.EvaluateScript)\n                    {\n                        res = await client.EvaluateJavaScriptAsync(step.Value);\n                    }\n\n                    if (res != null)\n                    {\n                        Log($\u0022[AUTO-RX] {res.Status} | {res.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n                    }\n                    \n                    await Task.Delay(500);\n                }\n                Log(\u0022[SYS] Automation Run Completed.\u0022, Color.Lime);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Automation aborted: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                btnRunAutomation.Enabled = true;\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void BtnMoveUp_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedItem is AutomationStep step \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedIndex \u003E 0)\n            {\n                int idx = lstSteps.SelectedIndex;\n                seq.Steps.RemoveAt(idx);\n                seq.Steps.Insert(idx - 1, step);\n                \n                lstSteps.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                lstSteps.Items.Insert(idx - 1, step);\n                lstSteps.SelectedIndex = idx - 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveDown_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedItem is AutomationStep step \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedIndex \u003C lstSteps.Items.Count - 1)\n            {\n                int idx = lstSteps.SelectedIndex;\n                seq.Steps.RemoveAt(idx);\n                seq.Steps.Insert(idx \u002B 1, step);\n                \n                lstSteps.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                lstSteps.Items.Insert(idx \u002B 1, step);\n                lstSteps.SelectedIndex = idx \u002B 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void ChkLstSequences_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            lstSteps.Items.Clear();\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq)\n            {\n                foreach (var step in seq.Steps)\n                {\n                    lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void ChkLstSequences_ItemCheck(object? sender, ItemCheckEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.Items[e.Index] is AutomationSequence seq)\n            {\n                seq.IsActive = e.NewValue == CheckState.Checked;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnAddSequence_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new list name:\u0022, \u0022Add Automation List\u0022);\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name))\n            {\n                var seq = new AutomationSequence { Name = name };\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Add(seq, true);\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedItem = seq;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRemoveSequence_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem != null)\n            {\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Remove(chkLstSequences.SelectedItem);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveSeqUp_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem != null \u0026\u0026 chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex \u003E 0)\n            {\n                int idx = chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex;\n                var item = chkLstSequences.SelectedItem;\n                bool isChecked = chkLstSequences.GetItemChecked(idx);\n                \n                chkLstSequences.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Insert(idx - 1, item);\n                chkLstSequences.SetItemChecked(idx - 1, isChecked);\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = idx - 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveSeqDown_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem != null \u0026\u0026 chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex \u003C chkLstSequences.Items.Count - 1)\n            {\n                int idx = chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex;\n                var item = chkLstSequences.SelectedItem;\n                bool isChecked = chkLstSequences.GetItemChecked(idx);\n                \n                chkLstSequences.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Insert(idx \u002B 1, item);\n                chkLstSequences.SetItemChecked(idx \u002B 1, isChecked);\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = idx \u002B 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRenameSeq_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq)\n            {\n                string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new list name:\u0022, \u0022Rename Automation List\u0022);\n                if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name))\n                {\n                    seq.Name = name;\n                    int idx = chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex;\n                    bool isChecked = chkLstSequences.GetItemChecked(idx);\n                    chkLstSequences.Items[idx] = seq;\n                    chkLstSequences.SetItemChecked(idx, isChecked);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnRunAutomation_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a client first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            var activeSequences = chkLstSequences.Items.Cast\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E()\n                .Where((seq, idx) =\u003E chkLstSequences.GetItemChecked(idx))\n                .ToList();\n\n            if (activeSequences.Count == 0)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No active automation lists selected to run.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            Log(\u0022[SYS] Starting Automation Run...\u0022, Color.Magenta);\n            btnRunAutomation.Enabled = false;\n\n            try\n            {\n                foreach (var seq in activeSequences)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[AUTO] --- Starting List: {seq.Name} ---\u0022, Color.Magenta);\n                    foreach (var step in seq.Steps)\n                    {\n                        Log($\u0022[AUTO] Executing: {step.Name}\u0022, Color.Plum);\n                        CommandResult res = null;\n                        \n                        if (step.ActionType == AutomationActionType.Click)\n                        {\n                            res = await client.ClickReactElementAsync(step.Selector);\n                        }\n                        else if (step.ActionType == AutomationActionType.SetValue)\n                        {\n                            res = await client.SetReactInputValueAsync(step.Selector, step.Value, step.Overwrite);\n                        }\n                        else if (step.ActionType == AutomationActionType.EvaluateScript)\n                        {\n                            res = await client.EvaluateJavaScriptAsync(step.Value);\n                        }\n\n                        if (res != null)\n                        {\n                            Log($\u0022[AUTO-RX] {res.Status} | {res.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n                        }\n                        \n                        await Task.Delay(500);\n                    }\n                }\n                Log(\u0022[SYS] Automation Run Completed.\u0022, Color.Lime);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Automation aborted: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                btnRunAutomation.Enabled = true;\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060",
      "ModelExplanation": "I have implemented the multiple automation lists feature.\n\n- Created a new \u0060AutomationSequence\u0060 model to hold a list of steps.\n- Updated the UI in the \u0022Automation Editor\u0022 tab to include a \u0060CheckedListBox\u0060 for managing multiple automation lists.\n- Added buttons to Add, Remove, Rename, and Move lists up/down.\n- Updated the DOM viewer\u0027s right-click context menu to dynamically populate submenus with your available automation lists, allowing you to add steps directly to any specific list.\n- Updated the \u0022Run Automation\u0022 logic to iterate through all checked automation lists in the order they appear, executing their steps sequentially.\n- Updated the Save/Load functionality to serialize and deserialize the entire collection of automation lists and their checked states.\n\nTo test:\n\n- Open the application and go to the \u0022Automation Editor\u0022 tab.\n- Click \u0022Add List\u0022 to create a few automation lists (e.g., \u0022Login\u0022, \u0022Navigate\u0022, \u0022Scrape\u0022).\n- Go to the \u0022DOM Explorer\u0022 tab, right-click an element, and hover over \u0022Add Click Step To...\u0022 or \u0022Add Set Value Step To...\u0022. You will see your lists as submenus. Click one to add the step to that specific list.\n- Back in the \u0022Automation Editor\u0022, select different lists to see their individual steps. Use the checkboxes to enable/disable lists for the run.\n- Use the \u0022Move Up\u0022 and \u0022Move Down\u0022 buttons above the lists to reorder them.\n- Click \u0022Run Automation\u0022 and verify it only runs the checked lists in the order they appear.\n- Save the project and open it again to verify the lists, steps, and checked states are preserved.",
