      "UserPrompt": "The root directory for this project is: C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\nThe following directories are currently tracked/active for this project (place new files in these directories unless otherwise specified):\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\n\nStudy this project, for as we will be working on it.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\nI have studied the \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060 and \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 projects, including:\n\n- **BrowserAutomationFramework**:\n\n- \u0060AutomationServer\u0060 and \u0060BrowserClient\u0060 for managing HTTP Polling and WebSocket IPC connections with browser instances.\n- \u0060ScriptGenerator\u0060 for generating Tampermonkey userscripts with React event simulation (\u0060REACT_CLICK\u0060, \u0060SET_VALUE\u0060), JS evaluation (\u0060EVAL\u0060), DOM serialization (\u0060GET_DOM\u0060), element highlighting, and mutation/click observers.\n- \u0060ReactExtensions\u0060 and IPC models (\u0060CommandMessage\u0060, \u0060CommandResult\u0060, \u0060EventMessage\u0060, \u0060ScriptOptions\u0060, \u0060IpcMode\u0060).\n- **TestBedApp**:\n\n- \u0060MainForm\u0060 and \u0060DomTreeView\u0060 for managing connected clients, raw commands, live DOM exploration, automation sequences/steps, and project serialization (\u0060AutomationProject\u0060, \u0060AutomationSequence\u0060, \u0060AutomationStep\u0060, \u0060DomNode\u0060).\n- Dark mode utilities (\u0060DarkMessageBox\u0060, \u0060DarkModeTitleBar\u0060, \u0060ReThemer\u0060, \u0060FileAssociationHelper\u0060).\n\nReady for your instructions.",
      "ModelExplanation": "I have studied the \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060 and \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 projects, including:\n\n- **BrowserAutomationFramework**:\n\n- \u0060AutomationServer\u0060 and \u0060BrowserClient\u0060 for managing HTTP Polling and WebSocket IPC connections with browser instances.\n- \u0060ScriptGenerator\u0060 for generating Tampermonkey userscripts with React event simulation (\u0060REACT_CLICK\u0060, \u0060SET_VALUE\u0060), JS evaluation (\u0060EVAL\u0060), DOM serialization (\u0060GET_DOM\u0060), element highlighting, and mutation/click observers.\n- \u0060ReactExtensions\u0060 and IPC models (\u0060CommandMessage\u0060, \u0060CommandResult\u0060, \u0060EventMessage\u0060, \u0060ScriptOptions\u0060, \u0060IpcMode\u0060).\n- **TestBedApp**:\n\n- \u0060MainForm\u0060 and \u0060DomTreeView\u0060 for managing connected clients, raw commands, live DOM exploration, automation sequences/steps, and project serialization (\u0060AutomationProject\u0060, \u0060AutomationSequence\u0060, \u0060AutomationStep\u0060, \u0060DomNode\u0060).\n- Dark mode utilities (\u0060DarkMessageBox\u0060, \u0060DarkModeTitleBar\u0060, \u0060ReThemer\u0060, \u0060FileAssociationHelper\u0060).\n\nReady for your instructions.",
