    {
      "Id": "2b3bc481",
      "Timestamp": "2026-10-27T15:45:29.5071413-05:00",
      "UserPrompt": "This is perfect! Now i want you to study the codebase as a whole, and see where you can migrate logic into the BrowserAutomationFramework project. We want this to be as modular and extensible as possible for other developers. So our test bed app needs to ONLY be a UI wrapper. WE want the rest of the project to be an api that is easy for other devs to expand upon.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\n### Changes Made\n\n- **Migrated Core Models \u0026 Project Persistence (\u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\\u0060)**:\n\n- Moved \u0060DomNode\u0060, \u0060AutomationStep\u0060, \u0060AutomationActionType\u0060, \u0060AutomationSequence\u0060, and \u0060AutomationProject\u0060 from \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 into \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\u0060.\n- Added DOM helper methods on \u0060DomNode\u0060 (\u0060FindByPath\u0060, \u0060QueryAll\u0060, \u0060GetFormattedDetails\u0060, \u0060CreateStep\u0060).\n- Added step management helpers on \u0060AutomationSequence\u0060 (\u0060MoveStepUp\u0060, \u0060MoveStepDown\u0060) and serialization/persistence \u002B script option builders on \u0060AutomationProject\u0060 (\u0060FromJson\u0060 with automatic legacy format fallback, \u0060ToJson\u0060, \u0060LoadFromFile\u0060, \u0060LoadFromFileAsync\u0060, \u0060SaveToFile\u0060, \u0060SaveToFileAsync\u0060, \u0060CreateScriptOptions\u0060).\n- Added strongly-typed event argument models in \u0060BrowserEventArgs.cs\u0060 (\u0060DomChangedEventArgs\u0060, \u0060ElementClickedEventArgs\u0060, \u0060AutomationSequenceEventArgs\u0060, \u0060AutomationStepEventArgs\u0060).\n- **Created Extensible Automation Execution Engine (\u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\\Automation\\AutomationRunner.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Added \u0060AutomationRunner\u0060 to execute projects, sequences, and individual steps against a \u0060BrowserClient\u0060.\n- Exposed \u0060RegisterStepHandler\u0060 and \u0060RegisterCustomActionHandler\u0060 so developers can register custom step logic or override built-in step types (\u0060Click\u0060, \u0060SetValue\u0060, \u0060EvaluateScript\u0060, \u0060Custom\u0060).\n- Added lifecycle events (\u0060OnSequenceStarted\u0060, \u0060OnSequenceCompleted\u0060, \u0060OnStepStarted\u0060, \u0060OnStepCompleted\u0060, \u0060OnStepFailed\u0060).\n- **Expanded Client, Server, Generator \u0026 Extension APIs**:\n\n- Updated \u0060BrowserClient\u0060 with strongly-typed browser events (\u0060OnDomChanged\u0060, \u0060OnHighlightedElementRemoved\u0060, \u0060OnElementClicked\u0060) and \u0060SendRawCommandAsync\u0060 for automatic JSON/string payload parsing.\n- Updated \u0060AutomationServer\u0060 with \u0060OnClientDisconnected\u0060 when WebSocket or HTTP Polling clients disconnect.\n- Updated \u0060ReactExtensions\u0060 with \u0060GetDomNodeAsync\u0060, \u0060ExecuteStepAsync\u0060, \u0060ExecuteSequenceAsync\u0060, and \u0060ExecuteProjectAsync\u0060.\n- Added \u0060ScriptGenerator.Generate(AutomationProject, ...)\u0060 overload.\n- **Refactored \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 into a Pure UI Wrapper**:\n\n- Replaced inline JSON parsing, DOM formatting, file load/save logic, and step execution loops in \u0060MainForm.cs\u0060 with calls to \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060 APIs.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Build the solution and verify both \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060 and \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 compile cleanly.\n- Run \u0060TestBedApp\u0060, start the server, and connect a browser client.\n- Verify DOM Explorer loading, element selection/highlighting, raw command execution, project Open/Save, script generation, and running automation sequences.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\DomNode.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Text;\nusing System.Text.Json.Serialization;\n\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\n{\n    public class DomNode\n    {\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022type\u0022)]\n        public string Type { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022tagName\u0022)]\n        public string? TagName { get; set; }\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022path\u0022)]\n        public string? Path { get; set; }\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022text\u0022)]\n        public string? Text { get; set; }\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022attributes\u0022)]\n        public Dictionary\u003Cstring, string\u003E? Attributes { get; set; }\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022children\u0022)]\n        public List\u003CDomNode\u003E? Children { get; set; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Recursively searches this DOM subtree for a node matching the specified CSS path.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomNode? FindByPath(string path)\n        {\n            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(path)) return null;\n            if (Path == path) return this;\n\n            if (Children != null)\n            {\n                foreach (var child in Children)\n                {\n                    var found = child.FindByPath(path);\n                    if (found != null) return found;\n                }\n            }\n\n            return null;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Recursively returns all nodes in this DOM subtree matching the given predicate.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public IEnumerable\u003CDomNode\u003E QueryAll(Func\u003CDomNode, bool\u003E predicate)\n        {\n            if (predicate(this))\n            {\n                yield return this;\n            }\n\n            if (Children != null)\n            {\n                foreach (var child in Children)\n                {\n                    foreach (var match in child.QueryAll(predicate))\n                    {\n                        yield return match;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Returns a formatted multi-line summary of the DOM node\u0027s properties and attributes.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string GetFormattedDetails()\n        {\n            var details = new StringBuilder();\n            details.AppendLine($\u0022Type: {Type}\u0022);\n            if (Type == \u0022element\u0022)\n            {\n                details.AppendLine($\u0022Tag: {TagName}\u0022);\n                details.AppendLine($\u0022Path: {Path}\u0022);\n                details.AppendLine(\u0022Attributes:\u0022);\n                if (Attributes != null)\n                {\n                    foreach (var kvp in Attributes)\n                    {\n                        details.AppendLine($\u0022  {kvp.Key} = \\\u0022{kvp.Value}\\\u0022\u0022);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            else if (Type == \u0022text\u0022)\n            {\n                details.AppendLine($\u0022Text: {Text}\u0022);\n            }\n\n            return details.ToString();\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Creates an \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationStep\u0022/\u003E targeting this DOM node.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationStep CreateStep(AutomationActionType actionType, string value = \u0022\u0022, bool overwrite = true)\n        {\n            string actionLabel = actionType switch\n            {\n                AutomationActionType.Click =\u003E \u0022Click\u0022,\n                AutomationActionType.SetValue =\u003E \u0022Set Value\u0022,\n                AutomationActionType.EvaluateScript =\u003E \u0022Evaluate Script\u0022,\n                _ =\u003E actionType.ToString()\n            };\n\n            return new AutomationStep\n            {\n                Name = $\u0022{actionLabel} \u003C{TagName}\u003E\u0022,\n                ActionType = actionType,\n                Selector = Path ?? string.Empty,\n                Value = value,\n                Overwrite = overwrite\n            };\n        }\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\AutomationStep.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System.Text.Json.Serialization;\n\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\n{\n    public enum AutomationActionType\n    {\n        Click,\n        SetValue,\n        EvaluateScript,\n        Custom\n    }\n\n    public class AutomationStep\n    {\n        public string Name { get; set; } = \u0022New Step\u0022;\n        public AutomationActionType ActionType { get; set; }\n        public string CustomCommandType { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n        public string Selector { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n        public string Value { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n        public bool Overwrite { get; set; } = true;\n        public int DelayAfterMs { get; set; } = 500;\n\n        public override string ToString() =\u003E $\u0022{Name} ({ActionType})\u0022;\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\AutomationSequence.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Text.Json.Serialization;\n\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\n{\n    public class AutomationSequence\n    {\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022id\u0022)]\n        public string Id { get; set; } = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022name\u0022)]\n        public string Name { get; set; } = \u0022New Sequence\u0022;\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022isActive\u0022)]\n        public bool IsActive { get; set; } = true;\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022steps\u0022)]\n        public List\u003CAutomationStep\u003E Steps { get; set; } = new();\n\n        public bool MoveStepUp(int index)\n        {\n            if (index \u003C= 0 || index \u003E= Steps.Count) return false;\n            var step = Steps[index];\n            Steps.RemoveAt(index);\n            Steps.Insert(index - 1, step);\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        public bool MoveStepDown(int index)\n        {\n            if (index \u003C 0 || index \u003E= Steps.Count - 1) return false;\n            var step = Steps[index];\n            Steps.RemoveAt(index);\n            Steps.Insert(index \u002B 1, step);\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        public override string ToString() =\u003E Name;\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\AutomationProject.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.IO;\nusing System.Linq;\nusing System.Text.Json;\nusing System.Text.Json.Serialization;\nusing System.Threading;\nusing System.Threading.Tasks;\n\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\n{\n    public class AutomationProject\n    {\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022matchAnySite\u0022)]\n        public bool MatchAnySite { get; set; } = true;\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022matchUrls\u0022)]\n        public List\u003Cstring\u003E MatchUrls { get; set; } = new();\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022sequences\u0022)]\n        public List\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E Sequences { get; set; } = new();\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Builds a \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScriptOptions\u0022/\u003E instance configured from this project\u0027s match rules.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public ScriptOptions CreateScriptOptions(int port, IpcMode mode, string? customScript = null)\n        {\n            var options = new ScriptOptions\n            {\n                Port = port,\n                Mode = mode,\n                CustomScript = customScript ?? string.Empty\n            };\n\n            if (!MatchAnySite \u0026\u0026 MatchUrls != null \u0026\u0026 MatchUrls.Any(u =\u003E !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(u)))\n            {\n                options.MatchUrls = MatchUrls.Where(u =\u003E !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(u)).Select(u =\u003E u.Trim()).ToList();\n            }\n\n            return options;\n        }\n\n        public string ToJson(bool writeIndented = true)\n        {\n            return JsonSerializer.Serialize(this, new JsonSerializerOptions { WriteIndented = writeIndented });\n        }\n\n        public static AutomationProject FromJson(string json)\n        {\n            if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(json))\n                throw new ArgumentException(\u0022Project JSON cannot be empty.\u0022, nameof(json));\n\n            try\n            {\n                var project = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CAutomationProject\u003E(json);\n                if (project != null \u0026\u0026 project.Sequences != null)\n                {\n                    return project;\n                }\n            }\n            catch\n            {\n                // Fallback to legacy format (List\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E)\n            }\n\n            var legacySequences = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CList\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E\u003E(json);\n            if (legacySequences != null)\n            {\n                return new AutomationProject\n                {\n                    MatchAnySite = true,\n                    Sequences = legacySequences\n                };\n            }\n\n            throw new InvalidDataException(\u0022Unable to deserialize AutomationProject from JSON.\u0022);\n        }\n\n        public void SaveToFile(string filePath)\n        {\n            File.WriteAllText(filePath, ToJson(true));\n        }\n\n        public Task SaveToFileAsync(string filePath, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            return File.WriteAllTextAsync(filePath, ToJson(true), cancellationToken);\n        }\n\n        public static AutomationProject LoadFromFile(string filePath)\n        {\n            string json = File.ReadAllText(filePath);\n            return FromJson(json);\n        }\n\n        public static async Task\u003CAutomationProject\u003E LoadFromFileAsync(string filePath, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            string json = await File.ReadAllTextAsync(filePath, cancellationToken);\n            return FromJson(json);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\BrowserEventArgs.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System;\n\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\n{\n    public class DomChangedEventArgs : EventArgs\n    {\n        public string? HighlightedPath { get; }\n        public bool HasHighlightedPath { get; }\n\n        public DomChangedEventArgs(string? highlightedPath, bool hasHighlightedPath)\n        {\n            HighlightedPath = highlightedPath;\n            HasHighlightedPath = hasHighlightedPath;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public class ElementClickedEventArgs : EventArgs\n    {\n        public string Path { get; }\n\n        public ElementClickedEventArgs(string path)\n        {\n            Path = path;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public class AutomationSequenceEventArgs : EventArgs\n    {\n        public AutomationSequence Sequence { get; }\n\n        public AutomationSequenceEventArgs(AutomationSequence sequence)\n        {\n            Sequence = sequence;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public class AutomationStepEventArgs : EventArgs\n    {\n        public AutomationSequence? Sequence { get; }\n        public AutomationStep Step { get; }\n        public CommandResult? Result { get; }\n        public Exception? Error { get; }\n\n        public AutomationStepEventArgs(AutomationSequence? sequence, AutomationStep step, CommandResult? result = null, Exception? error = null)\n        {\n            Sequence = sequence;\n            Step = step;\n            Result = result;\n            Error = error;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Automation\\AutomationRunner.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System;\nusing System.Collections.Concurrent;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Linq;\nusing System.Threading;\nusing System.Threading.Tasks;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Extensions;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Models;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Server;\n\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Automation\n{\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Modular execution engine for running \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationProject\u0022/\u003E, \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationSequence\u0022/\u003E, and \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationStep\u0022/\u003E workflows.\n    /// Allows developers to register custom step handlers and subscribe to execution lifecycle events.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public class AutomationRunner\n    {\n        public delegate Task\u003CCommandResult?\u003E StepHandlerDelegate(BrowserClient client, AutomationStep step, CancellationToken cancellationToken);\n\n        private readonly ConcurrentDictionary\u003CAutomationActionType, StepHandlerDelegate\u003E _stepHandlers = new();\n        private readonly ConcurrentDictionary\u003Cstring, StepHandlerDelegate\u003E _customCommandHandlers = new(StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase);\n\n        public event EventHandler\u003CAutomationSequenceEventArgs\u003E? OnSequenceStarted;\n        public event EventHandler\u003CAutomationSequenceEventArgs\u003E? OnSequenceCompleted;\n        public event EventHandler\u003CAutomationStepEventArgs\u003E? OnStepStarted;\n        public event EventHandler\u003CAutomationStepEventArgs\u003E? OnStepCompleted;\n        public event EventHandler\u003CAutomationStepEventArgs\u003E? OnStepFailed;\n\n        public AutomationRunner()\n        {\n            RegisterDefaultHandlers();\n        }\n\n        private void RegisterDefaultHandlers()\n        {\n            RegisterStepHandler(AutomationActionType.Click, (client, step, ct) =\u003E\n                client.ClickReactElementAsync(step.Selector, ct)!);\n\n            RegisterStepHandler(AutomationActionType.SetValue, (client, step, ct) =\u003E\n                client.SetReactInputValueAsync(step.Selector, step.Value, step.Overwrite, ct)!);\n\n            RegisterStepHandler(AutomationActionType.EvaluateScript, (client, step, ct) =\u003E\n                client.EvaluateJavaScriptAsync(step.Value, ct)!);\n\n            RegisterStepHandler(AutomationActionType.Custom, async (client, step, ct) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(step.CustomCommandType) \u0026\u0026\n                    _customCommandHandlers.TryGetValue(step.CustomCommandType, out var customHandler))\n                {\n                    return await customHandler(client, step, ct);\n                }\n\n                string cmdType = !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(step.CustomCommandType) ? step.CustomCommandType : step.Name;\n                return await client.SendRawCommandAsync(cmdType, step.Value, ct);\n            });\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Registers or overrides the execution handler for a given \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationActionType\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void RegisterStepHandler(AutomationActionType actionType, StepHandlerDelegate handler)\n        {\n            _stepHandlers[actionType] = handler ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(handler));\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Registers a custom step handler keyed by \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationStep.CustomCommandType\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void RegisterCustomActionHandler(string customCommandType, StepHandlerDelegate handler)\n        {\n            if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(customCommandType))\n                throw new ArgumentException(\u0022Custom command type cannot be empty.\u0022, nameof(customCommandType));\n\n            _customCommandHandlers[customCommandType] = handler ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(handler));\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Runs all active sequences in an \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationProject\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public Task RunProjectAsync(BrowserClient client, AutomationProject project, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (project == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(project));\n            var activeSequences = project.Sequences.Where(s =\u003E s.IsActive);\n            return RunSequencesAsync(client, activeSequences, cancellationToken);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Runs a collection of \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationSequence\u0022/\u003E instances sequentially.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task RunSequencesAsync(BrowserClient client, IEnumerable\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E sequences, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (client == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(client));\n            if (sequences == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(sequences));\n\n            foreach (var sequence in sequences)\n            {\n                cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n                await RunSequenceAsync(client, sequence, cancellationToken);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Runs all steps in a single \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationSequence\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task RunSequenceAsync(BrowserClient client, AutomationSequence sequence, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (client == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(client));\n            if (sequence == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(sequence));\n\n            OnSequenceStarted?.Invoke(this, new AutomationSequenceEventArgs(sequence));\n\n            foreach (var step in sequence.Steps)\n            {\n                cancellationToken.ThrowIfCancellationRequested();\n                await ExecuteStepInternalAsync(client, sequence, step, cancellationToken);\n\n                if (step.DelayAfterMs \u003E 0)\n                {\n                    await Task.Delay(step.DelayAfterMs, cancellationToken);\n                }\n            }\n\n            OnSequenceCompleted?.Invoke(this, new AutomationSequenceEventArgs(sequence));\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Executes a single \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationStep\u0022/\u003E against the specified client.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public Task\u003CCommandResult?\u003E RunStepAsync(BrowserClient client, AutomationStep step, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (client == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(client));\n            if (step == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(step));\n\n            return ExecuteStepInternalAsync(client, null, step, cancellationToken);\n        }\n\n        private async Task\u003CCommandResult?\u003E ExecuteStepInternalAsync(BrowserClient client, AutomationSequence? sequence, AutomationStep step, CancellationToken cancellationToken)\n        {\n            OnStepStarted?.Invoke(this, new AutomationStepEventArgs(sequence, step));\n\n            try\n            {\n                if (!_stepHandlers.TryGetValue(step.ActionType, out var handler))\n                {\n                    throw new NotSupportedException($\u0022No handler registered for action type \u0027{step.ActionType}\u0027.\u0022);\n                }\n\n                var result = await handler(client, step, cancellationToken);\n                OnStepCompleted?.Invoke(this, new AutomationStepEventArgs(sequence, step, result));\n                return result;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                OnStepFailed?.Invoke(this, new AutomationStepEventArgs(sequence, step, null, ex));\n                throw;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Server\\BrowserClient.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Triggered when the browser script sends an event.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CEventMessage\u003E? OnEventReceived;\n\n        public BrowserClient(string instanceId, IpcMode mode, WebSocket? webSocket = null)\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Triggered when the browser script sends an event.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CEventMessage\u003E? OnEventReceived;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Triggered when the page DOM mutates.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CDomChangedEventArgs\u003E? OnDomChanged;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Triggered when the currently highlighted element is removed from the page DOM.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler? OnHighlightedElementRemoved;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Triggered when an element is selected in the browser via middle-click.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CElementClickedEventArgs\u003E? OnElementClicked;\n\n        public BrowserClient(string instanceId, IpcMode mode, WebSocket? webSocket = null)\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        internal bool TryGetNextHttpCommand(out CommandMessage? command)\n        {\n            return _httpCommandQueue.TryDequeue(out command);\n        }\n\n        internal void HandleEvent(EventMessage evt)\n        {\n            OnEventReceived?.Invoke(this, evt);\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Sends a command to the browser, automatically parsing JSON object/array strings if provided.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public Task\u003CCommandResult\u003E SendRawCommandAsync(string type, string? rawPayload, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            object? payload = rawPayload;\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(rawPayload))\n            {\n                string trimmed = rawPayload.Trim();\n                if (trimmed.StartsWith(\u0022{\u0022) || trimmed.StartsWith(\u0022[\u0022))\n                {\n                    try\n                    {\n                        payload = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003Cobject\u003E(trimmed) ?? rawPayload;\n                    }\n                    catch\n                    {\n                        payload = rawPayload;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            return SendCommandAsync(type, payload, cancellationToken);\n        }\n\n        internal bool TryGetNextHttpCommand(out CommandMessage? command)\n        {\n            return _httpCommandQueue.TryDequeue(out command);\n        }\n\n        internal void HandleEvent(EventMessage evt)\n        {\n            OnEventReceived?.Invoke(this, evt);\n\n            try\n            {\n                if (evt.Event == \u0022DOM_CHANGED\u0022)\n                {\n                    string? highlightedPath = null;\n                    bool hasHighlightedPath = false;\n                    if (evt.Payload is JsonElement domPayload \u0026\u0026\n                        domPayload.ValueKind == JsonValueKind.Object \u0026\u0026\n                        domPayload.TryGetProperty(\u0022highlightedPath\u0022, out var hpProp))\n                    {\n                        hasHighlightedPath = true;\n                        highlightedPath = hpProp.ValueKind == JsonValueKind.String ? hpProp.GetString() : null;\n                    }\n\n                    OnDomChanged?.Invoke(this, new DomChangedEventArgs(highlightedPath, hasHighlightedPath));\n                }\n                else if (evt.Event == \u0022ELEMENT_REMOVED\u0022)\n                {\n                    OnHighlightedElementRemoved?.Invoke(this, EventArgs.Empty);\n                }\n                else if (evt.Event == \u0022ELEMENT_CLICKED\u0022)\n                {\n                    if (evt.Payload is JsonElement clickPayload \u0026\u0026\n                        clickPayload.ValueKind == JsonValueKind.Object \u0026\u0026\n                        clickPayload.TryGetProperty(\u0022path\u0022, out var pathProp))\n                    {\n                        string? path = pathProp.GetString();\n                        if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(path))\n                        {\n                            OnElementClicked?.Invoke(this, new ElementClickedEventArgs(path));\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch\n            {\n                // Ignore malformed event payloads\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Server\\AutomationServer.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        public event EventHandler\u003CBrowserClient\u003E? OnClientConnected;\n\n        public AutomationServer(int port = 8081)\n==== REPLACE\n        public event EventHandler\u003CBrowserClient\u003E? OnClientConnected;\n        public event EventHandler\u003CBrowserClient\u003E? OnClientDisconnected;\n\n        public AutomationServer(int port = 8081)\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void CleanupStaleClients(object? state)\n        {\n            var threshold = DateTime.UtcNow.AddSeconds(-10);\n            foreach (var kvp in _clients)\n            {\n                if (kvp.Value.Mode == IpcMode.HttpPolling \u0026\u0026 kvp.Value.LastSeen \u003C threshold)\n                {\n                    _clients.TryRemove(kvp.Key, out _);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void CleanupStaleClients(object? state)\n        {\n            var threshold = DateTime.UtcNow.AddSeconds(-10);\n            foreach (var kvp in _clients)\n            {\n                if (kvp.Value.Mode == IpcMode.HttpPolling \u0026\u0026 kvp.Value.LastSeen \u003C threshold)\n                {\n                    if (_clients.TryRemove(kvp.Key, out var removedClient))\n                    {\n                        OnClientDisconnected?.Invoke(this, removedClient);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            finally\n            {\n                _clients.TryRemove(instanceId, out _);\n                if (webSocket.State != WebSocketState.Closed \u0026\u0026 webSocket.State != WebSocketState.Aborted)\n                {\n                    webSocket.Dispose();\n                }\n            }\n==== REPLACE\n            finally\n            {\n                if (_clients.TryRemove(instanceId, out var removedClient))\n                {\n                    OnClientDisconnected?.Invoke(this, removedClient);\n                }\n                if (webSocket.State != WebSocketState.Closed \u0026\u0026 webSocket.State != WebSocketState.Aborted)\n                {\n                    webSocket.Dispose();\n                }\n            }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Extensions\\ReactExtensions.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\nusing System.Threading;\nusing System.Threading.Tasks;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Models;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Server;\n\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Extensions\n{\n    public static class ReactExtensions\n    {\n==== REPLACE\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Text.Json;\nusing System.Threading;\nusing System.Threading.Tasks;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Automation;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Models;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Server;\n\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Extensions\n{\n    public static class ReactExtensions\n    {\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Retrieves a serialized representation of the DOM.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static Task\u003CCommandResult\u003E GetDomAsync(this BrowserClient client, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            return client.SendCommandAsync(\u0022GET_DOM\u0022, null, cancellationToken);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Highlights an element on the page using its CSS selector.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Retrieves a serialized representation of the DOM.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static Task\u003CCommandResult\u003E GetDomAsync(this BrowserClient client, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            return client.SendCommandAsync(\u0022GET_DOM\u0022, null, cancellationToken);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Retrieves and deserializes the page DOM into a \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomNode\u0022/\u003E tree.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static async Task\u003CDomNode?\u003E GetDomNodeAsync(this BrowserClient client, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var result = await client.GetDomAsync(cancellationToken);\n            if (result.Status == \u0022completed\u0022 \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(result.Output))\n            {\n                return JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CDomNode\u003E(result.Output);\n            }\n            return null;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Highlights an element on the page using its CSS selector.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Removes the highlight overlay from the page.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static Task\u003CCommandResult\u003E RemoveHighlightAsync(this BrowserClient client, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            return client.SendCommandAsync(\u0022REMOVE_HIGHLIGHT\u0022, null, cancellationToken);\n        }\n    }\n}\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Removes the highlight overlay from the page.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static Task\u003CCommandResult\u003E RemoveHighlightAsync(this BrowserClient client, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            return client.SendCommandAsync(\u0022REMOVE_HIGHLIGHT\u0022, null, cancellationToken);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Executes a single \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationStep\u0022/\u003E on this client using the provided or default \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationRunner\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static Task\u003CCommandResult?\u003E ExecuteStepAsync(this BrowserClient client, AutomationStep step, AutomationRunner? runner = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var activeRunner = runner ?? new AutomationRunner();\n            return activeRunner.RunStepAsync(client, step, cancellationToken);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Executes an \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationSequence\u0022/\u003E on this client using the provided or default \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationRunner\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static Task ExecuteSequenceAsync(this BrowserClient client, AutomationSequence sequence, AutomationRunner? runner = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var activeRunner = runner ?? new AutomationRunner();\n            return activeRunner.RunSequenceAsync(client, sequence, cancellationToken);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Executes all active sequences in an \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationProject\u0022/\u003E on this client.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static Task ExecuteProjectAsync(this BrowserClient client, AutomationProject project, AutomationRunner? runner = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var activeRunner = runner ?? new AutomationRunner();\n            return activeRunner.RunProjectAsync(client, project, cancellationToken);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Generators\\ScriptGenerator.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n    public static class ScriptGenerator\n    {\n        public static string Generate(ScriptOptions options)\n==== REPLACE\n    public static class ScriptGenerator\n    {\n        public static string Generate(AutomationProject project, int port, IpcMode mode, string? customScript = null)\n        {\n            var options = project.CreateScriptOptions(port, mode, customScript);\n            return Generate(options);\n        }\n\n        public static string Generate(ScriptOptions options)\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\Controls\\DomTreeView.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\nusing System;\nusing System.Drawing;\nusing System.Windows.Forms;\nusing TestBedApp.Models;\n\nnamespace TestBedApp.Controls\n==== REPLACE\nusing System;\nusing System.Drawing;\nusing System.Windows.Forms;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Models;\n\nnamespace TestBedApp.Controls\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\nusing System;\nusing System.Drawing;\nusing System.Linq;\nusing System.Text.Json;\nusing System.Threading;\nusing System.Windows.Forms;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Models;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Server;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Generators;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Extensions;\nusing TestBedApp.Models;\nusing TestBedApp.Utils;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.IO;\n\nnamespace TestBedApp\n{\n    public partial class MainForm : Form\n    {\n        private AutomationServer? _server;\n        private CancellationTokenSource? _cts;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Timer _clientRefreshTimer;\n\n        public MainForm()\n        {\n            InitializeComponent();\n            \n            cmbMode.DataSource = Enum.GetValues(typeof(IpcMode));\n            cmbMode.SelectedIndex = 1;\n\n            _clientRefreshTimer = new System.Windows.Forms.Timer { Interval = 2000 };\n            _clientRefreshTimer.Tick \u002B= ClientRefreshTimer_Tick;\n        }\n==== REPLACE\nusing System;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Drawing;\nusing System.Linq;\nusing System.Threading;\nusing System.Threading.Tasks;\nusing System.Windows.Forms;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Automation;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Extensions;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Generators;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Models;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Server;\nusing TestBedApp.Utils;\n\nnamespace TestBedApp\n{\n    public partial class MainForm : Form\n    {\n        private AutomationServer? _server;\n        private CancellationTokenSource? _cts;\n        private readonly AutomationRunner _runner;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Timer _clientRefreshTimer;\n\n        public MainForm()\n        {\n            InitializeComponent();\n            \n            cmbMode.DataSource = Enum.GetValues(typeof(IpcMode));\n            cmbMode.SelectedIndex = 1;\n\n            _runner = new AutomationRunner();\n            _runner.OnSequenceStarted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[AUTO] --- Starting List: {e.Sequence.Name} ---\u0022, Color.Magenta);\n            _runner.OnStepStarted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[AUTO] Executing: {e.Step.Name}\u0022, Color.Plum);\n            _runner.OnStepCompleted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (e.Result != null)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[AUTO-RX] {e.Result.Status} | {e.Result.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n                }\n            };\n\n            _clientRefreshTimer = new System.Windows.Forms.Timer { Interval = 2000 };\n            _clientRefreshTimer.Tick \u002B= ClientRefreshTimer_Tick;\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private async void BtnStart_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int port = (int)numPort.Value;\n            _server = new AutomationServer(port);\n            _server.OnClientConnected \u002B= Server_OnClientConnected;\n            _cts = new CancellationTokenSource();\n==== REPLACE\n        private async void BtnStart_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int port = (int)numPort.Value;\n            _server = new AutomationServer(port);\n            _server.OnClientConnected \u002B= Server_OnClientConnected;\n            _server.OnClientDisconnected \u002B= Server_OnClientDisconnected;\n            _cts = new CancellationTokenSource();\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void BtnGenerate_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            var options = new ScriptOptions\n            {\n                Port = (int)numPort.Value,\n                Mode = (IpcMode)cmbMode.SelectedItem!\n            };\n\n            if (!chkMatchAnySite.Checked)\n            {\n                var urls = lstMatchUrls.Items.Cast\u003Cstring\u003E().ToList();\n                if (urls.Any())\n                {\n                    options.MatchUrls = urls;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    Log(\u0022[WARN] No Match URLs provided. Defaulting to match any site.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                }\n            }\n            \n            string script = ScriptGenerator.Generate(options);\n            Clipboard.SetText(script);\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Tampermonkey script generated for {options.Mode} and copied to clipboard!\u0022, Color.Lime);\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientConnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Client Connected: {client.InstanceId} via {client.Mode}\u0022, Color.LimeGreen);\n            \n            client.OnStreamDataReceived \u002B= (s, res) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[STREAM \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] {res.Output}\u0022, Color.MediumPurple);\n            };\n\n            client.OnEventReceived \u002B= (s, evt) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (evt.Event == \u0022DOM_CHANGED\u0022)\n                {\n                    Invoke(new Action(async () =\u003E\n                    {\n                        if (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient selectedClient \u0026\u0026 selectedClient.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                        {\n                            string? highlightedPath = null;\n                            bool hasHighlightedPath = false;\n                            try\n                            {\n                                if (evt.Payload is JsonElement domPayload \u0026\u0026 domPayload.ValueKind == JsonValueKind.Object \u0026\u0026 domPayload.TryGetProperty(\u0022highlightedPath\u0022, out var hpProp))\n                                {\n                                    hasHighlightedPath = true;\n                                    highlightedPath = hpProp.ValueKind == JsonValueKind.String ? hpProp.GetString() : null;\n                                }\n                            }\n                            catch { /* Ignore parsing errors */ }\n\n                            await RefreshDomAsync(client, highlightedPath, hasHighlightedPath);\n                        }\n                    }));\n                }\n                else if (evt.Event == \u0022ELEMENT_REMOVED\u0022)\n                {\n                    Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n                    {\n                        if (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient selectedClient \u0026\u0026 selectedClient.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                        {\n                            tvDom.SelectedNode = null;\n                            txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                        }\n                    }));\n                }\n                else if (evt.Event == \u0022ELEMENT_CLICKED\u0022)\n                {\n                    Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n                    {\n                        if (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient selectedClient \u0026\u0026 selectedClient.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                        {\n                            try\n                            {\n                                if (evt.Payload is JsonElement payload \u0026\u0026 payload.TryGetProperty(\u0022path\u0022, out var pathProp))\n                                {\n                                    string path = pathProp.GetString() ?? \u0022\u0022;\n                                    if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(path) \u0026\u0026 tvDom.Nodes.Count \u003E 0)\n                                    {\n                                        var node = FindNodeByPath(tvDom.Nodes[0], path);\n                                        if (node != null)\n                                        {\n                                            tvDom.SelectedNode = node;\n                                            node.EnsureVisible();\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                            catch { /* Ignore parsing errors */ }\n                        }\n                    }));\n                }\n            };\n\n            Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n            {\n                if (!lstClients.Items.Cast\u003CBrowserClient\u003E().Any(c =\u003E c.InstanceId == client.InstanceId))\n                {\n                    lstClients.Items.Add(client);\n                    if (lstClients.Items.Count == 1)\n                    {\n                        lstClients.SelectedIndex = 0;\n                    }\n                }\n            }));\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private AutomationProject BuildCurrentProjectFromUi()\n        {\n            return new AutomationProject\n            {\n                MatchAnySite = chkMatchAnySite.Checked,\n                MatchUrls = lstMatchUrls.Items.Cast\u003Cstring\u003E().ToList(),\n                Sequences = chkLstSequences.Items.Cast\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E().ToList()\n            };\n        }\n\n        private void ApplyProjectToUi(AutomationProject project)\n        {\n            chkMatchAnySite.Checked = project.MatchAnySite;\n            lstMatchUrls.Items.Clear();\n            foreach (var url in project.MatchUrls)\n            {\n                lstMatchUrls.Items.Add(url);\n            }\n\n            chkLstSequences.Items.Clear();\n            lstSteps.Items.Clear();\n            foreach (var seq in project.Sequences)\n            {\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Add(seq, seq.IsActive);\n            }\n\n            if (chkLstSequences.Items.Count \u003E 0)\n            {\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnGenerate_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            var project = BuildCurrentProjectFromUi();\n            if (!project.MatchAnySite \u0026\u0026 project.MatchUrls.Count == 0)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No Match URLs provided. Defaulting to match any site.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n            }\n\n            var mode = (IpcMode)cmbMode.SelectedItem!;\n            string script = ScriptGenerator.Generate(project, (int)numPort.Value, mode);\n            Clipboard.SetText(script);\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Tampermonkey script generated for {mode} and copied to clipboard!\u0022, Color.Lime);\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientConnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Client Connected: {client.InstanceId} via {client.Mode}\u0022, Color.LimeGreen);\n            \n            client.OnStreamDataReceived \u002B= (s, res) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[STREAM \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] {res.Output}\u0022, Color.MediumPurple);\n            };\n\n            client.OnDomChanged \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                Invoke(new Action(async () =\u003E\n                {\n                    if (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient selectedClient \u0026\u0026 selectedClient.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                    {\n                        await RefreshDomAsync(client, e.HighlightedPath, e.HasHighlightedPath);\n                    }\n                }));\n            };\n\n            client.OnHighlightedElementRemoved \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n                {\n                    if (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient selectedClient \u0026\u0026 selectedClient.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                    {\n                        tvDom.SelectedNode = null;\n                        txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                    }\n                }));\n            };\n\n            client.OnElementClicked \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n                {\n                    if (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient selectedClient \u0026\u0026 selectedClient.InstanceId == client.InstanceId \u0026\u0026 tvDom.Nodes.Count \u003E 0)\n                    {\n                        var node = FindNodeByPath(tvDom.Nodes[0], e.Path);\n                        if (node != null)\n                        {\n                            tvDom.SelectedNode = node;\n                            node.EnsureVisible();\n                        }\n                    }\n                }));\n            };\n\n            Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n            {\n                if (!lstClients.Items.Cast\u003CBrowserClient\u003E().Any(c =\u003E c.InstanceId == client.InstanceId))\n                {\n                    lstClients.Items.Add(client);\n                    if (lstClients.Items.Count == 1)\n                    {\n                        lstClients.SelectedIndex = 0;\n                    }\n                }\n            }));\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientDisconnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Client Disconnected: {client.InstanceId}\u0022, Color.Orange);\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n            {\n                Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E lstClients.Items.Remove(client)));\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                lstClients.Items.Remove(client);\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private async void BtnSend_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a client from the list first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            string type = txtCmdType.Text;\n            string payloadStr = txtPayload.Text;\n            object payload = payloadStr;\n\n            try\n            {\n                if (payloadStr.Trim().StartsWith(\u0022{\u0022) || payloadStr.Trim().StartsWith(\u0022[\u0022))\n                {\n                    payload = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003Cobject\u003E(payloadStr) ?? payloadStr;\n                }\n            }\n            catch { /* Ignore, send as string */ }\n\n            Log($\u0022[TX -\u003E {client.InstanceId}] {type} | Payload: {payloadStr}\u0022, Color.DeepSkyBlue);\n            \n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.SendCommandAsync(type, payload);\n                Log($\u0022[RX \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Status: {result.Status} | Output: {result.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private async void BtnSend_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a client from the list first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            string type = txtCmdType.Text;\n            string payloadStr = txtPayload.Text;\n\n            Log($\u0022[TX -\u003E {client.InstanceId}] {type} | Payload: {payloadStr}\u0022, Color.DeepSkyBlue);\n            \n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.SendRawCommandAsync(type, payloadStr);\n                Log($\u0022[RX \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Status: {result.Status} | Output: {result.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.GetDomAsync();\n                if (result.Status == \u0022completed\u0022 \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(result.Output))\n                {\n                    var rootNode = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CDomNode\u003E(result.Output);\n                    if (rootNode != null)\n                    {\n                        string? currentSelectedPath = (tvDom.SelectedNode?.Tag as DomNode)?.Path;\n                        string? selectedPath = hasTargetPath\n                            ? (currentSelectedPath == null ? null : targetSelectedPath)\n                            : currentSelectedPath;\n                        var expandedPaths = new HashSet\u003Cstring\u003E();\n                        if (tvDom.Nodes.Count \u003E 0)\n                        {\n                            SaveExpandedState(tvDom.Nodes[0], expandedPaths);\n                        }\n\n                        tvDom.BeginUpdate();\n                        try\n                        {\n                            tvDom.Nodes.Clear();\n                            var treeNode = BuildTreeNode(rootNode);\n                            tvDom.Nodes.Add(treeNode);\n                            \n                            treeNode.Expand();\n                            RestoreExpandedState(treeNode, expandedPaths);\n\n                            if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(selectedPath))\n                            {\n                                var nodeToSelect = FindNodeByPath(treeNode, selectedPath);\n                                if (nodeToSelect != null)\n                                {\n                                    tvDom.SelectedNode = nodeToSelect;\n                                    nodeToSelect.EnsureVisible();\n                                }\n                                else\n                                {\n                                    tvDom.SelectedNode = null;\n                                    txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                                }\n                            }\n                            else\n                            {\n                                tvDom.SelectedNode = null;\n                                txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                            }\n                        }\n                        finally\n                        {\n                            tvDom.EndUpdate();\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n==== REPLACE\n            try\n            {\n                var rootNode = await client.GetDomNodeAsync();\n                if (rootNode != null)\n                {\n                    string? currentSelectedPath = (tvDom.SelectedNode?.Tag as DomNode)?.Path;\n                    string? selectedPath = hasTargetPath\n                        ? (currentSelectedPath == null ? null : targetSelectedPath)\n                        : currentSelectedPath;\n                    var expandedPaths = new HashSet\u003Cstring\u003E();\n                    if (tvDom.Nodes.Count \u003E 0)\n                    {\n                        SaveExpandedState(tvDom.Nodes[0], expandedPaths);\n                    }\n\n                    tvDom.BeginUpdate();\n                    try\n                    {\n                        tvDom.Nodes.Clear();\n                        var treeNode = BuildTreeNode(rootNode);\n                        tvDom.Nodes.Add(treeNode);\n                        \n                        treeNode.Expand();\n                        RestoreExpandedState(treeNode, expandedPaths);\n\n                        if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(selectedPath))\n                        {\n                            var nodeToSelect = FindNodeByPath(treeNode, selectedPath);\n                            if (nodeToSelect != null)\n                            {\n                                tvDom.SelectedNode = nodeToSelect;\n                                nodeToSelect.EnsureVisible();\n                            }\n                            else\n                            {\n                                tvDom.SelectedNode = null;\n                                txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                            }\n                        }\n                        else\n                        {\n                            tvDom.SelectedNode = null;\n                            txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    finally\n                    {\n                        tvDom.EndUpdate();\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private async void TvDom_AfterSelect(object? sender, TreeViewEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (e.Node?.Tag is DomNode domNode)\n            {\n                var details = new System.Text.StringBuilder();\n                details.AppendLine($\u0022Type: {domNode.Type}\u0022);\n                if (domNode.Type == \u0022element\u0022)\n                {\n                    details.AppendLine($\u0022Tag: {domNode.TagName}\u0022);\n                    details.AppendLine($\u0022Path: {domNode.Path}\u0022);\n                    details.AppendLine(\u0022Attributes:\u0022);\n                    if (domNode.Attributes != null)\n                    {\n                        foreach (var kvp in domNode.Attributes)\n                        {\n                            details.AppendLine($\u0022  {kvp.Key} = \\\u0022{kvp.Value}\\\u0022\u0022);\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n                else if (domNode.Type == \u0022text\u0022)\n                {\n                    details.AppendLine($\u0022Text: {domNode.Text}\u0022);\n                }\n\n                txtElementDetails.Text = details.ToString();\n\n                if (domNode.Type == \u0022element\u0022 \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path) \u0026\u0026 lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient client)\n                {\n                    try\n                    {\n                        await client.HighlightElementAsync(domNode.Path);\n                    }\n                    catch { /* Ignore highlight errors */ }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private async void TvDom_AfterSelect(object? sender, TreeViewEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (e.Node?.Tag is DomNode domNode)\n            {\n                txtElementDetails.Text = domNode.GetFormattedDetails();\n\n                if (domNode.Type == \u0022element\u0022 \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path) \u0026\u0026 lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient client)\n                {\n                    try\n                    {\n                        await client.HighlightElementAsync(domNode.Path);\n                    }\n                    catch { /* Ignore highlight errors */ }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void AddStepToSequence(AutomationSequence seq, AutomationActionType actionType)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedNode?.Tag is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n            {\n                var step = new AutomationStep\n                {\n                    Name = $\u0022{(actionType == AutomationActionType.Click ? \u0022Click\u0022 : \u0022Set Value\u0022)} \u003C{domNode.TagName}\u003E\u0022,\n                    ActionType = actionType,\n                    Selector = domNode.Path\n                };\n                seq.Steps.Add(step);\n                \n                if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem == seq)\n                {\n                    lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                    lstSteps.SelectedItem = step;\n                }\n                \n                tabMain.SelectedTab = tabEditor;\n                Log($\u0022[SYS] Added step to list \u0027{seq.Name}\u0027\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void AddStepToSequence(AutomationSequence seq, AutomationActionType actionType)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedNode?.Tag is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n            {\n                var step = domNode.CreateStep(actionType);\n                seq.Steps.Add(step);\n                \n                if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem == seq)\n                {\n                    lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                    lstSteps.SelectedItem = step;\n                }\n                \n                tabMain.SelectedTab = tabEditor;\n                Log($\u0022[SYS] Added step to list \u0027{seq.Name}\u0027\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void MnuFileOpen_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var ofd = new OpenFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Open Automation Project\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (ofd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    string json = File.ReadAllText(ofd.FileName);\n                    \n                    // Try loading as new AutomationProject format\n                    try\n                    {\n                        var project = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CAutomationProject\u003E(json);\n                        if (project != null \u0026\u0026 project.Sequences != null)\n                        {\n                            chkMatchAnySite.Checked = project.MatchAnySite;\n                            lstMatchUrls.Items.Clear();\n                            foreach (var url in project.MatchUrls)\n                            {\n                                lstMatchUrls.Items.Add(url);\n                            }\n\n                            chkLstSequences.Items.Clear();\n                            lstSteps.Items.Clear();\n                            foreach (var seq in project.Sequences)\n                            {\n                                chkLstSequences.Items.Add(seq, seq.IsActive);\n                            }\n                            if (chkLstSequences.Items.Count \u003E 0) chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = 0;\n                            Log($\u0022[SYS] Loaded project from {ofd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                            return;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    catch { /* Fallback to old format */ }\n\n                    // Fallback for older saves (List\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E)\n                    var sequences = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CList\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E\u003E(json);\n                    if (sequences != null)\n                    {\n                        chkLstSequences.Items.Clear();\n                        lstSteps.Items.Clear();\n                        foreach (var seq in sequences)\n                        {\n                            chkLstSequences.Items.Add(seq, seq.IsActive);\n                        }\n                        if (chkLstSequences.Items.Count \u003E 0) chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = 0;\n                        Log($\u0022[SYS] Loaded legacy project from {ofd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                    }\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to load project: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileSave_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Save Automation Project\u0022,\n                DefaultExt = \u0022json\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    var project = new AutomationProject\n                    {\n                        MatchAnySite = chkMatchAnySite.Checked,\n                        MatchUrls = lstMatchUrls.Items.Cast\u003Cstring\u003E().ToList(),\n                        Sequences = chkLstSequences.Items.Cast\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E().ToList()\n                    };\n\n                    string json = JsonSerializer.Serialize(project, new JsonSerializerOptions { WriteIndented = true });\n                    File.WriteAllText(sfd.FileName, json);\n                    Log($\u0022[SYS] Saved project to {sfd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to save project: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void MnuFileOpen_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var ofd = new OpenFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Open Automation Project\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (ofd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    var project = AutomationProject.LoadFromFile(ofd.FileName);\n                    ApplyProjectToUi(project);\n                    Log($\u0022[SYS] Loaded project from {ofd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to load project: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileSave_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Save Automation Project\u0022,\n                DefaultExt = \u0022json\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    var project = BuildCurrentProjectFromUi();\n                    project.SaveToFile(sfd.FileName);\n                    Log($\u0022[SYS] Saved project to {sfd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to save project: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void BtnMoveUp_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedItem is AutomationStep step \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedIndex \u003E 0)\n            {\n                int idx = lstSteps.SelectedIndex;\n                seq.Steps.RemoveAt(idx);\n                seq.Steps.Insert(idx - 1, step);\n                \n                lstSteps.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                lstSteps.Items.Insert(idx - 1, step);\n                lstSteps.SelectedIndex = idx - 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveDown_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedItem is AutomationStep step \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedIndex \u003C lstSteps.Items.Count - 1)\n            {\n                int idx = lstSteps.SelectedIndex;\n                seq.Steps.RemoveAt(idx);\n                seq.Steps.Insert(idx \u002B 1, step);\n                \n                lstSteps.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                lstSteps.Items.Insert(idx \u002B 1, step);\n                lstSteps.SelectedIndex = idx \u002B 1;\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void BtnMoveUp_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedItem is AutomationStep step)\n            {\n                int idx = lstSteps.SelectedIndex;\n                if (seq.MoveStepUp(idx))\n                {\n                    lstSteps.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                    lstSteps.Items.Insert(idx - 1, step);\n                    lstSteps.SelectedIndex = idx - 1;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveDown_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedItem is AutomationStep step)\n            {\n                int idx = lstSteps.SelectedIndex;\n                if (seq.MoveStepDown(idx))\n                {\n                    lstSteps.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                    lstSteps.Items.Insert(idx \u002B 1, step);\n                    lstSteps.SelectedIndex = idx \u002B 1;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            Log(\u0022[SYS] Starting Automation Run...\u0022, Color.Magenta);\n            btnRunAutomation.Enabled = false;\n\n            try\n            {\n                foreach (var seq in activeSequences)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[AUTO] --- Starting List: {seq.Name} ---\u0022, Color.Magenta);\n                    foreach (var step in seq.Steps)\n                    {\n                        Log($\u0022[AUTO] Executing: {step.Name}\u0022, Color.Plum);\n                        CommandResult res = null;\n                        \n                        if (step.ActionType == AutomationActionType.Click)\n                        {\n                            res = await client.ClickReactElementAsync(step.Selector);\n                        }\n                        else if (step.ActionType == AutomationActionType.SetValue)\n                        {\n                            res = await client.SetReactInputValueAsync(step.Selector, step.Value, step.Overwrite);\n                        }\n                        else if (step.ActionType == AutomationActionType.EvaluateScript)\n                        {\n                            res = await client.EvaluateJavaScriptAsync(step.Value);\n                        }\n\n                        if (res != null)\n                        {\n                            Log($\u0022[AUTO-RX] {res.Status} | {res.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n                        }\n                        \n                        await Task.Delay(500);\n                    }\n                }\n                Log(\u0022[SYS] Automation Run Completed.\u0022, Color.Lime);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Automation aborted: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                btnRunAutomation.Enabled = true;\n            }\n==== REPLACE\n            Log(\u0022[SYS] Starting Automation Run...\u0022, Color.Magenta);\n            btnRunAutomation.Enabled = false;\n\n            try\n            {\n                await _runner.RunSequencesAsync(client, activeSequences);\n                Log(\u0022[SYS] Automation Run Completed.\u0022, Color.Lime);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Automation aborted: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                btnRunAutomation.Enabled = true;\n            }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\Models\\DomNode.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Text.Json.Serialization;\n\nnamespace TestBedApp.Models\n{\n    public class DomNode\n    {\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022type\u0022)]\n        public string Type { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022tagName\u0022)]\n        public string? TagName { get; set; }\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022path\u0022)]\n        public string? Path { get; set; }\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022text\u0022)]\n        public string? Text { get; set; }\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022attributes\u0022)]\n        public Dictionary\u003Cstring, string\u003E? Attributes { get; set; }\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022children\u0022)]\n        public List\u003CDomNode\u003E? Children { get; set; }\n    }\n}\n==== REPLACE\n// Migrated to BrowserAutomationFramework.Models.DomNode\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\Models\\AutomationStep.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\nnamespace TestBedApp.Models\n{\n    public enum AutomationActionType\n    {\n        Click,\n        SetValue,\n        EvaluateScript\n    }\n\n    public class AutomationStep\n    {\n        public string Name { get; set; } = \u0022New Step\u0022;\n        public AutomationActionType ActionType { get; set; }\n        public string Selector { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n        public string Value { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n        public bool Overwrite { get; set; } = true;\n\n        public override string ToString() =\u003E $\u0022{Name} ({ActionType})\u0022;\n    }\n}\n==== REPLACE\n// Migrated to BrowserAutomationFramework.Models.AutomationStep\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\Models\\AutomationSequence.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\nusing System;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Text.Json.Serialization;\n\nnamespace TestBedApp.Models\n{\n    public class AutomationSequence\n    {\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022id\u0022)]\n        public string Id { get; set; } = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022name\u0022)]\n        public string Name { get; set; } = \u0022New Sequence\u0022;\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022isActive\u0022)]\n        public bool IsActive { get; set; } = true;\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022steps\u0022)]\n        public List\u003CAutomationStep\u003E Steps { get; set; } = new();\n\n        public override string ToString() =\u003E Name;\n    }\n}\n==== REPLACE\n// Migrated to BrowserAutomationFramework.Models.AutomationSequence\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\Models\\AutomationProject.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Text.Json.Serialization;\n\nnamespace TestBedApp.Models\n{\n    public class AutomationProject\n    {\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022matchAnySite\u0022)]\n        public bool MatchAnySite { get; set; } = true;\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022matchUrls\u0022)]\n        public List\u003Cstring\u003E MatchUrls { get; set; } = new();\n\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022sequences\u0022)]\n        public List\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E Sequences { get; set; } = new();\n    }\n}\n==== REPLACE\n// Migrated to BrowserAutomationFramework.Models.AutomationProject\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060",
      "ModelExplanation": "### Changes Made\n\n- **Migrated Core Models \u0026 Project Persistence (\u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\\u0060)**:\n\n- Moved \u0060DomNode\u0060, \u0060AutomationStep\u0060, \u0060AutomationActionType\u0060, \u0060AutomationSequence\u0060, and \u0060AutomationProject\u0060 from \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 into \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\u0060.\n- Added DOM helper methods on \u0060DomNode\u0060 (\u0060FindByPath\u0060, \u0060QueryAll\u0060, \u0060GetFormattedDetails\u0060, \u0060CreateStep\u0060).\n- Added step management helpers on \u0060AutomationSequence\u0060 (\u0060MoveStepUp\u0060, \u0060MoveStepDown\u0060) and serialization/persistence \u002B script option builders on \u0060AutomationProject\u0060 (\u0060FromJson\u0060 with automatic legacy format fallback, \u0060ToJson\u0060, \u0060LoadFromFile\u0060, \u0060LoadFromFileAsync\u0060, \u0060SaveToFile\u0060, \u0060SaveToFileAsync\u0060, \u0060CreateScriptOptions\u0060).\n- Added strongly-typed event argument models in \u0060BrowserEventArgs.cs\u0060 (\u0060DomChangedEventArgs\u0060, \u0060ElementClickedEventArgs\u0060, \u0060AutomationSequenceEventArgs\u0060, \u0060AutomationStepEventArgs\u0060).\n- **Created Extensible Automation Execution Engine (\u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\\Automation\\AutomationRunner.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Added \u0060AutomationRunner\u0060 to execute projects, sequences, and individual steps against a \u0060BrowserClient\u0060.\n- Exposed \u0060RegisterStepHandler\u0060 and \u0060RegisterCustomActionHandler\u0060 so developers can register custom step logic or override built-in step types (\u0060Click\u0060, \u0060SetValue\u0060, \u0060EvaluateScript\u0060, \u0060Custom\u0060).\n- Added lifecycle events (\u0060OnSequenceStarted\u0060, \u0060OnSequenceCompleted\u0060, \u0060OnStepStarted\u0060, \u0060OnStepCompleted\u0060, \u0060OnStepFailed\u0060).\n- **Expanded Client, Server, Generator \u0026 Extension APIs**:\n\n- Updated \u0060BrowserClient\u0060 with strongly-typed browser events (\u0060OnDomChanged\u0060, \u0060OnHighlightedElementRemoved\u0060, \u0060OnElementClicked\u0060) and \u0060SendRawCommandAsync\u0060 for automatic JSON/string payload parsing.\n- Updated \u0060AutomationServer\u0060 with \u0060OnClientDisconnected\u0060 when WebSocket or HTTP Polling clients disconnect.\n- Updated \u0060ReactExtensions\u0060 with \u0060GetDomNodeAsync\u0060, \u0060ExecuteStepAsync\u0060, \u0060ExecuteSequenceAsync\u0060, and \u0060ExecuteProjectAsync\u0060.\n- Added \u0060ScriptGenerator.Generate(AutomationProject, ...)\u0060 overload.\n- **Refactored \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 into a Pure UI Wrapper**:\n\n- Replaced inline JSON parsing, DOM formatting, file load/save logic, and step execution loops in \u0060MainForm.cs\u0060 with calls to \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060 APIs.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Build the solution and verify both \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060 and \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 compile cleanly.\n- Run \u0060TestBedApp\u0060, start the server, and connect a browser client.\n- Verify DOM Explorer loading, element selection/highlighting, raw command execution, project Open/Save, script generation, and running automation sequences.",
