      "UserPrompt": "[Attached Image]\n\nThis is great! Now we need to fix some of the UI for the test bed app. Whenever it spawns a text input box like the one shown in the screenshot, we need to ensure that the UI isnt cut off like it is in this one. We also need to ensure that all TextBoxes or any winforms controls that has the BorderStyle property that they are set to BorderStyle.FixedSingle always.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\n### Changes Made\n\n- **Fixed Prompt Dialog Layout \u0026 DPI Sizing (\u0060MainForm.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Replaced hardcoded pixel coordinates and fixed form height in \u0060PromptForValue\u0060 with a DPI-scaled, auto-sized \u0060TableLayoutPanel\u0060 and \u0060FlowLayoutPanel\u0060 so the label, input \u0060TextBox\u0060, and \u0060Ok\u0060 button never overlap or get cut off at any display scaling factor.\n- Set \u0060BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle\u0060 and dark mode colors on the prompt \u0060TextBox\u0060, and disabled minimize/maximize buttons on the modal dialog.\n- **Enforced \u0060BorderStyle.FixedSingle\u0060 Across Controls (\u0060MainForm.Designer.cs\u0060, \u0060MainForm.cs\u0060, \u0060DomTreeView.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Explicitly set \u0060BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle\u0060 on \u0060numPort\u0060, \u0060tvDom\u0060, \u0060txtElementDetails\u0060, \u0060chkLstSequences\u0060, and \u0060lstSteps\u0060 in \u0060MainForm.Designer.cs\u0060 and in the \u0060DomTreeView\u0060 constructor (alongside the existing \u0060FixedSingle\u0060 controls).\n- Added \u0060ApplyFixedSingleBorders\u0060 in \u0060MainForm.cs\u0060 to recursively enforce \u0060BorderStyle.FixedSingle\u0060 on all \u0060TextBoxBase\u0060, \u0060ListBox\u0060, \u0060TreeView\u0060, and \u0060UpDownBase\u0060 controls in the form and spawned dialogs.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Build and run \u0060TestBedApp\u0060.\n- Trigger any input prompt (e.g., **Add List** in Automation Editor, **Add** under Match URLs, or right-click a DOM node and click **Test Set Value**).\n- Verify that the prompt dialog\u0027s label, text box, and **Ok** button are fully visible with proper spacing and not cut off.\n- Inspect all text boxes, list boxes, tree views, and numeric inputs across all tabs and dialogs to confirm they use \u0060BorderStyle.FixedSingle\u0060.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        public MainForm()\n        {\n            InitializeComponent();\n            \n            cmbMode.DataSource = Enum.GetValues(typeof(IpcMode));\n==== REPLACE\n        public MainForm()\n        {\n            InitializeComponent();\n            ApplyFixedSingleBorders(this);\n            \n            cmbMode.DataSource = Enum.GetValues(typeof(IpcMode));\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private string PromptForValue(string text, string caption, string defaultValue = \u0022\u0022)\n        {\n            Form prompt = new Form()\n            {\n                Width = 400,\n                Height = 150,\n                FormBorderStyle = FormBorderStyle.FixedDialog,\n                Text = caption,\n                StartPosition = FormStartPosition.CenterScreen\n            };\n            Label textLabel = new Label() { Left = 20, Top = 20, Text = text, Width = 340 };\n            TextBox textBox = new TextBox() { Left = 20, Top = 50, Width = 340, Text = defaultValue };\n            Button confirmation = new Button() { Text = \u0022Ok\u0022, Left = 260, Width = 100, Top = 80, DialogResult = DialogResult.OK };\n            prompt.Controls.Add(textBox);\n            prompt.Controls.Add(confirmation);\n            prompt.Controls.Add(textLabel);\n            prompt.AcceptButton = confirmation;\n\n            return prompt.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK ? textBox.Text : string.Empty;\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private static void ApplyFixedSingleBorders(Control control)\n        {\n            switch (control)\n            {\n                case TextBoxBase textBoxBase:\n                    textBoxBase.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n                    break;\n                case ListBox listBox:\n                    listBox.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n                    break;\n                case TreeView treeView:\n                    treeView.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n                    break;\n                case UpDownBase upDownBase:\n                    upDownBase.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n                    break;\n            }\n\n            foreach (Control child in control.Controls)\n            {\n                ApplyFixedSingleBorders(child);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private string PromptForValue(string text, string caption, string defaultValue = \u0022\u0022)\n        {\n            using Form prompt = new Form\n            {\n                FormBorderStyle = FormBorderStyle.FixedDialog,\n                Text = caption,\n                StartPosition = FormStartPosition.CenterParent,\n                MinimizeBox = false,\n                MaximizeBox = false,\n                ShowInTaskbar = false,\n                BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30),\n                ForeColor = Color.LightGray,\n                Font = Font,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                AutoSizeMode = AutoSizeMode.GrowAndShrink\n            };\n\n            float scaleFactor = DeviceDpi / 96f;\n            int Scale(int value) =\u003E (int)Math.Ceiling(value * scaleFactor);\n\n            var layout = new TableLayoutPanel\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                AutoSizeMode = AutoSizeMode.GrowAndShrink,\n                ColumnCount = 1,\n                RowCount = 3,\n                Padding = new Padding(Scale(16)),\n                MinimumSize = new Size(Scale(380), 0)\n            };\n            layout.ColumnStyles.Add(new ColumnStyle(SizeType.Percent, 100F));\n            layout.RowStyles.Add(new RowStyle(SizeType.AutoSize));\n            layout.RowStyles.Add(new RowStyle(SizeType.AutoSize));\n            layout.RowStyles.Add(new RowStyle(SizeType.AutoSize));\n\n            Label textLabel = new Label\n            {\n                Text = text,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                Margin = new Padding(0, 0, 0, Scale(8))\n            };\n\n            TextBox textBox = new TextBox\n            {\n                Text = defaultValue,\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle,\n                BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30),\n                ForeColor = Color.LightGray,\n                Margin = new Padding(0, 0, 0, Scale(14))\n            };\n\n            var buttonPanel = new FlowLayoutPanel\n            {\n                FlowDirection = FlowDirection.RightToLeft,\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                AutoSizeMode = AutoSizeMode.GrowAndShrink,\n                Margin = new Padding(0)\n            };\n\n            Button confirmation = new Button\n            {\n                Text = \u0022Ok\u0022,\n                DialogResult = DialogResult.OK,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                MinimumSize = new Size(Scale(90), Scale(32)),\n                Padding = new Padding(Scale(10), Scale(2), Scale(10), Scale(2)),\n                Margin = new Padding(0),\n                UseVisualStyleBackColor = true\n            };\n\n            buttonPanel.Controls.Add(confirmation);\n            layout.Controls.Add(textLabel, 0, 0);\n            layout.Controls.Add(textBox, 0, 1);\n            layout.Controls.Add(buttonPanel, 0, 2);\n\n            prompt.Controls.Add(layout);\n            prompt.AcceptButton = confirmation;\n\n            ApplyFixedSingleBorders(prompt);\n\n            return prompt.ShowDialog(this) == DialogResult.OK ? textBox.Text : string.Empty;\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.Designer.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // \n            // numPort\n            // \n            numPort.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            numPort.ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n==== REPLACE\n            // \n            // numPort\n            // \n            numPort.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            numPort.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            numPort.ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // \n            // tvDom\n            // \n            tvDom.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            tvDom.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n            tvDom.DrawMode = TreeViewDrawMode.OwnerDrawText;\n            tvDom.ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n            tvDom.HideSelection = false;\n            tvDom.ItemHeight = 22;\n            tvDom.Location = new Point(0, 0);\n            tvDom.Name = \u0022tvDom\u0022;\n            tvDom.Size = new Size(402, 436);\n            tvDom.TabIndex = 0;\n            tvDom.AfterSelect \u002B= TvDom_AfterSelect;\n            tvDom.NodeMouseClick \u002B= TvDom_NodeMouseClick;\n            // \n            // txtElementDetails\n            // \n            txtElementDetails.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            txtElementDetails.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n==== REPLACE\n            // \n            // tvDom\n            // \n            tvDom.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            tvDom.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            tvDom.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n            tvDom.DrawMode = TreeViewDrawMode.OwnerDrawText;\n            tvDom.ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n            tvDom.HideSelection = false;\n            tvDom.ItemHeight = 22;\n            tvDom.Location = new Point(0, 0);\n            tvDom.Name = \u0022tvDom\u0022;\n            tvDom.Size = new Size(402, 436);\n            tvDom.TabIndex = 0;\n            tvDom.AfterSelect \u002B= TvDom_AfterSelect;\n            tvDom.NodeMouseClick \u002B= TvDom_NodeMouseClick;\n            // \n            // txtElementDetails\n            // \n            txtElementDetails.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            txtElementDetails.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            txtElementDetails.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // \n            // chkLstSequences\n            // \n            chkLstSequences.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            chkLstSequences.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n==== REPLACE\n            // \n            // chkLstSequences\n            // \n            chkLstSequences.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            chkLstSequences.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            chkLstSequences.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // \n            // lstSteps\n            // \n            lstSteps.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            lstSteps.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n==== REPLACE\n            // \n            // lstSteps\n            // \n            lstSteps.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            lstSteps.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            lstSteps.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\Controls\\DomTreeView.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        public DomTreeView()\n        {\n            DrawMode = TreeViewDrawMode.OwnerDrawText;\n            BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n==== REPLACE\n        public DomTreeView()\n        {\n            DrawMode = TreeViewDrawMode.OwnerDrawText;\n            BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060",
