      "UserPrompt": "[Attached Image]\n\n[Attached Image]\n\n[Attached Image]\n\nOk so this is great! However, now we need to rework our UI somewhat. Right now, my windows 11 is set to 4k resolution with 150% dsiplay scaling. However, i have a line in the program.cs file that sets the application to be high dpi coimpliant (\u0060\u0060\u0060Application.SetHighDpiMode(HighDpiMode.PerMonitorV2);\u0060\u0060\u0060)\nAs you can see in the screenshots, the UI of the entire app is very small looking. I want to make it look a bit bigger and more easy to read and work with when the resolution is up at 4k. However, this should still look adn feel the same when we lower the display scaling or lower the system resolution. Make sure we keep the UI layout exactly the same, just make things bigger and more readable. Notice how the dom viewer control renders all its text? This is very easily readable and we need the rest of the app to be that similar kinda size.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\n### Changes Made\n\n- **Fixed Tiny Font \u0026 Enabled Per-Monitor DPI Auto-Scaling (\u0060MainForm.Designer.cs\u0060, \u0060Program.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Replaced the \u00606.666667F\u0060 font size on \u0060MainForm\u0060 and \u0060rtbLogs\u0060 with \u006010F\u0060 (\u0060new Font(\u0022Segoe UI\u0022, 10F)\u0060 for UI controls/menus and \u0060new Font(\u0022Consolas\u0022, 10F)\u0060 for code/details/log views), matching the readable \u006010F\u0060 text size used by \u0060DomTreeView\u0060.\n- Added \u0060AutoScaleDimensions = new SizeF(96F, 96F)\u0060 and \u0060AutoScaleMode = AutoScaleMode.Dpi\u0060 to \u0060MainForm\u0060 so WinForms automatically scales all control dimensions, buttons, panels, and splitters proportionally across 4K @ 150% scaling as well as lower resolutions/scalings.\n- Adjusted base dimensions of the top bar (\u0060pnlTop\u0060, \u0060pnlMatchUrls\u0060), sequence list toolbar (\u0060pnlSequencesTop\u0060), and step editor toolbar (\u0060pnlEditorTop\u0060) so buttons (such as **Move Down**, **Add List**, **Remove List**, etc.) fit comfortably on a single line without wrapping or clipping.\n- **Dynamic DPI-Aware Row Height in DOM Explorer (\u0060DomTreeView.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Updated \u0060DomTreeView\u0060 to dynamically calculate \u0060ItemHeight\u0060 based on the current DPI and font height (\u0060OnHandleCreated\u0060 and \u0060OnDpiChangedAfterParent\u0060) instead of using a fixed 22px height.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Build and run \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 on 4K with 150% display scaling.\n- Verify that menus, buttons, labels, client lists, element details, automation sequences/steps, property grid, and real-time logs are all sized to match the readability of the DOM Explorer tree view.\n- Verify that no button text wraps or clips (e.g., **Move Down** in the Automation Editor and **Add/Edit/Remove** in Match URLs).\n- Change display scaling or resolution (e.g., 100% or 125%) and confirm the layout and proportions remain consistent.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\Program.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        [STAThread]\n        static void Main()\n        {\n            ApplicationConfiguration.Initialize();\n            Application.SetColorMode(SystemColorMode.Dark);\n            Application.Run(new MainForm());\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        [STAThread]\n        static void Main()\n        {\n            ApplicationConfiguration.Initialize();\n            Application.SetHighDpiMode(HighDpiMode.PerMonitorV2);\n            Application.SetColorMode(SystemColorMode.Dark);\n            Application.Run(new MainForm());\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\Controls\\DomTreeView.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        public DomTreeView()\n        {\n            DrawMode = TreeViewDrawMode.OwnerDrawText;\n            BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n            _codeFont = new Font(\u0022Consolas\u0022, 10F);\n            ItemHeight = 22;\n            ShowLines = true;\n            ShowPlusMinus = true;\n            ShowRootLines = true;\n            HideSelection = false;\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        public DomTreeView()\n        {\n            DrawMode = TreeViewDrawMode.OwnerDrawText;\n            BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n            _codeFont = new Font(\u0022Consolas\u0022, 10F);\n            ItemHeight = 24;\n            ShowLines = true;\n            ShowPlusMinus = true;\n            ShowRootLines = true;\n            HideSelection = false;\n        }\n\n        protected override void OnHandleCreated(EventArgs e)\n        {\n            base.OnHandleCreated(e);\n            UpdateItemHeight();\n        }\n\n        protected override void OnDpiChangedAfterParent(EventArgs e)\n        {\n            base.OnDpiChangedAfterParent(e);\n            UpdateItemHeight();\n        }\n\n        private void UpdateItemHeight()\n        {\n            int scaledHeight = (int)Math.Ceiling(24 * (DeviceDpi / 96f));\n            ItemHeight = Math.Max(_codeFont.Height \u002B 6, scaledHeight);\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.Designer.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // \n            // numPort\n            // \n            numPort.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            numPort.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            numPort.ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n            numPort.Location = new Point(56, 14);\n            numPort.Margin = new Padding(3, 4, 15, 3);\n            numPort.Maximum = new decimal(new int[] { 65535, 0, 0, 0 });\n            numPort.Minimum = new decimal(new int[] { 1024, 0, 0, 0 });\n            numPort.Name = \u0022numPort\u0022;\n            numPort.Size = new Size(80, 25);\n            numPort.TabIndex = 1;\n            numPort.Value = new decimal(new int[] { 9999, 0, 0, 0 });\n            // \n            // lblMode\n            // \n            lblMode.AutoSize = true;\n            lblMode.Location = new Point(154, 16);\n            lblMode.Margin = new Padding(3, 6, 3, 3);\n            lblMode.Name = \u0022lblMode\u0022;\n            lblMode.Size = new Size(73, 19);\n            lblMode.TabIndex = 2;\n            lblMode.Text = \u0022IPC Mode:\u0022;\n            // \n            // cmbMode\n            // \n            cmbMode.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            cmbMode.DropDownStyle = ComboBoxStyle.DropDownList;\n            cmbMode.ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n            cmbMode.Location = new Point(233, 14);\n            cmbMode.Margin = new Padding(3, 4, 15, 3);\n            cmbMode.Name = \u0022cmbMode\u0022;\n            cmbMode.Size = new Size(173, 25);\n            cmbMode.TabIndex = 3;\n            // \n            // chkMatchAnySite\n            // \n            chkMatchAnySite.AutoSize = true;\n            chkMatchAnySite.Checked = true;\n            chkMatchAnySite.CheckState = CheckState.Checked;\n            chkMatchAnySite.Location = new Point(424, 16);\n            chkMatchAnySite.Margin = new Padding(3, 6, 15, 3);\n            chkMatchAnySite.Name = \u0022chkMatchAnySite\u0022;\n            chkMatchAnySite.Size = new Size(128, 23);\n            chkMatchAnySite.TabIndex = 4;\n            chkMatchAnySite.Text = \u0022Match Any Site\u0022;\n            chkMatchAnySite.UseVisualStyleBackColor = true;\n            chkMatchAnySite.CheckedChanged \u002B= ChkMatchAnySite_CheckedChanged;\n            // \n            // lblMatchUrls\n            // \n            lblMatchUrls.AutoSize = true;\n            lblMatchUrls.Location = new Point(570, 16);\n            lblMatchUrls.Margin = new Padding(3, 6, 3, 3);\n            lblMatchUrls.Name = \u0022lblMatchUrls\u0022;\n            lblMatchUrls.Size = new Size(86, 19);\n            lblMatchUrls.TabIndex = 5;\n            lblMatchUrls.Text = \u0022Match URLs:\u0022;\n            lblMatchUrls.Visible = false;\n            // \n            // pnlMatchUrls\n            // \n            pnlMatchUrls.Controls.Add(lstMatchUrls);\n            pnlMatchUrls.Controls.Add(pnlMatchUrlBtns);\n            pnlMatchUrls.Location = new Point(662, 14);\n            pnlMatchUrls.Margin = new Padding(3, 4, 15, 3);\n            pnlMatchUrls.Name = \u0022pnlMatchUrls\u0022;\n            pnlMatchUrls.Size = new Size(250, 80);\n            pnlMatchUrls.TabIndex = 6;\n            pnlMatchUrls.Visible = false;\n            // \n            // lstMatchUrls\n            // \n            lstMatchUrls.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            lstMatchUrls.BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle;\n            lstMatchUrls.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;\n            lstMatchUrls.ForeColor = Color.LightGray;\n            lstMatchUrls.Location = new Point(0, 0);\n            lstMatchUrls.Name = \u0022lstMatchUrls\u0022;\n            lstMatchUrls.Size = new Size(170, 80);\n            lstMatchUrls.TabIndex = 0;\n            // \n            // pnlMatchUrlBtns\n            // \n            pnlMatchUrlBtns.Controls.Add(btnRemoveMatchUrl);\n            pnlMatchUrlBtns.Controls.Add(btnEditMatchUrl);\n            pnlMatchUrlBtns.Controls.Add(btnAddMatchUrl);\n            pnlMatchUrlBtns.Dock = DockStyle.Right;\n            pnlMatchUrlBtns.Location = new Point(170, 0);\n            pnlMatchUrlBtns.Name = \u0022pnlMatchUrlBtns\u0022;\n            pnlMatchUrlBtns.Size = new Size(80, 80);\n            pnlMatchUrlBtns.TabIndex = 1;\n            // \n            // btnRemoveMatchUrl\n            // \n            btnRemoveMatchUrl.Dock = DockStyle.Top;\n            btnRemoveMatchUrl.Location = new Point(0, 52);\n            btnRemoveMatchUrl.Name = \u0022btnRemoveMatchUrl\u0022;\n            btnRemoveMatchUrl.Size = new Size(80, 28);\n            btnRemoveMatchUrl.TabIndex = 2;\n            btnRemoveMatchUrl.Text = \u0022Remove\u0022;\n            btnRemoveMatchUrl.UseVisualStyleBackColor = true;\n            btnRemoveMatchUrl.Click \u002B= BtnRemoveMatchUrl_Click;\n            // \n            // btnEditMatchUrl\n            // \n            btnEditMatchUrl.Dock = DockStyle.Top;\n            btnEditMatchUrl.Location = new Point(0, 26);\n            btnEditMatchUrl.Name = \u0022btnEditMatchUrl\u0022;\n            btnEditMatchUrl.Size = new Size(80, 26);\n            btnEditMatchUrl.TabIndex = 1;\n            btnEditMatchUrl.Text = \u0022Edit\u0022;\n            btnEditMatchUrl.UseVisualStyleBackColor = true;\n            btnEditMatchUrl.Click \u002B= BtnEditMatchUrl_Click;\n            // \n            // btnAddMatchUrl\n            // \n 