      "UserPrompt": "[Attached Image]\n\n[Attached Image]\n\nThe root directory for this project is: C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\nThe following directories are currently tracked/active for this project (place new files in these directories unless otherwise specified):\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\n\nOk so this project is great! However, we need to do some work on the test bed UI for the automation editor and data scraper tabs. As you can see in the screenshots, many of the buttons are too small for thier texts and the text wraps to a new line, so we need to make the buttons be able to handle their text, and make sure that the UI for these tabs feels not as cramped and make sure nothing is overalapping, obsecured, or cut off.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n- **Automation Editor Tab (\u0060MainForm.Designer.cs\u0060 \u0026 \u0060MainForm.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Converted \u0060pnlSequencesTop\u0060 into an auto-sizing \u0060FlowLayoutPanel\u0060 and enabled \u0060AutoSize\u0060 (\u0060GrowAndShrink\u0060) with padding on \u0060btnAddSequence\u0060, \u0060btnRemoveSequence\u0060, \u0060btnMoveSeqUp\u0060, \u0060btnMoveSeqDown\u0060, and \u0060btnRenameSeq\u0060 so button text never wraps onto multiple lines or clips vertically at high DPI.\n- Replaced the fixed-width docked button layout in \u0060pnlEditorTop\u0060 with an auto-sizing \u0060TableLayoutPanel\u0060 and \u0060FlowLayoutPanel\u0060 so \u0060btnAddStep\u0060, \u0060btnRemoveStep\u0060, \u0060btnMoveUp\u0060, \u0060btnMoveDown\u0060, and \u0060btnRunAutomation\u0060 size dynamically to their text with proper spacing and alignment.\n- Escaped the ampersand in \u0060btnGenerate.Text\u0060 (\u0060\u0022Generate \u0026\u0026 Copy Script\u0022\u0060) so it renders literally instead of as a mnemonic underscore.\n- **Data Scraper Tab (\u0060MainForm.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Replaced fixed-pixel button positions/widths in \u0060pnlScrapesTop\u0060, \u0060pnlFieldsToolbar\u0060, and \u0060pnlResultsToolbar\u0060 with DPI-aware \u0060TableLayoutPanel\u0060 and \u0060FlowLayoutPanel\u0060 containers and \u0060AutoSize\u0060 buttons so no buttons wrap text, clip vertically, or overlap status labels or adjacent buttons.\n- Updated \u0060grpScrapeConfig\u0060 (\u0060\u0022Container \u0026\u0026 Automation Hooks\u0022\u0060) and \u0060tlpConfig\u0060 to use \u0060AutoSize\u0060 (\u0060GrowAndShrink\u0060) with \u0060SizeType.AutoSize\u0060 on the label column so labels never wrap and all 6 configuration rows (including pagination and next-page selector controls) remain fully visible without clipping.\n- Fixed \u0060SplitContainer\u0060 initialization and added proportional splitter initialization when tabs are sized/selected so \u0060splitScraperMain\u0060, \u0060splitScraperRight\u0060, \u0060splitFields\u0060, \u0060splitSequences\u0060, and \u0060splitEditor\u0060 maintain balanced panel proportions at any screen resolution and DPI scale.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Build and run \u0060TestBedApp\u0060.\n- Open the **Automation Editor** tab and verify that \u0060Add List\u0060, \u0060Remove List\u0060, \u0060Move Up\u0060, \u0060Move Down\u0060, \u0060Rename\u0060, \u0060Add Step\u0060, \u0060Remove Step\u0060, and \u0060Run Automation\u0060 display their full text on a single line without clipping or overlapping.\n- Open the **Data Scraper** tab and verify that:\n\n- The left panel, top fields/property grid panel, and bottom results preview panel are proportionally split.\n- All buttons (\u0060Add Scrape\u0060, \u0060Remove\u0060, \u0060Move Up\u0060, \u0060Move Down\u0060, \u0060Rename\u0060, \u0060Add Field\u0060, \u0060Generalize\u0060, \u0060Highlight\u0060, \u0060Preview Scrape\u0060, \u0060Run Active Scrapes\u0060, \u0060Copy JSON\u0060, \u0060Export CSV...\u0060, \u0060Export JSON...\u0060) fit their text on a single line without overlapping.\n- All rows inside \u0060Container \u0026 Automation Hooks\u0060 (including \u0060Paginate (Max):\u0060 and \u0060Next Button CSS:\u0060) are completely visible.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.Designer.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            tabEditor = new TabPage();\n            splitSequences = new SplitContainer();\n            chkLstSequences = new CheckedListBox();\n            pnlSequencesTop = new Panel();\n            btnRenameSeq = new Button();\n            btnMoveSeqDown = new Button();\n            btnMoveSeqUp = new Button();\n            btnRemoveSequence = new Button();\n            btnAddSequence = new Button();\n            splitEditor = new SplitContainer();\n            lstSteps = new ListBox();\n            pgStepDetails = new PropertyGrid();\n            pnlEditorTop = new Panel();\n            btnRunAutomation = new Button();\n            btnMoveDown = new Button();\n            btnMoveUp = new Button();\n            btnRemoveStep = new Button();\n            btnAddStep = new Button();\n==== REPLACE\n            tabEditor = new TabPage();\n            splitSequences = new SplitContainer();\n            chkLstSequences = new CheckedListBox();\n            pnlSequencesTop = new FlowLayoutPanel();\n            btnRenameSeq = new Button();\n            btnMoveSeqDown = new Button();\n            btnMoveSeqUp = new Button();\n            btnRemoveSequence = new Button();\n            btnAddSequence = new Button();\n            splitEditor = new SplitContainer();\n            lstSteps = new ListBox();\n            pgStepDetails = new PropertyGrid();\n            pnlEditorTop = new TableLayoutPanel();\n            flpStepButtons = new FlowLayoutPanel();\n            btnRunAutomation = new Button();\n            btnMoveDown = new Button();\n            btnMoveUp = new Button();\n            btnRemoveStep = new Button();\n            btnAddStep = new Button();\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            ((System.ComponentModel.ISupportInitialize)splitEditor).BeginInit();\n            splitEditor.Panel1.SuspendLayout();\n            splitEditor.Panel2.SuspendLayout();\n            splitEditor.SuspendLayout();\n            pnlEditorTop.SuspendLayout();\n            pnlLogs.SuspendLayout();\n==== REPLACE\n            ((System.ComponentModel.ISupportInitialize)splitEditor).BeginInit();\n            splitEditor.Panel1.SuspendLayout();\n            splitEditor.Panel2.SuspendLayout();\n            splitEditor.SuspendLayout();\n            pnlEditorTop.SuspendLayout();\n            flpStepButtons.SuspendLayout();\n            pnlLogs.SuspendLayout();\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // \n            // btnGenerate\n            // \n  