;\n            tabMain.Controls.Add(tabRaw);\n            tabMain.Controls.Add(tabDom);\n            tabMain.Controls.Add(tabEditor);\n            tabMain.Controls.Add(tabScraper);\n==== REPLACE\n            tabScraper = new TabPage();\n            tabReverseEngineering = new TabPage();\n            mnuDomSeparator1 = new ToolStripSeparator();\n            mnuQuickScrapeText = new ToolStripMenuItem();\n            mnuAddScrapeFieldTo = new ToolStripMenuItem();\n            mnuAddRepeatingFieldTo = new ToolStripMenuItem();\n            mnuSetScrapeContainerFor = new ToolStripMenuItem();\n            mnuSetPaginationNextFor = new ToolStripMenuItem();\n            tabMain.Controls.Add(tabRaw);\n            tabMain.Controls.Add(tabDom);\n            tabMain.Controls.Add(tabEditor);\n            tabMain.Controls.Add(tabScraper);\n            tabMain.Controls.Add(tabReverseEngineering);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            // \n            // tabScraper\n            // \n            tabScraper.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            tabScraper.Location = new Point(4, 34);\n            tabScraper.Name = \u0022tabScraper\u0022;\n            tabScraper.Padding = new Padding(3);\n            tabScraper.Size = new Size(923, 442);\n            tabScraper.TabIndex = 3;\n            tabScraper.Text = \u0022Data Scraper\u0022;\n            // \n            // pnlLogs\n==== REPLACE\n            // \n            // tabScraper\n            // \n            tabScraper.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            tabScraper.Location = new Point(4, 34);\n            tabScraper.Name = \u0022tabScraper\u0022;\n            tabScraper.Padding = new Padding(3);\n            tabScraper.Size = new Size(923, 442);\n            tabScraper.TabIndex = 3;\n            tabScraper.Text = \u0022Data Scraper\u0022;\n            // \n            // tabReverseEngineering\n            // \n            tabReverseEngineering.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n            tabReverseEngineering.Location = new Point(4, 34);\n            tabReverseEngineering.Name = \u0022tabReverseEngineering\u0022;\n            tabReverseEngineering.Padding = new Padding(3);\n            tabReverseEngineering.Size = new Size(923, 442);\n            tabReverseEngineering.TabIndex = 4;\n            tabReverseEngineering.Text = \u0022Reverse Engineering\u0022;\n            // \n            // pnlLogs\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private System.Windows.Forms.TabPage tabScraper;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.ToolStripSeparator mnuDomSeparator1;\n==== REPLACE\n        private System.Windows.Forms.TabPage tabScraper;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.TabPage tabReverseEngineering;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.ToolStripSeparator mnuDomSeparator1;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Automation;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Extensions;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Generators;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Models;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Scraping;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Server;\nusing TestBedApp.Utils;\n==== REPLACE\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Automation;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Extensions;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Generators;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Models;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.ReverseEngineering;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Scraping;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Server;\nusing TestBedApp.Utils;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private readonly AutomationRunner _runner;\n        private readonly DataScraper _scraper;\n        private ScrapeResult? _lastScrapeResult;\n        private bool _isUpdatingScrapeUi;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Timer _clientRefreshTimer;\n\n        // Data Scraper Tab Controls\n        private SplitContainer splitScraperMain = null!;\n        private SplitContainer splitScraperRight = null!;\n        private SplitContainer splitFields = null!;\n        private CheckedListBox chkLstScrapes = null!;\n        private TextBox txtContainerSelector = null!;\n        private ComboBox cmbPreScrapeSeq = null!;\n        private ComboBox cmbPostScrapeSeq = null!;\n        private CheckBox chkEnablePagination = null!;\n        private NumericUpDown numMaxPages = null!;\n        private NumericUpDown numStartPage = null!;\n        private NumericUpDown numPageDelayMs = null!;\n        private TextBox txtNextPageSelector = null!;\n        private TextBox txtPaginationUrlPattern = null!;\n        private ListBox lstScrapeFields = null!;\n        private PropertyGrid pgScrapeFieldDetails = null!;\n        private Button btnPreviewScrape = null!;\n        private Button btnRunAllScrapes = null!;\n        private Label lblScrapeStatus = null!;\n        private DataGridView dgvScrapePreview = null!;\n        private TextBox txtScrapeJsonPreview = null!;\n        private bool _domSplittersInitialized;\n        private bool _editorSplittersInitialized;\n        private bool _scraperSplittersInitialized;\n\n        public MainForm()\n        {\n            InitializeComponent();\n            InitializeScraperTabUi();\n            ApplyFixedSingleBorders(this);\n==== REPLACE\n        private readonly AutomationRunner _runner;\n        private readonly DataScraper _scraper;\n        private readonly SiteDumper _siteDumper;\n        private ScrapeResult? _lastScrapeResult;\n        private SiteDumpResult? _lastSiteDumpResult;\n        private bool _isUpdatingScrapeUi;\n        private System.Windows.Forms.Timer _clientRefreshTimer;\n\n        // Data Scraper Tab Controls\n        private SplitContainer splitScraperMain = null!;\n        private SplitContainer splitScraperRight = null!;\n        private SplitContainer splitFields = null!;\n        private CheckedListBox chkLstScrapes = null!;\n        private TextBox txtContainerSelector = null!;\n        private ComboBox cmbPreScrapeSeq = null!;\n        private ComboBox cmbPostScrapeSeq = null!;\n        private CheckBox chkEnablePagination = null!;\n        private NumericUpDown numMaxPages = null!;\n        private NumericUpDown numStartPage = null!;\n        private NumericUpDown numPageDelayMs = null!;\n        private TextBox txtNextPageSelector = null!;\n        private TextBox txtPaginationUrlPattern = null!;\n        private ListBox lstScrapeFields = null!;\n        private PropertyGrid pgScrapeFieldDetails = null!;\n        private Button btnPreviewScrape = null!;\n        private Button btnRunAllScrapes = null!;\n        private Label lblScrapeStatus = null!;\n        private DataGridView dgvScrapePreview = null!;\n        private TextBox txtScrapeJsonPreview = null!;\n\n        // Reverse Engineering Tab Controls\n        private SplitContainer splitRevEngMain = null!;\n        private SplitContainer splitRevEngLeft = null!;\n        private Button btnDumpHtml = null!;\n        private Button btnDumpCss = null!;\n        private Button btnDumpJs = null!;\n        private Button btnDumpAll = null!;\n        private CheckBox chkDumpInline = null!;\n        private CheckBox chkDumpExternal = null!;\n        private CheckBox chkDumpDynamicJs = null!;\n        private TextBox txtFilterResources = null!;\n        private ListBox lstDumpedResources = null!;\n        private TextBox txtDumpedResourceDetails = null!;\n        private Label lblDumpStatus = null!;\n        private TabControl tabDumpViewers = null!;\n        private TabPage tabSelectedResourceView = null!;\n        private TabPage tabCombinedHtmlView = null!;\n        private TabPage tabCombinedCssView = null!;\n        private TabPage tabCombinedJsView = null!;\n        private TextBox txtSelectedResourceSource = null!;\n        private TextBox txtCombinedHtmlSource = null!;\n        private TextBox txtCombinedCssSource = null!;\n        private TextBox txtCombinedJsSource = null!;\n\n        private bool _domSplittersInitialized;\n        private bool _editorSplittersInitialized;\n        private bool _scraperSplittersInitialized;\n        private bool _revEngSplittersInitialized;\n\n        public MainForm()\n        {\n            InitializeComponent();\n            InitializeScraperTabUi();\n            InitializeReverseEngineeringTabUi();\n            ApplyFixedSingleBorders(this);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            _scraper.OnScrapeFailed \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[SCRAPE-ERR] \u0027{e.Definition.Name}\u0027 failed: {e.Error?.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n\n            _clientRefreshTimer = new System.Windows.Forms.Timer { Interval = 2000 };\n==== REPLACE\n            _scraper.OnScrapeFailed \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[SCRAPE-ERR] \u0027{e.Definition.Name}\u0027 failed: {e.Error?.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n\n            _siteDumper = new SiteDumper();\n            _siteDumper.OnDumpStarted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[REV-ENG] --- Starting Site Dump ({e.DumpType}) ---\u0022, Color.DeepSkyBlue);\n            _siteDumper.OnDumpCompleted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (e.Result != null)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[REV-ENG] Dump ({e.DumpType}) completed: {e.Result.HtmlResources.Count} HTML, {e.Result.CssResources.Count} CSS, {e.Result.JavaScriptResources.Count} JS resource(s) ({e.Result.GetFormattedTotalSize()}).\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                    Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E DisplaySiteDumpResult(e.Result)));\n                }\n            };\n            _siteDumper.OnDumpFailed \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[REV-ENG-ERR] Dump ({e.DumpType}) failed: {e.Error?.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n\n            _clientRefreshTimer = new System.Windows.Forms.Timer { Interval = 2000 };\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                    if (splitFields.Width \u003E 250)\n                    {\n                        splitFields.SplitterDistance = Math.Clamp((int)(splitFields.Width * 0.35), ScaleDpi(180), ScaleDpi(400));\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch\n==== REPLACE\n                    if (splitFields.Width \u003E 250)\n                    {\n                        splitFields.SplitterDistance = Math.Clamp((int)(splitFields.Width * 0.35), ScaleDpi(180), ScaleDpi(400));\n                    }\n                }\n                else if (tabMain.SelectedTab == tabReverseEngineering \u0026\u0026 !_revEngSplittersInitialized \u0026\u0026 splitRevEngMain != null \u0026\u0026 splitRevEngMain.Width \u003E 300)\n                {\n                    _revEngSplittersInitialized = true;\n                    splitRevEngMain.SplitterDistance = Math.Clamp((int)(splitRevEngMain.Width * 0.34), ScaleDpi(260), ScaleDpi(440));\n                    if (splitRevEngLeft.Height \u003E 200)\n                    {\n                        splitRevEngLeft.SplitterDistance = Math.Clamp(\n                            (int)(splitRevEngLeft.Height * 0.65),\n                            ScaleDpi(150),\n                            Math.Max(ScaleDpi(160), splitRevEngLeft.Height - ScaleDpi(110)));\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to export CSV: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n==== REPLACE\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to export CSV: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        // --- Reverse Engineering Tab UI \u0026 API Wrappers ---\n\n        private void InitializeReverseEngineeringTabUi()\n        {\n            var darkBg = Color.FromArgb(30, 30, 30);\n\n            int padX = ScaleDpi(8);\n            int padY = ScaleDpi(4);\n            int btnMargin = ScaleDpi(4);\n\n            // Top Action Bar containing the 4 Dump Buttons \u002B Options \u002B Export Buttons\n            var pnlTopBar = new TableLayoutPanel\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Top,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                AutoSizeMode = AutoSizeMode.GrowAndShrink,\n                ColumnCount = 2,\n                RowCount = 2,\n                Padding = new Padding(ScaleDpi(4))\n            };\n            pnlTopBar.ColumnStyles.Add(new ColumnStyle(SizeType.Percent, 100F));\n            pnlTopBar.ColumnStyles.Add(new ColumnStyle(SizeType.AutoSize));\n            pnlTopBar.RowStyles.Add(new RowStyle(SizeType.AutoSize));\n            pnlTopBar.RowStyles.Add(new RowStyle(SizeType.AutoSize));\n\n            var flpDumpButtons = new FlowLayoutPanel\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                AutoSizeMode = AutoSizeMode.GrowAndShrink,\n                WrapContents = true,\n                Margin = new Padding(0)\n            };\n\n            btnDumpHtml = CreateToolbarButton(\u0022Dump HTML\u0022, padX, padY, btnMargin);\n            btnDumpCss = CreateToolbarButton(\u0022Dump CSS\u0022, padX, padY, btnMargin);\n            btnDumpJs = CreateToolbarButton(\u0022Dump JavaScript\u0022, padX, padY, btnMargin);\n            btnDumpAll = CreateToolbarButton(\u0022Dump Everything\u0022, padX, padY, btnMargin);\n\n            btnDumpHtml.Click \u002B= async (s, e) =\u003E await ExecuteSiteDumpFromUiAsync(SiteDumpType.Html);\n            btnDumpCss.Click \u002B= async (s, e) =\u003E await ExecuteSiteDumpFromUiAsync(SiteDumpType.Css);\n            btnDumpJs.Click \u002B= async (s, e) =\u003E await ExecuteSiteDumpFromUiAsync(SiteDumpType.JavaScript);\n            btnDumpAll.Click \u002B= async (s, e) =\u003E await ExecuteSiteDumpFromUiAsync(SiteDumpType.All);\n\n            flpDumpButtons.Controls.AddRange(new Control[]\n            {\n                btnDumpHtml, btnDumpCss, btnDumpJs, btnDumpAll\n            });\n\n            var flpExportActions = new FlowLayoutPanel\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Top,\n                Anchor = AnchorStyles.Top | AnchorStyles.Right,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                AutoSizeMode = AutoSizeMode.GrowAndShrink,\n                WrapContents = false,\n                Margin = new Padding(0)\n            };\n\n            var btnCopyCurrentView = CreateToolbarButton(\u0022Copy Active View\u0022, ScaleDpi(6), ScaleDpi(3), btnMargin);\n            var btnSaveSelectedFile = CreateToolbarButton(\u0022Save Active File...\u0022, ScaleDpi(6), ScaleDpi(3), btnMargin);\n            var btnSaveDumpFolder = CreateToolbarButton(\u0022Save Dump to Folder...\u0022, ScaleDpi(6), ScaleDpi(3), btnMargin);\n\n            btnCopyCurrentView.Click \u002B= BtnCopyCurrentDumpView_Click;\n            btnSaveSelectedFile.Click \u002B= BtnSaveActiveDumpFile_Click;\n            btnSaveDumpFolder.Click \u002B= BtnSaveDumpToFolder_Click;\n\n            flpExportActions.Controls.AddRange(new Control[]\n            {\n                btnCopyCurrentView, btnSaveSelectedFile, btnSaveDumpFolder\n            });\n\n            var flpOptionsRow = new FlowLayoutPanel\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                AutoSizeMode = AutoSizeMode.GrowAndShrink,\n                WrapContents = true,\n                Margin = new Padding(ScaleDpi(2), ScaleDpi(2), 0, 0)\n            };\n\n            chkDumpExternal = new CheckBox\n            {\n                Text = \u0022Include External Assets\u0022,\n                Checked = true,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                Margin = new Padding(0, ScaleDpi(2), ScaleDpi(12), ScaleDpi(2))\n            };\n            chkDumpInline = new CheckBox\n            {\n                Text = \u0022Include Inline \u003Cstyle\u003E / \u003Cscript\u003E\u0022,\n                Checked = true,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                Margin = new Padding(0, ScaleDpi(2), ScaleDpi(12), ScaleDpi(2))\n            };\n            chkDumpDynamicJs = new CheckBox\n            {\n                Text = \u0022Include Dynamic JS Resources\u0022,\n                Checked = true,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                Margin = new Padding(0, ScaleDpi(2), ScaleDpi(12), ScaleDpi(2))\n            };\n\n            flpOptionsRow.Controls.AddRange(new Control[]\n            {\n                chkDumpExternal, chkDumpInline, chkDumpDynamicJs\n            });\n\n            lblDumpStatus = new Label\n            {\n                Text = \u0022Ready \u2014 Connect a browser client and click one of the 4 dump buttons.\u0022,\n                AutoSize = false,\n                AutoEllipsis = true,\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                TextAlign = ContentAlignment.MiddleRight,\n                ForeColor = Color.LightGray,\n                Margin = new Padding(ScaleDpi(4), 0, ScaleDpi(4), 0)\n            };\n\n            pnlTopBar.Controls.Add(flpDumpButtons, 0, 0);\n            pnlTopBar.Controls.Add(flpExportActions, 1, 0);\n            pnlTopBar.Controls.Add(flpOptionsRow, 0, 1);\n            pnlTopBar.Controls.Add(lblDumpStatus, 1, 1);\n\n            // Main Split Container: Left = Resource Explorer \u0026 Metadata, Right = Source Viewers\n            splitRevEngMain = new SplitContainer\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                Size = new Size(920, 380)\n            };\n\n            splitRevEngLeft = new SplitContainer\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                Orientation = Orientation.Horizontal,\n                Size = new Size(300, 380)\n            };\n\n            var pnlFilterTop = new TableLayoutPanel\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Top,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                AutoSizeMode = AutoSizeMode.GrowAndShrink,\n                ColumnCount = 2,\n                RowCount = 1,\n                Padding = new Padding(0, 0, 0, ScaleDpi(4))\n            };\n            pnlFilterTop.ColumnStyles.Add(new ColumnStyle(SizeType.AutoSize));\n            pnlFilterTop.ColumnStyles.Add(new ColumnStyle(SizeType.Percent, 100F));\n            pnlFilterTop.RowStyles.Add(new RowStyle(SizeType.AutoSize));\n\n            var lblFilter = new Label\n            {\n                Text = \u0022Filter:\u0022,\n                AutoSize = true,\n                Anchor = AnchorStyles.Left,\n                Margin = new Padding(0, 0, ScaleDpi(6), 0)\n            };\n            txtFilterResources = new TextBox\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                BackColor = darkBg,\n                ForeColor = Color.LightGray,\n                PlaceholderText = \u0022Filter by name, type, URL, or code...\u0022,\n                Margin = new Padding(0)\n            };\n            txtFilterResources.TextChanged \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E RefreshDumpedResourcesList();\n\n            pnlFilterTop.Controls.Add(lblFilter, 0, 0);\n            pnlFilterTop.Controls.Add(txtFilterResources, 1, 0);\n\n            lstDumpedResources = new ListBox\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                BackColor = darkBg,\n                ForeColor = Color.LightGray,\n                BorderStyle = BorderStyle.FixedSingle,\n                IntegralHeight = false\n            };\n            lstDumpedResources.SelectedIndexChanged \u002B= LstDumpedResources_SelectedIndexChanged;\n\n            txtDumpedResourceDetails = new TextBox\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                Multiline = true,\n                ReadOnly = true,\n                ScrollBars = ScrollBars.Vertical,\n                BackColor = darkBg,\n                ForeColor = Color.LightGray,\n                Font = new Font(\u0022Consolas\u0022, 9.5F)\n            };\n\n            splitRevEngLeft.Panel1.Controls.Add(lstDumpedResources);\n            splitRevEngLeft.Panel1.Controls.Add(pnlFilterTop);\n            splitRevEngLeft.Panel2.Controls.Add(txtDumpedResourceDetails);\n\n            tabDumpViewers = new TabControl { Dock = DockStyle.Fill };\n            tabSelectedResourceView = new TabPage(\u0022Selected Resource\u0022) { BackColor = darkBg };\n            tabCombinedHtmlView = new TabPage(\u0022Combined HTML\u0022) { BackColor = darkBg };\n            tabCombinedCssView = new TabPage(\u0022Combined CSS\u0022) { BackColor = darkBg };\n            tabCombinedJsView = new TabPage(\u0022Combined JavaScript\u0022) { BackColor = darkBg };\n\n            txtSelectedResourceSource = CreateCodeViewerTextBox(darkBg);\n            txtCombinedHtmlSource = CreateCodeViewerTextBox(darkBg);\n            txtCombinedCssSource = CreateCodeViewerTextBox(darkBg);\n            txtCombinedJsSource = CreateCodeViewerTextBox(darkBg);\n\n            tabSelectedResourceView.Controls.Add(txtSelectedResourceSource);\n            tabCombinedHtmlView.Controls.Add(txtCombinedHtmlSource);\n            tabCombinedCssView.Controls.Add(txtCombinedCssSource);\n            tabCombinedJsView.Controls.Add(txtCombinedJsSource);\n\n            tabDumpViewers.Controls.Add(tabSelectedResourceView);\n            tabDumpViewers.Controls.Add(tabCombinedHtmlView);\n            tabDumpViewers.Controls.Add(tabCombinedCssView);\n            tabDumpViewers.Controls.Add(tabCombinedJsView);\n\n            splitRevEngMain.Panel1.Controls.Add(splitRevEngLeft);\n            splitRevEngMain.Panel2.Controls.Add(tabDumpViewers);\n\n            tabReverseEngineering.Controls.Add(splitRevEngMain);\n            tabReverseEngineering.Controls.Add(pnlTopBar);\n\n            splitRevEngMain.SplitterDistance = 300;\n            splitRevEngLeft.SplitterDistance = 240;\n        }\n\n        private static TextBox CreateCodeViewerTextBox(Color darkBg)\n        {\n            return new TextBox\n            {\n                Dock = DockStyle.Fill,\n                Multiline = true,\n                ReadOnly = true,\n                WordWrap = false,\n                ScrollBars = ScrollBars.Both,\n                BackColor = darkBg,\n                ForeColor = Color.LightGray,\n                Font = new Font(\u0022Consolas\u0022, 10F),\n                MaxLength = 0\n            };\n        }\n\n        private SiteDumpOptions BuildSiteDumpOptionsFromUi()\n        {\n            return new SiteDumpOptions\n            {\n                IncludeExternalCss = chkDumpExternal.Checked,\n                IncludeExternalScripts = chkDumpExternal.Checked,\n                IncludeInlineCss = chkDumpInline.Checked,\n                IncludeConstructedCss = chkDumpInline.Checked,\n                IncludeInlineScripts = chkDumpInline.Checked,\n                IncludePerformanceResourceScripts = chkDumpDynamicJs.Checked\n            };\n        }\n\n        private void SetDumpButtonsEnabled(bool enabled)\n        {\n            btnDumpHtml.Enabled = enabled;\n            btnDumpCss.Enabled = enabled;\n            btnDumpJs.Enabled = enabled;\n            btnDumpAll.Enabled = enabled;\n        }\n\n        private async Task ExecuteSiteDumpFromUiAsync(SiteDumpType dumpType)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a connected client first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            var options = BuildSiteDumpOptionsFromUi();\n            SetDumpButtonsEnabled(false);\n            lblDumpStatus.Text = $\u0022Dumping {dumpType} from {client.InstanceId}...\u0022;\n\n            try\n            {\n                SiteDumpResult result = dumpType switch\n                {\n                    SiteDumpType.Html =\u003E await client.DumpHtmlAsync(options, _siteDumper),\n                    SiteDumpType.Css =\u003E await client.DumpCssAsync(options, _siteDumper),\n                    SiteDumpType.JavaScript =\u003E await client.DumpJavaScriptAsync(options, _siteDumper),\n                    _ =\u003E await client.DumpAllAsync(options, _siteDumper)\n                };\n\n                DisplaySiteDumpResult(result);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                lblDumpStatus.Text = $\u0022Dump failed: {ex.Message}\u0022;\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Site dump ({dumpType}) failed: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                SetDumpButtonsEnabled(true);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void DisplaySiteDumpResult(SiteDumpResult result)\n        {\n            _lastSiteDumpResult = result;\n\n            lblDumpStatus.Text = $\u0022Dumped {result.HtmlResources.Count} HTML, {result.CssResources.Count} CSS, {result.JavaScriptResources.Count} JS ({result.GetFormattedTotalSize()})\u0022;\n\n            txtCombinedHtmlSource.Text = result.GetCombinedHtml();\n            txtCombinedCssSource.Text = result.GetCombinedCss();\n            txtCombinedJsSource.Text = result.GetCombinedJavaScript();\n\n            RefreshDumpedResourcesList();\n\n            if (result.DumpType == SiteDumpType.Html)\n            {\n                tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab = tabCombinedHtmlView;\n            }\n            else if (result.DumpType == SiteDumpType.Css)\n            {\n                tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab = tabCombinedCssView;\n            }\n            else if (result.DumpType == SiteDumpType.JavaScript)\n            {\n                tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab = tabCombinedJsView;\n            }\n            else if (lstDumpedResources.Items.Count \u003E 0)\n            {\n                tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab = tabSelectedResourceView;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void RefreshDumpedResourcesList()\n        {\n            lstDumpedResources.BeginUpdate();\n            try\n            {\n                lstDumpedResources.Items.Clear();\n                if (_lastSiteDumpResult == null)\n                {\n                    txtDumpedResourceDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                    txtSelectedResourceSource.Text = string.Empty;\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                string filter = txtFilterResources.Text.Trim();\n                var allResources = _lastSiteDumpResult.GetAllResources();\n\n                foreach (var res in allResources)\n                {\n                    if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(filter))\n                    {\n                        bool matches = res.Name.Contains(filter, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n                                       res.Url.Contains(filter, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n                                       res.SourceType.Contains(filter, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n                                       res.Category.ToString().Contains(filter, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) ||\n                                       (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(res.Content) \u0026\u0026 res.Content.Contains(filter, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase));\n                        if (!matches)\n                            continue;\n                    }\n\n                    lstDumpedResources.Items.Add(res);\n                }\n\n                if (lstDumpedResources.Items.Count \u003E 0)\n                {\n                    lstDumpedResources.SelectedIndex = 0;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    txtDumpedResourceDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                    txtSelectedResourceSource.Text = string.Empty;\n                }\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                lstDumpedResources.EndUpdate();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void LstDumpedResources_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstDumpedResources.SelectedItem is SiteResourceItem resource)\n            {\n                txtDumpedResourceDetails.Text = resource.GetFormattedDetails();\n                txtSelectedResourceSource.Text = resource.Content;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private string GetActiveDumpViewerText(out string suggestedFileName)\n        {\n            suggestedFileName = \u0022dump.txt\u0022;\n            if (_lastSiteDumpResult == null)\n                return string.Empty;\n\n            if (tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab == tabSelectedResourceView \u0026\u0026 lstDumpedResources.SelectedItem is SiteResourceItem selectedRes)\n            {\n                suggestedFileName = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(selectedRes.Name) ? \u0022resource.txt\u0022 : selectedRes.Name;\n                return selectedRes.Content;\n            }\n\n            if (tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab == tabCombinedHtmlView)\n            {\n                suggestedFileName = \u0022combined.html\u0022;\n                return _lastSiteDumpResult.GetCombinedHtml();\n            }\n\n            if (tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab == tabCombinedCssView)\n            {\n                suggestedFileName = \u0022combined.css\u0022;\n                return _lastSiteDumpResult.GetCombinedCss();\n            }\n\n            if (tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab == tabCombinedJsView)\n            {\n                suggestedFileName = \u0022combined.js\u0022;\n                return _lastSiteDumpResult.GetCombinedJavaScript();\n            }\n\n            suggestedFileName = \u0022combined_dump.txt\u0022;\n            return _lastSiteDumpResult.GetCombinedContent();\n        }\n\n        private void BtnCopyCurrentDumpView_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string content = GetActiveDumpViewerText(out string name);\n            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(content))\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No dumped source content in the active view to copy.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            Clipboard.SetText(content);\n            Log($\u0022[REV-ENG] Copied \u0027{name}\u0027 ({content.Length:N0} chars) to clipboard.\u0022, Color.Lime);\n        }\n\n        private void BtnSaveActiveDumpFile_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_lastSiteDumpResult == null)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please run a dump operation first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab == tabSelectedResourceView \u0026\u0026 lstDumpedResources.SelectedItem is SiteResourceItem selectedResource)\n            {\n                using var sfdResource = new SaveFileDialog\n                {\n                    Filter = \u0022All Files (*.*)|*.*|HTML Files (*.html)|*.html|CSS Files (*.css)|*.css|JavaScript Files (*.js)|*.js\u0022,\n                    Title = \u0022Save Selected Resource\u0022,\n                    FileName = selectedResource.Name\n                };\n\n                if (sfdResource.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n                {\n                    try\n                    {\n                        selectedResource.SaveToFile(sfdResource.FileName);\n                        Log($\u0022[REV-ENG] Saved resource \u0027{selectedResource.Name}\u0027 to {sfdResource.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                    }\n                    catch (Exception ex)\n                    {\n                        Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to save resource: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                    }\n                }\n                return;\n            }\n\n            string content = GetActiveDumpViewerText(out string defaultFileName);\n            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(content))\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Active dump view is empty.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022All Files (*.*)|*.*|HTML Files (*.html)|*.html|CSS Files (*.css)|*.css|JavaScript Files (*.js)|*.js\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Save Combined Dump Output\u0022,\n                FileName = defaultFileName\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    System.IO.File.WriteAllText(sfd.FileName, content, System.Text.Encoding.UTF8);\n                    Log($\u0022[REV-ENG] Saved \u0027{defaultFileName}\u0027 to {sfd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to save file: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnSaveDumpToFolder_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_lastSiteDumpResult == null || _lastSiteDumpResult.TotalResourceCount == 0)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No site dump results available to save.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            using var fbd = new FolderBrowserDialog\n            {\n                Description = \u0022Select a destination folder to save all dumped HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files\u0022,\n                UseDescriptionForTitle = true\n            };\n\n            if (fbd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(fbd.SelectedPath))\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    string savedPath = _lastSiteDumpResult.SaveToDirectory(fbd.SelectedPath);\n                    Log($\u0022[REV-ENG] Saved {_lastSiteDumpResult.TotalResourceCount} resource(s) ({_lastSiteDumpResult.GetFormattedTotalSize()}) to {savedPath}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to save dump to folder: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060Anti-Agent v1.0\n\n### Overview of Changes\n\n1. **Reverse Engineering Models (\u0060SiteResourceItem\u0060, \u0060SiteDumpOptions\u0060, \u0060SiteDumpResult\u0060, \u0060SiteDumpEventArgs\u0060)**:\n   - Added \u0060SiteResourceType\u0060 (\u0060Html\u0060, \u0060Css\u0060, \u0060JavaScript\u0060) and \u0060SiteDumpType\u0060 (\u0060Html\u0060, \u0060Css\u0060, \u0060JavaScript\u0060, \u0060All\u0060) enums.\n   - Added \u0060SiteResourceItem\u0060 to represent individual dumped assets (document HTML, iframes, external/inline/constructed CSS stylesheets, and external/inline/dynamic JS scripts) with helper methods to format metadata and save individual files (\u0060SaveToFile\u0060 / \u0060SaveToFileAsync\u0060).\n   - Added \u0060SiteDumpOptions\u0060 to configure what asset types and sources are included during a dump.\n   - Added \u0060SiteDumpResult\u0060 with methods to retrieve combined HTML/CSS/JS sources (\u0060GetCombinedHtml\u0060, \u0060GetCombinedCss\u0060, \u0060GetCombinedJavaScript\u0060, \u0060GetCombinedContent\u0060), serialize to JSON (\u0060ToJson\u0060), save combined output (\u0060SaveCombinedToFile\u0060), and export structured site dumps (\u0060index.html\u0060, \u0060css/\u0060, \u0060js/\u0060, \u0060manifest.json\u0060) to a directory (\u0060SaveToDirectory\u0060 / \u0060SaveToDirectoryAsync\u0060).\n2. **Reverse Engineering Engine \u0026 \u0060BrowserClient\u0060 API (\u0060SiteDumper\u0060, \u0060ReactExtensions\u0060, \u0060AutomationRunner\u0060)**:\n   - Added \u0060SiteDumper\u0060 in \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework.ReverseEngineering\u0060 with \u0060DumpHtmlAsync\u0060, \u0060DumpCssAsync\u0060, \u0060DumpJavaScriptAsync\u0060, \u0060DumpAllAsync\u0060, and \u0060DumpSiteAsync\u0060, plus lifecycle events (\u0060OnDumpStarted\u0060, \u0060OnDumpCompleted\u0060, \u0060OnDumpFailed\u0060).\n   - Added \u0060BrowserClient\u0060 extension methods (\u0060DumpHtmlAsync\u0060, \u0060DumpCssAsync\u0060, \u0060DumpJavaScriptAsync\u0060, \u0060DumpAllAsync\u0060, \u0060DumpSiteAsync\u0060) in \u0060ReactExtensions\u0060.\n   - Added \u0060AutomationActionType.DumpSite\u0060 support to \u0060AutomationRunner\u0060.\n3. **Userscript Reverse Engineering Actions (\u0060ScriptGenerator\u0060)**:\n   - Added \u0060ReverseEngineeringUtils\u0060 and registered \u0060DUMP_HTML\u0060, \u0060DUMP_CSS\u0060, \u0060DUMP_JS\u0060, and \u0060DUMP_SITE\u0060 commands in the generated Tampermonkey script.\n   - Uses \u0060GM_xmlhttpRequest\u0060 (with \u0060fetch\u0060 and CSSOM \u0060cssRules\u0060 fallbacks) to retrieve cross-origin external stylesheets and scripts, inline \u0060\u003Cstyle\u003E\u0060 and \u0060\u003Cscript\u003E\u0060 blocks, constructed stylesheets, and dynamically loaded scripts from \u0060performance.getEntriesByType(\u0027resource\u0027)\u0060, while stripping framework highlight overlays from the dumped HTML.\n4. **TestBedApp UI (\u0060MainForm\u0060, \u0060MainForm.Designer\u0060)**:\n   - Added a **Reverse Engineering** tab to \u0060MainForm\u0060 featuring the 4 dump buttons (**Dump HTML**, **Dump CSS**, **Dump JavaScript**, **Dump Everything**), resource filter \u0026 options checkboxes, a resource inspector list, individual and combined source viewers, and file/folder export buttons that wrap the new API methods.\n\n### How to Test\n\n1. Build and run \u0060TestBedApp\u0060.\n2. Click **Start Server**, then click **Generate \u0026 Copy Script** and install/update the Tampermonkey userscript in your browser.\n3. Open any website in the browser and verify the client appears in **Connected Clients**.\n4. Open the **Reverse Engineering** tab and test the 4 buttons:\n   - **Dump HTML**: Extracts and displays the full page HTML (and any accessible iframe HTML).\n   - **Dump CSS**: Extracts all external \u0060\u003Clink rel=\u0022stylesheet\u0022\u003E\u0060, inline \u0060\u003Cstyle\u003E\u0060, and constructed CSSOM stylesheets.\n   - **Dump JavaScript**: Extracts all external \u0060\u003Cscript src\u003E\u0060, inline \u0060\u003Cscript\u003E\u0060, and dynamically loaded JS resources.\n   - **Dump Everything**: Extracts all HTML, CSS, and JavaScript in a single operation.\n5. Select individual assets on the left to inspect their source code and metadata, switch between the combined HTML/CSS/JS tabs, or click **Save Dump to Folder...** to write the full structured site dump to disk.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\SiteResourceItem.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\ncsusing System;using System.IO;using System.Text;using System.Text.Json.Serialization;using System.Threading;using System.Threading.Tasks;namespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models{    public enum SiteResourceType    {        Html,        Css,        JavaScript    }    public enum SiteDumpType    {        Html,        Css,        JavaScript,        All    }    public class SiteResourceItem    {        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022name\u0022)]        public string Name { get; set; } = string.Empty;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022category\u0022)]        public SiteResourceType Category { get; set; } = SiteResourceType.Html;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022sourceType\u0022)]        public string SourceType { get; set; } = string.Empty;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022url\u0022)]        public string Url { get; set; } = string.Empty;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022content\u0022)]        public string Content { get; set; } = string.Empty;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022sizeBytes\u0022)]        public long SizeBytes { get; set; }        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022index\u0022)]        public int Index { get; set; }        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022error\u0022)]        public string? Error { get; set; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Returns a human-readable size string (e.g., \u002214.2 KB\u0022).        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public string GetFormattedSize()        {            long bytes = SizeBytes \u003E 0 ? SizeBytes : Encoding.UTF8.GetByteCount(Content ?? string.Empty);            if (bytes \u003C 1024)                return $\u0022{bytes} B\u0022;            if (bytes \u003C 1024 * 1024)                return $\u0022{bytes / 1024.0:0.1} KB\u0022;            return $\u0022{bytes / (1024.0 * 1024.0):0.2} MB\u0022;        }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Returns a multi-line summary of this resource\u0027s metadata.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public string GetFormattedDetails()        {            var sb = new StringBuilder();            sb.AppendLine($\u0022Name:        {Name}\u0022);            sb.AppendLine($\u0022Category:    {Category}\u0022);            sb.AppendLine($\u0022Source Type: {SourceType}\u0022);            sb.AppendLine($\u0022Size:        {GetFormattedSize()} ({SizeBytes:N0} bytes)\u0022);            sb.AppendLine($\u0022URL:         {Url}\u0022);            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Error))            {                sb.AppendLine($\u0022Error:       {Error}\u0022);            }            return sb.ToString();        }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Saves this resource\u0027s content to the specified file path.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public void SaveToFile(string filePath)        {            if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(filePath))                throw new ArgumentException(\u0022File path cannot be empty.\u0022, nameof(filePath));            string? dir = Path.GetDirectoryName(filePath);            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(dir))            {                Directory.CreateDirectory(dir);            }            File.WriteAllText(filePath, Content ?? string.Empty, Encoding.UTF8);        }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Asynchronously saves this resource\u0027s content to the specified file path.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public Task SaveToFileAsync(string filePath, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)        {            if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(filePath))                throw new ArgumentException(\u0022File path cannot be empty.\u0022, nameof(filePath));            string? dir = Path.GetDirectoryName(filePath);            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(dir))            {                Directory.CreateDirectory(dir);            }            return File.WriteAllTextAsync(filePath, Content ?? string.Empty, Encoding.UTF8, cancellationToken);        }        public override string ToString()        {            string tag = Category switch            {                SiteResourceType.Html =\u003E \u0022HTML\u0022,                SiteResourceType.Css =\u003E \u0022CSS\u0022,                SiteResourceType.JavaScript =\u003E \u0022JS\u0022,                _ =\u003E Category.ToString().ToUpperInvariant()            };            string errSuffix = !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Error) ? \u0022 [!]\u0022 : string.Empty;            return $\u0022[{tag} | {SourceType}] {Name} ({GetFormattedSize()}){errSuffix}\u0022;        }    }}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\SiteDumpOptions.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\ncsusing System.Text.Json.Serialization;namespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models{    /// \u003Csummary\u003E    /// Configuration options controlling which page resources are extracted during a reverse-engineering site dump.    /// \u003C/summary\u003E    public class SiteDumpOptions    {        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022includeHtml\u0022)]        public bool IncludeHtml { get; set; } = true;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022includeCss\u0022)]        public bool IncludeCss { get; set; } = true;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022includeJavaScript\u0022)]        public bool IncludeJavaScript { get; set; } = true;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022includeInlineCss\u0022)]        public bool IncludeInlineCss { get; set; } = true;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022includeExternalCss\u0022)]        public bool IncludeExternalCss { get; set; } = true;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022includeConstructedCss\u0022)]        public bool IncludeConstructedCss { get; set; } = true;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022includeInlineScripts\u0022)]        public bool IncludeInlineScripts { get; set; } = true;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022includeExternalScripts\u0022)]        public bool IncludeExternalScripts { get; set; } = true;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022includePerformanceResourceScripts\u0022)]        public bool IncludePerformanceResourceScripts { get; set; } = true;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022includeIframes\u0022)]        public bool IncludeIframes { get; set; } = true;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022fetchTimeoutMs\u0022)]        public int FetchTimeoutMs { get; set; } = 15000;        public SiteDumpOptions Clone()        {            return new SiteDumpOptions            {                IncludeHtml = IncludeHtml,                IncludeCss = IncludeCss,                IncludeJavaScript = IncludeJavaScript,                IncludeInlineCss = IncludeInlineCss,                IncludeExternalCss = IncludeExternalCss,                IncludeConstructedCss = IncludeConstructedCss,                IncludeInlineScripts = IncludeInlineScripts,                IncludeExternalScripts = IncludeExternalScripts,                IncludePerformanceResourceScripts = IncludePerformanceResourceScripts,                IncludeIframes = IncludeIframes,                FetchTimeoutMs = FetchTimeoutMs            };        }        public static SiteDumpOptions ForType(SiteDumpType dumpType, SiteDumpOptions? baseOptions = null)        {            var opts = baseOptions?.Clone() ?? new SiteDumpOptions();            opts.IncludeHtml = dumpType == SiteDumpType.Html || dumpType == SiteDumpType.All;            opts.IncludeCss = dumpType == SiteDumpType.Css || dumpType == SiteDumpType.All;            opts.IncludeJavaScript = dumpType == SiteDumpType.JavaScript || dumpType == SiteDumpType.All;            return opts;        }    }}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\SiteDumpResult.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\ncsusing System;using System.Collections.Generic;using System.IO;using System.Linq;using System.Text;using System.Text.Json;using System.Text.Json.Serialization;using System.Threading;using System.Threading.Tasks;namespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models{    /// \u003Csummary\u003E    /// Contains all extracted HTML, CSS, and JavaScript assets from a reverse-engineering site dump operation,    /// along with helper methods for combining, serializing, and exporting the dumped files to disk.    /// \u003C/summary\u003E    public class SiteDumpResult    {        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022dumpType\u0022)]        public SiteDumpType DumpType { get; set; } = SiteDumpType.All;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022pageUrl\u0022)]        public string PageUrl { get; set; } = string.Empty;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022pageTitle\u0022)]        public string PageTitle { get; set; } = string.Empty;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022timestampUtc\u0022)]        public DateTime TimestampUtc { get; set; } = DateTime.UtcNow;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022success\u0022)]        public bool Success { get; set; } = true;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022errorMessage\u0022)]        public string? ErrorMessage { get; set; }        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022html\u0022)]        public string Html { get; set; } = string.Empty;        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022htmlResources\u0022)]        public List\u003CSiteResourceItem\u003E HtmlResources { get; set; } = new();        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022cssResources\u0022)]        public List\u003CSiteResourceItem\u003E CssResources { get; set; } = new();        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022javascriptResources\u0022)]        public List\u003CSiteResourceItem\u003E JavaScriptResources { get; set; } = new();        [JsonIgnore]        public int TotalResourceCount =\u003E HtmlResources.Count \u002B CssResources.Count \u002B JavaScriptResources.Count;        [JsonIgnore]        public long TotalSizeBytes =\u003E GetAllResources().Sum(r =\u003E r.SizeBytes \u003E 0 ? r.SizeBytes : Encoding.UTF8.GetByteCount(r.Content ?? string.Empty));        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Returns a flat read-only list of all dumped HTML, CSS, and JavaScript resource items.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public IReadOnlyList\u003CSiteResourceItem\u003E GetAllResources()        {            var all = new List\u003CSiteResourceItem\u003E(TotalResourceCount);            all.AddRange(HtmlResources);            all.AddRange(CssResources);            all.AddRange(JavaScriptResources);            return all;        }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Returns a human-readable total size string (e.g. \u0022512.4 KB\u0022).        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public string GetFormattedTotalSize()        {            long bytes = TotalSizeBytes;            if (bytes \u003C 1024)                return $\u0022{bytes} B\u0022;            if (bytes \u003C 1024 * 1024)                return $\u0022{bytes / 1024.0:0.1} KB\u0022;            return $\u0022{bytes / (1024.0 * 1024.0):0.2} MB\u0022;        }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Returns the combined HTML source across the main document and any captured iframes.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public string GetCombinedHtml()        {            if (HtmlResources.Count \u003C= 1)                return !string.IsNullOrEmpty(Html) ? Html : (HtmlResources.FirstOrDefault()?.Content ?? string.Empty);            var sb = new StringBuilder();            foreach (var item in HtmlResources)            {                sb.AppendLine($\u0022\u003C!-- ======================================================================\u0022);                sb.AppendLine($\u0022     HTML Resource #{item.Index}: {item.Name} ({item.SourceType})\u0022);                sb.AppendLine($\u0022     URL: {item.Url}\u0022);                sb.AppendLine($\u0022     ====================================================================== --\u003E\u0022);                sb.AppendLine(item.Content);                sb.AppendLine();            }            return sb.ToString();        }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Returns all dumped CSS stylesheets concatenated into a single stylesheet with source headers.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public string GetCombinedCss()        {            if (CssResources.Count == 0)                return string.Empty;            var sb = new StringBuilder();            foreach (var item in CssResources)            {                sb.AppendLine(\u0022/* ======================================================================\u0022);                sb.AppendLine($\u0022   CSS Resource #{item.Index}: {item.Name} ({item.SourceType})\u0022);                sb.AppendLine($\u0022   URL: {item.Url}\u0022);                if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(item.Error))                {                    sb.AppendLine($\u0022   Error: {item.Error}\u0022);                }                sb.AppendLine(\u0022   ====================================================================== */\u0022);                sb.AppendLine(item.Content);                sb.AppendLine();            }            return sb.ToString();        }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Returns all dumped JavaScript resources concatenated into a single script with source headers.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public string GetCombinedJavaScript()        {            if (JavaScriptResources.Count == 0)                return string.Empty;            var sb = new StringBuilder();            foreach (var item in JavaScriptResources)            {                sb.AppendLine(\u0022// ======================================================================\u0022);                sb.AppendLine($\u0022// JS Resource #{item.Index}: {item.Name} ({item.SourceType})\u0022);                sb.AppendLine($\u0022// URL: {item.Url}\u0022);                if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(item.Error))                {                    sb.AppendLine($\u0022// Error: {item.Error}\u0022);                }                sb.AppendLine(\u0022// ======================================================================\u0022);                sb.AppendLine(item.Content);                sb.AppendLine();            }            return sb.ToString();        }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Returns the combined text output corresponding to \u003Csee cref=\u0022DumpType\u0022/\u003E.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public string GetCombinedContent()        {            return DumpType switch            {                SiteDumpType.Html =\u003E GetCombinedHtml(),                SiteDumpType.Css =\u003E GetCombinedCss(),                SiteDumpType.JavaScript =\u003E GetCombinedJavaScript(),                _ =\u003E BuildFullCombinedSummary()            };        }        private string BuildFullCombinedSummary()        {            var sb = new StringBuilder();            if (HtmlResources.Count \u003E 0 || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(Html))            {                sb.AppendLine(\u0022/ ==================== DUMPED HTML ==================== /\u0022);                sb.AppendLine(GetCombinedHtml());                sb.AppendLine();            }            if (CssResources.Count \u003E 0)            {                sb.AppendLine(\u0022/ ==================== DUMPED CSS ==================== /\u0022);                sb.AppendLine(GetCombinedCss());                sb.AppendLine();            }            if (JavaScriptResources.Count \u003E 0)            {                sb.AppendLine(\u0022/ ==================== DUMPED JAVASCRIPT ==================== /\u0022);                sb.AppendLine(GetCombinedJavaScript());            }            return sb.ToString();        }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Serializes the entire \u003