h: $.children[1].children[2].children[3].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[2].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0] | LineNumber: 0 | BytePositionInLine: 2616569.\n[19:59:33.974] [ERR] Failed to fetch DOM: The maximum configured depth of 64 has been exceeded. Cannot read next JSON object. Path: $.children[1].children[2].children[3].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[2].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0] | LineNumber: 0 | BytePositionInLine: 2618910.\n[19:59:36.701] [ERR] Failed to fetch DOM: The maximum configured depth of 64 has been exceeded. Cannot read next JSON object. Path: $.children[1].children[2].children[3].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[2].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[1].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0].children[0] | LineNumber: 0 | BytePositionInLine: 2618910.\n\u0060\u0060\u0060",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\n### Overview of Changes\n\n- **Increased JSON MaxDepth Limit (\u0060ReactExtensions\u0060, \u0060AutomationServer\u0060, \u0060BrowserClient\u0060, \u0060DataScraper\u0060, \u0060SiteDumper\u0060)**:\n\n- \u0060System.Text.Json\u0060 defaults to a maximum nesting depth of \u006064\u0060 (which corresponds to only 32 nested DOM elements because each \u0060DomNode\u0060 level nests both a JSON object and a \u0060children\u0060 JSON array).\n- Configured \u0060JsonSerializerOptions\u0060 and \u0060JsonDocumentOptions\u0060 with \u0060MaxDepth = 1024\u0060 across \u0060GetDomNodeAsync\u0060 and all IPC/scraping/dumping JSON parsers so deeply nested web apps like Discord deserialize without throwing \u0060MaxDepth\u0060 exceptions.\n- **Optimized DOM Serialization in \u0060ScriptGenerator\u0060**:\n\n- Updated \u0060serializeElement\u0060 in \u0060ScriptGenerator.cs\u0060 to compute \u0060:nth-child(N)\u0060 paths incrementally from parent to child in \u0060O(N)\u0060 time instead of walking up the ancestor tree for every node, and added a safe \u0060MAX_DOM_DEPTH = 300\u0060 guard.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Rebuild and run \u0060TestBedApp\u0060, then click **Start Server** (which also auto-updates \u0060bridge.js\u0060 in the \u0060ChromeExtension\u0060 folder; click the reload icon on the extension in \u0060chrome://extensions\u0060 or re-switch to the Discord tab).\n- Select the Discord tab in **Chrome Extension - Open Tabs** and open the **DOM Explorer** tab to verify the full DOM tree loads without \u0060MaxDepth\u0060 errors.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Extensions\\ReactExtensions.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n    public static class ReactExtensions\n    {\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Locates an element via CSS selector and simulates a trusted React or native click event.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n==== REPLACE\n    public static class ReactExtensions\n    {\n        private static readonly JsonSerializerOptions DomJsonSerializerOptions = new()\n        {\n            MaxDepth = 1024\n        };\n\n        private static readonly JsonDocumentOptions HighDepthJsonDocumentOptions = new()\n        {\n            MaxDepth = 1024\n        };\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Locates an element via CSS selector and simulates a trusted React or native click event.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(navResult.Output))\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(navResult.Output);\n==== REPLACE\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(navResult.Output))\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(navResult.Output, HighDepthJsonDocumentOptions);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(reloadResult.Output))\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(reloadResult.Output);\n==== REPLACE\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(reloadResult.Output))\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(reloadResult.Output, HighDepthJsonDocumentOptions);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            try\n            {\n                using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(output);\n==== REPLACE\n            try\n            {\n                using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(output, HighDepthJsonDocumentOptions);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        public static async Task\u003CDomNode?\u003E GetDomNodeAsync(this BrowserClient client, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var result = await client.GetDomAsync(cancellationToken);\n            if (result.Status == \u0022completed\u0022 \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(result.Output))\n            {\n                return JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CDomNode\u003E(result.Output);\n            }\n            return null;\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        public static async Task\u003CDomNode?\u003E GetDomNodeAsync(this BrowserClient client, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var result = await client.GetDomAsync(cancellationToken);\n            if (result.Status == \u0022completed\u0022 \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(result.Output))\n            {\n                return JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CDomNode\u003E(result.Output, DomJsonSerializerOptions);\n            }\n            return null;\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(res.Output))\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(res.Output);\n==== REPLACE\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(res.Output))\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(res.Output, HighDepthJsonDocumentOptions);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Generators\\ScriptGenerator.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n    function serializeElement(el) {\n        if (el.nodeType === Node.TEXT_NODE) {\n            const text = el.textContent.trim();\n            return text ? { type: \u0027text\u0027, text: text } : null;\n        }\n        if (el.nodeType !== Node.ELEMENT_NODE) return null;\n        if (el.id === \u0027__baf_highlight_overlay\u0027 || el.id === \u0027__baf_multi_highlight_container\u0027 || el.id === \u0027__baf_ratelimit_banner\u0027) return null;\n        if (el.closest \u0026\u0026 el.closest(\u0027#__baf_multi_highlight_container\u0027)) return null;\n        if (el.id \u0026\u0026 typeof el.id === \u0027string\u0027 \u0026\u0026 el.id.startsWith(\u0027eval_\u0027) \u0026\u0026 el.id.endsWith(\u0027_script\u0027)) return null;\n        \n        const path = getElementPath(el);\n\n        const node = {\n            type: \u0027element\u0027,\n            tagName: el.tagName.toLowerCase(),\n            path: path,\n            attributes: {}\n        };\n        \n        for (let attr of el.attributes) {\n            node.attributes[attr.name] = attr.value;\n        }\n        \n        node.children = [];\n        for (let child of el.childNodes) {\n            const serializedChild = serializeElement(child);\n            if (serializedChild) node.children.push(serializedChild);\n        }\n        return node;\n    }\n\n    registerAction(\u0027GET_DOM\u0027, async (payload) =\u003E {\n        return serializeElement(document.documentElement);\n    });\n==== REPLACE\n    const MAX_DOM_DEPTH = 300;\n\n    function isInternalBridgeNode(el) {\n        if (!el || el.nodeType !== Node.ELEMENT_NODE) return false;\n        if (el.id === \u0027__baf_highlight_overlay\u0027 || el.id === \u0027__baf_multi_highlight_container\u0027 || el.id === \u0027__baf_ratelimit_banner\u0027) return true;\n        if (el.id \u0026\u0026 typeof el.id === \u0027string\u0027 \u0026\u0026 el.id.startsWith(\u0027eval_\u0027) \u0026\u0026 el.id.endsWith(\u0027_script\u0027)) return true;\n        return false;\n    }\n\n    function serializeElement(el, depth = 0, computedPath = null) {\n        if (depth \u003E MAX_DOM_DEPTH) return null;\n        if (el.nodeType === Node.TEXT_NODE) {\n            const text = el.textContent.trim();\n            return text ? { type: \u0027text\u0027, text: text } : null;\n        }\n        if (el.nodeType !== Node.ELEMENT_NODE) return null;\n        if (isInternalBridgeNode(el)) return null;\n\n        const tag = el.tagName.toLowerCase();\n        let path = computedPath;\n        if (!path) {\n            if (tag === \u0027html\u0027) path = \u0027html\u0027;\n            else if (tag === \u0027body\u0027) path = \u0027body\u0027;\n            else path = getElementPath(el);\n        }\n\n        const node = {\n            type: \u0027element\u0027,\n            tagName: tag,\n            path: path,\n            attributes: {}\n        };\n\n        for (let attr of el.attributes) {\n            node.attributes[attr.name] = attr.value;\n        }\n\n        node.children = [];\n        if (depth \u003C MAX_DOM_DEPTH) {\n            let elementIndex = 0;\n            for (let child of el.childNodes) {\n                if (child.nodeType === Node.ELEMENT_NODE) {\n                    elementIndex\u002B\u002B;\n                    if (isInternalBridgeNode(child)) continue;\n                    const childTag = child.tagName.toLowerCase();\n                    const childPath = childTag === \u0027body\u0027\n                        ? \u0027body\u0027\n                        : \u0060${path} \u003E ${childTag}:nth-child(${elementIndex})\u0060;\n                    const serializedChild = serializeElement(child, depth \u002B 1, childPath);\n                    if (serializedChild) node.children.push(serializedChild);\n                } else if (child.nodeType === Node.TEXT_NODE) {\n                    const serializedText = serializeElement(child, depth \u002B 1, null);\n                    if (serializedText) node.children.push(serializedText);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return node;\n    }\n\n    registerAction(\u0027GET_DOM\u0027, async (payload) =\u003E {\n        return serializeElement(document.documentElement, 0, \u0027html\u0027);\n    });\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Server\\AutomationServer.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n    public class AutomationServer\n    {\n        private readonly int _port;\n==== REPLACE\n    public class AutomationServer\n    {\n        private static readonly JsonSerializerOptions HighDepthSerializerOptions = new()\n        {\n            MaxDepth = 1024\n        };\n\n        private static readonly JsonDocumentOptions HighDepthDocumentOptions = new()\n        {\n            MaxDepth = 1024\n        };\n\n        private readonly int _port;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            if (tabsElement.ValueKind == JsonValueKind.Array)\n            {\n                parsedTabs = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CList\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E\u003E(tabsElement.GetRawText()) ?? new List\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E();\n            }\n==== REPLACE\n            if (tabsElement.ValueKind == JsonValueKind.Array)\n            {\n                parsedTabs = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CList\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E\u003E(tabsElement.GetRawText(), HighDepthSerializerOptions) ?? new List\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E();\n            }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                    using var reader = new StreamReader(request.InputStream);\n                    string body = await reader.ReadToEndAsync(cancellationToken);\n                    var result = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CCommandResult\u003E(body);\n==== REPLACE\n                    using var reader = new StreamReader(request.InputStream);\n                    string body = await reader.ReadToEndAsync(cancellationToken);\n                    var result = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CCommandResult\u003E(body, HighDepthSerializerOptions);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                    using var reader = new StreamReader(request.InputStream);\n                    string body = await reader.ReadToEndAsync(cancellationToken);\n                    var evt = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CEventMessage\u003E(body);\n==== REPLACE\n                    using var reader = new StreamReader(request.InputStream);\n                    string body = await reader.ReadToEndAsync(cancellationToken);\n                    var evt = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CEventMessage\u003E(body, HighDepthSerializerOptions);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                    using var reader = new StreamReader(request.InputStream);\n                    string body = await reader.ReadToEndAsync(cancellationToken);\n                    if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(body))\n                    {\n                        using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(body);\n                        UpdateExtensionTabsFromPayload(doc.RootElement);\n                    }\n==== REPLACE\n                    using var reader = new StreamReader(request.InputStream);\n                    string body = await reader.ReadToEndAsync(cancellationToken);\n                    if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(body))\n                    {\n                        using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(body, HighDepthDocumentOptions);\n                        UpdateExtensionTabsFromPayload(doc.RootElement);\n                    }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                    MarkExtensionSeen();\n                    string message = Encoding.UTF8.GetString(ms.ToArray());\n                    using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(message);\n==== REPLACE\n                    MarkExtensionSeen();\n                    string message = Encoding.UTF8.GetString(ms.ToArray());\n                    using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(message, HighDepthDocumentOptions);\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                    client.LastSeen = DateTime.UtcNow;\n                    string message = Encoding.UTF8.GetString(ms.ToArray());\n                    using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(message);\n                    if (doc.RootElement.TryGetProperty(\u0022event\u0022, out _))\n                    {\n                        var evt = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CEventMessage\u003E(message);\n                        if (evt != null)\n                        {\n                            client.HandleEvent(evt);\n                        }\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        var cmdResult = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CCommandResult\u003E(message);\n                        if (cmdResult != null)\n                        {\n                            client.HandleResult(cmdResult);\n                        }\n                    }\n==== REPLACE\n                    client.LastSeen = DateTime.UtcNow;\n                    string message = Encoding.UTF8.GetString(ms.ToArray());\n                    using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(message, HighDepthDocumentOptions);\n                    if (doc.RootElement.TryGetProperty(\u0022event\u0022, out _))\n                    {\n                        var evt = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CEventMessage\u003E(message, HighDepthSerializerOptions);\n                        if (evt != null)\n                        {\n                            client.HandleEvent(evt);\n                        }\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        var cmdResult = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003CCommandResult\u003E(message, HighDepthSerializerOptions);\n                        if (cmdResult != null)\n                        {\n                            client.HandleResult(cmdResult);\n                        }\n                    }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Server\\BrowserClient.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                if (trimmed.StartsWith(\u0022{\u0022) || trimmed.StartsWith(\u0022[\u0022))\n                {\n                    try\n                    {\n                        payload = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003Cobject\u003E(trimmed) ?? rawPayload;\n                    }\n==== REPLACE\n                if (trimmed.StartsWith(\u0022{\u0022) || trimmed.StartsWith(\u0022[\u0022))\n                {\n                    try\n                    {\n                        payload = JsonSerializer.Deserialize\u003Cobject\u003E(trimmed, new JsonSerializerOptions { MaxDepth = 1024 }) ?? rawPayload;\n                    }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Scraping\\DataScraper.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            try\n            {\n                using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(output);\n                JsonElement recordsElement = doc.RootElement;\n==== REPLACE\n            try\n            {\n                using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(output, new JsonDocumentOptions { MaxDepth = 1024 });\n                JsonElement recordsElement = doc.RootElement;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\ReverseEngineering\\SiteDumper.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            try\n            {\n                using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(rawOutput);\n                var root = doc.RootElement;\n==== REPLACE\n            try\n            {\n                using var doc = JsonDocument.Parse(rawOutput, new JsonDocumentOptions { MaxDepth = 1024 });\n                var root = doc.RootElement;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060",
      "ModelExplanation": "### Overview of Changes\n\n- **Increased JSON MaxDepth Limit (\u0060ReactExtensions\u0060, \u0060AutomationServer\u0060, \u0060BrowserClient\u0060, \u0060DataScraper\u0060, \u0060SiteDumper\u0060)**:\n\n- \u0060System.Text.Json\u0060 defaults to a maximum nesting depth of \u006064\u0060 (which corresponds to only 32 nested DOM elements because each \u0060DomNode\u0060 level nests both a JSON object and a \u0060children\u0060 JSON array).\n- Configured \u0060JsonSerializerOptions\u0060 and \u0060JsonDocumentOptions\u0060 with \u0060MaxDepth = 1024\u0060 across \u0060GetDomNodeAsync\u0060 and all IPC/scraping/dumping JSON parsers so deeply nested web apps like Discord deserialize without throwing \u0060MaxDepth\u0060 exceptions.\n- **Optimized DOM Serialization in \u0060ScriptGenerator\u0060**:\n\n- Updated \u0060serializeElement\u0060 in \u0060ScriptGenerator.cs\u0060 to compute \u0060:nth-child(N)\u0060 paths incrementally from parent to child in \u0060O(N)\u0060 time instead of walking up the ancestor tree for every node, and added a safe \u0060MAX_DOM_DEPTH = 300\u0060 guard.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Rebuild and run \u0060TestBedApp\u0060, then click **Start Server** (which also auto-updates \u0060bridge.js\u0060 in the \u0060ChromeExtension\u0060 folder; click the reload icon on the extension in \u0060chrome://extensions\u0060 or re-switch to the Discord tab).\n- Select the Discord tab in **Chrome Extension - Open Tabs** and open the **DOM Explorer** tab to verify the full DOM tree loads without \u0060MaxDepth\u0060 errors.",
