      "Id": "c3999e22",
      "Timestamp": "2026-10-27T20:53:16.5365978-05:00",
      "UserPrompt": "So now we need to fix a bug. After the first site i hook, the DOM fails to ever load into the program. I cant find any error logs from the js console or the apps logs. This happens after the first time i hook a site, and it works, but any subsequent after that, no matter if i unhook the page or hook it again, the DOM never populates into the viewer.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n- **Prevent Client Deselection \u0026 \u0060tvDom.Clear()\u0060 on Status Updates (\u0060TestBedApp\\MainForm.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Fixed \u0060RefreshClientListItemDisplay\u0060 where assigning \u0060lstClients.Items[i] = item\u0060 caused WinForms \u0060ListBox\u0060 to reset \u0060SelectedIndex\u0060 to \u0060-1\u0060 and fire \u0060LstClients_SelectedIndexChanged\u0060 (which cleared \u0060tvDom\u0060 and left \u0060lstClients.SelectedItem\u0060 as \u0060null\u0060 on subsequent \u0060PAGE_LOADED\u0060 and \u0060EXTENSION_TABS_UPDATED\u0060 heartbeats).\n- Updated \u0060Server_OnClientConnected\u0060, \u0060Server_OnClientDisconnected\u0060, and \u0060client.OnPageLoaded\u0060 so newly hooked or re-hooked tabs are always selected in \u0060lstClients\u0060 and immediately trigger \u0060RefreshDomAsync\u0060.\n- Added a 10-second \u0060CancellationTokenSource\u0060 timeout per DOM fetch in \u0060RefreshDomAsync\u0060 so an unresponsive or unloading tab can never hold \u0060_domRefreshInFlight\u0060 indefinitely.\n- **Prevent Premature Extension Client Disconnection \u0026 Zombie Sockets (\u0060AutomationServer.cs\u0060, \u0060BrowserClient.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Updated \u0060AutomationServer.UpdateExtensionTabsFromPayload\u0060 so an actively connected extension tab client is not prematurely disconnected by an in-flight tab list update that was captured just before injection completed.\n- Added \u0060BrowserClient.Disconnect()\u0060 (called from \u0060AutomationServer.DisconnectClient\u0060) to cancel any pending commands and close the underlying WebSocket cleanly when a tab is detached.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Start the server in \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 and hook a browser tab; verify its DOM populates in the **DOM Explorer**.\n- Switch to a different tab (or detach and re-hook the same tab or another site) using either the **Chrome Extension - Open Tabs** panel or the Chrome Extension popup.\n- Verify that the DOM Explorer reliably populates for every subsequent hooked site and after page navigations.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Server\\BrowserClient.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        internal void DetachWebSocket(WebSocket webSocket)\n        {\n            LastSeen = DateTime.UtcNow;\n            if (ReferenceEquals(_webSocket, webSocket))\n            {\n                _webSocket = null;\n                Interlocked.Exchange(ref _wsReconnectTcs, new TaskCompletionSource\u003Cbool\u003E(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously));\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        internal void DetachWebSocket(WebSocket webSocket)\n        {\n            LastSeen = DateTime.UtcNow;\n            if (ReferenceEquals(_webSocket, webSocket))\n            {\n                _webSocket = null;\n                Interlocked.Exchange(ref _wsReconnectTcs, new TaskCompletionSource\u003Cbool\u003E(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously));\n            }\n        }\n\n        internal void Disconnect()\n        {\n            foreach (var kvp in _pendingCommands.ToArray())\n            {\n                if (_pendingCommands.TryRemove(kvp.Key, out var entry))\n                {\n                    entry.Tcs.TrySetCanceled();\n                }\n            }\n\n            var reconnectTcs = Interlocked.Exchange(ref _wsReconnectTcs, new TaskCompletionSource\u003Cbool\u003E(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously));\n            reconnectTcs.TrySetCanceled();\n\n            var ws = Interlocked.Exchange(ref _webSocket, null);\n            if (ws != null)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    if (ws.State == WebSocketState.Open || ws.State == WebSocketState.CloseReceived)\n                    {\n                        ws.Abort();\n                    }\n                    ws.Dispose();\n                }\n                catch { }\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Server\\AutomationServer.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                if (isStale)\n                {\n                    if (_clients.TryRemove(kvp.Key, out var removedClient))\n                    {\n                        OnClientDisconnected?.Invoke(this, removedClient);\n                    }\n                }\n==== REPLACE\n                if (isStale)\n                {\n                    if (_clients.TryRemove(kvp.Key, out var removedClient))\n                    {\n                        removedClient.Disconnect();\n                        OnClientDisconnected?.Invoke(this, removedClient);\n                    }\n                }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        public void DisconnectClient(string instanceId)\n        {\n            if (_clients.TryRemove(instanceId, out var removed))\n            {\n                OnClientDisconnected?.Invoke(this, removed);\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        public void DisconnectClient(string instanceId)\n        {\n            if (_clients.TryRemove(instanceId, out var removed))\n            {\n                removed.Disconnect();\n                OnClientDisconnected?.Invoke(this, removed);\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            var allOpenTabIds = new HashSet\u003Cint\u003E(parsedTabs.Select(t =\u003E t.TabId));\n            foreach (var kvp in _clients.ToArray())\n            {\n                if (kvp.Value.IsExtensionClient \u0026\u0026 kvp.Value.TabId.HasValue)\n                {\n                    int cTabId = kvp.Value.TabId.Value;\n                    if (!allOpenTabIds.Contains(cTabId) || !openInjectedTabIds.Contains(cTabId))\n                    {\n                        DisconnectClient(kvp.Key);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n==== REPLACE\n            var allOpenTabIds = new HashSet\u003Cint\u003E(parsedTabs.Select(t =\u003E t.TabId));\n            foreach (var kvp in _clients.ToArray())\n            {\n                if (kvp.Value.IsExtensionClient \u0026\u0026 kvp.Value.TabId.HasValue)\n                {\n                    int cTabId = kvp.Value.TabId.Value;\n                    if (!allOpenTabIds.Contains(cTabId))\n                    {\n                        DisconnectClient(kvp.Key);\n                    }\n                    else if (!openInjectedTabIds.Contains(cTabId) \u0026\u0026\n                             ActiveExtensionTabId != cTabId \u0026\u0026\n                             !kvp.Value.IsWebSocketConnected \u0026\u0026\n                             (DateTime.UtcNow - kvp.Value.LastSeen) \u003E TimeSpan.FromSeconds(5))\n                    {\n                        DisconnectClient(kvp.Key);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private List\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E _latestExtensionTabs = new();\n        private bool _isUpdatingBrowserTabsList;\n        private int? _pendingAutoSelectTabId;\n==== REPLACE\n        private List\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E _latestExtensionTabs = new();\n        private bool _isUpdatingBrowserTabsList;\n        private bool _isUpdatingClientsList;\n        private int? _pendingAutoSelectTabId;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            client.OnPageLoaded \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (e.StatusCode == 429)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[NAV \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Page rate-limited (HTTP 429): {e.Url}\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[NAV \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Page loaded: {e.Url}\u0022, Color.Aqua);\n                }\n                Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E RefreshClientListItemDisplay(client)));\n            };\n==== REPLACE\n            client.OnPageLoaded \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (e.StatusCode == 429)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[NAV \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Page rate-limited (HTTP 429): {e.Url}\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[NAV \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Page loaded: {e.Url}\u0022, Color.Aqua);\n                }\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(async () =\u003E\n                {\n                    RefreshClientListItemDisplay(client);\n                    if (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient selectedClient \u0026\u0026 selectedClient.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                    {\n                        await RefreshDomAsync(client);\n                    }\n                }));\n            };\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n            {\n                var existing = lstClients.Items.Cast\u003CBrowserClient\u003E().FirstOrDefault(c =\u003E c.InstanceId == client.InstanceId);\n                if (existing == null)\n                {\n                    lstClients.Items.Add(client);\n                    existing = client;\n                }\n\n                if ((_pendingAutoSelectTabId.HasValue \u0026\u0026 client.TabId == _pendingAutoSelectTabId.Value) ||\n                    lstClients.Items.Count == 1)\n                {\n                    if (_pendingAutoSelectTabId.HasValue \u0026\u0026 client.TabId == _pendingAutoSelectTabId.Value)\n                    {\n                        _pendingAutoSelectTabId = null;\n                    }\n                    lstClients.SelectedItem = existing;\n                }\n            }));\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientDisconnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Client Disconnected: {client.InstanceId}\u0022, Color.Orange);\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n            {\n                Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E lstClients.Items.Remove(client)));\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                lstClients.Items.Remove(client);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void LstClients_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                _lastHighlightedBrowserPath = null;\n                await RefreshDomAsync(client);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                tvDom.Clear();\n                txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void ClientRefreshTimer_Tick(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_server == null) return;\n            \n            var activeClients = _server.GetAllClients().ToList();\n            var currentClients = lstClients.Items.Cast\u003CBrowserClient\u003E().ToList();\n\n            // Remove disconnected\n            for (int i = lstClients.Items.Count - 1; i \u003E= 0; i--)\n            {\n                var client = (BrowserClient)lstClients.Items[i];\n                if (!activeClients.Any(c =\u003E c.InstanceId == client.InstanceId))\n                {\n                    lstClients.Items.RemoveAt(i);\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Add new\n            foreach (var client in activeClients.Where(c =\u003E !currentClients.Any(cc =\u003E cc.InstanceId == c.InstanceId)))\n            {\n                lstClients.Items.Add(client);\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n            BeginInvoke(new Action(async () =\u003E\n            {\n                int existingIdx = -1;\n                for (int i = 0; i \u003C lstClients.Items.Count; i\u002B\u002B)\n                {\n                    if (lstClients.Items[i] is BrowserClient item \u0026\u0026 item.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                    {\n                        existingIdx = i;\n                        break;\n                    }\n                }\n\n                _isUpdatingClientsList = true;\n                try\n                {\n                    if (existingIdx \u003E= 0)\n                    {\n                        lstClients.Items[existingIdx] = client;\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        lstClients.Items.Add(client);\n                    }\n                }\n                finally\n                {\n                    _isUpdatingClientsList = false;\n                }\n\n                bool shouldSelect =\n                    (_pendingAutoSelectTabId.HasValue \u0026\u0026 client.TabId == _pendingAutoSelectTabId.Value) ||\n                    (_server?.ActiveExtensionTabId != null \u0026\u0026 client.TabId == _server.ActiveExtensionTabId) ||\n                    (client.IsExtensionClient \u0026\u0026 chkExclusiveTab.Checked) ||\n                    lstClients.SelectedItem == null ||\n                    lstClients.Items.Count == 1 ||\n                    (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient sel \u0026\u0026 sel.InstanceId == client.InstanceId);\n\n                if (_pendingAutoSelectTabId.HasValue \u0026\u0026 client.TabId == _pendingAutoSelectTabId.Value)\n                {\n                    _pendingAutoSelectTabId = null;\n                }\n\n                if (shouldSelect)\n                {\n                    _isUpdatingClientsList = true;\n                    try\n                    {\n                        lstClients.SelectedItem = client;\n                    }\n                    finally\n                    {\n                        _isUpdatingClientsList = false;\n                    }\n\n                    _lastHighlightedBrowserPath = null;\n                    await RefreshDomAsync(client);\n                }\n            }));\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientDisconnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Client Disconnected: {client.InstanceId}\u0022, Color.Orange);\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n            {\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(() =\u003E HandleClientRemovedFromUi(client)));\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                HandleClientRemovedFromUi(client);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void HandleClientRemovedFromUi(BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            bool wasSelected = lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient sel \u0026\u0026 sel.InstanceId == client.InstanceId;\n\n            for (int i = lstClients.Items.Count - 1; i \u003E= 0; i--)\n            {\n                if (lstClients.Items[i] is BrowserClient item \u0026\u0026 item.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                {\n                    lstClients.Items.RemoveAt(i);\n                }\n            }\n\n            if (wasSelected)\n            {\n                if (lstClients.Items.Count \u003E 0)\n                {\n                    lstClients.SelectedIndex = 0;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    tvDom.Clear();\n                    txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void LstClients_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_isUpdatingClientsList) return;\n\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                _lastHighlightedBrowserPath = null;\n                await RefreshDomAsync(client);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                tvDom.Clear();\n                txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void ClientRefreshTimer_Tick(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_server == null) return;\n            \n            var activeClients = _server.GetAllClients().ToList();\n            var currentClients = lstClients.Items.Cast\u003CBrowserClient\u003E().ToList();\n\n            // Remove disconnected\n            for (int i = lstClients.Items.Count - 1; i \u003E= 0; i--)\n            {\n                var client = (BrowserClient)lstClients.Items[i];\n                if (!activeClients.Any(c =\u003E c.InstanceId == client.InstanceId))\n                {\n                    HandleClientRemovedFromUi(client);\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Add new\n            foreach (var client in activeClients.Where(c =\u003E !currentClients.Any(cc =\u003E cc.InstanceId == c.InstanceId)))\n            {\n                lstClients.Items.Add(client);\n                if (lstClients.SelectedItem == null)\n                {\n                    lstClients.SelectedItem = client;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                    // Fetch, deserialize, and index the entire DOM tree on a background thread\n                    var snapshot = await Task.Run(async () =\u003E\n                    {\n                        var rootNode = await currentClient.GetDomNodeAsync().ConfigureAwait(false);\n                        return rootNode != null ? TestBedApp.Controls.DomTreeSnapshot.Build(rootNode) : null;\n                    });\n==== REPLACE\n                    // Fetch, deserialize, and index the entire DOM tree on a background thread with timeout protection\n                    using var fetchTimeoutCts = new CancellationTokenSource(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));\n                    var token = fetchTimeoutCts.Token;\n\n                    TestBedApp.Controls.DomTreeSnapshot? snapshot = null;\n                    try\n                    {\n                        snapshot = await Task.Run(async () =\u003E\n                        {\n                            var rootNode = await currentClient.GetDomNodeAsync(token).ConfigureAwait(false);\n                            return rootNode != null ? TestBedApp.Controls.DomTreeSnapshot.Build(rootNode) : null;\n                        }, token);\n                    }\n                    catch (OperationCanceledException)\n                    {\n                        snapshot = null;\n                    }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void RefreshClientListItemDisplay(BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            for (int i = 0; i \u003C lstClients.Items.Count; i\u002B\u002B)\n            {\n                if (lstClients.Items[i] is BrowserClient item \u0026\u0026 item.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                {\n                    lstClients.Items[i] = item;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void RefreshClientListItemDisplay(BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            for (int i = 0; i \u003C lstClients.Items.Count; i\u002B\u002B)\n            {\n                if (lstClients.Items[i] is BrowserClient item \u0026\u0026 item.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                {\n                    bool wasSelected = lstClients.SelectedIndex == i;\n                    _isUpdatingClientsList = true;\n                    try\n                    {\n                        lstClients.Items[i] = client;\n                        if (wasSelected)\n                        {\n                            lstClients.SelectedIndex = i;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    finally\n                    {\n                        _isUpdatingClientsList = false;\n                    }\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            var existingClient = lstClients.Items.Cast\u003CBrowserClient\u003E().FirstOrDefault(c =\u003E c.TabId == tab.TabId || c.InstanceId == tab.InstanceId);\n            if (existingClient != null)\n            {\n                lstClients.SelectedItem = existingClient;\n            }\n==== REPLACE\n            var existingClient = lstClients.Items.Cast\u003CBrowserClient\u003E().FirstOrDefault(c =\u003E c.TabId == tab.TabId || c.InstanceId == tab.InstanceId);\n            if (existingClient != null)\n            {\n                if (lstClients.SelectedItem != existingClient)\n                {\n                    lstClients.SelectedItem = existingClient;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    _ = RefreshDomAsync(existingClient);\n                }\n            }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060",
      "ModelExplanation": "### Summary of Changes\n\n- **Prevent Client Deselection \u0026 \u0060tvDom.Clear()\u0060 on Status Updates (\u0060TestBedApp\\MainForm.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Fixed \u0060RefreshClientListItemDisplay\u0060 where assigning \u0060lstClients.Items[i] = item\u0060 caused WinForms \u0060ListBox\u0060 to reset \u0060SelectedIndex\u0060 to \u0060-1\u0060 and fire \u0060LstClients_SelectedIndexChanged\u0060 (which cleared \u0060tvDom\u0060 and left \u0060lstClients.SelectedItem\u0060 as \u0060null\u0060 on subsequent \u0060PAGE_LOADED\u0060 and \u0060EXTENSION_TABS_UPDATED\u0060 heartbeats).\n- Updated \u0060Server_OnClientConnected\u0060, \u0060Server_OnClientDisconnected\u0060, and \u0060client.OnPageLoaded\u0060 so newly hooked or re-hooked tabs are always selected in \u0060lstClients\u0060 and immediately trigger \u0060RefreshDomAsync\u0060.\n- Added a 10-second \u0060CancellationTokenSource\u0060 timeout per DOM fetch in \u0060RefreshDomAsync\u0060 so an unresponsive or unloading tab can never hold \u0060_domRefreshInFlight\u0060 indefinitely.\n- **Prevent Premature Extension Client Disconnection \u0026 Zombie Sockets (\u0060AutomationServer.cs\u0060, \u0060BrowserClient.cs\u0060)**:\n\n- Updated \u0060AutomationServer.UpdateExtensionTabsFromPayload\u0060 so an actively connected extension tab client is not prematurely disconnected by an in-flight tab list update that was captured just before injection completed.\n- Added \u0060BrowserClient.Disconnect()\u0060 (called from \u0060AutomationServer.DisconnectClient\u0060) to cancel any pending commands and close the underlying WebSocket cleanly when a tab is detached.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Start the server in \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 and hook a browser tab; verify its DOM populates in the **DOM Explorer**.\n- Switch to a different tab (or detach and re-hook the same tab or another site) using either the **Chrome Extension - Open Tabs** panel or the Chrome Extension popup.\n- Verify that the DOM Explorer reliably populates for every subsequent hooked site and after page navigations.",
