    {
      "Id": "3aa0c240",
      "Timestamp": "2026-10-27T22:22:21.2563181-05:00",
      "UserPrompt": "The root directory for this project is: C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\nThe following directories are currently tracked/active for this project (place new files in these directories unless otherwise specified):\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\n\nTort off with for this project, i want you to study iot and see if there is any logic that needs to be migrated to the Browser Automation Framework project. We want to ensure that the UI winforms project is strictly a UI wrapper around the base project. We also need to ensure that the base rpoject is very easy to document and be a very well structured API for other developers to build off of.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n- **Migrated DOM Snapshot, Indexing \u0026 Syntax Tokenization to \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060**:\n\n- Created \u0060Models/DomTreeSnapshot.cs\u0060 containing \u0060DomTreeSnapshot\u0060, \u0060DomTreeItem\u0060, \u0060DomDisplayPart\u0060, and \u0060DomTokenColor\u0060. Any consumer or UI framework can now build an O(1) path-indexed, pre-tokenized DOM snapshot via \u0060await client.GetDomSnapshotAsync()\u0060 or \u0060domNode.CreateSnapshot()\u0060.\n- Updated \u0060TestBedApp/Controls/DomTreeView.cs\u0060 to be a pure WinForms virtualized renderer over \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework.Models.DomTreeSnapshot\u0060.\n- **Migrated Authoring, Filtering \u0026 Aggregation Logic from \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 to \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060**:\n\n- **\u0060ScrapeDefinition\u0060 \u0026 \u0060ScrapeField\u0060**: Added \u0060AddFieldFromDomNode\u0060, \u0060SetContainerFromDomNode\u0060, \u0060GeneralizeAndSetContainer\u0060, \u0060SetPaginationNextFromDomNode\u0060, and \u0060ScrapeField.GeneralizeSelector\u0060.\n- **\u0060AutomationSequence\u0060 \u0026 \u0060AutomationProject\u0060**: Added \u0060AutomationSequence.AddStepFromDomNode\u0060 and project-level helpers (\u0060GetActiveSequences\u0060, \u0060GetActiveScrapes\u0060, \u0060GetSequenceNames\u0060, \u0060MoveSequenceUp\u0060/\u0060Down\u0060, \u0060MoveScrapeUp\u0060/\u0060Down\u0060).\n- **\u0060ScrapeResult\u0060 \u0026 \u0060DataScraper\u0060**: Added \u0060ScrapeResult.Combine\u0060 and \u0060DataScraper.RunProjectScrapesCombinedAsync\u0060 (plus \u0060client.ExecuteProjectScrapesCombinedAsync\u0060).\n- **\u0060BrowserTabInfo\u0060, \u0060SiteResourceItem\u0060 \u0026 \u0060SiteDumpResult\u0060**: Added \u0060BrowserTabInfo.MatchesFilter\u0060, \u0060SiteResourceItem.MatchesFilter\u0060, and \u0060SiteDumpResult.FilterResources\u0060.\n- **\u0060AutomationServer\u0060 \u0026 \u0060ReactExtensions\u0060**: Added \u0060AutomationServer.Port\u0060, \u0060SyncDefaultChromeExtension\u0060, \u0060GetExtensionTabs(filter)\u0060, \u0060GetClientForTab\u0060, \u0060client.HighlightScrapeFieldAsync\u0060, and \u0060client.HighlightScrapeContainerAsync\u0060.\n- **\u0060BrowserAutomationFramework.csproj\u0060**: Enabled \u0060\u003CGenerateDocumentationFile\u003Etrue\u003C/GenerateDocumentationFile\u003E\u0060 and added XML documentation across the framework models and services.\n- **\u0060TestBedApp/MainForm.cs\u0060**: Replaced inline business logic with calls to the \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060 API.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Build the solution (\u0060dotnet build\u0060) and verify both \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060 (including its generated XML documentation) and \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 compile cleanly.\n- Run \u0060TestBedApp\u0060, start the server, connect via the Chrome Extension or Tampermonkey, and verify DOM Explorer rendering, right-click DOM-to-Scraper/Automation actions, container/field generalization and highlighting, and Reverse Engineering resource filtering.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\BrowserAutomationFramework.csproj**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060csproj\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n  \u003CPropertyGroup\u003E\n    \u003CTargetFramework\u003Enet10.0\u003C/TargetFramework\u003E\n    \u003CImplicitUsings\u003Eenable\u003C/ImplicitUsings\u003E\n    \u003CNullable\u003Eenable\u003C/Nullable\u003E\n  \u003C/PropertyGroup\u003E\n==== REPLACE\n  \u003CPropertyGroup\u003E\n    \u003CTargetFramework\u003Enet10.0\u003C/TargetFramework\u003E\n    \u003CImplicitUsings\u003Eenable\u003C/ImplicitUsings\u003E\n    \u003CNullable\u003Eenable\u003C/Nullable\u003E\n    \u003CGenerateDocumentationFile\u003Etrue\u003C/GenerateDocumentationFile\u003E\n    \u003CNoWarn\u003E$(NoWarn);1591\u003C/NoWarn\u003E\n  \u003C/PropertyGroup\u003E\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\DomTreeSnapshot.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Text;\n\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\n{\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Classifies syntax tokens for rendering a \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomNode\u0022/\u003E in a developer tools tree view.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public enum DomTokenColor : byte\n    {\n        Punctuation,\n        TagName,\n        AttributeName,\n        AttributeValue,\n        TextContent\n    }\n\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Represents a single syntax-highlighted text segment of a serialized \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomNode\u0022/\u003E line.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public readonly struct DomDisplayPart\n    {\n        public readonly string Text;\n        public readonly DomTokenColor ColorType;\n\n        public DomDisplayPart(string text, DomTokenColor colorType)\n        {\n            Text = text;\n            ColorType = colorType;\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Represents an indexed, pre-tokenized node entry inside a \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomTreeSnapshot\u0022/\u003E.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public sealed class DomTreeItem\n    {\n        public DomNode Node { get; }\n        public string UniqueKey { get; }\n        public string? ParentKey { get; }\n        public int Depth { get; }\n        public List\u003CDomTreeItem\u003E Children { get; } = new();\n        public bool HasChildren =\u003E Children.Count \u003E 0;\n        public DomDisplayPart[] OpenParts { get; }\n        public DomDisplayPart[] CollapsedSuffixParts { get; }\n        public int EstimatedCharLength { get; }\n\n        public DomTreeItem(\n            DomNode node,\n            string uniqueKey,\n            string? parentKey,\n            int depth,\n            DomDisplayPart[] openParts,\n            DomDisplayPart[] collapsedSuffixParts,\n            int estimatedCharLength)\n        {\n            Node = node;\n            UniqueKey = uniqueKey;\n            ParentKey = parentKey;\n            Depth = depth;\n            OpenParts = openParts;\n            CollapsedSuffixParts = collapsedSuffixParts;\n            EstimatedCharLength = estimatedCharLength;\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Thread-safe, pre-indexed DOM tree snapshot built from a \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomNode\u0022/\u003E hierarchy.\n    /// Provides O(1) lookup by CSS path, ancestor expansion helpers, and pre-tokenized syntax highlighting parts.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public sealed class DomTreeSnapshot\n    {\n        private const int MaxAttrValueDisplayLength = 180;\n        private const int MaxTextDisplayLength = 220;\n        private const int MaxAttributesDisplayed = 24;\n\n        public DomNode RootNode { get; }\n        public DomTreeItem RootItem { get; }\n        public Dictionary\u003Cstring, DomTreeItem\u003E ItemsByKey { get; }\n\n        private DomTreeSnapshot(DomNode rootNode, DomTreeItem rootItem, Dictionary\u003Cstring, DomTreeItem\u003E itemsByKey)\n        {\n            RootNode = rootNode;\n            RootItem = rootItem;\n            ItemsByKey = itemsByKey;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Indexes and tokenizes a \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomNode\u0022/\u003E hierarchy into a \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomTreeSnapshot\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// Safe to call on a background worker thread.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static DomTreeSnapshot Build(DomNode rootNode)\n        {\n            if (rootNode == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(rootNode));\n            var itemsByKey = new Dictionary\u003Cstring, DomTreeItem\u003E(4096, StringComparer.Ordinal);\n            var rootItem = BuildItemRecursive(rootNode, null, 0, 0, itemsByKey);\n            return new DomTreeSnapshot(rootNode, rootItem, itemsByKey);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Attempts to find a \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomTreeItem\u0022/\u003E by its unique CSS path key in O(1) time.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomTreeItem? FindItemByPath(string? path)\n        {\n            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(path)) return null;\n            return ItemsByKey.TryGetValue(path, out var item) ? item : null;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Attempts to find a \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomNode\u0022/\u003E by its CSS path in O(1) time using the snapshot index.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomNode? FindNodeByPath(string? path)\n        {\n            return FindItemByPath(path)?.Node;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Expands all ancestor keys of \u003Cparamref name=\u0022targetItem\u0022/\u003E into \u003Cparamref name=\u0022expandedKeys\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// Returns \u003Cc\u003Etrue\u003C/c\u003E if any new ancestor key was added.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool ExpandAncestors(DomTreeItem targetItem, HashSet\u003Cstring\u003E expandedKeys)\n        {\n            if (targetItem == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(targetItem));\n            if (expandedKeys == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(expandedKeys));\n\n            bool addedAny = false;\n            string? parentKey = targetItem.ParentKey;\n            while (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(parentKey))\n            {\n                if (expandedKeys.Add(parentKey))\n                    addedAny = true;\n\n                if (ItemsByKey.TryGetValue(parentKey, out var parentItem))\n                    parentKey = parentItem.ParentKey;\n                else\n                    break;\n            }\n            return addedAny;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Builds the flat list of currently visible \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomTreeItem\u0022/\u003E rows based on the set of expanded node keys.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public List\u003CDomTreeItem\u003E BuildVisibleRows(HashSet\u003Cstring\u003E expandedKeys)\n        {\n            return BuildVisibleRows(RootItem, expandedKeys);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Builds the flat list of currently visible \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomTreeItem\u0022/\u003E rows starting from \u003Cparamref name=\u0022rootItem\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static List\u003CDomTreeItem\u003E BuildVisibleRows(DomTreeItem rootItem, HashSet\u003Cstring\u003E expandedKeys)\n        {\n            var list = new List\u003CDomTreeItem\u003E(Math.Max(64, (expandedKeys?.Count ?? 1) * 8));\n            if (rootItem != null \u0026\u0026 expandedKeys != null)\n            {\n                AppendVisibleRecursive(rootItem, expandedKeys, list);\n            }\n            return list;\n        }\n\n        private static void AppendVisibleRecursive(DomTreeItem item, HashSet\u003Cstring\u003E expandedKeys, List\u003CDomTreeItem\u003E output)\n        {\n            output.Add(item);\n            if (item.HasChildren \u0026\u0026 expandedKeys.Contains(item.UniqueKey))\n            {\n                var children = item.Children;\n                for (int i = 0; i \u003C children.Count; i\u002B\u002B)\n                {\n                    AppendVisibleRecursive(children[i], expandedKeys, output);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private static DomTreeItem BuildItemRecursive(\n            DomNode node,\n            string? parentKey,\n            int depth,\n            int siblingIndex,\n            Dictionary\u003Cstring, DomTreeItem\u003E itemsByKey)\n        {\n            string uniqueKey = !string.IsNullOrEmpty(node.Path)\n                ? node.Path!\n                : $\u0022{parentKey ?? \u0022root\u0022}#text_{siblingIndex}\u0022;\n\n            BuildDisplayParts(node, out var openParts, out var suffixParts, out int charLen);\n\n            var item = new DomTreeItem(node, uniqueKey, parentKey, depth, openParts, suffixParts, charLen);\n            itemsByKey[uniqueKey] = item;\n\n            if (node.Children != null \u0026\u0026 node.Children.Count \u003E 0)\n            {\n                for (int i = 0; i \u003C node.Children.Count; i\u002B\u002B)\n                {\n                    var childItem = BuildItemRecursive(node.Children[i], uniqueKey, depth \u002B 1, i, itemsByKey);\n                    item.Children.Add(childItem);\n                }\n            }\n\n            return item;\n        }\n\n        private static void BuildDisplayParts(\n            DomNode domNode,\n            out DomDisplayPart[] openParts,\n            out DomDisplayPart[] collapsedSuffixParts,\n            out int estimatedCharLen)\n        {\n            estimatedCharLen = 0;\n            if (domNode.Type == \u0022element\u0022)\n            {\n                string tag = domNode.TagName ?? \u0022element\u0022;\n                int attrCount = domNode.Attributes?.Count ?? 0;\n                var parts = new List\u003CDomDisplayPart\u003E(3 \u002B (Math.Min(attrCount, MaxAttributesDisplayed) * 3));\n\n                parts.Add(new DomDisplayPart(\u0022\u003C\u0022, DomTokenColor.Punctuation));\n                parts.Add(new DomDisplayPart(tag, DomTokenColor.TagName));\n                estimatedCharLen \u002B= 1 \u002B tag.Length;\n\n                if (domNode.Attributes != null \u0026\u0026 attrCount \u003E 0)\n                {\n                    int processed = 0;\n                    foreach (var attr in domNode.Attributes)\n                    {\n                        if (processed \u003E= MaxAttributesDisplayed)\n                        {\n                            parts.Add(new DomDisplayPart(\u0022 ...\u0022, DomTokenColor.Punctuation));\n                            estimatedCharLen \u002B= 4;\n                            break;\n                        }\n\n                        string cleanVal = SanitizeSingleLine(attr.Value, MaxAttrValueDisplayLength);\n                        string quotedVal = $\u0022\\\u0022{cleanVal}\\\u0022\u0022;\n\n                        parts.Add(new DomDisplayPart($\u0022 {attr.Key}\u0022, DomTokenColor.AttributeName));\n                        parts.Add(new DomDisplayPart(\u0022=\u0022, DomTokenColor.Punctuation));\n                        parts.Add(new DomDisplayPart(quotedVal, DomTokenColor.AttributeValue));\n\n                        estimatedCharLen \u002B= 1 \u002B attr.Key.Length \u002B 1 \u002B quotedVal.Length;\n                        processed\u002B\u002B;\n                    }\n                }\n\n                parts.Add(new DomDisplayPart(\u0022\u003E\u0022, DomTokenColor.Punctuation));\n                estimatedCharLen \u002B= 1;\n                openParts = parts.ToArray();\n\n                if (domNode.Children != null \u0026\u0026 domNode.Children.Count \u003E 0)\n                {\n                    collapsedSuffixParts = new[]\n                    {\n                        new DomDisplayPart(\u0022...\u003C/\u0022, DomTokenColor.Punctuation),\n                        new DomDisplayPart(tag, DomTokenColor.TagName),\n                        new DomDisplayPart(\u0022\u003E\u0022, DomTokenColor.Punctuation)\n                    };\n                    estimatedCharLen \u002B= 6 \u002B tag.Length;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    collapsedSuffixParts = Array.Empty\u003CDomDisplayPart\u003E();\n                }\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                string cleanText = SanitizeSingleLine(domNode.Text ?? string.Empty, MaxTextDisplayLength);\n                string display = $\u0022\\\u0022{cleanText}\\\u0022\u0022;\n                openParts = new[] { new DomDisplayPart(display, DomTokenColor.TextContent) };\n                collapsedSuffixParts = Array.Empty\u003CDomDisplayPart\u003E();\n                estimatedCharLen = display.Length;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private static string SanitizeSingleLine(string raw, int maxLen)\n        {\n            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(raw))\n                return string.Empty;\n\n            int limit = Math.Min(raw.Length, maxLen);\n            var sb = new StringBuilder(limit \u002B 3);\n            bool lastWasSpace = false;\n\n            for (int i = 0; i \u003C raw.Length; i\u002B\u002B)\n            {\n                char c = raw[i];\n                if (c == \u0027\\r\u0027 || c == \u0027\\n\u0027 || c == \u0027\\t\u0027)\n                {\n                    if (!lastWasSpace)\n                    {\n                        sb.Append(\u0027 \u0027);\n                        lastWasSpace = true;\n                    }\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    sb.Append(c);\n                    lastWasSpace = c == \u0027 \u0027;\n                }\n\n                if (sb.Length \u003E= maxLen)\n                {\n                    if (i \u003C raw.Length - 1)\n                        sb.Append(\u0022...\u0022);\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n\n            return sb.ToString();\n        }\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\DomNode.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n    public class DomNode\n    {\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022type\u0022)]\n==== REPLACE\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Represents a serialized DOM element or text node from a connected browser page.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public class DomNode\n    {\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022type\u0022)]\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Searches this DOM subtree for a node matching the specified CSS path using fast prefix pruning.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomNode? FindByPath(string path)\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Builds a pre-indexed, syntax-tokenized \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomTreeSnapshot\u0022/\u003E from this DOM node subtree.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomTreeSnapshot CreateSnapshot()\n        {\n            return DomTreeSnapshot.Build(this);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Searches this DOM subtree for a node matching the specified CSS path using fast prefix pruning.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomNode? FindByPath(string path)\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\AutomationProject.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\n{\n    public class AutomationProject\n    {\n==== REPLACE\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\n{\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Represents a complete browser automation and data scraping project, including URL match rules,\n    /// \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationSequence\u0022/\u003E workflows, and \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeDefinition\u0022/\u003E configurations.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public class AutomationProject\n    {\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022scrapes\u0022)]\n        public List\u003CScrapeDefinition\u003E Scrapes { get; set; } = new();\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Builds a \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScriptOptions\u0022/\u003E instance configured from this project\u0027s match rules.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n==== REPLACE\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022scrapes\u0022)]\n        public List\u003CScrapeDefinition\u003E Scrapes { get; set; } = new();\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Returns all active \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationSequence\u0022/\u003E items in the project.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public IReadOnlyList\u003CAutomationSequence\u003E GetActiveSequences()\n        {\n            return Sequences.Where(s =\u003E s.IsActive).ToList();\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Returns all active \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeDefinition\u0022/\u003E items in the project.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public IReadOnlyList\u003CScrapeDefinition\u003E GetActiveScrapes()\n        {\n            return Scrapes.Where(s =\u003E s.IsActive).ToList();\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Returns the names of all configured \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationSequence\u0022/\u003E items in the project.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public IReadOnlyList\u003Cstring\u003E GetSequenceNames()\n        {\n            return Sequences\n                .Where(s =\u003E !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(s.Name))\n                .Select(s =\u003E s.Name)\n                .ToList();\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Creates and appends a new \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationSequence\u0022/\u003E to this project.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationSequence AddSequence(string name)\n        {\n            var seq = new AutomationSequence\n            {\n                Name = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name) ? $\u0022Sequence {Sequences.Count \u002B 1}\u0022 : name.Trim(),\n                IsActive = true\n            };\n            Sequences.Add(seq);\n            return seq;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Moves the \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationSequence\u0022/\u003E at \u003Cparamref name=\u0022index\u0022/\u003E one position up.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool MoveSequenceUp(int index)\n        {\n            if (index \u003C= 0 || index \u003E= Sequences.Count) return false;\n            var item = Sequences[index];\n            Sequences.RemoveAt(index);\n            Sequences.Insert(index - 1, item);\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Moves the \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationSequence\u0022/\u003E at \u003Cparamref name=\u0022index\u0022/\u003E one position down.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool MoveSequenceDown(int index)\n        {\n            if (index \u003C 0 || index \u003E= Sequences.Count - 1) return false;\n            var item = Sequences[index];\n            Sequences.RemoveAt(index);\n            Sequences.Insert(index \u002B 1, item);\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Creates and appends a new \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeDefinition\u0022/\u003E to this project.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public ScrapeDefinition AddScrape(string name)\n        {\n            var scrape = new ScrapeDefinition\n            {\n                Name = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name) ? $\u0022Scrape {Scrapes.Count \u002B 1}\u0022 : name.Trim(),\n                IsActive = true\n            };\n            Scrapes.Add(scrape);\n            return scrape;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Moves the \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeDefinition\u0022/\u003E at \u003Cparamref name=\u0022index\u0022/\u003E one position up.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool MoveScrapeUp(int index)\n        {\n            if (index \u003C= 0 || index \u003E= Scrapes.Count) return false;\n            var item = Scrapes[index];\n            Scrapes.RemoveAt(index);\n            Scrapes.Insert(index - 1, item);\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Moves the \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeDefinition\u0022/\u003E at \u003Cparamref name=\u0022index\u0022/\u003E one position down.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool MoveScrapeDown(int index)\n        {\n            if (index \u003C 0 || index \u003E= Scrapes.Count - 1) return false;\n            var item = Scrapes[index];\n            Scrapes.RemoveAt(index);\n            Scrapes.Insert(index \u002B 1, item);\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Builds a \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScriptOptions\u0022/\u003E instance configured from this project\u0027s match rules.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\AutomationSequence.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\n{\n    public class AutomationSequence\n    {\n==== REPLACE\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Models\n{\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Represents an ordered sequence of \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationStep\u0022/\u003E actions that can be executed against a \u003Csee cref=\u0022Server.BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public class AutomationSequence\n    {\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022steps\u0022)]\n        public List\u003CAutomationStep\u003E Steps { get; set; } = new();\n\n        public bool MoveStepUp(int index)\n==== REPLACE\n        [JsonPropertyName(\u0022steps\u0022)]\n        public List\u003CAutomationStep\u003E Steps { get; set; } = new();\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Creates an \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationStep\u0022/\u003E targeting \u003Cparamref name=\u0022domNode\u0022/\u003E and appends it to \u003Csee cref=\u0022Steps\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationStep AddStepFromDomNode(\n            DomNode domNode,\n            AutomationActionType actionType,\n            string value = \u0022\u0022,\n            bool overwrite = true)\n        {\n            if (domNode == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(domNode));\n            var step = domNode.CreateStep(actionType, value, overwrite);\n            Steps.Add(step);\n            return step;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csumma