      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\nAll remaining non-UI logic in \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 has been migrated into \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework.dll\u0060, leaving \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 (\u0060MainForm.cs\u0060 and \u0060Controls\\DomTreeView.cs\u0060) as a thin WinForms UI wrapper around the framework:\n\n1. **Multi-Engine Studio Session Controller (\u0060AutomationStudioSession.cs\u0060)**:\n   - Created \u0060AutomationStudioSession\u0060 in \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework.Automation\u0060 to own and coordinate \u0060AutomationProject\u0060, \u0060AutomationServer\u0060, \u0060AutomationRunner\u0060, \u0060DataScraper\u0060, \u0060SiteDumper\u0060, \u0060LastScrapeResult\u0060, and \u0060LastSiteDumpResult\u0060.\n   - Centralized server start/stop lifecycle, Chrome Extension synchronization, userscript generation, project file load/save, raw/eval/click/set-value command execution, point-and-click sequence/scrape builder actions, scrape previews/exports, and reverse-engineering site dump execution/saving.\n2. **Unified Telemetry \u0026 Log Event Pipeline (\u0060BrowserEventArgs.cs\u0060)**:\n   - Added \u0060AutomationLogLevel\u0060, \u0060AutomationLogLevelExtensions.GetDefaultRgb(...)\u0060, and \u0060AutomationLogEventArgs\u0060 so host applications can subscribe to a single \u0060OnLog\u0060 event with pre-formatted timestamps, category prefixes, and default dark-mode RGB color tuples.\n3. **Server \u0026 Client DOM/List Helpers (\u0060AutomationServer.cs\u0060, \u0060BrowserClient.cs\u0060, \u0060ReactExtensions.cs\u0060)**:\n   - Added \u0060AutomationServer.GetExtensionStatusMessage(...)\u0060, \u0060AutomationServer.UpsertClientInList(...)\u0060, \u0060AutomationServer.RemoveClientFromList(...)\u0060, \u0060AutomationServer.RefreshClientInList(...)\u0060, and \u0060skipIfAlreadyActive\u0060 handling in \u0060SwitchToExtensionTabAsync(...)\u0060.\n   - Added \u0060BrowserClient.HandleElementClickedOrRefreshDomAsync(...)\u0060 to encapsulate checking the current snapshot before falling back to a coalesced DOM refresh.\n   - Added \u0060ReactExtensions.GeneralizeContainerSelector(...)\u0060 and \u0060ReactExtensions.HighlightContainerOrSelectorAsync(...)\u0060.\n4. **Virtualized DOM Tree Viewport \u0026 Scroll Geometry (\u0060DomTreeSnapshot.cs\u0060 \u0026 \u0060DomTreeView.cs\u0060)**:\n   - Added \u0060DomRect\u0060, scrollbar/corner layout calculation (\u0060CalculateScrollBarLayout\u0060, \u0060GetViewportBounds\u0060), ancestor guide-line X enumeration (\u0060EnumerateAncestorGuideLineXs\u0060), and viewport-based \u0060ApplyMouseWheel\u0060 overloads to \u0060DomTreeViewportState\u0060 and \u0060DomScrollBarMetrics\u0060.\n   - Updated \u0060DomTreeView.cs\u0060 and \u0060MainForm.cs\u0060 to delegate directly to these DLL APIs.\n\n### How to Test\n1. Build the solution (\u0060dotnet build\u0060) and verify both \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060 and \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 compile with zero warnings or errors.\n2. Launch \u0060TestBedApp\u0060, click **Start Server**, connect a tab via the Chrome Extension or Tampermonkey, and verify real-time logs, DOM Explorer selection/middle-click inspection, Automation Editor execution, Data Scraper preview/export, and Reverse Engineering dumps.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\BrowserEventArgs.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Initializes a new instance of the \u003Csee cref=\u0022ExtensionTabsEventArgs\u0022/\u003E class.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public ExtensionTabsEventArgs(\n            System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyList\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E tabs,\n            int? activeAttachedTabId = null)\n        {\n            Tabs = tabs;\n            ActiveAttachedTabId = activeAttachedTabId;\n        }\n    }\n}\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Initializes a new instance of the \u003Csee cref=\u0022ExtensionTabsEventArgs\u0022/\u003E class.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public ExtensionTabsEventArgs(\n            System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyList\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E tabs,\n            int? activeAttachedTabId = null)\n        {\n            Tabs = tabs;\n            ActiveAttachedTabId = activeAttachedTabId;\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Classifies the severity or category of an \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationLogEventArgs\u0022/\u003E message for UI color-coding.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public enum AutomationLogLevel\n    {\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Standard informational or command response output.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        Default,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// System lifecycle notification.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        System,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Server stop or caution notification.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        ServerStopped,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Chrome Extension synchronization or tab operation message.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        Extension,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Browser client or extension connection established.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        ClientConnected,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Non-fatal warning or rate-limit notification.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        Warning,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Execution or transport error.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        Error,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Outgoing IPC command transmission.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        CommandTx,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Incoming IPC command result.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        CommandRx,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Streaming partial command data.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        Stream,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Browser page load or navigation event.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        Navigation,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Automation sequence lifecycle event.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        Automation,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Individual automation step execution event.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        AutomationStep,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Data scrape started or field/container configured.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        ScrapeStart,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Data scrape page extraction completed.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        ScrapePage,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Pagination delay wait notification.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        ScrapeDelay,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Operation or scrape completed successfully.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        Success,\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Reverse-engineering site dump started.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        ReverseEngineering\n    }\n\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Provides default dark-theme RGB color mappings for \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationLogLevel\u0022/\u003E values.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public static class AutomationLogLevelExtensions\n    {\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Returns the default dark-theme RGB color tuple \u003Cc\u003E(R, G, B)\u003C/c\u003E for the specified \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationLogLevel\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static (byte R, byte G, byte B) GetDefaultRgb(this AutomationLogLevel level)\n        {\n            return level switch\n            {\n                AutomationLogLevel.System =\u003E (0, 255, 255),\n                AutomationLogLevel.ServerStopped =\u003E (255, 255, 0),\n                AutomationLogLevel.Extension =\u003E (0, 255, 127),\n                AutomationLogLevel.ClientConnected =\u003E (50, 205, 50),\n                AutomationLogLevel.Warning =\u003E (255, 165, 0),\n                AutomationLogLevel.Error =\u003E (255, 0, 0),\n                AutomationLogLevel.CommandTx =\u003E (0, 191, 255),\n                AutomationLogLevel.CommandRx =\u003E (255, 255, 255),\n                AutomationLogLevel.Stream =\u003E (147, 112, 219),\n                AutomationLogLevel.Navigation =\u003E (0, 255, 255),\n                AutomationLogLevel.Automation =\u003E (255, 0, 255),\n                AutomationLogLevel.AutomationStep =\u003E (221, 160, 221),\n                AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeStart =\u003E (0, 255, 127),\n                AutomationLogLevel.ScrapePage =\u003E (144, 238, 144),\n                AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeDelay =\u003E (240, 230, 140),\n                AutomationLogLevel.Success =\u003E (0, 255, 0),\n                AutomationLogLevel.ReverseEngineering =\u003E (0, 191, 255),\n                _ =\u003E (211, 211, 211)\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Event arguments representing a structured log entry emitted by \u003Csee cref=\u0022Automation.AutomationStudioSession\u0022/\u003E.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public class AutomationLogEventArgs : EventArgs\n    {\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the local timestamp when the log entry was created.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DateTime Timestamp { get; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the short bracketed category tag (e.g., \u003Cc\u003E\u0022SYS\u0022\u003C/c\u003E, \u003Cc\u003E\u0022EXT\u0022\u003C/c\u003E, \u003Cc\u003E\u0022SCRAPE\u0022\u003C/c\u003E), or empty if already prefixed.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string Category { get; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the log message body.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string Message { get; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the semantic \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationLogLevel\u0022/\u003E used for UI color-coding.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationLogLevel Level { get; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the default dark-theme RGB color tuple for this log entry.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public (byte R, byte G, byte B) ColorRgb =\u003E Level.GetDefaultRgb();\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the complete formatted log text without a trailing newline (e.g., \u003Cc\u003E\u0022[12:34:56.789] [SYS] Server stopped.\u0022\u003C/c\u003E).\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string FormattedMessage =\u003E\n            string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Category)\n                ? $\u0022[{Timestamp:HH:mm:ss.fff}] {Message}\u0022\n                : $\u0022[{Timestamp:HH:mm:ss.fff}] [{Category}] {Message}\u0022;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Initializes a new instance of the \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationLogEventArgs\u0022/\u003E class.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationLogEventArgs(string category, string message, AutomationLogLevel level = AutomationLogLevel.Default, DateTime? timestamp = null)\n        {\n            Timestamp = timestamp ?? DateTime.Now;\n            Category = category ?? string.Empty;\n            Message = message ?? string.Empty;\n            Level = level;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\DomTreeSnapshot.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Contains computed scrollbar visibility, viewport dimensions, and scroll range parameters for a virtualized DOM tree control.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public readonly struct DomScrollBarMetrics\n    {\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets whether the vertical scrollbar should be visible.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool NeedVertical { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets whether the horizontal scrollbar should be visible.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool NeedHorizontal { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the available viewport width excluding visible scrollbars and border insets.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int ViewportWidth { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the available viewport height excluding visible scrollbars and border insets.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int ViewportHeight { get; init; }\n==== REPLACE\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Represents a platform-independent integer rectangle for layout and rendering bounds.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public readonly struct DomRect\n    {\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the left X coordinate.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int X { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the top Y coordinate.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int Y { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the width of the rectangle.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int Width { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the height of the rectangle.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int Height { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the right X coordinate (\u003Cc\u003EX \u002B Width\u003C/c\u003E).\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int Right =\u003E X \u002B Width;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the bottom Y coordinate (\u003Cc\u003EY \u002B Height\u003C/c\u003E).\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int Bottom =\u003E Y \u002B Height;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets whether the rectangle has a non-positive width or height.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool IsEmpty =\u003E Width \u003C= 0 || Height \u003C= 0;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Initializes a new instance of the \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomRect\u0022/\u003E struct.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomRect(int x, int y, int width, int height)\n        {\n            X = x;\n            Y = y;\n            Width = width;\n            Height = height;\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// Contains computed scrollbar visibility, viewport dimensions, scrollbar layout bounds, and scroll range parameters for a virtualized DOM tree control.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public readonly struct DomScrollBarMetrics\n    {\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets whether the vertical scrollbar should be visible.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool NeedVertical { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets whether the horizontal scrollbar should be visible.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool NeedHorizontal { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the left X coordinate of the content viewport.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int ViewportX { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the top Y coordinate of the content viewport.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int ViewportY { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the available viewport width excluding visible scrollbars and border insets.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int ViewportWidth { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the available viewport height excluding visible scrollbars and border insets.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public int ViewportHeight { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the bounding rectangle of the content viewport.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomRect ViewportBounds =\u003E new(ViewportX, ViewportY, ViewportWidth, ViewportHeight);\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the bounding rectangle for the vertical scrollbar control.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomRect VerticalScrollBarBounds { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the bounding rectangle for the horizontal scrollbar control.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomRect HorizontalScrollBarBounds { get; init; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the bounding rectangle for the bottom-right intersection corner when both scrollbars are visible.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomRect ScrollCornerBounds { get; init; }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Attempts to compute the horizontal pixel coordinate for a vertical hierarchy guide line at \u003Cparamref name=\u0022depthLevel\u0022/\u003E\n        /// if it falls within \u003Cc\u003E[viewportLeft, viewportRight]\u003C/c\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool TryGetAncestorGuideLineX(\n            int depthLevel,\n            int viewportLeft,\n            int viewportRight,\n            int paddingLeft,\n            int indentWidth,\n            int glyphColumnWidth,\n            out int guideX)\n        {\n            guideX = viewportLeft \u002B paddingLeft \u002B (depthLevel * indentWidth) \u002B (glyphColumnWidth / 2) - ScrollX;\n            return guideX \u003E= viewportLeft \u0026\u0026 guideX \u003C= viewportRight;\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Attempts to compute the horizontal pixel coordinate for a vertical hierarchy guide line at \u003Cparamref name=\u0022depthLevel\u0022/\u003E\n        /// if it falls within \u003Cc\u003E[viewportLeft, viewportRight]\u003C/c\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool TryGetAncestorGuideLineX(\n            int depthLevel,\n            int viewportLeft,\n            int viewportRight,\n            int paddingLeft,\n            int indentWidth,\n            int glyphColumnWidth,\n            out int guideX)\n        {\n            guideX = viewportLeft \u002B paddingLeft \u002B (depthLevel * indentWidth) \u002B (glyphColumnWidth / 2) - ScrollX;\n            return guideX \u003E= viewportLeft \u0026\u0026 guideX \u003C= viewportRight;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Enumerates the horizontal X coordinates of all visible ancestor vertical hierarchy guide lines for \u003Cparamref name=\u0022item\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public IEnumerable\u003Cint\u003E EnumerateAncestorGuideLineXs(\n            DomTreeItem item,\n            bool showLines,\n            bool showRootLines,\n            int viewportLeft,\n            int viewportRight,\n            int paddingLeft,\n            int indentWidth,\n            int glyphColumnWidth)\n        {\n            if (!showLines || item == null)\n                yield break;\n\n            int startDepth = showRootLines ? 0 : 1;\n            for (int d = startDepth; d \u003C item.Depth; d\u002B\u002B)\n            {\n                if (TryGetAncestorGuideLineX(d, viewportLeft, viewportRight, paddingLeft, indentWidth, glyphColumnWidth, out int guideX))\n                {\n                    yield return guideX;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            return new DomScrollBarMetrics\n            {\n                NeedVertical = needV,\n                NeedHorizontal = needH,\n                ViewportWidth = viewW,\n                ViewportHeight = viewH,\n                VerticalLargeChange = vLarge,\n                VerticalSmallChange = vSmall,\n                VerticalMaximum = vMax,\n                VerticalValue = vVal,\n                HorizontalLargeChange = hLarge,\n                HorizontalSmallChange = hSmall,\n                HorizontalMaximum = hMax,\n                HorizontalValue = hVal\n            };\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n            CalculateScrollBarLayout(\n                clientWidth,\n                clientHeight,\n                borderInset,\n                verticalScrollBarWidth,\n                horizontalScrollBarHeight,\n                needV,\n                needH,\n                out var vBounds,\n                out var hBounds,\n                out var cornerBounds);\n\n            return new DomScrollBarMetrics\n            {\n                NeedVertical = needV,\n                NeedHorizontal = needH,\n                ViewportX = borderInset,\n                ViewportY = borderInset,\n                ViewportWidth = viewW,\n                ViewportHeight = viewH,\n                VerticalScrollBarBounds = vBounds,\n                HorizontalScrollBarBounds = hBounds,\n                ScrollCornerBounds = cornerBounds,\n                VerticalLargeChange = vLarge,\n                VerticalSmallChange = vSmall,\n                VerticalMaximum = vMax,\n                VerticalValue = vVal,\n                HorizontalLargeChange = hLarge,\n                HorizontalSmallChange = hSmall,\n                HorizontalMaximum = hMax,\n                HorizontalValue = hVal\n            };\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Computes the content viewport rectangle given the control client dimensions, border inset, and current scrollbar visibility.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomRect GetViewportBounds(\n            int clientWidth,\n            int clientHeight,\n            int borderInset,\n            bool vScrollVisible,\n            int vScrollWidth,\n            bool hScrollVisible,\n            int hScrollHeight)\n        {\n            int w = Math.Max(0, clientWidth - (borderInset * 2) - (vScrollVisible ? vScrollWidth : 0));\n            int h = Math.Max(0, clientHeight - (borderInset * 2) - (hScrollVisible ? hScrollHeight : 0));\n            return new DomRect(borderInset, borderInset, w, h);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Computes the pixel layout rectangles for the vertical scrollbar, horizontal scrollbar, and bottom-right corner box.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static void CalculateScrollBarLayout(\n            int clientWidth,\n            int clientHeight,\n            int borderInset,\n            int verticalScrollBarWidth,\n            int horizontalScrollBarHeight,\n            bool vScrollVisible,\n            bool hScrollVisible,\n            out DomRect verticalScrollBarBounds,\n            out DomRect horizontalScrollBarBounds,\n            out DomRect scrollCornerBounds)\n        {\n            int innerW = Math.Max(0, clientWidth - (borderInset * 2));\n            int innerH = Math.Max(0, clientHeight - (borderInset * 2));\n\n            int vLeft = clientWidth - borderInset - verticalScrollBarWidth;\n            int vTop = borderInset;\n            int vHeight = Math.Max(0, innerH - (hScrollVisible ? horizontalScrollBarHeight : 0));\n            verticalScrollBarBounds = new DomRect(vLeft, vTop, verticalScrollBarWidth, vHeight);\n\n            int hLeft = borderInset;\n            int hTop = clientHeight - borderInset - horizontalScrollBarHeight;\n            int hWidth = Math.Max(0, innerW - (vScrollVisible ? verticalScrollBarWidth : 0));\n            horizontalScrollBarBounds = new DomRect(hLeft, hTop, hWidth, horizontalScrollBarHeight);\n\n            scrollCornerBounds = (vScrollVisible \u0026\u0026 hScrollVisible)\n                ? new DomRect(vLeft, hTop, verticalScrollBarWidth, horizontalScrollBarHeight)\n                : new DomRect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Applies a mouse wheel delta to \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrollX\u0022/\u003E (when \u003Cparamref name=\u0022horizontal\u0022/\u003E is true) or \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrollY\u0022/\u003E,\n        /// clamping against the provided maximum scroll bound. Returns \u003Cc\u003Etrue\u003C/c\u003E if the scroll offset changed.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool ApplyMouseWheel(int wheelDelta, bool horizontal, int maxScrollOffset, int itemHeight, int mouseWheelLines = 3)\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Applies a mouse wheel delta to \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrollX\u0022/\u003E (when \u003Cparamref name=\u0022horizontal\u0022/\u003E is true) or \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrollY\u0022/\u003E,\n        /// computing the maximum scroll offset automatically from the current content size and viewport dimensions.\n        /// Returns \u003Cc\u003Etrue\u003C/c\u003E if the scroll offset changed.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool ApplyMouseWheel(\n            int wheelDelta,\n            bool horizontal,\n            int viewportWidth,\n            int viewportHeight,\n            int itemHeight,\n            int mouseWheelLines = 3)\n        {\n            int maxScrollOffset = horizontal\n                ? Math.Max(0, MaxContentWidth - Math.Max(0, viewportWidth))\n                : Math.Max(0, (_visibleRows.Count * Math.Max(1, itemHeight)) - Math.Max(0, viewportHeight));\n            return ApplyMouseWheel(wheelDelta, horizontal, maxScrollOffset, itemHeight, mouseWheelLines);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Applies a mouse wheel delta to \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrollX\u0022/\u003E (when \u003Cparamref name=\u0022horizontal\u0022/\u003E is true) or \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrollY\u0022/\u003E,\n        /// clamping against the provided maximum scroll bound. Returns \u003Cc\u003Etrue\u003C/c\u003E if the scroll offset changed.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool ApplyMouseWheel(int wheelDelta, bool horizontal, int maxScrollOffset, int itemHeight, int mouseWheelLines = 3)\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Extensions\\ReactExtensions.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Highlights all repeating container elements configured on a \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeDefinition\u0022/\u003E and returns the match count.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static Task\u003Cint\u003E HighlightScrapeContainerAsync(\n            this BrowserClient client,\n            ScrapeDefinition definition,\n            CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (definition == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(definition));\n            return client.HighlightElementsAsync(definition.ContainerSelector, null, true, cancellationToken);\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Highlights all repeating container elements configured on a \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeDefinition\u0022/\u003E and returns the match count.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static Task\u003Cint\u003E HighlightScrapeContainerAsync(\n            this BrowserClient client,\n            ScrapeDefinition definition,\n            CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (definition == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(definition));\n            return client.HighlightElementsAsync(definition.ContainerSelector, null, true, cancellationToken);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Generalizes a container CSS selector using the client\u0027s cached DOM root (or \u003Cparamref name=\u0022fallbackDomRoot\u0022/\u003E),\n        /// and updates \u003Cparamref name=\u0022definition\u0022/\u003E if provided.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static string GeneralizeContainerSelector(\n            this BrowserClient? client,\n            string rawSelector,\n            ScrapeDefinition? definition = null,\n            DomNode? fallbackDomRoot = null)\n        {\n            if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(rawSelector))\n                return string.Empty;\n\n            DomNode? rootDom = client?.ResolveDomRoot(fallbackDomRoot) ?? fallbackDomRoot;\n            return definition != null\n                ? definition.GeneralizeAndSetContainer(rawSelector, rootDom)\n                : SelectorHelper.GeneralizeContainerSelector(rawSelector, rootDom);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Highlights the repeating container configured on \u003Cparamref name=\u0022definition\u0022/\u003E if provided,\n        /// or highlights all elements matching \u003Cparamref name=\u0022rawSelector\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static Task\u003Cint\u003E HighlightContainerOrSelectorAsync(\n            this BrowserClient client,\n            string rawSelector,\n            ScrapeDefinition? definition = null,\n            CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (client == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(client));\n            if (definition != null \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(definition.ContainerSelector))\n            {\n                return client.HighlightScrapeContainerAsync(definition, cancellationToken);\n            }\n            return client.HighlightElementsAsync(rawSelector, null, true, cancellationToken);\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Server\\AutomationServer.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Validates that \u003Cparamref name=\u0022tab\u0022/\u003E allows script injection, instructs the connected Chrome Extension\n        /// to inject the automation bridge into the tab, and returns any already-connected \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E for the tab.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003CBrowserClient?\u003E SwitchToExtensionTabAsync(\n            BrowserTabInfo tab,\n            bool focusBrowserTab = false,\n            bool detachOtherTabs = true,\n            IpcMode mode = IpcMode.WebSocket,\n            CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (tab == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(tab));\n            if (!tab.CanInject)\n                throw new InvalidOperationException($\u0022Tab #{tab.TabId} (\u0027{tab.Url}\u0027) is a restricted internal browser page and cannot be injected.\u0022);\n\n            var existingClient = GetClientForTab(tab);\n            await SwitchToExtensionTabAsync(tab.TabId, focusBrowserTab, detachOtherTabs, mode, cancellationToken);\n            if (existingClient != null)\n            {\n                ActiveClient = existingClient;\n            }\n            return existingClient;\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Returns a human-readable status message describing the current Chrome Extension connection state and open tab count.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string GetExtensionStatusMessage()\n        {\n            return GetExtensionStatusMessage(IsRunning, IsExtensionConnected, GetExtensionTabs().Count);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Returns a human-readable status message describing the Chrome Extension connection state and open tab count.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static string GetExtensionStatusMessage(bool isServerRunning, bool isExtensionConnected, int openTabCount)\n        {\n            if (isExtensionConnected)\n            {\n                return $\u0022Extension: Connected ({openTabCount} open tab{(openTabCount == 1 ? \u0022\u0022 : \u0022s\u0022)})\u0022;\n            }\n\n            return isServerRunning\n                ? \u0022Extension: Waiting for connection...\u0022\n                : \u0022Extension: Server stopped\u0022;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Finds the index of a \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E with a matching \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient.InstanceId\u0022/\u003E in an \u003Csee cref=\u0022System.Collections.IList\u0022/\u003E, or returns -1.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static int FindClientIndex(System.Collections.IList items, BrowserClient? client)\n        {\n            if (items == null || client == null) return -1;\n            for (int i = 0; i \u003C items.Count; i\u002B\u002B)\n            {\n                if (items[i] is BrowserClient item \u0026\u0026\n                    string.Equals(item.InstanceId, client.InstanceId, StringComparison.Ordinal))\n                {\n                    return i;\n                }\n            }\n            return -1;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Inserts or updates \u003Cparamref name=\u0022client\u0022/\u003E inside \u003Cparamref name=\u0022items\u0022/\u003E by matching \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient.InstanceId\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static int UpsertClientInList(System.Collections.IList items, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            if (items == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(items));\n            if (client == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(client));\n\n            int idx = FindClientIndex(items, client);\n            if (idx \u003E= 0)\n            {\n                items[idx] = client;\n                return idx;\n            }\n\n            return items.Add(client);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Removes all entries matching \u003Cparamref name=\u0022client\u0022/\u003E\u0027s \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient.InstanceId\u0022/\u003E from \u003Cparamref name=\u0022items\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static bool RemoveClientFromList(System.Collections.IList items, BrowserClient? client)\n        {\n            if (items == null || client == null) return false;\n            bool removedAny = false;\n            for (int i = items.Count - 1; i \u003E= 0; i--)\n            {\n                if (items[i] is BrowserClient item \u0026\u0026\n                    string.Equals(item.InstanceId, client.InstanceId, StringComparison.Ordinal))\n                {\n                    items.RemoveAt(i);\n                    removedAny = true;\n                }\n            }\n            return removedAny;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Refreshes the display entry for \u003Cparamref name=\u0022client\u0022/\u003E in \u003Cparamref name=\u0022items\u0022/\u003E if present, returning its index or -1.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public static int RefreshClientInList(System.Collections.IList items, BrowserClient? client)\n        {\n            int idx = FindClientIndex(items, client);\n            if (idx \u003E= 0 \u0026\u0026 client != null)\n            {\n                items[idx] = client;\n            }\n            return idx;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Validates that \u003Cparamref name=\u0022tab\u0022/\u003E allows script injection, instructs the connected Chrome Extension\n        /// to inject the automation bridge into the tab, and returns any already-connected \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E for the tab.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003CBrowserClient?\u003E SwitchToExtensionTabAsync(\n            BrowserTabInfo tab,\n            bool focusBrowserTab = false,\n            bool detachOtherTabs = true,\n            IpcMode mode = IpcMode.WebSocket,\n            bool skipIfAlreadyActive = false,\n            CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (tab == null) throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(tab));\n            if (skipIfAlreadyActive \u0026\u0026 tab.IsAlreadyActiveClient(_activeClient, detachOtherTabs))\n            {\n                return _activeClient;\n            }\n\n            if (!tab.CanInject)\n                throw new InvalidOperationException($\u0022Tab #{tab.TabId} (\u0027{tab.Url}\u0027) is a restricted internal browser page and cannot be injected.\u0022);\n\n            var existingClient = GetClientForTab(tab);\n            await SwitchToExtensionTabAsync(tab.TabId, focusBrowserTab, detachOtherTabs, mode, cancellationToken);\n            if (existingClient != null)\n            {\n                ActiveClient = existingClient;\n            }\n            return existingClient;\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Server\\BrowserClient.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Executes a coalesced DOM tree snapshot refresh for this client. If a refresh is already in flight,\n        /// queues the latest target request and invokes \u003Cparamref name=\u0022onSnapshotReady\u0022/\u003E for each completed snapshot.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task RefreshDomSnapshotCoalescedAsync(\n==== REPLACE\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Handles a browser middle-click element selection by attempting to select \u003Cparamref name=\u0022clickedPath\u0022/\u003E immediately via \u003Cparamref name=\u0022trySelectExistingPath\u0022/\u003E,\n        /// or falling back to a coalesced DOM snapshot refresh targeting \u003Cparamref name=\u0022clickedPath\u0022/\u003E if the node is not yet present in the current tree.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task HandleElementClickedOrRefreshDomAsync(\n            string? clickedPath,\n            Func\u003Cstring, bool\u003E trySelectExistingPath,\n            Action onSelectedInExistingTree,\n            Func\u003Cstring?\u003E getCurrentSelectedPath,\n            Action\u003CDomSnapshotRefreshResult\u003E onSnapshotReady,\n            int timeoutSeconds = 10)\n        {\n            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(clickedPath))\n                return;\n\n            if (trySelectExistingPath(clickedPath))\n            {\n                onSelectedInExistingTree();\n                return;\n            }\n\n            await RefreshDomSnapshotCoalescedAsync(\n                getCurrentSelectedPath,\n                onSnapshotReady,\n                targetSelectedPath: clickedPath,\n                hasTargetPath: true,\n                timeoutSeconds: timeoutSeconds).ConfigureAwait(true);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Executes a coalesced DOM tree snapshot refresh for this client. If a refresh is already in flight,\n        /// queues the latest target request and invokes \u003Cparamref name=\u0022onSnapshotReady\u0022/\u003E for each completed snapshot.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task RefreshDomSnapshotCoalescedAsync(\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Automation\\AutomationStudioSession.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\nusing System;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Threading;\nusing System.Threading.Tasks;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Extensions;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Generators;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Models;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.ReverseEngineering;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Scraping;\nusing BrowserAutomationFramework.Server;\n\nnamespace BrowserAutomationFramework.Automation\n{\n    /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n    /// High-level studio session controller that coordinates \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationServer\u0022/\u003E, \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationProject\u0022/\u003E,\n    /// \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationRunner\u0022/\u003E, \u003Csee cref=\u0022DataScraper\u0022/\u003E, and \u003Csee cref=\u0022SiteDumper\u0022/\u003E into a single facade with unified logging and state management.\n    /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n    public class AutomationStudioSession : IDisposable\n    {\n        private AutomationServer? _server;\n        private bool _exclusiveTabMode = true;\n        private bool _disposed;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the active \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationProject\u0022/\u003E managed by this session.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationProject Project { get; private set; } = new();\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the current \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationServer\u0022/\u003E instance if started.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationServer? Server =\u003E _server;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationRunner\u0022/\u003E engine for this session.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationRunner Runner { get; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the \u003Csee cref=\u0022DataScraper\u0022/\u003E engine for this session.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DataScraper Scraper { get; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the \u003Csee cref=\u0022SiteDumper\u0022/\u003E reverse-engineering engine for this session.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public SiteDumper SiteDumper { get; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the most recent \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeResult\u0022/\u003E produced during this session, if any.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public ScrapeResult? LastScrapeResult { get; private set; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets the most recent \u003Csee cref=\u0022SiteDumpResult\u0022/\u003E produced during this session, if any.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public SiteDumpResult? LastSiteDumpResult { get; private set; }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets or sets whether switching to a Chrome Extension tab detaches other tabs automatically.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool ExclusiveTabMode\n        {\n            get =\u003E _exclusiveTabMode;\n            set\n            {\n                _exclusiveTabMode = value;\n                if (_server != null)\n                {\n                    _server.ExclusiveTabMode = value;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets or sets the currently active/selected \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E on the server.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public BrowserClient? ActiveClient\n        {\n            get =\u003E _server?.ActiveClient;\n            set\n            {\n                if (_server != null)\n                {\n                    _server.ActiveClient = value;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets whether the \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationServer\u0022/\u003E is currently running.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool IsServerRunning =\u003E _server?.IsRunning ?? false;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Gets whether the BAF Chrome Extension is currently connected to the server.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool IsExtensionConnected =\u003E _server?.IsExtensionConnected ?? false;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised whenever any component in the session emits a formatted log message.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CAutomationLogEventArgs\u003E? OnLog;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when the scraper status bar summary text changes.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003Cstring\u003E? OnScrapeStatusChanged;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when the reverse-engineering dump status bar summary text changes.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003Cstring\u003E? OnDumpStatusChanged;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when an HTTP 429 rate-limit response is detected during scraping.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CScrapeRateLimitEventArgs\u003E? OnRateLimitDetected;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when a new \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeResult\u0022/\u003E is available for display.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CScrapeResult\u003E? OnScrapeResultAvailable;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when a new \u003Csee cref=\u0022SiteDumpResult\u0022/\u003E is available for display.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CSiteDumpResult\u003E? OnSiteDumpResultAvailable;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when a \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E connects to the server.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CBrowserClient\u003E? OnClientConnected;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when a \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E disconnects from the server.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CBrowserClient\u003E? OnClientDisconnected;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when a connected \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E updates its metadata (title, URL, or IPC mode).\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CBrowserClient\u003E? OnClientMetadataUpdated;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when \u003Csee cref=\u0022ActiveClient\u0022/\u003E changes.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CBrowserClient?\u003E? OnActiveClientChanged;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when \u003Csee cref=\u0022ActiveClient\u0022/\u003E finishes loading a page.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CPageLoadedEventArgs\u003E? OnActiveClientPageLoaded;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when \u003Csee cref=\u0022ActiveClient\u0022/\u003E reports a DOM mutation.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CDomChangedEventArgs\u003E? OnActiveClientDomChanged;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when the highlighted element on \u003Csee cref=\u0022ActiveClient\u0022/\u003E is removed from the DOM.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler? OnActiveClientHighlightedElementRemoved;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when an element is middle-clicked in the \u003Csee cref=\u0022ActiveClient\u0022/\u003E browser tab.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CElementClickedEventArgs\u003E? OnActiveClientElementClicked;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when the Chrome Extension connects, disconnects, or updates its open tab list.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler? OnExtensionStateChanged;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Raised when the Chrome Extension reports an updated list of open browser tabs.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public event EventHandler\u003CExtensionTabsEventArgs\u003E? OnExtensionTabsUpdated;\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Initializes a new instance of the \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationStudioSession\u0022/\u003E class and wires all engine lifecycle events.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationStudioSession()\n        {\n            Runner = new AutomationRunner();\n            Scraper = Runner.Scraper;\n            SiteDumper = Runner.SiteDumper;\n\n            Runner.OnSequenceStarted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log(\u0022AUTO\u0022, e.GetStartedLogMessage(), AutomationLogLevel.Automation);\n            Runner.OnStepStarted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log(\u0022AUTO\u0022, e.GetStartedLogMessage(), AutomationLogLevel.AutomationStep);\n            Runner.OnStepCompleted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (e.Result != null)\n                {\n                    Log(\u0022AUTO-RX\u0022, e.GetCompletedLogMessage(), AutomationLogLevel.CommandRx);\n                }\n            };\n\n            Scraper.OnScrapeStarted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, e.GetStartedLogMessage(), AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeStart);\n            Scraper.OnScrapePageCompleted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, e.GetLogMessage(), AutomationLogLevel.ScrapePage);\n            Scraper.OnPageTurnDelay \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                string msg = e.GetStatusMessage();\n                Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, msg, AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeDelay);\n                OnScrapeStatusChanged?.Invoke(this, msg);\n            };\n            Scraper.OnRateLimitDetected \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log(\u0022RATE-LIMIT 429\u0022, e.GetLogMessage(), AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                OnScrapeStatusChanged?.Invoke(this, e.GetStatusMessage());\n                OnRateLimitDetected?.Invoke(this, e);\n            };\n            Scraper.OnScrapeCompleted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (e.Result != null)\n                {\n                    Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, e.GetCompletedLogMessage(), AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n                    SetLastScrapeResult(e.Result);\n                }\n            };\n            Scraper.OnScrapeFailed \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log(\u0022SCRAPE-ERR\u0022, e.GetFailedLogMessage(), AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n\n            SiteDumper.OnDumpStarted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log(\u0022REV-ENG\u0022, e.GetStartedLogMessage(), AutomationLogLevel.ReverseEngineering);\n            SiteDumper.OnDumpCompleted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (e.Result != null)\n                {\n                    Log(\u0022REV-ENG\u0022, e.GetCompletedLogMessage(), AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n                    SetLastSiteDumpResult(e.Result);\n                }\n            };\n            SiteDumper.OnDumpFailed \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log(\u0022REV-ENG-ERR\u0022, e.GetFailedLogMessage(), AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Emits a structured log message to \u003Csee cref=\u0022OnLog\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void Log(string category, string message, AutomationLogLevel level = AutomationLogLevel.Default)\n        {\n            OnLog?.Invoke(this, new AutomationLogEventArgs(category, message, level));\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Attempts to synchronize the default unpacked Chrome Extension folder on startup without throwing if disk access is restricted.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void TrySyncDefaultChromeExtensionQuietly(int port = 9999, IpcMode mode = IpcMode.WebSocket)\n        {\n            try\n            {\n                ChromeExtensionGenerator.SyncDefaultDirectory(port, mode);\n            }\n            catch { }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Updates \u003Csee cref=\u0022LastScrapeResult\u0022/\u003E and raises \u003Csee cref=\u0022OnScrapeStatusChanged\u0022/\u003E and \u003Csee cref=\u0022OnScrapeResultAvailable\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void SetLastScrapeResult(ScrapeResult result)\n        {\n            if (result == null) return;\n            LastScrapeResult = result;\n            OnScrapeStatusChanged?.Invoke(this, result.GetStatusSummary());\n            OnScrapeResultAvailable?.Invoke(this, result);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Updates \u003Csee cref=\u0022LastSiteDumpResult\u0022/\u003E and raises \u003Csee cref=\u0022OnDumpStatusChanged\u0022/\u003E and \u003Csee cref=\u0022OnSiteDumpResultAvailable\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void SetLastSiteDumpResult(SiteDumpResult result)\n        {\n            if (result == null) return;\n            LastSiteDumpResult = result;\n            OnDumpStatusChanged?.Invoke(this, result.GetStatusSummary());\n            OnSiteDumpResultAvailable?.Invoke(this, result);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Returns a formatted status string describing the current Chrome Extension connection and open tab count.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string GetExtensionStatusMessage()\n        {\n            return _server != null\n                ? _server.GetExtensionStatusMessage()\n                : AutomationServer.GetExtensionStatusMessage(false, false, 0);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Returns all open browser tabs reported by the Chrome Extension, optionally filtered by a search string.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public IReadOnlyList\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E GetExtensionTabs(string? filter = null)\n        {\n            return _server?.GetExtensionTabs(filter) ?? Array.Empty\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E();\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Creates, configures, and starts a new \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationServer\u0022/\u003E on the specified \u003Cparamref name=\u0022port\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task StartServerAsync(int port, IpcMode mode = IpcMode.WebSocket, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            _server?.Dispose();\n            _server = new AutomationServer(port)\n            {\n                ExclusiveTabMode = _exclusiveTabMode\n            };\n\n            try\n            {\n                string defaultExtDir = _server.SyncDefaultChromeExtension(mode);\n                Log(\u0022EXT\u0022, $\u0022Synced Chrome Extension files (Port {port}) at: {defaultExtDir}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Extension);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, $\u0022Could not auto-sync default ChromeExtension folder: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n            }\n\n            _server.OnClientConnected \u002B= (s, c) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, $\u0022Client Connected: {c.InstanceId} via {c.Mode}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.ClientConnected);\n                OnClientConnected?.Invoke(this, c);\n            };\n            _server.OnClientDisconnected \u002B= (s, c) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, $\u0022Client Disconnected: {c.InstanceId}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                OnClientDisconnected?.Invoke(this, c);\n            };\n            _server.OnClientMetadataUpdated \u002B= (s, c) =\u003E OnClientMetadataUpdated?.Invoke(this, c);\n            _server.OnActiveClientChanged \u002B= (s, c) =\u003E OnActiveClientChanged?.Invoke(this, c);\n            _server.OnClientModeChanged \u002B= (s, c) =\u003E Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, $\u0022Client {c.InstanceId} switched IPC transport to {c.Mode}.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.System);\n            _server.OnClientStreamDataReceived \u002B= (s, ev) =\u003E Log($\u0022STREAM \u003C- {ev.Client.InstanceId}\u0022, ev.Result.Output ?? string.Empty, AutomationLogLevel.Stream);\n            _server.OnClientPageLoaded \u002B= (s, ev) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log(string.Empty, ev.Args.GetLogMessage(ev.Client.InstanceId), ev.Args.IsRateLimited ? AutomationLogLevel.Warning : AutomationLogLevel.Navigation);\n            };\n            _server.OnActiveClientPageLoaded \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E OnActiveClientPageLoaded?.Invoke(s, e);\n            _server.OnActiveClientDomChanged \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E OnActiveClientDomChanged?.Invoke(s, e);\n            _server.OnActiveClientHighlightedElementRemoved \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E OnActiveClientHighlightedElementRemoved?.Invoke(s, e);\n            _server.OnActiveClientElementClicked \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E OnActiveClientElementClicked?.Invoke(s, e);\n\n            _server.OnExtensionConnected \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log(\u0022EXT\u0022, \u0022Chrome Extension connected to Automation Server!\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.ClientConnected);\n                OnExtensionStateChanged?.Invoke(this, EventArgs.Empty);\n            };\n            _server.OnExtensionDisconnected \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log(\u0022EXT\u0022, \u0022Chrome Extension disconnected.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                OnExtensionStateChanged?.Invoke(this, EventArgs.Empty);\n            };\n            _server.OnExtensionTabsUpdated \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                OnExtensionStateChanged?.Invoke(this, EventArgs.Empty);\n                OnExtensionTabsUpdated?.Invoke(this, e);\n            };\n\n            Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, $\u0022Starting Automation Server on port {port}...\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.System);\n            OnExtensionStateChanged?.Invoke(this, EventArgs.Empty);\n\n            try\n            {\n                await _server.StartAsync(cancellationToken);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex) when (ex is not OperationCanceledException)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Server error: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                StopServer();\n                throw;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Stops the active \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationServer\u0022/\u003E if running.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void StopServer()\n        {\n            _server?.Stop();\n            Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, \u0022Server stopped.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.ServerStopped);\n            OnExtensionStateChanged?.Invoke(this, EventArgs.Empty);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Resets \u003Csee cref=\u0022Project\u0022/\u003E to a new empty \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationProject\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationProject ResetProject()\n        {\n            Project.Reset();\n            Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, \u0022Started new automation project.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.System);\n            return Project;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Loads an \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationProject\u0022/\u003E from disk into \u003Csee cref=\u0022Project\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationProject LoadProjectFromFile(string filePath)\n        {\n            Project = AutomationProject.LoadFromFile(filePath);\n            Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, $\u0022Loaded project from {filePath}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n            return Project;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Saves \u003Csee cref=\u0022Project\u0022/\u003E to the specified file path.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void SaveProjectToFile(string filePath)\n        {\n            Project.SaveToFile(filePath);\n            Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, $\u0022Saved project to {filePath}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Generates a Tampermonkey userscript for the current \u003Csee cref=\u0022Project\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string GenerateUserscript(int port, IpcMode mode)\n        {\n            if (!Project.HasValidMatchRules)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022No Match URLs provided. Defaulting to match any site.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n            }\n\n            string script = ScriptGenerator.Generate(Project, port, mode);\n            Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, $\u0022Tampermonkey script generated for {mode} and copied to clipboard!\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n            return script;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Exports the unpacked BAF Chrome Extension to \u003Cparamref name=\u0022folderPath\u0022/\u003E and returns the user load instructions.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string ExportChromeExtension(string folderPath, int port, IpcMode mode)\n        {\n            string savedPath = ChromeExtensionGenerator.ExportToDirectory(folderPath, port, mode);\n            Log(\u0022EXT\u0022, $\u0022Exported unpacked Chrome Extension (Port {port}, {mode}) to: {savedPath}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n            return ChromeExtensionGenerator.GetLoadInstructions(savedPath);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Resolves the target \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E (using \u003Cparamref name=\u0022explicitClient\u0022/\u003E or \u003Csee cref=\u0022ActiveClient\u0022/\u003E),\n        /// logging a warning if no client is selected.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public BrowserClient? RequireClient(BrowserClient? explicitClient = null, string warningMessage = \u0022Please select a connected client first.\u0022)\n        {\n            var client = explicitClient ?? ActiveClient;\n            if (client == null)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, warningMessage, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n            }\n            return client;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Resolves the most recent root \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomNode\u0022/\u003E from \u003Csee cref=\u0022ActiveClient\u0022/\u003E or \u003Cparamref name=\u0022fallbackDomRoot\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public DomNode? ResolveDomRoot(DomNode? fallbackDomRoot = null)\n        {\n            return ActiveClient?.ResolveDomRoot(fallbackDomRoot) ?? fallbackDomRoot;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Instructs the Chrome Extension to inject and switch to \u003Cparamref name=\u0022tab\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// Returns any already-connected \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E for that tab if an immediate DOM refresh should be triggered.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003CBrowserClient?\u003E SwitchToExtensionTabAsync(\n            BrowserTabInfo? tab,\n            IpcMode mode,\n            bool focusBrowserTab = false,\n            bool skipIfAlreadyActive = false,\n            CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (tab == null)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022Please select a browser tab from the Chrome Extension tabs list first.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return null;\n            }\n\n            if (_server == null)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022Start the Automation Server first.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return null;\n            }\n\n            if (skipIfAlreadyActive \u0026\u0026 tab.IsAlreadyActiveClient(ActiveClient, _exclusiveTabMode))\n            {\n                return null;\n            }\n\n            Log(\u0022EXT\u0022, $\u0022Injecting \u0026 switching to Tab #{tab.TabId}: {tab.Title} ({tab.Url})\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Extension);\n            try\n            {\n                return await _server.SwitchToExtensionTabAsync(tab, focusBrowserTab, _exclusiveTabMode, mode, skipIfAlreadyActive: false, cancellationToken);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to switch to tab #{tab.TabId}: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return null;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Detaches the automation bridge from \u003Cparamref name=\u0022tab\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task DetachExtensionTabAsync(BrowserTabInfo? tab, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (_server == null) return;\n            if (tab == null)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022Please select a tab to detach.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            Log(\u0022EXT\u0022, $\u0022Detaching automation bridge from Tab #{tab.TabId}...\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.ServerStopped);\n            try\n            {\n                await _server.DetachExtensionTabAsync(tab.TabId, cancellationToken);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to detach tab: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Brings \u003Cparamref name=\u0022tab\u0022/\u003E to the foreground in Chrome.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task FocusExtensionTabAsync(BrowserTabInfo? tab, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (_server == null) return;\n            if (tab == null)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022Please select a tab to focus in Chrome.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            try\n            {\n                await _server.FocusExtensionTabAsync(tab.TabId, cancellationToken);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to focus tab: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Requests an immediate refresh of open tabs from the Chrome Extension.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task RefreshExtensionTabsAsync(CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            if (_server == null) return;\n            try\n            {\n                await _server.RequestExtensionTabsRefreshAsync(cancellationToken);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to refresh tabs: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Sends a raw command and payload to the specified or active \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003CCommandResult?\u003E SendRawCommandAsync(string type, string? payloadStr, BrowserClient? client = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = RequireClient(client, \u0022Please select a client from the list first.\u0022);\n            if (target == null) return null;\n\n            Log($\u0022TX -\u003E {target.InstanceId}\u0022, $\u0022{type} | Payload: {payloadStr}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.CommandTx);\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await target.SendRawCommandAsync(type, payloadStr, cancellationToken);\n                Log($\u0022RX \u003C- {target.InstanceId}\u0022, $\u0022Status: {result.Status} | Output: {result.Output}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.CommandRx);\n                return result;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022ERR \u003C- {target.InstanceId}\u0022, ex.Message, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return null;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Sends a \u003Cc\u003EREACT_CLICK\u003C/c\u003E command for \u003Cparamref name=\u0022selector\u0022/\u003E to the specified or active \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003CCommandResult?\u003E TestReactClickAsync(string selector, BrowserClient? client = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = client ?? ActiveClient;\n            if (target == null) return null;\n\n            string trimmed = selector?.Trim() ?? string.Empty;\n            Log($\u0022TX -\u003E {target.InstanceId}\u0022, $\u0022REACT_CLICK | Selector: {trimmed}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.CommandTx);\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await target.ClickReactElementAsync(trimmed, cancellationToken);\n                Log($\u0022RX \u003C- {target.InstanceId}\u0022, $\u0022Status: {result.Status} | Output: {result.Output}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.CommandRx);\n                return result;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, ex.Message, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return null;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Evaluates JavaScript \u003Cparamref name=\u0022code\u0022/\u003E on the specified or active \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003CCommandResult?\u003E TestEvalAsync(string code, BrowserClient? client = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = client ?? ActiveClient;\n            if (target == null) return null;\n\n            string trimmed = code?.Trim() ?? string.Empty;\n            Log($\u0022TX -\u003E {target.InstanceId}\u0022, $\u0022EVAL | Code: {trimmed}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.CommandTx);\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await target.EvaluateJavaScriptAsync(trimmed, cancellationToken);\n                Log($\u0022RX \u003C- {target.InstanceId}\u0022, $\u0022Status: {result.Status} | Output: {result.Output}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.CommandRx);\n                return result;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, ex.Message, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return null;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Tests clicking a \u003Csee cref=\u0022DomNode\u0022/\u003E on the specified or active \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003CCommandResult?\u003E ClickDomNodeAsync(DomNode? domNode, BrowserClient? client = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = client ?? ActiveClient;\n            if (domNode == null || string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path) || target == null)\n                return null;\n\n            Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, $\u0022Testing click on {domNode.Path}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.System);\n            try\n            {\n                var res = await target.ClickReactElementAsync(domNode, cancellationToken);\n                Log(\u0022RX\u0022, res.Output ?? string.Empty, AutomationLogLevel.CommandRx);\n                return res;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, ex.Message, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return null;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Tests setting an input \u003Cparamref name=\u0022value\u0022/\u003E on \u003Cparamref name=\u0022domNode\u0022/\u003E on the specified or active \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003CCommandResult?\u003E SetDomNodeValueAsync(DomNode? domNode, string? value, BrowserClient? client = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = client ?? ActiveClient;\n            if (domNode == null || string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path) || target == null || string.IsNullOrEmpty(value))\n                return null;\n\n            Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, $\u0022Testing set value on {domNode.Path}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.System);\n            try\n            {\n                var res = await target.SetReactInputValueAsync(domNode, value, cancellationToken: cancellationToken);\n                Log(\u0022RX\u0022, res.Output ?? string.Empty, AutomationLogLevel.CommandRx);\n                return res;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, ex.Message, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return null;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Tests extracting text/value from \u003Cparamref name=\u0022domNode\u0022/\u003E on the specified or active \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003Cstring?\u003E QuickScrapeDomNodeAsync(DomNode? domNode, BrowserClient? client = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = client ?? ActiveClient;\n            if (domNode == null || string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path) || target == null)\n                return null;\n\n            var extType = domNode.GetSuggestedExtractionType();\n            Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, $\u0022Testing extraction ({extType}) on {domNode.Path}...\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeStart);\n            try\n            {\n                string? val = await target.ScrapeElementAsync(domNode, extType, cancellationToken: cancellationToken);\n                Log(\u0022SCRAPE-RX\u0022, $\u0022Extracted Value: {val}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.CommandRx);\n                return val;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Quick scrape failed: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return null;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Creates an \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationStep\u0022/\u003E from \u003Cparamref name=\u0022domNode\u0022/\u003E and appends it to \u003Cparamref name=\u0022sequence\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public AutomationStep? AddStepFromDomNode(AutomationSequence? sequence, DomNode? domNode, AutomationActionType actionType)\n        {\n            if (sequence == null || domNode == null || string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n                return null;\n\n            var step = sequence.AddStepFromDomNode(domNode, actionType);\n            Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, $\u0022Added step to list \u0027{sequence.Name}\u0027\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.System);\n            return step;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Creates a \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeField\u0022/\u003E from \u003Cparamref name=\u0022domNode\u0022/\u003E and adds it to \u003Cparamref name=\u0022scrape\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public ScrapeField? AddFieldFromDomNode(ScrapeDefinition? scrape, DomNode? domNode, bool matchAllElements, DomNode? fallbackDomRoot = null)\n        {\n            if (scrape == null || domNode == null || string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n                return null;\n\n            var field = scrape.AddFieldFromDomNode(domNode, matchAllElements, ResolveDomRoot(fallbackDomRoot));\n            Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, $\u0022Added field \u0027{field.Name}\u0027 ({field.ExtractionType}) to \u0027{scrape.Name}\u0027.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeStart);\n            return field;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Sets the repeating container selector on \u003Cparamref name=\u0022scrape\u0022/\u003E from \u003Cparamref name=\u0022domNode\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string? SetContainerFromDomNode(ScrapeDefinition? scrape, DomNode? domNode, DomNode? fallbackDomRoot = null)\n        {\n            if (scrape == null || domNode == null || string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n                return null;\n\n            string generalizedContainer = scrape.SetContainerFromDomNode(domNode, ResolveDomRoot(fallbackDomRoot));\n            Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, $\u0022Set repeating container for \u0027{scrape.Name}\u0027 to: {generalizedContainer}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeStart);\n            return generalizedContainer;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Configures pagination Next button on \u003Cparamref name=\u0022scrape\u0022/\u003E from \u003Cparamref name=\u0022domNode\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string? SetPaginationNextFromDomNode(ScrapeDefinition? scrape, DomNode? domNode, DomNode? fallbackDomRoot = null)\n        {\n            if (scrape == null || domNode == null || string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n                return null;\n\n            string selector = scrape.SetPaginationNextFromDomNode(domNode, ResolveDomRoot(fallbackDomRoot));\n            Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, $\u0022Set pagination Next button for \u0027{scrape.Name}\u0027 to: {selector}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeStart);\n            return selector;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Generalizes a container CSS selector using the active client\u0027s DOM root (or \u003Cparamref name=\u0022fallbackDomRoot\u0022/\u003E).\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string GeneralizeContainerSelector(string rawSelector, ScrapeDefinition? scrape = null, DomNode? fallbackDomRoot = null)\n        {\n            return ActiveClient.GeneralizeContainerSelector(rawSelector, scrape, fallbackDomRoot);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Highlights all elements matching a container selector on the specified or active \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003Cint\u003E HighlightContainerAsync(string rawSelector, ScrapeDefinition? scrape = null, BrowserClient? client = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = RequireClient(client);\n            if (target == null) return 0;\n\n            string selector = rawSelector?.Trim() ?? string.Empty;\n            if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(selector))\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022Container selector is empty.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return 0;\n            }\n\n            try\n            {\n                int count = await target.HighlightContainerOrSelectorAsync(selector, scrape, cancellationToken);\n                Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, $\u0022Highlighted {count} container element(s) matching \u0027{selector}\u0027.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeStart);\n                return count;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to highlight container: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Highlights all elements matching \u003Cparamref name=\u0022field\u0022/\u003E on the specified or active \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003Cint\u003E HighlightScrapeFieldAsync(ScrapeField? field, ScrapeDefinition? parentScrape = null, BrowserClient? client = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = RequireClient(client);\n            if (target == null) return 0;\n\n            if (field == null || string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(field.Selector))\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022Please select a field with a valid selector first.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return 0;\n            }\n\n            try\n            {\n                int count = await target.HighlightScrapeFieldAsync(field, parentScrape, cancellationToken);\n                Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, $\u0022Highlighted {count} element(s) for field \u0027{field.Name}\u0027.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeStart);\n                return count;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Highlight failed: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Executes all active \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationSequence\u0022/\u003E items in \u003Csee cref=\u0022Project\u0022/\u003E on the specified or active \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003Cbool\u003E RunActiveSequencesAsync(BrowserClient? client = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = RequireClient(client, \u0022Please select a client first.\u0022);\n            if (target == null) return false;\n\n            if (!Project.HasActiveSequences)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022No active automation lists selected to run.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return false;\n            }\n\n            Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, \u0022Starting Automation Run...\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Automation);\n            try\n            {\n                await target.ExecuteProjectAsync(Project, Runner, cancellationToken);\n                Log(\u0022SYS\u0022, \u0022Automation Run Completed.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n                return true;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Automation aborted: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return false;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Previews a single \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeDefinition\u0022/\u003E on the specified or active \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003CScrapeResult?\u003E PreviewScrapeAsync(ScrapeDefinition? scrape, BrowserClient? client = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = RequireClient(client);\n            if (target == null) return null;\n\n            if (scrape == null)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022Please select a scrape list to preview.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return null;\n            }\n\n            if (!scrape.HasFields)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022The selected scrape list has no fields defined.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return null;\n            }\n\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await target.ExecuteScrapeAsync(scrape, Project.Sequences, Scraper, cancellationToken);\n                SetLastScrapeResult(result);\n                return result;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Scrape preview failed: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return null;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Executes all active \u003Csee cref=\u0022ScrapeDefinition\u0022/\u003E items in \u003Csee cref=\u0022Project\u0022/\u003E and combines their results.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003CScrapeResult?\u003E RunActiveScrapesAsync(BrowserClient? client = null, CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = RequireClient(client);\n            if (target == null) return null;\n\n            if (!Project.HasActiveScrapes)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022No active scrape lists selected to run.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return null;\n            }\n\n            try\n            {\n                var combined = await target.ExecuteProjectScrapesCombinedAsync(Project, Scraper, cancellationToken: cancellationToken);\n                SetLastScrapeResult(combined);\n                return combined;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Active scrapes run aborted: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return null;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Returns the JSON string for \u003Csee cref=\u0022LastScrapeResult\u0022/\u003E if it contains records, or logs a warning and returns \u003Cc\u003Enull\u003C/c\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string? GetLastScrapeJsonForCopy()\n        {\n            if (LastScrapeResult == null || !LastScrapeResult.HasRecords)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022No scrape results available to copy.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return null;\n            }\n\n            string json = LastScrapeResult.ToJson(true, true);\n            Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, \u0022Copied scraped JSON records to clipboard.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n            return json;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Validates that \u003Csee cref=\u0022LastScrapeResult\u0022/\u003E contains records for file export.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public bool EnsureHasScrapeResultForExport()\n        {\n            if (LastScrapeResult == null || !LastScrapeResult.HasRecords)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022No scrape results available to export.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return false;\n            }\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Exports \u003Csee cref=\u0022LastScrapeResult\u0022/\u003E as JSON to \u003Cparamref name=\u0022filePath\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void ExportLastScrapeToJsonFile(string filePath)\n        {\n            if (LastScrapeResult == null) return;\n            try\n            {\n                LastScrapeResult.SaveToJsonFile(filePath, recordsOnly: true);\n                Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, $\u0022Exported {LastScrapeResult.RecordCount} record(s) to {filePath}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to export JSON: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Exports \u003Csee cref=\u0022LastScrapeResult\u0022/\u003E as CSV to \u003Cparamref name=\u0022filePath\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void ExportLastScrapeToCsvFile(string filePath)\n        {\n            if (LastScrapeResult == null) return;\n            try\n            {\n                LastScrapeResult.SaveToCsvFile(filePath);\n                Log(\u0022SCRAPE\u0022, $\u0022Exported {LastScrapeResult.RecordCount} record(s) to {filePath}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to export CSV: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Executes a reverse-engineering site dump of \u003Cparamref name=\u0022dumpType\u0022/\u003E on the specified or active \u003Csee cref=\u0022BrowserClient\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public async Task\u003CSiteDumpResult?\u003E ExecuteSiteDumpAsync(\n            SiteDumpType dumpType,\n            SiteDumpOptions options,\n            BrowserClient? client = null,\n            CancellationToken cancellationToken = default)\n        {\n            var target = RequireClient(client);\n            if (target == null) return null;\n\n            OnDumpStatusChanged?.Invoke(this, $\u0022Dumping {dumpType} from {target.InstanceId}...\u0022);\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await target.DumpSiteAsync(dumpType, options, SiteDumper, cancellationToken);\n                SetLastSiteDumpResult(result);\n                return result;\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                OnDumpStatusChanged?.Invoke(this, $\u0022Dump failed: {ex.Message}\u0022);\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Site dump ({dumpType}) failed: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                return null;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Resolves the text content and suggested file name for the active dump view.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public string GetActiveDumpViewText(SiteDumpViewMode viewMode, SiteResourceItem? selectedResource, out string suggestedFileName)\n        {\n            suggestedFileName = \u0022dump.txt\u0022;\n            if (LastSiteDumpResult == null)\n                return string.Empty;\n\n            return LastSiteDumpResult.GetViewContent(viewMode, selectedResource, out suggestedFileName);\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Saves the active dump view to \u003Cparamref name=\u0022filePath\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void SaveActiveDumpViewToFile(string filePath, SiteDumpViewMode viewMode, SiteResourceItem? selectedResource, string displayFileName)\n        {\n            if (LastSiteDumpResult == null) return;\n            try\n            {\n                LastSiteDumpResult.SaveViewContentToFile(filePath, viewMode, selectedResource);\n                Log(\u0022REV-ENG\u0022, $\u0022Saved \u0027{displayFileName}\u0027 to {filePath}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to save file: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Saves all resources in \u003Csee cref=\u0022LastSiteDumpResult\u0022/\u003E to \u003Cparamref name=\u0022folderPath\u0022/\u003E.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void SaveLastDumpToFolder(string folderPath)\n        {\n            if (LastSiteDumpResult == null) return;\n            try\n            {\n                string savedPath = LastSiteDumpResult.SaveToDirectory(folderPath);\n                Log(\u0022REV-ENG\u0022, $\u0022Saved {LastSiteDumpResult.TotalResourceCount} resource(s) ({LastSiteDumpResult.GetFormattedTotalSize()}) to {savedPath}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to save dump to folder: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /// \u003Csummary\u003E\n        /// Disposes the underlying \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationServer\u0022/\u003E if created.\n        /// \u003C/summary\u003E\n        public void Dispose()\n        {\n            if (_disposed) return;\n            _disposed = true;\n            _server?.Dispose();\n            GC.SuppressFinalize(this);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\Controls\\DomTreeView.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private Rectangle GetViewportBounds()\n        {\n            int inset = BorderInset;\n            int w = Math.Max(0, ClientSize.Width - (inset * 2) - (_vScrollBar.Visible ? _vScrollBar.Width : 0));\n            int h = Math.Max(0, ClientSize.Height - (inset * 2) - (_hScrollBar.Visible ? _hScrollBar.Height : 0));\n            return new Rectangle(inset, inset, w, h);\n        }\n\n        private void LayoutScrollBars()\n        {\n            int inset = BorderInset;\n            int vWidth = SystemInformation.VerticalScrollBarWidth;\n            int hHeight = SystemInformation.HorizontalScrollBarHeight;\n\n            int clientW = ClientSize.Width - (inset * 2);\n            int clientH = ClientSize.Height - (inset * 2);\n\n            _vScrollBar.Bounds = new Rectangle(\n                ClientSize.Width - inset - vWidth,\n                inset,\n                vWidth,\n                Math.Max(0, clientH - (_hScrollBar.Visible ? hHeight : 0)));\n\n            _hScrollBar.Bounds = new Rectangle(\n                inset,\n                ClientSize.Height - inset - hHeight,\n                Math.Max(0, clientW - (_vScrollBar.Visible ? vWidth : 0)),\n                hHeight);\n        }\n\n        private void UpdateScrollBars()\n        {\n            if (!IsHandleCreated) return;\n\n            _updatingScrollBars = true;\n            try\n            {\n                var metrics = _state.CalculateScrollBarMetrics(\n                    ClientSize.Width,\n                    ClientSize.Height,\n                    BorderInset,\n                    SystemInformation.VerticalScrollBarWidth,\n                    SystemInformation.HorizontalScrollBarHeight,\n                    _itemHeight);\n\n                if (_vScrollBar.Visible != metrics.NeedVertical || _hScrollBar.Visible != metrics.NeedHorizontal)\n                {\n                    _vScrollBar.Visible = metrics.NeedVertical;\n                    _hScrollBar.Visible = metrics.NeedHorizontal;\n                    LayoutScrollBars();\n                }\n==== REPLACE\n        private static Rectangle ToRectangle(DomRect rect) =\u003E new(rect.X, rect.Y, rect.Width, rect.Height);\n\n        private Rectangle GetViewportBounds()\n        {\n            return ToRectangle(_state.GetViewportBounds(\n                ClientSize.Width,\n                ClientSize.Height,\n                BorderInset,\n                _vScrollBar.Visible,\n                _vScrollBar.Width,\n                _hScrollBar.Visible,\n                _hScrollBar.Height));\n        }\n\n        private void LayoutScrollBars()\n        {\n            DomTreeViewportState.CalculateScrollBarLayout(\n                ClientSize.Width,\n                ClientSize.Height,\n                BorderInset,\n                SystemInformation.VerticalScrollBarWidth,\n                SystemInformation.HorizontalScrollBarHeight,\n                _vScrollBar.Visible,\n                _hScrollBar.Visible,\n                out var vBounds,\n                out var hBounds,\n                out _);\n\n            _vScrollBar.Bounds = ToRectangle(vBounds);\n            _hScrollBar.Bounds = ToRectangle(hBounds);\n        }\n\n        private void UpdateScrollBars()\n        {\n            if (!IsHandleCreated) return;\n\n            _updatingScrollBars = true;\n            try\n            {\n                var metrics = _state.CalculateScrollBarMetrics(\n                    ClientSize.Width,\n                    ClientSize.Height,\n                    BorderInset,\n                    SystemInformation.VerticalScrollBarWidth,\n                    SystemInformation.HorizontalScrollBarHeight,\n                    _itemHeight);\n\n                if (_vScrollBar.Visible != metrics.NeedVertical || _hScrollBar.Visible != metrics.NeedHorizontal)\n                {\n                    _vScrollBar.Visible = metrics.NeedVertical;\n                    _hScrollBar.Visible = metrics.NeedHorizontal;\n                    _vScrollBar.Bounds = ToRectangle(metrics.VerticalScrollBarBounds);\n                    _hScrollBar.Bounds = ToRectangle(metrics.HorizontalScrollBarBounds);\n                }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n                        if (ShowLines)\n                        {\n                            for (int d = (ShowRootLines ? 0 : 1); d \u003C item.Depth; d\u002B\u002B)\n                            {\n                                if (_state.TryGetAncestorGuideLineX(d, view.Left, view.Right, _paddingLeft, _indentWidth, _glyphColumnWidth, out int guideX))\n                                {\n                                    g.DrawLine(_linePen, guideX, rowLayout.RowY, guideX, rowLayout.RowY \u002B _itemHeight);\n                                }\n                            }\n\n                            if (rowLayout.HasBranchConnector)\n                            {\n                                g.DrawLine(_linePen, rowLayout.BranchLineCenterX, rowLayout.RowY, rowLayout.BranchLineCenterX, rowLayout.CenterY);\n                                g.DrawLine(_linePen, rowLayout.BranchLineCenterX, rowLayout.CenterY, rowLayout.BranchHorizontalEndX, rowLayout.CenterY);\n                            }\n                        }\n==== REPLACE\n                        if (ShowLines)\n                        {\n                            foreach (int guideX in _state.EnumerateAncestorGuideLineXs(\n                                         item,\n                                         ShowLines,\n                                         ShowRootLines,\n                                         view.Left,\n                                         view.Right,\n                                         _paddingLeft,\n                                         _indentWidth,\n                                         _glyphColumnWidth))\n                            {\n                                g.DrawLine(_linePen, guideX, rowLayout.RowY, guideX, rowLayout.RowY \u002B _itemHeight);\n                            }\n\n                            if (rowLayout.HasBranchConnector)\n                            {\n                                g.DrawLine(_linePen, rowLayout.BranchLineCenterX, rowLayout.RowY, rowLayout.BranchLineCenterX, rowLayout.CenterY);\n                                g.DrawLine(_linePen, rowLayout.BranchLineCenterX, rowLayout.CenterY, rowLayout.BranchHorizontalEndX, rowLayout.CenterY);\n                            }\n                        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            if (_vScrollBar.Visible \u0026\u0026 _hScrollBar.Visible)\n            {\n                Rectangle corner = new Rectangle(\n                    _vScrollBar.Left,\n                    _hScrollBar.Top,\n                    _vScrollBar.Width,\n                    _hScrollBar.Height);\n                using var cornerBrush = new SolidBrush(BackColor);\n                g.FillRectangle(cornerBrush, corner);\n            }\n==== REPLACE\n            DomTreeViewportState.CalculateScrollBarLayout(\n                ClientSize.Width,\n                ClientSize.Height,\n                BorderInset,\n                _vScrollBar.Width,\n                _hScrollBar.Height,\n                _vScrollBar.Visible,\n                _hScrollBar.Visible,\n                out _,\n                out _,\n                out var cornerRect);\n\n            if (!cornerRect.IsEmpty)\n            {\n                using var cornerBrush = new SolidBrush(BackColor);\n                g.FillRectangle(cornerBrush, ToRectangle(cornerRect));\n            }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        protected override void OnMouseWheel(MouseEventArgs e)\n        {\n            base.OnMouseWheel(e);\n\n            if ((ModifierKeys \u0026 Keys.Shift) == Keys.Shift)\n            {\n                if (_hScrollBar.Visible)\n                {\n                    int maxScrollX = Math.Max(0, _hScrollBar.Maximum - _hScrollBar.LargeChange \u002B 1);\n                    if (_state.ApplyMouseWheel(e.Delta, horizontal: true, maxScrollX, _itemHeight))\n                    {\n                        _updatingScrollBars = true;\n                        _hScrollBar.Value = _state.ScrollX;\n                        _updatingScrollBars = false;\n                        Invalidate();\n                    }\n                }\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (_vScrollBar.Visible)\n            {\n                int maxScrollY = Math.Max(0, _vScrollBar.Maximum - _vScrollBar.LargeChange \u002B 1);\n                if (_state.ApplyMouseWheel(e.Delta, horizontal: false, maxScrollY, _itemHeight, SystemInformation.MouseWheelScrollLines))\n                {\n                    _updatingScrollBars = true;\n                    _vScrollBar.Value = _state.ScrollY;\n                    _updatingScrollBars = false;\n                    Invalidate();\n                }\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        protected override void OnMouseWheel(MouseEventArgs e)\n        {\n            base.OnMouseWheel(e);\n\n            Rectangle view = GetViewportBounds();\n            bool horizontal = (ModifierKeys \u0026 Keys.Shift) == Keys.Shift;\n\n            if (horizontal)\n            {\n                if (_hScrollBar.Visible \u0026\u0026 _state.ApplyMouseWheel(e.Delta, horizontal: true, view.Width, view.Height, _itemHeight))\n                {\n                    _updatingScrollBars = true;\n                    _hScrollBar.Value = _state.ScrollX;\n                    _updatingScrollBars = false;\n                    Invalidate();\n                }\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (_vScrollBar.Visible \u0026\u0026 _state.ApplyMouseWheel(e.Delta, horizontal: false, view.Width, view.Height, _itemHeight, SystemInformation.MouseWheelScrollLines))\n            {\n                _updatingScrollBars = true;\n                _vScrollBar.Value = _state.ScrollY;\n                _updatingScrollBars = false;\n                Invalidate();\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\MainForm.cs**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n    public partial class MainForm : Form\n    {\n        private AutomationServer? _server;\n        private AutomationProject _project = new();\n        private readonly AutomationRunner _runner;\n        private readonly DataScraper _scraper;\n        private readonly SiteDumper _siteDumper;\n        private ScrapeResult? _lastScrapeResult;\n        private SiteDumpResult? _lastSiteDumpResult;\n        private bool _isUpdatingScrapeUi;\n==== REPLACE\n    public partial class MainForm : Form\n    {\n        private readonly AutomationStudioSession _session = new();\n        private bool _isUpdatingScrapeUi;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        public MainForm()\n        {\n            InitializeComponent();\n            InitializeExtensionTabsSidebarUi();\n            InitializeScraperTabUi();\n            InitializeReverseEngineeringTabUi();\n            ApplyFixedSingleBorders(this);\n\n            try\n            {\n                ChromeExtensionGenerator.SyncDefaultDirectory((int)numPort.Value, IpcMode.WebSocket);\n            }\n            catch { }\n\n            tabMain.SelectedIndexChanged \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E EnsureTabSplittersConfigured();\n            Shown \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E EnsureTabSplittersConfigured();\n            \n            cmbMode.DataSource = Enum.GetValues(typeof(IpcMode));\n            cmbMode.SelectedIndex = 1;\n\n            _runner = new AutomationRunner();\n            _scraper = _runner.Scraper;\n            _siteDumper = _runner.SiteDumper;\n\n            _runner.OnSequenceStarted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[AUTO] {e.GetStartedLogMessage()}\u0022, Color.Magenta);\n            _runner.OnStepStarted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[AUTO] {e.GetStartedLogMessage()}\u0022, Color.Plum);\n            _runner.OnStepCompleted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (e.Result != null)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[AUTO-RX] {e.GetCompletedLogMessage()}\u0022, Color.White);\n                }\n            };\n\n            _scraper.OnScrapeStarted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] {e.GetStartedLogMessage()}\u0022, Color.SpringGreen);\n            _scraper.OnScrapePageCompleted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] {e.GetLogMessage()}\u0022, Color.LightGreen);\n            _scraper.OnPageTurnDelay \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                string msg = e.GetStatusMessage();\n                Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] {msg}\u0022, Color.Khaki);\n                Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E lblScrapeStatus.Text = msg));\n            };\n            _scraper.OnRateLimitDetected \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[RATE-LIMIT 429] {e.GetLogMessage()}\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n                {\n                    if (!e.IsDateHeader \u0026\u0026 chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem == e.Definition)\n                    {\n                        _isUpdatingScrapeUi = true;\n                        try\n                        {\n                            numPageDelayMs.Value = Math.Clamp(e.NewPageDelayMs, (int)numPageDelayMs.Minimum, (int)numPageDelayMs.Maximum);\n                        }\n                        finally\n                        {\n                            _isUpdatingScrapeUi = false;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    lblScrapeStatus.Text = e.GetStatusMessage();\n                }));\n            };\n            _scraper.OnScrapeCompleted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (e.Result != null)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] {e.GetCompletedLogMessage()}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                    Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E DisplayScrapeResult(e.Result)));\n                }\n            };\n            _scraper.OnScrapeFailed \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[SCRAPE-ERR] {e.GetFailedLogMessage()}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            _siteDumper.OnDumpStarted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[REV-ENG] {e.GetStartedLogMessage()}\u0022, Color.DeepSkyBlue);\n            _siteDumper.OnDumpCompleted \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (e.Result != null)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[REV-ENG] {e.GetCompletedLogMessage()}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                    Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E DisplaySiteDumpResult(e.Result)));\n                }\n            };\n            _siteDumper.OnDumpFailed \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E Log($\u0022[REV-ENG-ERR] {e.GetFailedLogMessage()}\u0022, Color.Red);\n        }\n\n        private void Log(string message, Color? color = null)\n        {\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n            {\n                Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E Log(message, color)));\n                return;\n            }\n\n            rtbLogs.SelectionStart = rtbLogs.TextLength;\n            rtbLogs.SelectionLength = 0;\n            rtbLogs.SelectionColor = color ?? Color.LightGray;\n            rtbLogs.AppendText($\u0022[{DateTime.Now:HH:mm:ss.fff}] {message}{Environment.NewLine}\u0022);\n            rtbLogs.ScrollToCaret();\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnStart_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int port = (int)numPort.Value;\n            var selectedMode = cmbMode.SelectedItem is IpcMode m ? m : IpcMode.WebSocket;\n\n            _server?.Dispose();\n            _server = new AutomationServer(port)\n            {\n                ExclusiveTabMode = chkExclusiveTab.Checked\n            };\n            try\n            {\n                string defaultExtDir = _server.SyncDefaultChromeExtension(selectedMode);\n                Log($\u0022[EXT] Synced Chrome Extension files (Port {port}) at: {defaultExtDir}\u0022, Color.MediumSpringGreen);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[WARN] Could not auto-sync default ChromeExtension folder: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Orange);\n            }\n            _server.OnClientConnected \u002B= Server_OnClientConnected;\n            _server.OnClientDisconnected \u002B= Server_OnClientDisconnected;\n            _server.OnClientMetadataUpdated \u002B= Server_OnClientMetadataUpdated;\n            _server.OnActiveClientChanged \u002B= Server_OnActiveClientChanged;\n            _server.OnClientModeChanged \u002B= (s, c) =\u003E Log($\u0022[SYS] Client {c.InstanceId} switched IPC transport to {c.Mode}.\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n            _server.OnClientStreamDataReceived \u002B= (s, ev) =\u003E Log($\u0022[STREAM \u003C- {ev.Client.InstanceId}] {ev.Result.Output}\u0022, Color.MediumPurple);\n            _server.OnClientPageLoaded \u002B= (s, ev) =\u003E Log(ev.Args.GetLogMessage(ev.Client.InstanceId), ev.Args.IsRateLimited ? Color.Orange : Color.Aqua);\n            _server.OnActiveClientPageLoaded \u002B= Server_OnActiveClientPageLoaded;\n            _server.OnActiveClientDomChanged \u002B= Server_OnActiveClientDomChanged;\n            _server.OnActiveClientHighlightedElementRemoved \u002B= Server_OnActiveClientHighlightedElementRemoved;\n            _server.OnActiveClientElementClicked \u002B= Server_OnActiveClientElementClicked;\n            _server.OnExtensionConnected \u002B= Server_OnExtensionConnected;\n            _server.OnExtensionDisconnected \u002B= Server_OnExtensionDisconnected;\n            _server.OnExtensionTabsUpdated \u002B= Server_OnExtensionTabsUpdated;\n            \n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Starting Automation Server on port {port}...\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n            btnStart.Enabled = false;\n            btnStop.Enabled = true;\n            numPort.Enabled = false;\n            UpdateExtensionStatusLabel(false, 0);\n\n            try\n            {\n                await _server.StartAsync();\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex) when (ex is not OperationCanceledException)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Server error: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                BtnStop_Click(null, EventArgs.Empty);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnStop_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            _server?.Stop();\n            \n            Log(\u0022[SYS] Server stopped.\u0022, Color.Yellow);\n            \n            btnStart.Enabled = true;\n            btnStop.Enabled = false;\n            numPort.Enabled = true;\n            lstClients.Items.Clear();\n            lstBrowserTabs.Items.Clear();\n            UpdateExtensionStatusLabel(false, 0);\n        }\n\n        private void ChkMatchAnySite_CheckedChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            _project.MatchAnySite = chkMatchAnySite.Checked;\n            lblMatchUrls.Visible = !_project.MatchAnySite;\n            pnlMatchUrls.Visible = !_project.MatchAnySite;\n        }\n\n        private void BtnAddMatchUrl_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string url = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter Match URL (e.g., https://*.example.com/*):\u0022, \u0022Add Match URL\u0022);\n            string? added = _project.AddMatchUrl(url);\n            if (added != null)\n            {\n                lstMatchUrls.Items.Add(added);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnEditMatchUrl_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstMatchUrls.SelectedItem is string currentUrl)\n            {\n                int idx = lstMatchUrls.SelectedIndex;\n                string url = PromptForValue(\u0022Edit Match URL:\u0022, \u0022Edit Match URL\u0022, currentUrl);\n                if (_project.UpdateMatchUrl(idx, url))\n                {\n                    lstMatchUrls.Items[idx] = _project.MatchUrls[idx];\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRemoveMatchUrl_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstMatchUrls.SelectedItem is string selectedUrl)\n            {\n                _project.RemoveMatchUrl(selectedUrl);\n                lstMatchUrls.Items.Remove(selectedUrl);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void ApplyProjectToUi(AutomationProject project)\n        {\n            _project = project ?? new AutomationProject();\n            chkMatchAnySite.Checked = _project.MatchAnySite;\n            lstMatchUrls.Items.Clear();\n            foreach (var url in _project.MatchUrls)\n            {\n                lstMatchUrls.Items.Add(url);\n            }\n\n            chkLstSequences.Items.Clear();\n            lstSteps.Items.Clear();\n            foreach (var seq in _project.Sequences)\n            {\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Add(seq, seq.IsActive);\n            }\n\n            if (chkLstSequences.Items.Count \u003E 0)\n            {\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = 0;\n            }\n\n            RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns();\n\n            chkLstScrapes.Items.Clear();\n            lstScrapeFields.Items.Clear();\n            pgScrapeFieldDetails.SelectedObject = null;\n            foreach (var scrape in _project.Scrapes)\n            {\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.Add(scrape, scrape.IsActive);\n            }\n\n            if (chkLstScrapes.Items.Count \u003E 0)\n            {\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex = 0;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                LoadSelectedScrapeToUi();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnGenerate_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (!_project.HasValidMatchRules)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No Match URLs provided. Defaulting to match any site.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n            }\n\n            var mode = (IpcMode)cmbMode.SelectedItem!;\n            string script = ScriptGenerator.Generate(_project, (int)numPort.Value, mode);\n            Clipboard.SetText(script);\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Tampermonkey script generated for {mode} and copied to clipboard!\u0022, Color.Lime);\n        }\n\n        private void BtnExportExtension_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string defaultDir = ChromeExtensionGenerator.GetDefaultExtensionDirectory();\n            using var fbd = new FolderBrowserDialog\n            {\n                Description = \u0022Select a folder to export the unpacked BAF Chrome Extension\u0022,\n                UseDescriptionForTitle = true,\n                SelectedPath = System.IO.Directory.Exists(defaultDir) ? defaultDir : string.Empty\n            };\n\n            if (fbd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(fbd.SelectedPath))\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    int port = (int)numPort.Value;\n                    var mode = cmbMode.SelectedItem is IpcMode m ? m : IpcMode.WebSocket;\n                    string savedPath = ChromeExtensionGenerator.ExportToDirectory(fbd.SelectedPath, port, mode);\n                    Log($\u0022[EXT] Exported unpacked Chrome Extension (Port {port}, {mode}) to: {savedPath}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n\n                    DarkMessageBox.Show(\n                        this,\n                        ChromeExtensionGenerator.GetLoadInstructions(savedPath),\n                        \u0022Chrome Extension Exported\u0022,\n                        MessageBoxButtons.OK,\n                        MessageBoxIcon.Information);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to export Chrome Extension: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientConnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Client Connected: {client.InstanceId} via {client.Mode}\u0022, Color.LimeGreen);\n\n            BeginInvoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n            {\n                UpsertClientInListUi(client);\n                if (_server?.ActiveClient != null \u0026\u0026 _server.ActiveClient.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                {\n                    SyncActiveClientSelectionToUi(_server.ActiveClient);\n                }\n            }));\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnActiveClientPageLoaded(object? sender, PageLoadedEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (sender is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(async () =\u003E await RefreshDomAsync(client)));\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnActiveClientDomChanged(object? sender, DomChangedEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (sender is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(async () =\u003E await RefreshDomAsync(client, e.HighlightedPath, e.HasHighlightedPath)));\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnActiveClientHighlightedElementRemoved(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            BeginInvoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n            {\n                tvDom.ClearSelection();\n                txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n            }));\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnActiveClientElementClicked(object? sender, ElementClickedEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (sender is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(async () =\u003E\n                {\n                    if (tvDom.SelectNodeByPath(e.Path, ensureVisible: true, raiseAfterSelect: false))\n                    {\n                        txtElementDetails.Text = tvDom.SelectedDomNode?.GetFormattedDetails() ?? string.Empty;\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        await RefreshDomAsync(client, e.Path, hasTargetPath: true);\n                    }\n                }));\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientMetadataUpdated(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n            {\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(() =\u003E RefreshClientListItemDisplay(client)));\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                RefreshClientListItemDisplay(client);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnActiveClientChanged(object? sender, BrowserClient? activeClient)\n        {\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n            {\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(() =\u003E SyncActiveClientSelectionToUi(activeClient)));\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                SyncActiveClientSelectionToUi(activeClient);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void UpsertClientInListUi(BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            int existingIdx = -1;\n            for (int i = 0; i \u003C lstClients.Items.Count; i\u002B\u002B)\n            {\n                if (lstClients.Items[i] is BrowserClient item \u0026\u0026 item.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                {\n                    existingIdx = i;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n\n            _isUpdatingClientsList = true;\n            try\n            {\n                if (existingIdx \u003E= 0)\n                {\n                    lstClients.Items[existingIdx] = client;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    lstClients.Items.Add(client);\n                }\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                _isUpdatingClientsList = false;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void SyncActiveClientSelectionToUi(BrowserClient? activeClient)\n        {\n            if (activeClient != null)\n            {\n                UpsertClientInListUi(activeClient);\n            }\n\n            _isUpdatingClientsList = true;\n            try\n            {\n                lstClients.SelectedItem = activeClient;\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                _isUpdatingClientsList = false;\n            }\n\n            if (activeClient != null)\n            {\n                await RefreshDomAsync(activeClient);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                tvDom.Clear();\n                txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientDisconnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            Log($\u0022[SYS] Client Disconnected: {client.InstanceId}\u0022, Color.Orange);\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n            {\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(() =\u003E HandleClientRemovedFromUi(client)));\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                HandleClientRemovedFromUi(client);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void HandleClientRemovedFromUi(BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            _isUpdatingClientsList = true;\n            try\n            {\n                for (int i = lstClients.Items.Count - 1; i \u003E= 0; i--)\n                {\n                    if (lstClients.Items[i] is BrowserClient item \u0026\u0026 item.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                    {\n                        lstClients.Items.RemoveAt(i);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                _isUpdatingClientsList = false;\n            }\n\n            if (lstClients.Items.Count == 0)\n            {\n                tvDom.Clear();\n                txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void LstClients_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_isUpdatingClientsList) return;\n\n            var selected = lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient;\n            if (_server != null)\n            {\n                _server.ActiveClient = selected;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnSend_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a client from the list first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            string type = txtCmdType.Text;\n            string payloadStr = txtPayload.Text;\n\n            Log($\u0022[TX -\u003E {client.InstanceId}] {type} | Payload: {payloadStr}\u0022, Color.DeepSkyBlue);\n            \n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.SendRawCommandAsync(type, payloadStr);\n                Log($\u0022[RX \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Status: {result.Status} | Output: {result.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnReactClick_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client) return;\n            string selector = txtPayload.Text.Trim();\n            \n            Log($\u0022[TX -\u003E {client.InstanceId}] REACT_CLICK | Selector: {selector}\u0022, Color.DeepSkyBlue);\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.ClickReactElementAsync(selector);\n                Log($\u0022[RX \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Status: {result.Status} | Output: {result.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex) { Log($\u0022[ERR] {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red); }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnEval_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client) return;\n            string code = txtPayload.Text.Trim();\n            \n            Log($\u0022[TX -\u003E {client.InstanceId}] EVAL | Code: {code}\u0022, Color.DeepSkyBlue);\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.EvaluateJavaScriptAsync(code);\n                Log($\u0022[RX \u003C- {client.InstanceId}] Status: {result.Status} | Output: {result.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex) { Log($\u0022[ERR] {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red); }\n        }\n\n        private async Task RefreshDomAsync(BrowserClient client, string? targetSelectedPath = null, bool hasTargetPath = false)\n        {\n            try\n            {\n                await client.RefreshDomSnapshotCoalescedAsync(\n                    getCurrentSelectedPath: () =\u003E tvDom.SelectedPath,\n                    onSnapshotReady: result =\u003E\n                    {\n                        if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient selectedClient ||\n                            selectedClient.InstanceId != client.InstanceId)\n                        {\n                            return;\n                        }\n\n                        var expandedPaths = tvDom.GetExpandedPathsSnapshot();\n                        tvDom.ApplySnapshot(\n                            result.Snapshot,\n                            expandedPaths,\n                            result.ResolvedSelectedPath,\n                            ensureSelectedVisible: result.ScrollSelectionIntoView,\n                            raiseAfterSelect: false);\n\n                        string details = tvDom.SelectedDomNode?.GetFormattedDetails() ?? string.Empty;\n                        if (!string.Equals(txtElementDetails.Text, details, StringComparison.Ordinal))\n                        {\n                            txtElementDetails.Text = details;\n                        }\n                    },\n                    targetSelectedPath: targetSelectedPath,\n                    hasTargetPath: hasTargetPath);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to fetch DOM: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void TvDom_AfterSelect(object? sender, TreeViewEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (e.Node?.Tag is DomNode domNode)\n            {\n                txtElementDetails.Text = domNode.GetFormattedDetails();\n                (lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient)?.SelectDomNode(domNode);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void TvDom_NodeMouseClick(object? sender, TreeNodeMouseClickEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (e.Button == MouseButtons.Right \u0026\u0026 e.Node?.Tag is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 domNode.Type == \u0022element\u0022)\n            {\n                ctxDomNode.Show(tvDom, e.Location);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void MnuClickElement_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedDomNode is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path) \u0026\u0026 lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[SYS] Testing click on {domNode.Path}\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n                try\n                {\n                    var res = await client.ClickReactElementAsync(domNode);\n                    Log($\u0022[RX] {res.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex) { Log($\u0022[ERR] {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red); }\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        public MainForm()\n        {\n            InitializeComponent();\n            InitializeExtensionTabsSidebarUi();\n            InitializeScraperTabUi();\n            InitializeReverseEngineeringTabUi();\n            ApplyFixedSingleBorders(this);\n\n            _session.TrySyncDefaultChromeExtensionQuietly((int)numPort.Value, IpcMode.WebSocket);\n\n            tabMain.SelectedIndexChanged \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E EnsureTabSplittersConfigured();\n            Shown \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E EnsureTabSplittersConfigured();\n\n            cmbMode.DataSource = Enum.GetValues(typeof(IpcMode));\n            cmbMode.SelectedIndex = 1;\n\n            _session.OnLog \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E AppendLogLine(e.FormattedMessage, Color.FromArgb(e.ColorRgb.R, e.ColorRgb.G, e.ColorRgb.B));\n            _session.OnScrapeStatusChanged \u002B= (s, msg) =\u003E InvokeOnUi(() =\u003E lblScrapeStatus.Text = msg);\n            _session.OnDumpStatusChanged \u002B= (s, msg) =\u003E InvokeOnUi(() =\u003E lblDumpStatus.Text = msg);\n            _session.OnRateLimitDetected \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E InvokeOnUi(() =\u003E\n            {\n                if (!e.IsDateHeader \u0026\u0026 chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem == e.Definition)\n                {\n                    _isUpdatingScrapeUi = true;\n                    try\n                    {\n                        numPageDelayMs.Value = Math.Clamp(e.NewPageDelayMs, (int)numPageDelayMs.Minimum, (int)numPageDelayMs.Maximum);\n                    }\n                    finally\n                    {\n                        _isUpdatingScrapeUi = false;\n                    }\n                }\n            });\n            _session.OnScrapeResultAvailable \u002B= (s, result) =\u003E InvokeOnUi(() =\u003E DisplayScrapeResult(result));\n            _session.OnSiteDumpResultAvailable \u002B= (s, result) =\u003E InvokeOnUi(() =\u003E DisplaySiteDumpResult(result));\n\n            _session.OnClientConnected \u002B= Server_OnClientConnected;\n            _session.OnClientDisconnected \u002B= Server_OnClientDisconnected;\n            _session.OnClientMetadataUpdated \u002B= Server_OnClientMetadataUpdated;\n            _session.OnActiveClientChanged \u002B= Server_OnActiveClientChanged;\n            _session.OnActiveClientPageLoaded \u002B= Server_OnActiveClientPageLoaded;\n            _session.OnActiveClientDomChanged \u002B= Server_OnActiveClientDomChanged;\n            _session.OnActiveClientHighlightedElementRemoved \u002B= Server_OnActiveClientHighlightedElementRemoved;\n            _session.OnActiveClientElementClicked \u002B= Server_OnActiveClientElementClicked;\n            _session.OnExtensionStateChanged \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E InvokeOnUi(UpdateExtensionStatusLabel);\n            _session.OnExtensionTabsUpdated \u002B= Server_OnExtensionTabsUpdated;\n        }\n\n        private void InvokeOnUi(Action action)\n        {\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n                BeginInvoke(action);\n            else\n                action();\n        }\n\n        private void AppendLogLine(string formattedLine, Color color)\n        {\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n            {\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(() =\u003E AppendLogLine(formattedLine, color)));\n                return;\n            }\n\n            rtbLogs.SelectionStart = rtbLogs.TextLength;\n            rtbLogs.SelectionLength = 0;\n            rtbLogs.SelectionColor = color;\n            rtbLogs.AppendText($\u0022{formattedLine}{Environment.NewLine}\u0022);\n            rtbLogs.ScrollToCaret();\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnStart_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int port = (int)numPort.Value;\n            var selectedMode = cmbMode.SelectedItem is IpcMode m ? m : IpcMode.WebSocket;\n            _session.ExclusiveTabMode = chkExclusiveTab.Checked;\n\n            btnStart.Enabled = false;\n            btnStop.Enabled = true;\n            numPort.Enabled = false;\n\n            try\n            {\n                await _session.StartServerAsync(port, selectedMode);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex) when (ex is not OperationCanceledException)\n            {\n                BtnStop_Click(null, EventArgs.Empty);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnStop_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            _session.StopServer();\n\n            btnStart.Enabled = true;\n            btnStop.Enabled = false;\n            numPort.Enabled = true;\n            lstClients.Items.Clear();\n            lstBrowserTabs.Items.Clear();\n            UpdateExtensionStatusLabel();\n        }\n\n        private void ChkMatchAnySite_CheckedChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            _session.Project.MatchAnySite = chkMatchAnySite.Checked;\n            lblMatchUrls.Visible = !_session.Project.MatchAnySite;\n            pnlMatchUrls.Visible = !_session.Project.MatchAnySite;\n        }\n\n        private void BtnAddMatchUrl_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string url = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter Match URL (e.g., https://*.example.com/*):\u0022, \u0022Add Match URL\u0022);\n            string? added = _session.Project.AddMatchUrl(url);\n            if (added != null)\n            {\n                lstMatchUrls.Items.Add(added);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnEditMatchUrl_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstMatchUrls.SelectedItem is string currentUrl)\n            {\n                int idx = lstMatchUrls.SelectedIndex;\n                string url = PromptForValue(\u0022Edit Match URL:\u0022, \u0022Edit Match URL\u0022, currentUrl);\n                if (_session.Project.UpdateMatchUrl(idx, url))\n                {\n                    lstMatchUrls.Items[idx] = _session.Project.MatchUrls[idx];\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRemoveMatchUrl_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstMatchUrls.SelectedItem is string selectedUrl)\n            {\n                _session.Project.RemoveMatchUrl(selectedUrl);\n                lstMatchUrls.Items.Remove(selectedUrl);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void ApplyProjectToUi(AutomationProject project)\n        {\n            chkMatchAnySite.Checked = project.MatchAnySite;\n            lstMatchUrls.Items.Clear();\n            foreach (var url in project.MatchUrls)\n            {\n                lstMatchUrls.Items.Add(url);\n            }\n\n            chkLstSequences.Items.Clear();\n            lstSteps.Items.Clear();\n            foreach (var seq in project.Sequences)\n            {\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Add(seq, seq.IsActive);\n            }\n\n            if (chkLstSequences.Items.Count \u003E 0)\n            {\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = 0;\n            }\n\n            RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns();\n\n            chkLstScrapes.Items.Clear();\n            lstScrapeFields.Items.Clear();\n            pgScrapeFieldDetails.SelectedObject = null;\n            foreach (var scrape in project.Scrapes)\n            {\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.Add(scrape, scrape.IsActive);\n            }\n\n            if (chkLstScrapes.Items.Count \u003E 0)\n            {\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex = 0;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                LoadSelectedScrapeToUi();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnGenerate_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            var mode = (IpcMode)cmbMode.SelectedItem!;\n            string script = _session.GenerateUserscript((int)numPort.Value, mode);\n            Clipboard.SetText(script);\n        }\n\n        private void BtnExportExtension_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string defaultDir = ChromeExtensionGenerator.GetDefaultExtensionDirectory();\n            using var fbd = new FolderBrowserDialog\n            {\n                Description = \u0022Select a folder to export the unpacked BAF Chrome Extension\u0022,\n                UseDescriptionForTitle = true,\n                SelectedPath = System.IO.Directory.Exists(defaultDir) ? defaultDir : string.Empty\n            };\n\n            if (fbd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(fbd.SelectedPath))\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    int port = (int)numPort.Value;\n                    var mode = cmbMode.SelectedItem is IpcMode m ? m : IpcMode.WebSocket;\n                    string instructions = _session.ExportChromeExtension(fbd.SelectedPath, port, mode);\n\n                    DarkMessageBox.Show(\n                        this,\n                        instructions,\n                        \u0022Chrome Extension Exported\u0022,\n                        MessageBoxButtons.OK,\n                        MessageBoxIcon.Information);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    _session.Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to export Chrome Extension: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientConnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            BeginInvoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n            {\n                UpsertClientInListUi(client);\n                if (_session.ActiveClient != null \u0026\u0026 _session.ActiveClient.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                {\n                    SyncActiveClientSelectionToUi(_session.ActiveClient);\n                }\n            }));\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnActiveClientPageLoaded(object? sender, PageLoadedEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (sender is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(async () =\u003E await RefreshDomAsync(client)));\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnActiveClientDomChanged(object? sender, DomChangedEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (sender is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(async () =\u003E await RefreshDomAsync(client, e.HighlightedPath, e.HasHighlightedPath)));\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnActiveClientHighlightedElementRemoved(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            BeginInvoke(new Action(() =\u003E\n            {\n                tvDom.ClearSelection();\n                txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n            }));\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnActiveClientElementClicked(object? sender, ElementClickedEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (sender is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                BeginInvoke(new Action(async () =\u003E\n                {\n                    await client.HandleElementClickedOrRefreshDomAsync(\n                        clickedPath: e.Path,\n                        trySelectExistingPath: path =\u003E tvDom.SelectNodeByPath(path, ensureVisible: true, raiseAfterSelect: false),\n                        onSelectedInExistingTree: () =\u003E txtElementDetails.Text = tvDom.SelectedDomNode?.GetFormattedDetails() ?? string.Empty,\n                        getCurrentSelectedPath: () =\u003E tvDom.SelectedPath,\n                        onSnapshotReady: result =\u003E ApplyDomSnapshotResultToUi(client, result));\n                }));\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientMetadataUpdated(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            InvokeOnUi(() =\u003E RefreshClientListItemDisplay(client));\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnActiveClientChanged(object? sender, BrowserClient? activeClient)\n        {\n            InvokeOnUi(() =\u003E SyncActiveClientSelectionToUi(activeClient));\n        }\n\n        private void UpsertClientInListUi(BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            _isUpdatingClientsList = true;\n            try\n            {\n                AutomationServer.UpsertClientInList(lstClients.Items, client);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                _isUpdatingClientsList = false;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void SyncActiveClientSelectionToUi(BrowserClient? activeClient)\n        {\n            if (activeClient != null)\n            {\n                UpsertClientInListUi(activeClient);\n            }\n\n            _isUpdatingClientsList = true;\n            try\n            {\n                lstClients.SelectedItem = activeClient;\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                _isUpdatingClientsList = false;\n            }\n\n            if (activeClient != null)\n            {\n                await RefreshDomAsync(activeClient);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                tvDom.Clear();\n                txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnClientDisconnected(object? sender, BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            InvokeOnUi(() =\u003E HandleClientRemovedFromUi(client));\n        }\n\n        private void HandleClientRemovedFromUi(BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            _isUpdatingClientsList = true;\n            try\n            {\n                AutomationServer.RemoveClientFromList(lstClients.Items, client);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                _isUpdatingClientsList = false;\n            }\n\n            if (lstClients.Items.Count == 0)\n            {\n                tvDom.Clear();\n                txtElementDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void LstClients_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_isUpdatingClientsList) return;\n            _session.ActiveClient = lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient;\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnSend_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            await _session.SendRawCommandAsync(txtCmdType.Text, txtPayload.Text, lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient);\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnReactClick_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            await _session.TestReactClickAsync(txtPayload.Text, lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient);\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnEval_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            await _session.TestEvalAsync(txtPayload.Text, lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient);\n        }\n\n        private void ApplyDomSnapshotResultToUi(BrowserClient client, DomSnapshotRefreshResult result)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient selectedClient ||\n                selectedClient.InstanceId != client.InstanceId)\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            var expandedPaths = tvDom.GetExpandedPathsSnapshot();\n            tvDom.ApplySnapshot(\n                result.Snapshot,\n                expandedPaths,\n                result.ResolvedSelectedPath,\n                ensureSelectedVisible: result.ScrollSelectionIntoView,\n                raiseAfterSelect: false);\n\n            string details = tvDom.SelectedDomNode?.GetFormattedDetails() ?? string.Empty;\n            if (!string.Equals(txtElementDetails.Text, details, StringComparison.Ordinal))\n            {\n                txtElementDetails.Text = details;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async Task RefreshDomAsync(BrowserClient client, string? targetSelectedPath = null, bool hasTargetPath = false)\n        {\n            try\n            {\n                await client.RefreshDomSnapshotCoalescedAsync(\n                    getCurrentSelectedPath: () =\u003E tvDom.SelectedPath,\n                    onSnapshotReady: result =\u003E ApplyDomSnapshotResultToUi(client, result),\n                    targetSelectedPath: targetSelectedPath,\n                    hasTargetPath: hasTargetPath);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                _session.Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to fetch DOM: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void TvDom_AfterSelect(object? sender, TreeViewEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (e.Node?.Tag is DomNode domNode)\n            {\n                txtElementDetails.Text = domNode.GetFormattedDetails();\n                (lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient)?.SelectDomNode(domNode);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void TvDom_NodeMouseClick(object? sender, TreeNodeMouseClickEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (e.Button == MouseButtons.Right \u0026\u0026 e.Node?.Tag is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 domNode.Type == \u0022element\u0022)\n            {\n                ctxDomNode.Show(tvDom, e.Location);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void MnuClickElement_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            await _session.ClickDomNodeAsync(tvDom.SelectedDomNode, lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient);\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private async void MnuSetValue_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedDomNode is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path) \u0026\u0026 lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                string value = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter value to set:\u0022, \u0022Set Value\u0022);\n                if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(value)) return;\n\n                Log($\u0022[SYS] Testing set value on {domNode.Path}\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n                try\n                {\n                    var res = await client.SetReactInputValueAsync(domNode, value);\n                    Log($\u0022[RX] {res.Output}\u0022, Color.White);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex) { Log($\u0022[ERR] {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red); }\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private async void MnuSetValue_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedDomNode is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path) \u0026\u0026 lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                string value = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter value to set:\u0022, \u0022Set Value\u0022);\n                await _session.SetDomNodeValueAsync(domNode, value, client);\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            var createNewItem = new ToolStripMenuItem(\u0022(\u002B New Scrape List...)\u0022);\n            createNewItem.Click \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                string defaultName = $\u0022Scrape {_project.Scrapes.Count \u002B 1}\u0022;\n                string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new scrape list name:\u0022, \u0022New Scrape List\u0022, defaultName);\n                if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name))\n                {\n                    var newScrape = _project.AddScrape(name);\n                    chkLstScrapes.Items.Add(newScrape, newScrape.IsActive);\n                    chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem = newScrape;\n                    onSelect(newScrape);\n                }\n            };\n            parentMenu.DropDownItems.Add(createNewItem);\n        }\n\n        private void AddStepToSequence(AutomationSequence seq, AutomationActionType actionType)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedDomNode is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n            {\n                var step = seq.AddStepFromDomNode(domNode, actionType);\n                \n                if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem == seq)\n                {\n                    lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                    lstSteps.SelectedItem = step;\n                }\n                \n                tabMain.SelectedTab = tabEditor;\n                Log($\u0022[SYS] Added step to list \u0027{seq.Name}\u0027\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnAddStep_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq)\n            {\n                var step = seq.AddStep();\n                lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                lstSteps.SelectedItem = step;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select an automation list first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRemoveStep_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedItem is AutomationStep step)\n            {\n                seq.RemoveStep(step);\n                lstSteps.Items.Remove(step);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void LstSteps_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            pgStepDetails.SelectedObject = lstSteps.SelectedItem;\n        }\n\n        private void PgStepDetails_PropertyValueChanged(object? s, PropertyValueChangedEventArgs e)\n        {\n            int idx = lstSteps.SelectedIndex;\n            if (idx \u003E= 0)\n            {\n                var item = lstSteps.Items[idx];\n                lstSteps.Items[idx] = item;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileNew_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            _project.Reset();\n            ApplyProjectToUi(_project);\n            Log(\u0022[SYS] Started new automation project.\u0022, Color.Cyan);\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileOpen_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var ofd = new OpenFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Open Automation Project\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (ofd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    var project = AutomationProject.LoadFromFile(ofd.FileName);\n                    ApplyProjectToUi(project);\n                    Log($\u0022[SYS] Loaded project from {ofd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to load project: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileSave_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Save Automation Project\u0022,\n                DefaultExt = \u0022json\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    _project.SaveToFile(sfd.FileName);\n                    Log($\u0022[SYS] Saved project to {sfd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to save project: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n            var createNewItem = new ToolStripMenuItem(\u0022(\u002B New Scrape List...)\u0022);\n            createNewItem.Click \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                string defaultName = $\u0022Scrape {_session.Project.Scrapes.Count \u002B 1}\u0022;\n                string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new scrape list name:\u0022, \u0022New Scrape List\u0022, defaultName);\n                if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name))\n                {\n                    var newScrape = _session.Project.AddScrape(name);\n                    chkLstScrapes.Items.Add(newScrape, newScrape.IsActive);\n                    chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem = newScrape;\n                    onSelect(newScrape);\n                }\n            };\n            parentMenu.DropDownItems.Add(createNewItem);\n        }\n\n        private void AddStepToSequence(AutomationSequence seq, AutomationActionType actionType)\n        {\n            var step = _session.AddStepFromDomNode(seq, tvDom.SelectedDomNode, actionType);\n            if (step != null)\n            {\n                if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem == seq)\n                {\n                    lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                    lstSteps.SelectedItem = step;\n                }\n                tabMain.SelectedTab = tabEditor;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnAddStep_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq)\n            {\n                var step = seq.AddStep();\n                lstSteps.Items.Add(step);\n                lstSteps.SelectedItem = step;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                _session.Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022Please select an automation list first.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRemoveStep_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq \u0026\u0026 lstSteps.SelectedItem is AutomationStep step)\n            {\n                seq.RemoveStep(step);\n                lstSteps.Items.Remove(step);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void LstSteps_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            pgStepDetails.SelectedObject = lstSteps.SelectedItem;\n        }\n\n        private void PgStepDetails_PropertyValueChanged(object? s, PropertyValueChangedEventArgs e)\n        {\n            int idx = lstSteps.SelectedIndex;\n            if (idx \u003E= 0)\n            {\n                var item = lstSteps.Items[idx];\n                lstSteps.Items[idx] = item;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileNew_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            ApplyProjectToUi(_session.ResetProject());\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileOpen_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var ofd = new OpenFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Open Automation Project\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (ofd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    ApplyProjectToUi(_session.LoadProjectFromFile(ofd.FileName));\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    _session.Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to load project: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void MnuFileSave_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Save Automation Project\u0022,\n                DefaultExt = \u0022json\u0022\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    _session.SaveProjectToFile(sfd.FileName);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    _session.Log(\u0022ERR\u0022, $\u0022Failed to save project: {ex.Message}\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Error);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void BtnAddSequence_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new list name:\u0022, \u0022Add Automation List\u0022);\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name))\n            {\n                var seq = _project.AddSequence(name);\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Add(seq, seq.IsActive);\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedItem = seq;\n                RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRemoveSequence_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq)\n            {\n                _project.RemoveSequence(seq);\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Remove(seq);\n                RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveSeqUp_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int idx = chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex;\n            if (_project.MoveSequenceUp(idx))\n            {\n                var item = chkLstSequences.Items[idx];\n                bool isChecked = chkLstSequences.GetItemChecked(idx);\n\n                chkLstSequences.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Insert(idx - 1, item);\n                chkLstSequences.SetItemChecked(idx - 1, isChecked);\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = idx - 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveSeqDown_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int idx = chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex;\n            if (_project.MoveSequenceDown(idx))\n            {\n                var item = chkLstSequences.Items[idx];\n                bool isChecked = chkLstSequences.GetItemChecked(idx);\n\n                chkLstSequences.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Insert(idx \u002B 1, item);\n                chkLstSequences.SetItemChecked(idx \u002B 1, isChecked);\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = idx \u002B 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRenameSeq_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq)\n            {\n                string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new list name:\u0022, \u0022Rename Automation List\u0022, seq.Name);\n                if (_project.RenameSequence(seq, name))\n                {\n                    int idx = chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex;\n                    bool isChecked = chkLstSequences.GetItemChecked(idx);\n                    chkLstSequences.Items[idx] = seq;\n                    chkLstSequences.SetItemChecked(idx, isChecked);\n                    RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns();\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnRunAutomation_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a client first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (!_project.HasActiveSequences)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No active automation lists selected to run.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            Log(\u0022[SYS] Starting Automation Run...\u0022, Color.Magenta);\n            btnRunAutomation.Enabled = false;\n\n            try\n            {\n                await client.ExecuteProjectAsync(_project, _runner);\n                Log(\u0022[SYS] Automation Run Completed.\u0022, Color.Lime);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Automation aborted: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                btnRunAutomation.Enabled = true;\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void BtnAddSequence_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new list name:\u0022, \u0022Add Automation List\u0022);\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name))\n            {\n                var seq = _session.Project.AddSequence(name);\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Add(seq, seq.IsActive);\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedItem = seq;\n                RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRemoveSequence_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq)\n            {\n                _session.Project.RemoveSequence(seq);\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Remove(seq);\n                RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveSeqUp_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int idx = chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex;\n            if (_session.Project.MoveSequenceUp(idx))\n            {\n                var item = chkLstSequences.Items[idx];\n                bool isChecked = chkLstSequences.GetItemChecked(idx);\n\n                chkLstSequences.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Insert(idx - 1, item);\n                chkLstSequences.SetItemChecked(idx - 1, isChecked);\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = idx - 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveSeqDown_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int idx = chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex;\n            if (_session.Project.MoveSequenceDown(idx))\n            {\n                var item = chkLstSequences.Items[idx];\n                bool isChecked = chkLstSequences.GetItemChecked(idx);\n\n                chkLstSequences.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                chkLstSequences.Items.Insert(idx \u002B 1, item);\n                chkLstSequences.SetItemChecked(idx \u002B 1, isChecked);\n                chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex = idx \u002B 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRenameSeq_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstSequences.SelectedItem is AutomationSequence seq)\n            {\n                string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new list name:\u0022, \u0022Rename Automation List\u0022, seq.Name);\n                if (_session.Project.RenameSequence(seq, name))\n                {\n                    int idx = chkLstSequences.SelectedIndex;\n                    bool isChecked = chkLstSequences.GetItemChecked(idx);\n                    chkLstSequences.Items[idx] = seq;\n                    chkLstSequences.SetItemChecked(idx, isChecked);\n                    RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns();\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnRunAutomation_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            btnRunAutomation.Enabled = false;\n            try\n            {\n                await _session.RunActiveSequencesAsync(lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                btnRunAutomation.Enabled = true;\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            chkExclusiveTab.CheckedChanged \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                if (_server != null)\n                {\n                    _server.ExclusiveTabMode = chkExclusiveTab.Checked;\n                }\n            };\n==== REPLACE\n            chkExclusiveTab.CheckedChanged \u002B= (s, e) =\u003E\n            {\n                _session.ExclusiveTabMode = chkExclusiveTab.Checked;\n            };\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void RefreshClientListItemDisplay(BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            for (int i = 0; i \u003C lstClients.Items.Count; i\u002B\u002B)\n            {\n                if (lstClients.Items[i] is BrowserClient item \u0026\u0026 item.InstanceId == client.InstanceId)\n                {\n                    bool wasSelected = lstClients.SelectedIndex == i;\n                    _isUpdatingClientsList = true;\n                    try\n                    {\n                        lstClients.Items[i] = client;\n                        if (wasSelected)\n                        {\n                            lstClients.SelectedIndex = i;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    finally\n                    {\n                        _isUpdatingClientsList = false;\n                    }\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void UpdateExtensionStatusLabel(bool connected, int tabCount)\n        {\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n            {\n                Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E UpdateExtensionStatusLabel(connected, tabCount)));\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (connected)\n            {\n                lblExtensionStatus.Text = $\u0022Extension: Connected ({tabCount} open tab{(tabCount == 1 ? \u0022\u0022 : \u0022s\u0022)})\u0022;\n                lblExtensionStatus.ForeColor = Color.LimeGreen;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                lblExtensionStatus.Text = _server != null\n                    ? \u0022Extension: Waiting for connection...\u0022\n                    : \u0022Extension: Server stopped\u0022;\n                lblExtensionStatus.ForeColor = Color.Orange;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnExtensionConnected(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            Log(\u0022[EXT] Chrome Extension connected to Automation Server!\u0022, Color.LimeGreen);\n            UpdateExtensionStatusLabel(true, _server?.GetExtensionTabs().Count ?? 0);\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnExtensionDisconnected(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            Log(\u0022[EXT] Chrome Extension disconnected.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n            UpdateExtensionStatusLabel(false, 0);\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnExtensionTabsUpdated(object? sender, ExtensionTabsEventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (InvokeRequired)\n            {\n                Invoke(new Action(() =\u003E Server_OnExtensionTabsUpdated(sender, e)));\n                return;\n            }\n\n            UpdateExtensionStatusLabel(true, e.Tabs.Count);\n            RefreshBrowserTabsListUi();\n        }\n\n        private void RefreshBrowserTabsListUi()\n        {\n            if (_server == null) return;\n\n            _isUpdatingBrowserTabsList = true;\n            lstBrowserTabs.BeginUpdate();\n            try\n            {\n                int? prevSelectedTabId = (lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem as BrowserTabInfo)?.TabId ?? _server.ActiveExtensionTabId;\n                var filteredTabs = _server.GetExtensionTabs(txtFilterTabs.Text);\n\n                lstBrowserTabs.Items.Clear();\n                BrowserTabInfo? itemToSelect = null;\n\n                foreach (var tab in filteredTabs)\n                {\n                    lstBrowserTabs.Items.Add(tab);\n                    if (prevSelectedTabId.HasValue \u0026\u0026 tab.TabId == prevSelectedTabId.Value)\n                    {\n                        itemToSelect = tab;\n                    }\n                }\n\n                if (itemToSelect != null)\n                {\n                    lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem = itemToSelect;\n                }\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                lstBrowserTabs.EndUpdate();\n                _isUpdatingBrowserTabsList = false;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void LstBrowserTabs_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_isUpdatingBrowserTabsList) return;\n            if (lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem is not BrowserTabInfo selectedTab) return;\n\n            if (selectedTab.IsAlreadyActiveClient(lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient, chkExclusiveTab.Checked))\n            {\n                return;\n            }\n\n            await SwitchToBrowserTabAsync(selectedTab, focusBrowserTab: false);\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnSwitchTab_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem is not BrowserTabInfo selectedTab)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a browser tab from the Chrome Extension tabs list first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            await SwitchToBrowserTabAsync(selectedTab, focusBrowserTab: false);\n        }\n\n        private async Task SwitchToBrowserTabAsync(BrowserTabInfo tab, bool focusBrowserTab)\n        {\n            if (_server == null)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Start the Automation Server first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            var mode = cmbMode.SelectedItem is IpcMode m ? m : IpcMode.WebSocket;\n            bool detachOthers = chkExclusiveTab.Checked;\n\n            Log($\u0022[EXT] Injecting \u0026 switching to Tab #{tab.TabId}: {tab.Title} ({tab.Url})\u0022, Color.SpringGreen);\n\n            try\n            {\n                var existingClient = await _server.SwitchToExtensionTabAsync(tab, focusBrowserTab, detachOthers, mode);\n                if (existingClient != null \u0026\u0026 lstClients.SelectedItem == existingClient)\n                {\n                    _ = RefreshDomAsync(existingClient);\n                }\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to switch to tab #{tab.TabId}: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnDetachTab_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_server == null) return;\n            if (lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem is not BrowserTabInfo selectedTab)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a tab to detach.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            Log($\u0022[EXT] Detaching automation bridge from Tab #{selectedTab.TabId}...\u0022, Color.Yellow);\n            try\n            {\n                await _server.DetachExtensionTabAsync(selectedTab.TabId);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to detach tab: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnFocusTab_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_server == null) return;\n            if (lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem is not BrowserTabInfo selectedTab)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a tab to focus in Chrome.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            try\n            {\n                await _server.FocusExtensionTabAsync(selectedTab.TabId);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to focus tab: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnRefreshTabs_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_server == null) return;\n            try\n            {\n                await _server.RequestExtensionTabsRefreshAsync();\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to refresh tabs: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void RefreshClientListItemDisplay(BrowserClient client)\n        {\n            int idx = AutomationServer.FindClientIndex(lstClients.Items, client);\n            if (idx \u003E= 0)\n            {\n                bool wasSelected = lstClients.SelectedIndex == idx;\n                _isUpdatingClientsList = true;\n                try\n                {\n                    AutomationServer.RefreshClientInList(lstClients.Items, client);\n                    if (wasSelected)\n                    {\n                        lstClients.SelectedIndex = idx;\n                    }\n                }\n                finally\n                {\n                    _isUpdatingClientsList = false;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void UpdateExtensionStatusLabel()\n        {\n            lblExtensionStatus.Text = _session.GetExtensionStatusMessage();\n            lblExtensionStatus.ForeColor = _session.IsExtensionConnected ? Color.LimeGreen : Color.Orange;\n        }\n\n        private void Server_OnExtensionTabsUpdated(object? sender, ExtensionTabsEventArgs e)\n        {\n            InvokeOnUi(RefreshBrowserTabsListUi);\n        }\n\n        private void RefreshBrowserTabsListUi()\n        {\n            if (_session.Server == null) return;\n\n            _isUpdatingBrowserTabsList = true;\n            lstBrowserTabs.BeginUpdate();\n            try\n            {\n                int? prevSelectedTabId = (lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem as BrowserTabInfo)?.TabId ?? _session.Server.ActiveExtensionTabId;\n                var filteredTabs = _session.GetExtensionTabs(txtFilterTabs.Text);\n\n                lstBrowserTabs.Items.Clear();\n                BrowserTabInfo? itemToSelect = null;\n\n                foreach (var tab in filteredTabs)\n                {\n                    lstBrowserTabs.Items.Add(tab);\n                    if (prevSelectedTabId.HasValue \u0026\u0026 tab.TabId == prevSelectedTabId.Value)\n                    {\n                        itemToSelect = tab;\n                    }\n                }\n\n                if (itemToSelect != null)\n                {\n                    lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem = itemToSelect;\n                }\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                lstBrowserTabs.EndUpdate();\n                _isUpdatingBrowserTabsList = false;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void LstBrowserTabs_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_isUpdatingBrowserTabsList) return;\n            if (lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem is not BrowserTabInfo selectedTab) return;\n\n            await SwitchToBrowserTabAsync(selectedTab, focusBrowserTab: false, skipIfAlreadyActive: true);\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnSwitchTab_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            await SwitchToBrowserTabAsync(lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem as BrowserTabInfo, focusBrowserTab: false, skipIfAlreadyActive: false);\n        }\n\n        private async Task SwitchToBrowserTabAsync(BrowserTabInfo? tab, bool focusBrowserTab, bool skipIfAlreadyActive)\n        {\n            var mode = cmbMode.SelectedItem is IpcMode m ? m : IpcMode.WebSocket;\n            var existingClient = await _session.SwitchToExtensionTabAsync(tab, mode, focusBrowserTab, skipIfAlreadyActive);\n            if (existingClient != null \u0026\u0026 lstClients.SelectedItem == existingClient)\n            {\n                _ = RefreshDomAsync(existingClient);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnDetachTab_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            await _session.DetachExtensionTabAsync(lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem as BrowserTabInfo);\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnFocusTab_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            await _session.FocusExtensionTabAsync(lstBrowserTabs.SelectedItem as BrowserTabInfo);\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnRefreshTabs_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            await _session.RefreshExtensionTabsAsync();\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns()\n        {\n            if (cmbPreScrapeSeq == null || cmbPostScrapeSeq == null) return;\n\n            _isUpdatingScrapeUi = true;\n            try\n            {\n                string prevPre = cmbPreScrapeSeq.SelectedItem as string ?? string.Empty;\n                string prevPost = cmbPostScrapeSeq.SelectedItem as string ?? string.Empty;\n\n                cmbPreScrapeSeq.Items.Clear();\n                cmbPostScrapeSeq.Items.Clear();\n\n                foreach (string option in _project.GetSequenceDropdownOptions())\n                {\n                    cmbPreScrapeSeq.Items.Add(option);\n                    cmbPostScrapeSeq.Items.Add(option);\n                }\n\n                if (chkLstScrapes?.SelectedItem is ScrapeDefinition def)\n                {\n                    cmbPreScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(def.PreScrapeSequenceName);\n                    cmbPostScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(def.PostScrapeSequenceName);\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    cmbPreScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(prevPre);\n                    cmbPostScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(prevPost);\n                }\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                _isUpdatingScrapeUi = false;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void LoadSelectedScrapeToUi()\n        {\n            _isUpdatingScrapeUi = true;\n            try\n            {\n                lstScrapeFields.Items.Clear();\n                pgScrapeFieldDetails.SelectedObject = null;\n\n                if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem is ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n                {\n                    txtContainerSelector.Text = scrape.ContainerSelector;\n                    cmbPreScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(scrape.PreScrapeSequenceName);\n                    cmbPostScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(scrape.PostScrapeSequenceName);\n                    chkEnablePagination.Checked = scrape.EnablePagination;\n==== REPLACE\n        private void RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns()\n        {\n            if (cmbPreScrapeSeq == null || cmbPostScrapeSeq == null) return;\n\n            _isUpdatingScrapeUi = true;\n            try\n            {\n                string prevPre = cmbPreScrapeSeq.SelectedItem as string ?? string.Empty;\n                string prevPost = cmbPostScrapeSeq.SelectedItem as string ?? string.Empty;\n\n                cmbPreScrapeSeq.Items.Clear();\n                cmbPostScrapeSeq.Items.Clear();\n\n                foreach (string option in _session.Project.GetSequenceDropdownOptions())\n                {\n                    cmbPreScrapeSeq.Items.Add(option);\n                    cmbPostScrapeSeq.Items.Add(option);\n                }\n\n                if (chkLstScrapes?.SelectedItem is ScrapeDefinition def)\n                {\n                    cmbPreScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _session.Project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(def.PreScrapeSequenceName);\n                    cmbPostScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _session.Project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(def.PostScrapeSequenceName);\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    cmbPreScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _session.Project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(prevPre);\n                    cmbPostScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _session.Project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(prevPost);\n                }\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                _isUpdatingScrapeUi = false;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void LoadSelectedScrapeToUi()\n        {\n            _isUpdatingScrapeUi = true;\n            try\n            {\n                lstScrapeFields.Items.Clear();\n                pgScrapeFieldDetails.SelectedObject = null;\n\n                if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem is ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n                {\n                    txtContainerSelector.Text = scrape.ContainerSelector;\n                    cmbPreScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _session.Project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(scrape.PreScrapeSequenceName);\n                    cmbPostScrapeSeq.SelectedItem = _session.Project.ResolveSequenceDropdownSelection(scrape.PostScrapeSequenceName);\n                    chkEnablePagination.Checked = scrape.EnablePagination;\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void BtnAddScrape_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new scrape list name:\u0022, \u0022Add Scrape List\u0022, $\u0022Scrape {_project.Scrapes.Count \u002B 1}\u0022);\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name))\n            {\n                var scrape = _project.AddScrape(name);\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.Add(scrape, scrape.IsActive);\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem = scrape;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRemoveScrape_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem is ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n            {\n                _project.RemoveScrape(scrape);\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.Remove(scrape);\n                LoadSelectedScrapeToUi();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveScrapeUp_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int idx = chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex;\n            if (_project.MoveScrapeUp(idx))\n            {\n                var item = chkLstScrapes.Items[idx];\n                bool isChecked = chkLstScrapes.GetItemChecked(idx);\n\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.Insert(idx - 1, item);\n                chkLstScrapes.SetItemChecked(idx - 1, isChecked);\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex = idx - 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveScrapeDown_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int idx = chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex;\n            if (_project.MoveScrapeDown(idx))\n            {\n                var item = chkLstScrapes.Items[idx];\n                bool isChecked = chkLstScrapes.GetItemChecked(idx);\n\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.Insert(idx \u002B 1, item);\n                chkLstScrapes.SetItemChecked(idx \u002B 1, isChecked);\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex = idx \u002B 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRenameScrape_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem is ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n            {\n                string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new scrape list name:\u0022, \u0022Rename Scrape List\u0022, scrape.Name);\n                if (_project.RenameScrape(scrape, name))\n                {\n                    int idx = chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex;\n                    bool isChecked = chkLstScrapes.GetItemChecked(idx);\n                    chkLstScrapes.Items[idx] = scrape;\n                    chkLstScrapes.SetItemChecked(idx, isChecked);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private DomNode? GetCurrentRootDomNode() =\u003E\n            (lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient)?.ResolveDomRoot(tvDom.RootDomNode) ?? tvDom.RootDomNode;\n\n        private void BtnGeneralizeContainer_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(txtContainerSelector.Text))\n            {\n                DomNode? rootDom = GetCurrentRootDomNode();\n                if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem is ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n                {\n                    txtContainerSelector.Text = scrape.GeneralizeAndSetContainer(txtContainerSelector.Text, rootDom);\n                    pgScrapeFieldDetails.Refresh();\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    txtContainerSelector.Text = SelectorHelper.GeneralizeContainerSelector(txtContainerSelector.Text, rootDom);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnHighlightContainer_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a connected client first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            string selector = txtContainerSelector.Text.Trim();\n            if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(selector))\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Container selector is empty.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            try\n            {\n                int count = chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem is ScrapeDefinition scrape\n                    ? await client.HighlightScrapeContainerAsync(scrape)\n                    : await client.HighlightElementsAsync(selector, null, true);\n                Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] Highlighted {count} container element(s) matching \u0027{selector}\u0027.\u0022, Color.SpringGreen);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to highlight container: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnAddScrapeField_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem is not ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select or create a scrape list first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void BtnAddScrape_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new scrape list name:\u0022, \u0022Add Scrape List\u0022, $\u0022Scrape {_session.Project.Scrapes.Count \u002B 1}\u0022);\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name))\n            {\n                var scrape = _session.Project.AddScrape(name);\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.Add(scrape, scrape.IsActive);\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem = scrape;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRemoveScrape_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem is ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n            {\n                _session.Project.RemoveScrape(scrape);\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.Remove(scrape);\n                LoadSelectedScrapeToUi();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveScrapeUp_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int idx = chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex;\n            if (_session.Project.MoveScrapeUp(idx))\n            {\n                var item = chkLstScrapes.Items[idx];\n                bool isChecked = chkLstScrapes.GetItemChecked(idx);\n\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.Insert(idx - 1, item);\n                chkLstScrapes.SetItemChecked(idx - 1, isChecked);\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex = idx - 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnMoveScrapeDown_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            int idx = chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex;\n            if (_session.Project.MoveScrapeDown(idx))\n            {\n                var item = chkLstScrapes.Items[idx];\n                bool isChecked = chkLstScrapes.GetItemChecked(idx);\n\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.RemoveAt(idx);\n                chkLstScrapes.Items.Insert(idx \u002B 1, item);\n                chkLstScrapes.SetItemChecked(idx \u002B 1, isChecked);\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex = idx \u002B 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnRenameScrape_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem is ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n            {\n                string name = PromptForValue(\u0022Enter new scrape list name:\u0022, \u0022Rename Scrape List\u0022, scrape.Name);\n                if (_session.Project.RenameScrape(scrape, name))\n                {\n                    int idx = chkLstScrapes.SelectedIndex;\n                    bool isChecked = chkLstScrapes.GetItemChecked(idx);\n                    chkLstScrapes.Items[idx] = scrape;\n                    chkLstScrapes.SetItemChecked(idx, isChecked);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnGeneralizeContainer_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(txtContainerSelector.Text))\n            {\n                txtContainerSelector.Text = _session.GeneralizeContainerSelector(\n                    txtContainerSelector.Text,\n                    chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem as ScrapeDefinition,\n                    tvDom.RootDomNode);\n                pgScrapeFieldDetails.Refresh();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnHighlightContainer_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            await _session.HighlightContainerAsync(\n                txtContainerSelector.Text,\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem as ScrapeDefinition,\n                lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient);\n        }\n\n        private void BtnAddScrapeField_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem is not ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n            {\n                _session.Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022Please select or create a scrape list first.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return;\n            }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void BtnGeneralizeScrapeField_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstScrapeFields.SelectedItem is ScrapeField field \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(field.Selector))\n            {\n                field.GeneralizeSelector(GetCurrentRootDomNode());\n                pgScrapeFieldDetails.Refresh();\n                RefreshSelectedFieldItemText();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnHighlightScrapeField_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a connected client first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (lstScrapeFields.SelectedItem is not ScrapeField field || string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(field.Selector))\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a field with a valid selector first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            var parentScrape = chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem as ScrapeDefinition;\n            try\n            {\n                int count = await client.HighlightScrapeFieldAsync(field, parentScrape);\n                Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] Highlighted {count} element(s) for field \u0027{field.Name}\u0027.\u0022, Color.SpringGreen);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Highlight failed: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private void BtnGeneralizeScrapeField_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstScrapeFields.SelectedItem is ScrapeField field \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(field.Selector))\n            {\n                field.GeneralizeSelector(_session.ResolveDomRoot(tvDom.RootDomNode));\n                pgScrapeFieldDetails.Refresh();\n                RefreshSelectedFieldItemText();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnHighlightScrapeField_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            await _session.HighlightScrapeFieldAsync(\n                lstScrapeFields.SelectedItem as ScrapeField,\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem as ScrapeDefinition,\n                lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient);\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private async void MnuQuickScrapeText_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedDomNode is DomNode domNode \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path) \u0026\u0026 lstClients.SelectedItem is BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                var extType = domNode.GetSuggestedExtractionType();\n                Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] Testing extraction ({extType}) on {domNode.Path}...\u0022, Color.SpringGreen);\n                try\n                {\n                    string? val = await client.ScrapeElementAsync(domNode, extType);\n                    Log($\u0022[SCRAPE-RX] Extracted Value: {val}\u0022, Color.White);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Quick scrape failed: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void AddFieldFromSelectedDomNode(ScrapeDefinition scrape, bool matchAllElements)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedDomNode is not DomNode domNode || string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n                return;\n\n            var field = scrape.AddFieldFromDomNode(domNode, matchAllElements, GetCurrentRootDomNode());\n\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem != scrape)\n            {\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem = scrape;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                lstScrapeFields.Items.Add(field);\n                lstScrapeFields.SelectedItem = field;\n            }\n\n            Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] Added field \u0027{field.Name}\u0027 ({field.ExtractionType}) to \u0027{scrape.Name}\u0027.\u0022, Color.SpringGreen);\n        }\n\n        private void SetContainerFromSelectedDomNode(ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedDomNode is not DomNode domNode || string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n                return;\n\n            string generalizedContainer = scrape.SetContainerFromDomNode(domNode, GetCurrentRootDomNode());\n\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem != scrape)\n            {\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem = scrape;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                LoadSelectedScrapeToUi();\n            }\n\n            Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] Set repeating container for \u0027{scrape.Name}\u0027 to: {generalizedContainer}\u0022, Color.SpringGreen);\n        }\n\n        private void SetPaginationNextFromSelectedDomNode(ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n        {\n            if (tvDom.SelectedDomNode is not DomNode domNode || string.IsNullOrEmpty(domNode.Path))\n                return;\n\n            string selector = scrape.SetPaginationNextFromDomNode(domNode, GetCurrentRootDomNode());\n\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem != scrape)\n            {\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem = scrape;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                LoadSelectedScrapeToUi();\n            }\n\n            Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] Set pagination Next button for \u0027{scrape.Name}\u0027 to: {selector}\u0022, Color.SpringGreen);\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnPreviewScrape_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a connected client first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem is not ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a scrape list to preview.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (!scrape.HasFields)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] The selected scrape list has no fields defined.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            btnPreviewScrape.Enabled = false;\n            try\n            {\n                var result = await client.ExecuteScrapeAsync(scrape, _project.Sequences, _scraper);\n                DisplayScrapeResult(result);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Scrape preview failed: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                btnPreviewScrape.Enabled = true;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnRunAllScrapes_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a connected client first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            if (!_project.HasActiveScrapes)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No active scrape lists selected to run.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            btnRunAllScrapes.Enabled = false;\n            try\n            {\n                var combined = await client.ExecuteProjectScrapesCombinedAsync(_project, _scraper);\n                DisplayScrapeResult(combined);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Active scrapes run aborted: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                btnRunAllScrapes.Enabled = true;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void DisplayScrapeResult(ScrapeResult result)\n        {\n            _lastScrapeResult = result;\n            lblScrapeStatus.Text = result.GetStatusSummary();\n            dgvScrapePreview.DataSource = result.ToDataTable();\n            txtScrapeJsonPreview.Text = result.ToJson(true, true);\n        }\n\n        private void BtnCopyScrapeJson_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_lastScrapeResult == null || !_lastScrapeResult.HasRecords)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No scrape results available to copy.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            Clipboard.SetText(_lastScrapeResult.ToJson(true, true));\n            Log(\u0022[SCRAPE] Copied scraped JSON records to clipboard.\u0022, Color.Lime);\n        }\n\n        private void BtnExportScrapeJson_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_lastScrapeResult == null || !_lastScrapeResult.HasRecords)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No scrape results available to export.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Export Scrape Results as JSON\u0022,\n                DefaultExt = \u0022json\u0022,\n                FileName = _lastScrapeResult.GetSuggestedFileName(\u0022json\u0022)\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    _lastScrapeResult.SaveToJsonFile(sfd.FileName, recordsOnly: true);\n                    Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] Exported {_lastScrapeResult.RecordCount} record(s) to {sfd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to export JSON: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnExportScrapeCsv_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_lastScrapeResult == null || !_lastScrapeResult.HasRecords)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No scrape results available to export.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022CSV Files (*.csv)|*.csv|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Export Scrape Results as CSV\u0022,\n                DefaultExt = \u0022csv\u0022,\n                FileName = _lastScrapeResult.GetSuggestedFileName(\u0022csv\u0022)\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    _lastScrapeResult.SaveToCsvFile(sfd.FileName);\n                    Log($\u0022[SCRAPE] Exported {_lastScrapeResult.RecordCount} record(s) to {sfd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to export CSV: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private async void MnuQuickScrapeText_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            await _session.QuickScrapeDomNodeAsync(tvDom.SelectedDomNode, lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient);\n        }\n\n        private void AddFieldFromSelectedDomNode(ScrapeDefinition scrape, bool matchAllElements)\n        {\n            var field = _session.AddFieldFromDomNode(scrape, tvDom.SelectedDomNode, matchAllElements, tvDom.RootDomNode);\n            if (field == null) return;\n\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem != scrape)\n            {\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem = scrape;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                lstScrapeFields.Items.Add(field);\n                lstScrapeFields.SelectedItem = field;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void SetContainerFromSelectedDomNode(ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n        {\n            if (_session.SetContainerFromDomNode(scrape, tvDom.SelectedDomNode, tvDom.RootDomNode) == null)\n                return;\n\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem != scrape)\n            {\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem = scrape;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                LoadSelectedScrapeToUi();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void SetPaginationNextFromSelectedDomNode(ScrapeDefinition scrape)\n        {\n            if (_session.SetPaginationNextFromDomNode(scrape, tvDom.SelectedDomNode, tvDom.RootDomNode) == null)\n                return;\n\n            if (chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem != scrape)\n            {\n                chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem = scrape;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                LoadSelectedScrapeToUi();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnPreviewScrape_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            btnPreviewScrape.Enabled = false;\n            try\n            {\n                await _session.PreviewScrapeAsync(\n                    chkLstScrapes.SelectedItem as ScrapeDefinition,\n                    lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                btnPreviewScrape.Enabled = true;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private async void BtnRunAllScrapes_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            btnRunAllScrapes.Enabled = false;\n            try\n            {\n                await _session.RunActiveScrapesAsync(lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                btnRunAllScrapes.Enabled = true;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void DisplayScrapeResult(ScrapeResult result)\n        {\n            lblScrapeStatus.Text = result.GetStatusSummary();\n            dgvScrapePreview.DataSource = result.ToDataTable();\n            txtScrapeJsonPreview.Text = result.ToJson(true, true);\n        }\n\n        private void BtnCopyScrapeJson_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string? json = _session.GetLastScrapeJsonForCopy();\n            if (json != null)\n            {\n                Clipboard.SetText(json);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnExportScrapeJson_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (!_session.EnsureHasScrapeResultForExport() || _session.LastScrapeResult == null)\n                return;\n\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022JSON Files (*.json)|*.json|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Export Scrape Results as JSON\u0022,\n                DefaultExt = \u0022json\u0022,\n                FileName = _session.LastScrapeResult.GetSuggestedFileName(\u0022json\u0022)\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                _session.ExportLastScrapeToJsonFile(sfd.FileName);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnExportScrapeCsv_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (!_session.EnsureHasScrapeResultForExport() || _session.LastScrapeResult == null)\n                return;\n\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022CSV Files (*.csv)|*.csv|All Files (*.*)|*.*\u0022,\n                Title = \u0022Export Scrape Results as CSV\u0022,\n                DefaultExt = \u0022csv\u0022,\n                FileName = _session.LastScrapeResult.GetSuggestedFileName(\u0022csv\u0022)\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                _session.ExportLastScrapeToCsvFile(sfd.FileName);\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private async Task ExecuteSiteDumpFromUiAsync(SiteDumpType dumpType)\n        {\n            if (lstClients.SelectedItem is not BrowserClient client)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please select a connected client first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            var options = BuildSiteDumpOptionsFromUi();\n            SetDumpButtonsEnabled(false);\n            lblDumpStatus.Text = $\u0022Dumping {dumpType} from {client.InstanceId}...\u0022;\n\n            try\n            {\n                SiteDumpResult result = await client.DumpSiteAsync(dumpType, options, _siteDumper);\n                DisplaySiteDumpResult(result);\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                lblDumpStatus.Text = $\u0022Dump failed: {ex.Message}\u0022;\n                Log($\u0022[ERR] Site dump ({dumpType}) failed: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                SetDumpButtonsEnabled(true);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void DisplaySiteDumpResult(SiteDumpResult result)\n        {\n            _lastSiteDumpResult = result;\n\n            lblDumpStatus.Text = result.GetStatusSummary();\n\n            txtCombinedHtmlSource.Text = result.GetCombinedHtml();\n            txtCombinedCssSource.Text = result.GetCombinedCss();\n            txtCombinedJsSource.Text = result.GetCombinedJavaScript();\n\n            RefreshDumpedResourcesList();\n\n            tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab = result.GetDefaultViewMode() switch\n            {\n                SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedHtml =\u003E tabCombinedHtmlView,\n                SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedCss =\u003E tabCombinedCssView,\n                SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedJavaScript =\u003E tabCombinedJsView,\n                _ =\u003E tabSelectedResourceView\n            };\n        }\n\n        private void RefreshDumpedResourcesList()\n        {\n            lstDumpedResources.BeginUpdate();\n            try\n            {\n                lstDumpedResources.Items.Clear();\n                if (_lastSiteDumpResult == null)\n                {\n                    txtDumpedResourceDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                    txtSelectedResourceSource.Text = string.Empty;\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                string filter = txtFilterResources.Text.Trim();\n                foreach (var res in _lastSiteDumpResult.FilterResources(filter))\n                {\n                    lstDumpedResources.Items.Add(res);\n                }\n\n                if (lstDumpedResources.Items.Count \u003E 0)\n                {\n                    lstDumpedResources.SelectedIndex = 0;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    txtDumpedResourceDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                    txtSelectedResourceSource.Text = string.Empty;\n                }\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                lstDumpedResources.EndUpdate();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void LstDumpedResources_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstDumpedResources.SelectedItem is SiteResourceItem resource)\n            {\n                txtDumpedResourceDetails.Text = resource.GetFormattedDetails();\n                txtSelectedResourceSource.Text = resource.Content;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private SiteDumpViewMode GetActiveDumpViewMode()\n        {\n            if (tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab == tabCombinedHtmlView) return SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedHtml;\n            if (tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab == tabCombinedCssView) return SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedCss;\n            if (tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab == tabCombinedJsView) return SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedJavaScript;\n            return SiteDumpViewMode.SelectedResource;\n        }\n\n        private string GetActiveDumpViewerText(out string suggestedFileName)\n        {\n            suggestedFileName = \u0022dump.txt\u0022;\n            if (_lastSiteDumpResult == null)\n                return string.Empty;\n\n            var viewMode = GetActiveDumpViewMode();\n            var selectedRes = lstDumpedResources.SelectedItem as SiteResourceItem;\n            return _lastSiteDumpResult.GetViewContent(viewMode, selectedRes, out suggestedFileName);\n        }\n\n        private void BtnCopyCurrentDumpView_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string content = GetActiveDumpViewerText(out string name);\n            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(content))\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No dumped source content in the active view to copy.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            Clipboard.SetText(content);\n            Log($\u0022[REV-ENG] Copied \u0027{name}\u0027 ({content.Length:N0} chars) to clipboard.\u0022, Color.Lime);\n        }\n\n        private void BtnSaveActiveDumpFile_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_lastSiteDumpResult == null)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Please run a dump operation first.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            var viewMode = GetActiveDumpViewMode();\n            var selectedResource = lstDumpedResources.SelectedItem as SiteResourceItem;\n            string content = _lastSiteDumpResult.GetViewContent(viewMode, selectedResource, out string defaultFileName);\n\n            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(content))\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] Active dump view is empty.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022All Files (*.*)|*.*|HTML Files (*.html)|*.html|CSS Files (*.css)|*.css|JavaScript Files (*.js)|*.js\u0022,\n                Title = viewMode == SiteDumpViewMode.SelectedResource ? \u0022Save Selected Resource\u0022 : \u0022Save Combined Dump Output\u0022,\n                FileName = defaultFileName\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    _lastSiteDumpResult.SaveViewContentToFile(sfd.FileName, viewMode, selectedResource);\n                    Log($\u0022[REV-ENG] Saved \u0027{defaultFileName}\u0027 to {sfd.FileName}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to save file: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnSaveDumpToFolder_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_lastSiteDumpResult == null || !_lastSiteDumpResult.HasResources)\n            {\n                Log(\u0022[WARN] No site dump results available to save.\u0022, Color.Orange);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            using var fbd = new FolderBrowserDialog\n            {\n                Description = \u0022Select a destination folder to save all dumped HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files\u0022,\n                UseDescriptionForTitle = true\n            };\n\n            if (fbd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(fbd.SelectedPath))\n            {\n                try\n                {\n                    string savedPath = _lastSiteDumpResult.SaveToDirectory(fbd.SelectedPath);\n                    Log($\u0022[REV-ENG] Saved {_lastSiteDumpResult.TotalResourceCount} resource(s) ({_lastSiteDumpResult.GetFormattedTotalSize()}) to {savedPath}\u0022, Color.Lime);\n                }\n                catch (Exception ex)\n                {\n                    Log($\u0022[ERR] Failed to save dump to folder: {ex.Message}\u0022, Color.Red);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private async Task ExecuteSiteDumpFromUiAsync(SiteDumpType dumpType)\n        {\n            SetDumpButtonsEnabled(false);\n            try\n            {\n                await _session.ExecuteSiteDumpAsync(\n                    dumpType,\n                    BuildSiteDumpOptionsFromUi(),\n                    lstClients.SelectedItem as BrowserClient);\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                SetDumpButtonsEnabled(true);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void DisplaySiteDumpResult(SiteDumpResult result)\n        {\n            lblDumpStatus.Text = result.GetStatusSummary();\n\n            txtCombinedHtmlSource.Text = result.GetCombinedHtml();\n            txtCombinedCssSource.Text = result.GetCombinedCss();\n            txtCombinedJsSource.Text = result.GetCombinedJavaScript();\n\n            RefreshDumpedResourcesList();\n\n            tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab = result.GetDefaultViewMode() switch\n            {\n                SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedHtml =\u003E tabCombinedHtmlView,\n                SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedCss =\u003E tabCombinedCssView,\n                SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedJavaScript =\u003E tabCombinedJsView,\n                _ =\u003E tabSelectedResourceView\n            };\n        }\n\n        private void RefreshDumpedResourcesList()\n        {\n            lstDumpedResources.BeginUpdate();\n            try\n            {\n                lstDumpedResources.Items.Clear();\n                if (_session.LastSiteDumpResult == null)\n                {\n                    txtDumpedResourceDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                    txtSelectedResourceSource.Text = string.Empty;\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                string filter = txtFilterResources.Text.Trim();\n                foreach (var res in _session.LastSiteDumpResult.FilterResources(filter))\n                {\n                    lstDumpedResources.Items.Add(res);\n                }\n\n                if (lstDumpedResources.Items.Count \u003E 0)\n                {\n                    lstDumpedResources.SelectedIndex = 0;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    txtDumpedResourceDetails.Text = string.Empty;\n                    txtSelectedResourceSource.Text = string.Empty;\n                }\n            }\n            finally\n            {\n                lstDumpedResources.EndUpdate();\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void LstDumpedResources_SelectedIndexChanged(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (lstDumpedResources.SelectedItem is SiteResourceItem resource)\n            {\n                txtDumpedResourceDetails.Text = resource.GetFormattedDetails();\n                txtSelectedResourceSource.Text = resource.Content;\n            }\n        }\n\n        private SiteDumpViewMode GetActiveDumpViewMode()\n        {\n            if (tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab == tabCombinedHtmlView) return SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedHtml;\n            if (tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab == tabCombinedCssView) return SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedCss;\n            if (tabDumpViewers.SelectedTab == tabCombinedJsView) return SiteDumpViewMode.CombinedJavaScript;\n            return SiteDumpViewMode.SelectedResource;\n        }\n\n        private string GetActiveDumpViewerText(out string suggestedFileName)\n        {\n            return _session.GetActiveDumpViewText(\n                GetActiveDumpViewMode(),\n                lstDumpedResources.SelectedItem as SiteResourceItem,\n                out suggestedFileName);\n        }\n\n        private void BtnCopyCurrentDumpView_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            string content = GetActiveDumpViewerText(out string name);\n            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(content))\n            {\n                _session.Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022No dumped source content in the active view to copy.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            Clipboard.SetText(content);\n            _session.Log(\u0022REV-ENG\u0022, $\u0022Copied \u0027{name}\u0027 ({content.Length:N0} chars) to clipboard.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Success);\n        }\n\n        private void BtnSaveActiveDumpFile_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_session.LastSiteDumpResult == null)\n            {\n                _session.Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022Please run a dump operation first.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            var viewMode = GetActiveDumpViewMode();\n            var selectedResource = lstDumpedResources.SelectedItem as SiteResourceItem;\n            string content = _session.GetActiveDumpViewText(viewMode, selectedResource, out string defaultFileName);\n\n            if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(content))\n            {\n                _session.Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022Active dump view is empty.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            using var sfd = new SaveFileDialog\n            {\n                Filter = \u0022All Files (*.*)|*.*|HTML Files (*.html)|*.html|CSS Files (*.css)|*.css|JavaScript Files (*.js)|*.js\u0022,\n                Title = viewMode == SiteDumpViewMode.SelectedResource ? \u0022Save Selected Resource\u0022 : \u0022Save Combined Dump Output\u0022,\n                FileName = defaultFileName\n            };\n\n            if (sfd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK)\n            {\n                _session.SaveActiveDumpViewToFile(sfd.FileName, viewMode, selectedResource, defaultFileName);\n            }\n        }\n\n        private void BtnSaveDumpToFolder_Click(object? sender, EventArgs e)\n        {\n            if (_session.LastSiteDumpResult == null || !_session.LastSiteDumpResult.HasResources)\n            {\n                _session.Log(\u0022WARN\u0022, \u0022No site dump results available to save.\u0022, AutomationLogLevel.Warning);\n                return;\n            }\n\n            using var fbd = new FolderBrowserDialog\n            {\n                Description = \u0022Select a destination folder to save all dumped HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files\u0022,\n                UseDescriptionForTitle = true\n            };\n\n            if (fbd.ShowDialog() == DialogResult.OK \u0026\u0026 !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(fbd.SelectedPath))\n            {\n                _session.SaveLastDumpToFolder(fbd.SelectedPath);\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060Anti-Agent v1.0\n\nAll remaining non-UI logic in \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 has been migrated into \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework.dll\u0060, leaving \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 (\u0060MainForm.cs\u0060 and \u0060Controls\\DomTreeView.cs\u0060) as a thin WinForms UI wrapper around the framework:\n\n1. **Multi-Engine Studio Session Controller (\u0060AutomationStudioSession.cs\u0060)**:\n   - Created \u0060AutomationStudioSession\u0060 in \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework.Automation\u0060 to own and coordinate \u0060AutomationProject\u0060, \u0060AutomationServer\u0060, \u0060AutomationRunner\u0060, \u0060DataScraper\u0060, \u0060SiteDumper\u0060, \u0060LastScrapeResult\u0060, and \u0060LastSiteDumpResult\u0060.\n   - Centralized server start/stop lifecycle, Chrome Extension synchronization, userscript generation, project file load/save, raw/eval/click/set-value command execution, point-and-click sequence/scrape builder actions, scrape previews/exports, and reverse-engineering site dump execution/saving.\n2. **Unified Telemetry \u0026 Log Event Pipeline (\u0060BrowserEventArgs.cs\u0060)**:\n   - Added \u0060AutomationLogLevel\u0060, \u0060AutomationLogLevelExtensions.GetDefaultRgb(...)\u0060, and \u0060AutomationLogEventArgs\u0060 so host applications can subscribe to a single \u0060OnLog\u0060 event with pre-formatted timestamps, category prefixes, and default dark-mode RGB color tuples.\n3. **Server \u0026 Client DOM/List Helpers (\u0060AutomationServer.cs\u0060, \u0060BrowserClient.cs\u0060, \u0060ReactExtensions.cs\u0060)**:\n   - Added \u0060AutomationServer.GetExtensionStatusMessage(...)\u0060, \u0060AutomationServer.UpsertClientInList(...)\u0060, \u0060AutomationServer.RemoveClientFromList(...)\u0060, \u0060AutomationServer.RefreshClientInList(...)\u0060, and \u0060skipIfAlreadyActive\u0060 handling in \u0060SwitchToExtensionTabAsync(...)\u0060.\n   - Added \u0060BrowserClient.HandleElementClickedOrRefreshDomAsync(...)\u0060 to encapsulate checking the current snapshot before falling back to a coalesced DOM refresh.\n   - Added \u0060ReactExtensions.GeneralizeContainerSelector(...)\u0060 and \u0060ReactExtensions.HighlightContainerOrSelectorAsync(...)\u0060.\n4. **Virtualized DOM Tree Viewport \u0026 Scroll Geometry (\u0060DomTreeSnapshot.cs\u0060 \u0026 \u0060DomTreeView.cs\u0060)**:\n   - Added \u0060DomRect\u0060, scrollbar/corner layout calculation (\u0060CalculateScrollBarLayout\u0060, \u0060GetViewportBounds\u0060), ancestor guide-line X enumeration (\u0060EnumerateAncestorGuideLineXs\u0060), and viewport-based \u0060ApplyMouseWheel\u0060 overloads to \u0060DomTreeViewportState\u0060 and \u0060DomScrollBarMetrics\u0060.\n   - Updated \u0060DomTreeView.cs\u0060 and \u0060MainForm.cs\u0060 to delegate directly to these DLL APIs.\n\n### How to Test\n\n1. Build the solution (\u0060dotnet build\u0060) and verify both \u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\u0060 and \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 compile with zero warnings or errors.\n2. Launch \u0060TestBedApp\u0060, click **Start Server**, connect a tab via the Chrome Extension or Tampermonkey, and verify real-time logs, DOM Explorer selection/middle-click inspection, Automation Editor execution, Data Scraper preview/export, and Reverse Engineering dumps.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\BrowserEventArgs.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\ncs\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Initializes a new instance of the \u003Csee cref=\u0022ExtensionTabsEventArgs\u0022/\u003E class.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public ExtensionTabsEventArgs(            System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyList\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E tabs,            int? activeAttachedTabId = null)        {            Tabs = tabs;            ActiveAttachedTabId = activeAttachedTabId;        }    }}==== REPLACE        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Initializes a new instance of the \u003Csee cref=\u0022ExtensionTabsEventArgs\u0022/\u003E class.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public ExtensionTabsEventArgs(            System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyList\u003CBrowserTabInfo\u003E tabs,            int? activeAttachedTabId = null)        {            Tabs = tabs;            ActiveAttachedTabId = activeAttachedTabId;        }    }    /// \u003Csummary\u003E    /// Classifies the severity or category of an \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationLogEventArgs\u0022/\u003E message for UI color-coding.    /// \u003C/summary\u003E    public enum AutomationLogLevel    {        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Standard informational or command response output.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        Default,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// System lifecycle notification.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        System,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Server stop or caution notification.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        ServerStopped,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Chrome Extension synchronization or tab operation message.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        Extension,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Browser client or extension connection established.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        ClientConnected,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Non-fatal warning or rate-limit notification.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        Warning,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Execution or transport error.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        Error,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Outgoing IPC command transmission.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        CommandTx,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Incoming IPC command result.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        CommandRx,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Streaming partial command data.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        Stream,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Browser page load or navigation event.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        Navigation,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Automation sequence lifecycle event.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        Automation,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Individual automation step execution event.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        AutomationStep,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Data scrape started or field/container configured.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        ScrapeStart,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Data scrape page extraction completed.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        ScrapePage,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Pagination delay wait notification.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        ScrapeDelay,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Operation or scrape completed successfully.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        Success,        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Reverse-engineering site dump started.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        ReverseEngineering    }    /// \u003Csummary\u003E    /// Provides default dark-theme RGB color mappings for \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationLogLevel\u0022/\u003E values.    /// \u003C/summary\u003E    public static class AutomationLogLevelExtensions    {        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Returns the default dark-theme RGB color tuple \u003Cc\u003E(R, G, B)\u003C/c\u003E for the specified \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationLogLevel\u0022/\u003E.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public static (byte R, byte G, byte B) GetDefaultRgb(this AutomationLogLevel level)        {            return level switch            {                AutomationLogLevel.System =\u003E (0, 255, 255),                AutomationLogLevel.ServerStopped =\u003E (255, 255, 0),                AutomationLogLevel.Extension =\u003E (0, 255, 127),                AutomationLogLevel.ClientConnected =\u003E (50, 205, 50),                AutomationLogLevel.Warning =\u003E (255, 165, 0),                AutomationLogLevel.Error =\u003E (255, 0, 0),                AutomationLogLevel.CommandTx =\u003E (0, 191, 255),                AutomationLogLevel.CommandRx =\u003E (255, 255, 255),                AutomationLogLevel.Stream =\u003E (147, 112, 219),                AutomationLogLevel.Navigation =\u003E (0, 255, 255),                AutomationLogLevel.Automation =\u003E (255, 0, 255),                AutomationLogLevel.AutomationStep =\u003E (221, 160, 221),                AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeStart =\u003E (0, 255, 127),                AutomationLogLevel.ScrapePage =\u003E (144, 238, 144),                AutomationLogLevel.ScrapeDelay =\u003E (240, 230, 140),                AutomationLogLevel.Success =\u003E (0, 255, 0),                AutomationLogLevel.ReverseEngineering =\u003E (0, 191, 255),                _ =\u003E (211, 211, 211)            };        }    }    /// \u003Csummary\u003E    /// Event arguments representing a structured log entry emitted by \u003Csee cref=\u0022Automation.AutomationStudioSession\u0022/\u003E.    /// \u003C/summary\u003E    public class AutomationLogEventArgs : EventArgs    {        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the local timestamp when the log entry was created.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public DateTime Timestamp { get; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the short bracketed category tag (e.g., \u003Cc\u003E\u0022SYS\u0022\u003C/c\u003E, \u003Cc\u003E\u0022EXT\u0022\u003C/c\u003E, \u003Cc\u003E\u0022SCRAPE\u0022\u003C/c\u003E), or empty if already prefixed.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public string Category { get; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the log message body.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public string Message { get; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the semantic \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationLogLevel\u0022/\u003E used for UI color-coding.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public AutomationLogLevel Level { get; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the default dark-theme RGB color tuple for this log entry.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public (byte R, byte G, byte B) ColorRgb =\u003E Level.GetDefaultRgb();        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the complete formatted log text without a trailing newline (e.g., \u003Cc\u003E\u0022[12:34:56.789] [SYS] Server stopped.\u0022\u003C/c\u003E).        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public string FormattedMessage =\u003E            string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Category)                ? $\u0022[{Timestamp:HH:mm:ss.fff}] {Message}\u0022                : $\u0022[{Timestamp:HH:mm:ss.fff}] [{Category}] {Message}\u0022;        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Initializes a new instance of the \u003Csee cref=\u0022AutomationLogEventArgs\u0022/\u003E class.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public AutomationLogEventArgs(string category, string message, AutomationLogLevel level = AutomationLogLevel.Default, DateTime? timestamp = null)        {            Timestamp = timestamp ?? DateTime.Now;            Category = category ?? string.Empty;            Message = message ?? string.Empty;            Level = level;        }    }}\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\DomTreeSnapshot.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\ncs\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH    /// \u003Csummary\u003E    /// Contains computed scrollbar visibility, viewport dimensions, and scroll range parameters for a virtualized DOM tree control.    /// \u003C/summary\u003E    public readonly struct DomScrollBarMetrics    {        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets whether the vertical scrollbar should be visible.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public bool NeedVertical { get; init; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets whether the horizontal scrollbar should be visible.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public bool NeedHorizontal { get; init; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the available viewport width excluding visible scrollbars and border insets.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public int ViewportWidth { get; init; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the available viewport height excluding visible scrollbars and border insets.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public int ViewportHeight { get; init; }==== REPLACE    /// \u003Csummary\u003E    /// Represents a platform-independent integer rectangle for layout and rendering bounds.    /// \u003C/summary\u003E    public readonly struct DomRect    {        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the left X coordinate.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public int X { get; init; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the top Y coordinate.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public int Y { get; init; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the width of the rectangle.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public int Width { get; init; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the height of the rectangle.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public int Height { get; init; }        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the right X coordinate (\u003Cc\u003EX \u002B Width\u003C/c\u003E).        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public int Right =\u003E X \u002B Width;        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets the bottom Y coordinate (\u003Cc\u003EY \u002B Height\u003C/c\u003E).        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public int Bottom =\u003E Y \u002B Height;        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Gets whether the rectangle has a non-positive width or height.        /// \u003C/summary\u003E        public bool IsEmpty =\u003E Width \u003C= 0 || Height \u003C= 0;        /// \u003Csummary\u003E        /// Initializes a new instance