    {
      "Id": "e4a395e7",
      "Timestamp": "2026-10-28T01:51:31.3602053-05:00",
      "UserPrompt": "Now i want you to rename the TestBed app project to BAF Studio (short for Browser Automation Framework Studio), and i also want you to build an svg icon (make sure its at least 256x2566) that will represent the BAF Studio app well and be visually appealing to look at.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\nRenamed the WinForms studio application to **BAF Studio (Browser Automation Framework Studio)** across the project configuration, namespaces (\u0060BAFStudio\u0060), window titles, and documentation, and created a 512x512 vector SVG application icon (\u0060baf-studio-icon.svg\u0060) along with a matching runtime window/taskbar icon renderer.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n- **SVG Application Icon (\u0060baf-studio-icon.svg\u0060)**:\n\n- Created a 512x512 (\u0060viewBox=\u00220 0 512 512\u0022\u0060) multi-layered vector icon featuring a dark cyber-studio squircle badge, glassmorphic browser frame, glowing DOM tree nodes, an electric automation core, an interactive target reticle, and a **BAF STUDIO** emblem.\n- Embedded the icon at the top of \u0060README.md\u0060.\n- **Project \u0026 Namespace Rename to BAF Studio**:\n\n- Updated \u0060AutomationStudioSession.StudioTitle\u0060 (\u0060\u0022BAF Studio - Browser Automation Framework Studio\u0022\u0060), \u0060StudioShortTitle\u0060 (\u0060\u0022BAF Studio\u0022\u0060), and \u0060StudioDescription\u0060.\n- Configured \u0060TestBedApp.csproj\u0060 with \u0060\u003CAssemblyName\u003EBAF Studio\u003C/AssemblyName\u003E\u0060, \u0060\u003CProduct\u003EBAF Studio\u003C/Product\u003E\u0060, and \u0060\u003CRootNamespace\u003EBAFStudio\u003C/RootNamespace\u003E\u0060.\n- Updated all namespaces and references in \u0060Program.cs\u0060, \u0060MainForm.cs\u0060, \u0060MainForm.Designer.cs\u0060, \u0060Controls\\DomTreeView.cs\u0060, \u0060utils\\DarkMessageBox.cs\u0060, \u0060utils\\DarkModeTitleBar.cs\u0060, and \u0060utils\\ReThemer.cs\u0060 from \u0060TestBedApp\u0060 to \u0060BAFStudio\u0060.\n- Added runtime GDI\u002B icon generation (\u0060CreateBafStudioAppIcon\u0060) and enabled \u0060DarkModeTitleBar\u0060 in \u0060MainForm.cs\u0060 so the window title bar, taskbar, and dialogs display the BAF Studio icon.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Open \u0060C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\baf-studio-icon.svg\u0060 in any browser or vector viewer to inspect the 512x512 SVG icon.\n- Build and run the application (\u0060dotnet run --project TestBedApp\u0060) and verify the window title (\u0060BAF Studio - Browser Automation Framework Studio\u0060), custom window/taskbar icon, and **Help -\u003E About** dialog.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\\baf-studio-icon.svg**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060xml\n\u003Csvg xmlns=\u0022http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\u0022 width=\u0022512\u0022 height=\u0022512\u0022 viewBox=\u00220 0 512 512\u0022 fill=\u0022none\u0022\u003E\n  \u003Cdefs\u003E\n    \u003C!-- Background Squircle Gradient --\u003E\n    \u003ClinearGradient id=\u0022bgGrad\u0022 x1=\u002232\u0022 y1=\u002224\u0022 x2=\u0022480\u0022 y2=\u0022488\u0022 gradientUnits=\u0022userSpaceOnUse\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u00220%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#0A0F1E\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u002250%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#111A30\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u0022100%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#17112E\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/linearGradient\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Outer Rim Neon Gradient --\u003E\n    \u003ClinearGradient id=\u0022rimGrad\u0022 x1=\u002224\u0022 y1=\u002224\u0022 x2=\u0022488\u0022 y2=\u0022488\u0022 gradientUnits=\u0022userSpaceOnUse\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u00220%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#00F0FF\u0022 stop-opacity=\u00220.85\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u002245%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#3B82F6\u0022 stop-opacity=\u00220.55\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u0022100%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#8B5CF6\u0022 stop-opacity=\u00220.85\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/linearGradient\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Browser Window Body Gradient --\u003E\n    \u003ClinearGradient id=\u0022browserBodyGrad\u0022 x1=\u002272\u0022 y1=\u002282\u0022 x2=\u0022440\u0022 y2=\u0022380\u0022 gradientUnits=\u0022userSpaceOnUse\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u00220%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#16223B\u0022 stop-opacity=\u00220.95\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u0022100%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#0D1526\u0022 stop-opacity=\u00220.95\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/linearGradient\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Browser Header Bar Gradient --\u003E\n    \u003ClinearGradient id=\u0022browserHeaderGrad\u0022 x1=\u002272\u0022 y1=\u002282\u0022 x2=\u0022440\u0022 y2=\u0022132\u0022 gradientUnits=\u0022userSpaceOnUse\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u00220%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#1E2D4D\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u0022100%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#16213A\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/linearGradient\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Cyan Electric Accent Gradient --\u003E\n    \u003ClinearGradient id=\u0022cyanAccent\u0022 x1=\u00220%\u0022 y1=\u00220%\u0022 x2=\u0022100%\u0022 y2=\u0022100%\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u00220%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#00F5D4\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u002250%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#00BBF9\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u0022100%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#3B82F6\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/linearGradient\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Automation Bolt / Core Gradient --\u003E\n    \u003ClinearGradient id=\u0022boltGrad\u0022 x1=\u0022250\u0022 y1=\u0022150\u0022 x2=\u0022380\u0022 y2=\u0022330\u0022 gradientUnits=\u0022userSpaceOnUse\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u00220%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#00F5D4\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u002255%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#00D2FF\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u0022100%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#7C3AED\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/linearGradient\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Purple/Magenta Secondary Accent --\u003E\n    \u003ClinearGradient id=\u0022purpleAccent\u0022 x1=\u00220%\u0022 y1=\u00220%\u0022 x2=\u0022100%\u0022 y2=\u0022100%\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u00220%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#A855F7\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u0022100%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#6366F1\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/linearGradient\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Bottom Badge Gradient --\u003E\n    \u003ClinearGradient id=\u0022badgeGrad\u0022 x1=\u0022136\u0022 y1=\u0022368\u0022 x2=\u0022376\u0022 y2=\u0022444\u0022 gradientUnits=\u0022userSpaceOnUse\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u00220%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#0E172A\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u002250%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#172544\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u0022100%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#1A163B\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/linearGradient\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Ambient Radial Glows --\u003E\n    \u003CradialGradient id=\u0022cyanGlow\u0022 cx=\u002235%\u0022 cy=\u002238%\u0022 r=\u002248%\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u00220%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#00E5FF\u0022 stop-opacity=\u00220.22\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u0022100%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#00E5FF\u0022 stop-opacity=\u00220\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/radialGradient\u003E\n\n    \u003CradialGradient id=\u0022violetGlow\u0022 cx=\u002272%\u0022 cy=\u002268%\u0022 r=\u002245%\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u00220%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#8B5CF6\u0022 stop-opacity=\u00220.24\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003Cstop offset=\u0022100%\u0022 stop-color=\u0022#8B5CF6\u0022 stop-opacity=\u00220\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/radialGradient\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Drop Shadow Filter --\u003E\n    \u003Cfilter id=\u0022dropShadow\u0022 x=\u0022-12%\u0022 y=\u0022-12%\u0022 width=\u0022124%\u0022 height=\u0022128%\u0022 filterUnits=\u0022userSpaceOnUse\u0022\u003E\n      \u003CfeDropShadow dx=\u00220\u0022 dy=\u002212\u0022 stdDeviation=\u002214\u0022 flood-color=\u0022#020617\u0022 flood-opacity=\u00220.7\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/filter\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Neon Glow Filter --\u003E\n    \u003Cfilter id=\u0022neonGlow\u0022 x=\u0022-25%\u0022 y=\u0022-25%\u0022 width=\u0022150%\u0022 height=\u0022150%\u0022\u003E\n      \u003CfeGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\u00225\u0022 result=\u0022blur\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003CfeComposite in=\u0022SourceGraphic\u0022 in2=\u0022blur\u0022 operator=\u0022over\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/filter\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Subtle Cyber Grid Pattern --\u003E\n    \u003Cpattern id=\u0022cyberGrid\u0022 width=\u002232\u0022 height=\u002232\u0022 patternUnits=\u0022userSpaceOnUse\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cpath d=\u0022M 32 0 L 0 0 0 32\u0022 fill=\u0022none\u0022 stroke=\u0022#38BDF8\u0022 stroke-width=\u00220.75\u0022 stroke-opacity=\u00220.07\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/pattern\u003E\n\n    \u003CclipPath id=\u0022squircleClip\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Crect x=\u002220\u0022 y=\u002220\u0022 width=\u0022472\u0022 height=\u0022472\u0022 rx=\u0022106\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C/clipPath\u003E\n  \u003C/defs\u003E\n\n  \u003C!-- 1. Main App Icon Squircle Base --\u003E\n  \u003Cg clip-path=\u0022url(#squircleClip)\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Crect x=\u002220\u0022 y=\u002220\u0022 width=\u0022472\u0022 height=\u0022472\u0022 rx=\u0022106\u0022 fill=\u0022url(#bgGrad)\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Crect x=\u002220\u0022 y=\u002220\u0022 width=\u0022472\u0022 height=\u0022472\u0022 fill=\u0022url(#cyberGrid)\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Ccircle cx=\u0022180\u0022 cy=\u0022190\u0022 r=\u0022220\u0022 fill=\u0022url(#cyanGlow)\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Ccircle cx=\u0022360\u0022 cy=\u0022340\u0022 r=\u0022210\u0022 fill=\u0022url(#violetGlow)\u0022 /\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Subtle Decorative Circuit Traces in Background --\u003E\n    \u003Cpath d=\u0022M40 140 H72 M440 140 H472 M40 310 H72 M440 310 H472\u0022 stroke=\u0022#00E5FF\u0022 stroke-width=\u00222\u0022 stroke-opacity=\u00220.2\u0022 stroke-linecap=\u0022round\u0022 /\u003E\n  \u003C/g\u003E\n\n  \u003C!-- Outer Glowing Squircle Border --\u003E\n  \u003Crect x=\u002222\u0022 y=\u002222\u0022 width=\u0022468\u0022 height=\u0022468\u0022 rx=\u0022104\u0022 stroke=\u0022url(#rimGrad)\u0022 stroke-width=\u00224\u0022 /\u003E\n  \u003Crect x=\u002228\u0022 y=\u002228\u0022 width=\u0022456\u0022 height=\u0022456\u0022 rx=\u002298\u0022 stroke=\u0022#FFFFFF\u0022 stroke-opacity=\u00220.06\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.5\u0022 /\u003E\n\n  \u003C!-- 2. Elevated Browser Studio Window --\u003E\n  \u003Cg filter=\u0022url(#dropShadow)\u0022\u003E\n    \u003C!-- Window Frame --\u003E\n    \u003Crect x=\u002264\u0022 y=\u002274\u0022 width=\u0022384\u0022 height=\u0022312\u0022 rx=\u002224\u0022 fill=\u0022url(#browserBodyGrad)\u0022 stroke=\u0022url(#cyanAccent)\u0022 stroke-width=\u00222.5\u0022 stroke-opacity=\u00220.75\u0022 /\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Browser Top Header Bar --\u003E\n    \u003Cpath d=\u0022M65.5 98 C65.5 85.5736 75.5736 75.5 88 75.5 H424 C436.426 75.5 446.5 85.5736 446.5 98 V128 H65.5 V98 Z\u0022 fill=\u0022url(#browserHeaderGrad)\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Cline x1=\u002265\u0022 y1=\u0022128\u0022 x2=\u0022447\u0022 y2=\u0022128\u0022 stroke=\u0022#38BDF8\u0022 stroke-opacity=\u00220.3\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.5\u0022 /\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Window Control Dots --\u003E\n    \u003Ccircle cx=\u002296\u0022 cy=\u0022102\u0022 r=\u00227\u0022 fill=\u0022#FF5F56\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Ccircle cx=\u0022118\u0022 cy=\u0022102\u0022 r=\u00227\u0022 fill=\u0022#FFBD2E\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Ccircle cx=\u0022140\u0022 cy=\u0022102\u0022 r=\u00227\u0022 fill=\u0022#27C93F\u0022 /\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Address / IPC Command Bar --\u003E\n    \u003Crect x=\u0022166\u0022 y=\u002289\u0022 width=\u0022218\u0022 height=\u002226\u0022 rx=\u00228\u0022 fill=\u0022#0B1324\u0022 stroke=\u0022#38BDF8\u0022 stroke-opacity=\u00220.35\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.2\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C!-- Stealth Shield Icon inside Address Bar --\u003E\n    \u003Cpath d=\u0022M181 95 L187 97.5 V102.5 C187 106.2 184.4 109.4 181 110.5 C177.6 109.4 175 106.2 175 102.5 V97.5 L181 95 Z\u0022 fill=\u0022#00F5D4\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003C!-- Address Bar URL Representation --\u003E\n    \u003Crect x=\u0022196\u0022 y=\u002299\u0022 width=\u002268\u0022 height=\u00226\u0022 rx=\u00223\u0022 fill=\u0022#38BDF8\u0022 fill-opacity=\u00220.8\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Crect x=\u0022270\u0022 y=\u002299\u0022 width=\u002294\u0022 height=\u00226\u0022 rx=\u00223\u0022 fill=\u0022#94A3B8\u0022 fill-opacity=\u00220.45\u0022 /\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Live Connection Pulse Dot --\u003E\n    \u003Ccircle cx=\u0022414\u0022 cy=\u0022102\u0022 r=\u00226\u0022 fill=\u0022#00F5D4\u0022 filter=\u0022url(#neonGlow)\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Ccircle cx=\u0022414\u0022 cy=\u0022102\u0022 r=\u002211\u0022 stroke=\u0022#00F5D4\u0022 stroke-opacity=\u00220.4\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.5\u0022 /\u003E\n  \u003C/g\u003E\n\n  \u003C!-- 3. Left Viewport: DOM Tree \u0026 Scraper Hierarchy --\u003E\n  \u003Cg\u003E\n    \u003C!-- Vertical Split Divider --\u003E\n    \u003Cline x1=\u0022236\u0022 y1=\u0022129\u0022 x2=\u0022236\u0022 y2=\u0022384\u0022 stroke=\u0022#38BDF8\u0022 stroke-opacity=\u00220.2\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.5\u0022 stroke-dasharray=\u00224 4\u0022 /\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Root DOM Node --\u003E\n    \u003Cpath d=\u0022M98 164 V316\u0022 stroke=\u0022#38BDF8\u0022 stroke-opacity=\u00220.4\u0022 stroke-width=\u00222.5\u0022 stroke-linecap=\u0022round\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Cpath d=\u0022M98 206 H124 M98 260 H124 M98 316 H124\u0022 stroke=\u0022#38BDF8\u0022 stroke-opacity=\u00220.4\u0022 stroke-width=\u00222.5\u0022 stroke-linecap=\u0022round\u0022 /\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Node 1: \u003Chtml / Root\u003E --\u003E\n    \u003Ccircle cx=\u002298\u0022 cy=\u0022164\u0022 r=\u00228\u0022 fill=\u0022#00F5D4\u0022 filter=\u0022url(#neonGlow)\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Crect x=\u0022116\u0022 y=\u0022156\u0022 width=\u002288\u0022 height=\u002216\u0022 rx=\u00225\u0022 fill=\u0022#1E3A5F\u0022 stroke=\u0022#00F5D4\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.5\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Crect x=\u0022124\u0022 y=\u0022161\u0022 width=\u002246\u0022 height=\u00226\u0022 rx=\u00223\u0022 fill=\u0022#00F5D4\u0022 /\u003E\n\n    \u003C!-- Node 2: Container Node --\u003E\n    \u003Ccircle cx=\u0022124\u0022 cy=\u0022206\u0022 r=\u00226.5\u0022 fill=\u0022#38BDF8\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Cre