      "UserPrompt": "[Attached Image]\n\nThe root directory for this project is: C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\nThe following directories are currently tracked/active for this project (place new files in these directories unless otherwise specified):\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\TestBedApp\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BAF Studio\n- C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\n\nWe are getting this runtime error on program start. Please help me fix it so that the BAF Program can launch again.",
      "ModelResponse": "Anti-Agent v1.0\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\nFixed the \u0060System.InvalidOperationException\u0060 (\u0060SplitterDistance must be between Panel1MinSize and Width - Panel2MinSize\u0060) thrown on startup in \u0060MainForm.InitializeReverseEngineeringTabUi()\u0060:\n\n- **\u0060BAF Studio\\MainForm.cs\u0060**:\n\n- Added a \u0060TrySetSplitterDistance(SplitContainer?, int)\u0060 helper that calculates the active container dimension (\u0060Height\u0060 for \u0060Orientation.Horizontal\u0060, \u0060Width\u0060 for \u0060Orientation.Vertical\u0060) and clamps \u0060SplitterDistance\u0060 to \u0060[Panel1MinSize, TotalSize - Panel2MinSize - SplitterWidth - BorderOffset]\u0060 when valid.\n- Replaced direct hardcoded \u0060SplitterDistance\u0060 assignments in \u0060InitializeScraperTabUi()\u0060, \u0060InitializeReverseEngineeringTabUi()\u0060, and \u0060EnsureTabSplittersConfigured()\u0060 with \u0060TrySetSplitterDistance(...)\u0060.\n- **\u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\StudioLayoutMetrics.cs\u0060**:\n\n- Updated \u0060CalculateClamped\u0060 to ensure calculated splitter distances never exceed the available \u0060totalSize\u0060 of the container at high DPI scales.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Build and run the **BAF Studio** project in Visual Studio (\u0060F5\u0060).\n- Verify that \u0060MainForm\u0060 launches without throwing \u0060InvalidOperationException\u0060 and that switching between the **DOM Explorer**, **Automation Editor**, **Data Scraper**, and **Reverse Engineering** tabs initializes all split panels smoothly.\n\n--CODESTART--\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\StudioLayoutMetrics.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            if (maxFirst \u003C minFirst)\n            {\n                maxFirst = minFirst;\n            }\n\n            return Math.Clamp((int)(totalSize * ratio), minFirst, maxFirst);\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n            int safeUpperLimit = Math.Max(25, totalSize - 30);\n            if (totalSize \u003E= 55)\n            {\n                maxFirst = Math.Min(maxFirst, safeUpperLimit);\n                minFirst = Math.Min(minFirst, safeUpperLimit);\n            }\n\n            if (maxFirst \u003C minFirst)\n            {\n                maxFirst = minFirst;\n            }\n\n            return Math.Clamp((int)(totalSize * ratio), minFirst, maxFirst);\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**C:\\Users\\Devtop1\\Documents\\GitHub\\baf\\BAF Studio\\MainForm.cs**\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060cs\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n        private void EnsureTabSplittersConfigured()\n        {\n            try\n            {\n                float dpiScale = DeviceDpi / 96f;\n\n                if (!_leftSidebarSplitterInitialized \u0026\u0026 splitLeftSidebar != null \u0026\u0026 splitLeftSidebar.Height \u003E 220)\n                {\n                    _leftSidebarSplitterInitialized = true;\n                    splitLeftSidebar.SplitterDistance = StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateLeftSidebarSplitterDistance(splitLeftSidebar.Height, dpiScale);\n                }\n\n                if (tabMain.SelectedTab == tabDom \u0026\u0026 !_domSplittersInitialized \u0026\u0026 splitDom.Width \u003E 200)\n                {\n                    _domSplittersInitialized = true;\n                    splitDom.SplitterDistance = StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateDomSplitterDistance(splitDom.Width);\n                }\n                else if (tabMain.SelectedTab == tabEditor \u0026\u0026 !_editorSplittersInitialized \u0026\u0026 splitSequences.Width \u003E 300)\n                {\n                    _editorSplittersInitialized = true;\n                    splitSequences.SplitterDistance = StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateSequencesSplitterDistance(splitSequences.Width, dpiScale);\n                    if (splitEditor.Width \u003E 250)\n                    {\n                        splitEditor.SplitterDistance = StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateEditorSplitterDistance(splitEditor.Width, dpiScale);\n                    }\n                }\n                else if (tabMain.SelectedTab == tabScraper \u0026\u0026 !_scraperSplittersInitialized \u0026\u0026 splitScraperMain != null \u0026\u0026 splitScraperMain.Width \u003E 300)\n                {\n                    _scraperSplittersInitialized = true;\n                    splitScraperMain.SplitterDistance = StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateScraperMainSplitterDistance(splitScraperMain.Width, dpiScale);\n                    if (splitScraperRight.Height \u003E 200)\n                    {\n                        splitScraperRight.SplitterDistance = StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateScraperRightSplitterDistance(splitScraperRight.Height, dpiScale);\n                    }\n                    if (splitFields.Width \u003E 250)\n                    {\n                        splitFields.SplitterDistance = StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateFieldsSplitterDistance(splitFields.Width, dpiScale);\n                    }\n                }\n                else if (tabMain.SelectedTab == tabReverseEngineering \u0026\u0026 !_revEngSplittersInitialized \u0026\u0026 splitRevEngMain != null \u0026\u0026 splitRevEngMain.Width \u003E 300)\n                {\n                    _revEngSplittersInitialized = true;\n                    splitRevEngMain.SplitterDistance = StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateReverseEngineeringMainSplitterDistance(splitRevEngMain.Width, dpiScale);\n                    if (splitRevEngLeft.Height \u003E 200)\n                    {\n                        splitRevEngLeft.SplitterDistance = StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateReverseEngineeringLeftSplitterDistance(splitRevEngLeft.Height, dpiScale);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch\n            {\n                // Ignore transient layout bounds exceptions during window initialization\n            }\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n        private static bool TrySetSplitterDistance(SplitContainer? splitter, int desiredDistance)\n        {\n            if (splitter == null)\n                return false;\n\n            int totalSize = splitter.Orientation == Orientation.Horizontal\n                ? splitter.Height\n                : splitter.Width;\n\n            int borderOffset = splitter.BorderStyle == BorderStyle.None ? 0 : 4;\n            int minDistance = Math.Max(1, splitter.Panel1MinSize);\n            int maxDistance = totalSize - splitter.Panel2MinSize - Math.Max(1, splitter.SplitterWidth) - borderOffset;\n            if (maxDistance \u003C minDistance)\n                return false;\n\n            splitter.SplitterDistance = Math.Clamp(desiredDistance, minDistance, maxDistance);\n            return true;\n        }\n\n        private void EnsureTabSplittersConfigured()\n        {\n            try\n            {\n                float dpiScale = DeviceDpi / 96f;\n\n                if (!_leftSidebarSplitterInitialized \u0026\u0026 splitLeftSidebar != null \u0026\u0026 splitLeftSidebar.Height \u003E 220)\n                {\n                    _leftSidebarSplitterInitialized = TrySetSplitterDistance(\n                        splitLeftSidebar,\n                        StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateLeftSidebarSplitterDistance(splitLeftSidebar.Height, dpiScale));\n                }\n\n                if (tabMain.SelectedTab == tabDom \u0026\u0026 !_domSplittersInitialized \u0026\u0026 splitDom.Width \u003E 200)\n                {\n                    _domSplittersInitialized = TrySetSplitterDistance(\n                        splitDom,\n                        StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateDomSplitterDistance(splitDom.Width));\n                }\n                else if (tabMain.SelectedTab == tabEditor \u0026\u0026 !_editorSplittersInitialized \u0026\u0026 splitSequences.Width \u003E 300)\n                {\n                    if (TrySetSplitterDistance(\n                            splitSequences,\n                            StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateSequencesSplitterDistance(splitSequences.Width, dpiScale)) \u0026\u0026\n                        splitEditor.Width \u003E 250 \u0026\u0026\n                        TrySetSplitterDistance(\n                            splitEditor,\n                            StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateEditorSplitterDistance(splitEditor.Width, dpiScale)))\n                    {\n                        _editorSplittersInitialized = true;\n                    }\n                }\n                else if (tabMain.SelectedTab == tabScraper \u0026\u0026 !_scraperSplittersInitialized \u0026\u0026 splitScraperMain != null \u0026\u0026 splitScraperMain.Width \u003E 300)\n                {\n                    if (TrySetSplitterDistance(\n                            splitScraperMain,\n                            StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateScraperMainSplitterDistance(splitScraperMain.Width, dpiScale)) \u0026\u0026\n                        splitScraperRight.Height \u003E 200 \u0026\u0026\n                        TrySetSplitterDistance(\n                            splitScraperRight,\n                            StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateScraperRightSplitterDistance(splitScraperRight.Height, dpiScale)) \u0026\u0026\n                        splitFields.Width \u003E 250 \u0026\u0026\n                        TrySetSplitterDistance(\n                            splitFields,\n                            StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateFieldsSplitterDistance(splitFields.Width, dpiScale)))\n                    {\n                        _scraperSplittersInitialized = true;\n                    }\n                }\n                else if (tabMain.SelectedTab == tabReverseEngineering \u0026\u0026 !_revEngSplittersInitialized \u0026\u0026 splitRevEngMain != null \u0026\u0026 splitRevEngMain.Width \u003E 300)\n                {\n                    if (TrySetSplitterDistance(\n                            splitRevEngMain,\n                            StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateReverseEngineeringMainSplitterDistance(splitRevEngMain.Width, dpiScale)) \u0026\u0026\n                        splitRevEngLeft.Height \u003E 200 \u0026\u0026\n                        TrySetSplitterDistance(\n                            splitRevEngLeft,\n                            StudioLayoutMetrics.CalculateReverseEngineeringLeftSplitterDistance(splitRevEngLeft.Height, dpiScale)))\n                    {\n                        _revEngSplittersInitialized = true;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch\n            {\n                // Ignore transient layout bounds exceptions during window initialization\n            }\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            splitScraperMain.SplitterDistance = 300;\n            splitScraperRight.SplitterDistance = 220;\n            splitFields.SplitterDistance = 210;\n\n            RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns();\n==== REPLACE\n            TrySetSplitterDistance(splitScraperMain, 300);\n            TrySetSplitterDistance(splitScraperRight, 220);\n            TrySetSplitterDistance(splitFields, 210);\n\n            RefreshAutomationSequenceDropdowns();\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u003C\u003C\u003C\u003C SEARCH\n            splitRevEngMain.SplitterDistance = 300;\n            splitRevEngLeft.SplitterDistance = 240;\n        }\n==== REPLACE\n            TrySetSplitterDistance(splitRevEngMain, 300);\n            TrySetSplitterDistance(splitRevEngLeft, 240);\n        }\n\u003E\u003E\u003E\u003E\n\u0060\u0060\u0060",
      "ModelExplanation": "### Summary of Changes\n\nFixed the \u0060System.InvalidOperationException\u0060 (\u0060SplitterDistance must be between Panel1MinSize and Width - Panel2MinSize\u0060) thrown on startup in \u0060MainForm.InitializeReverseEngineeringTabUi()\u0060:\n\n- **\u0060BAF Studio\\MainForm.cs\u0060**:\n\n- Added a \u0060TrySetSplitterDistance(SplitContainer?, int)\u0060 helper that calculates the active container dimension (\u0060Height\u0060 for \u0060Orientation.Horizontal\u0060, \u0060Width\u0060 for \u0060Orientation.Vertical\u0060) and clamps \u0060SplitterDistance\u0060 to \u0060[Panel1MinSize, TotalSize - Panel2MinSize - SplitterWidth - BorderOffset]\u0060 when valid.\n- Replaced direct hardcoded \u0060SplitterDistance\u0060 assignments in \u0060InitializeScraperTabUi()\u0060, \u0060InitializeReverseEngineeringTabUi()\u0060, and \u0060EnsureTabSplittersConfigured()\u0060 with \u0060TrySetSplitterDistance(...)\u0060.\n- **\u0060BrowserAutomationFramework\\Models\\StudioLayoutMetrics.cs\u0060**:\n\n- Updated \u0060CalculateClamped\u0060 to ensure calculated splitter distances never exceed the available \u0060totalSize\u0060 of the container at high DPI scales.\n\n### How to Test\n\n- Build and run the **BAF Studio** project in Visual Studio (\u0060F5\u0060).\n- Verify that \u0060MainForm\u0060 launches without throwing \u0060InvalidOperationException\u0060 and that switching between the **DOM Explorer**, **Automation Editor**, **Data Scraper**, and **Reverse Engineering** tabs initializes all split panels smoothly.",
